#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityLocation.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Put your Techniques to the test in these risky Obstacle Courses and be rewarded with Tokens to spend.\n\n[b]An entry cost is required per attempt.[/b]"
msgstr "在這些危險的障礙路線上考驗自己的技巧，完成挑戰即可賺取代幣。\n\n[b]每次挑戰都需支付入場費。[/b]"

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityLocation.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unique Trails"
msgstr "特殊小徑"

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityLocation.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[b]Unlock specialty content[/b] around the game by completing Unique Trails that gain access to hidden locations around Melvor.\n\n[b]Maps are required to be found prior to attempting.[/b]"
msgstr "走完特殊小徑，即可前往梅爾沃各地的隱藏地點，[b]解鎖遊戲中的特色內容[/b]。\n\n[b]找到對應的地圖後，才能挑戰該小徑。[/b]"

