#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seeds of Sustenance - The owner of the Spiced Honey Tavern has been having an issue keeping her pantry stocked, as goods have slowly but surely vanishing in the night. Worried about her customers going hungry, she reached out to you, hoping for a moment of your time."
msgstr "維持生計的種子——香蜜酒館的老闆最近遇到了麻煩，店裡存放的東西總在夜裡不翼而飛，店裡存貨不足。她擔心客人會捱餓，於是向你求助，希望你能花點時間幫幫她。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Only the best for Lira. I'll need to harvest some fresh produce, then hand it over."
msgstr "既然是利拉，那就要最好的。我去採些新鮮食材，然後給她送過去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These look great, hopefully it'll be enough to last her a while."
msgstr "這些看起來不錯，希望能夠她撐一段時間。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you walk into the warm tavern, a middle-aged woman rushes by you in a blur, carrying a half dozen tankards of ale, then quickly setting them in front of two excited looking patrons.\nThe whole place is buzzing with rowdy energy, but it remains light and warm. Despite all people clamoring for her attention, they quickly fall to silence as Lira holds up her hand. She gives you a warm embrace, then pinches your cheek shortly afterward."
msgstr "當你走進溫暖的酒館時，一位中間女子從你身邊匆匆掠過。她手裡端著六大杯麥芽酒，將酒快速放到兩位興奮的顧客面前。酒館內十分熱鬧，溫暖又明亮。周圍的人都在叫利拉，但她一抬手，大家立刻安靜了下來。她熱情地擁抱你，然後輕輕捏了捏你的臉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's so lovely to see you [i]{0}[/i]. Thank you for coming to see me on such short notice."
msgstr "見到你真是太好了[i]{0}[/i]。謝謝你匆匆忙忙地來見我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course, Lira, any time. You sounded urgent in the note you sent me, how can I help?"
msgstr "我肯定隨叫隨到，利拉。你在便條裡好像挺急的，有什麼我能幫忙的嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We've been running through our food supply far faster than we should be as of these last few weeks. I don't know where it could possibly be going, but it's a problem."
msgstr "這幾周我們的食物用得很快，比正常情況快多了。我不知道都去哪兒了，但肯定有問題。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can only imagine, looks like you're feeding half the town in here. Business is going well, it'd seem?"
msgstr "我能想到的只有你，現在半個鎮子的人都靠你養。生意不錯，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Half of Azamire, and a bit from every nearby town, too. If I don't find a way to get some fresh produce, I might have to start turning folks away."
msgstr "不僅僅是阿扎米爾一半的人，還有附近鎮子的人。如果找不到新鮮食材，我恐怕只能閉門謝客了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't worry, I can always find a bit of time to help out. What do you need the most?"
msgstr "別擔心，我會抽時間幫你的。現在你最需要的是什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you so much... I'd like to cook up some stew. Some potatoes and onions would keep this place happy and fed for quite a while, if it's really not too much trouble."
msgstr "太謝謝你了……我想做點燉菜。如果不太麻煩的話，弄些馬鈴薯和洋蔥就行，這些就夠大家填飽肚子，撐一陣子了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That shouldn't be an issue in the slightest. We'll be back soon!"
msgstr "那完全沒問題。我們很快就回來！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you turn to leave the Spiced Honey Tavern, the quieted customers start to stir once again, chattering among themselves or asking for refills on their ever dwindling pints."
msgstr "當你轉身離開香蜜酒館時，原本安靜的顧客又開始喧鬧起來，他們嘮叨閒聊或者呼喊著添酒倒酒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's a large fireplace, it'll take a lot of wood to fill, and a decent bit of effort to get it all burning."
msgstr "店裡有個大壁爐，加滿的話要不少木材，生火也要費些功夫。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A few folks begin to crowd around the fire, enjoying the warmth, now all that's left is to wait for Lira's stew. [Burn] X/X [Oak Logs] - [Complete Button]"
msgstr "幾個人圍在爐邊烤火；現在大家都在等利拉的燉菜。[Burn] X/X [Oak Logs] - [Complete Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With fresh produce in tow, you make your way back into the Spiced Honey Tavern. A couple of excited looking patrons eye the vegetables, knowing that they'll soon have it cooked and on their table.\n\nLira beams when she sees you. She motions for you to hand your haul over to a large, bearded man who has an apron half-tied around him."
msgstr "你帶著新鮮食材回到香蜜酒館。幾位興奮的顧客盯著蔬菜，他們知道這些食材很快就能煮好上桌。\n\n利拉看到你十分高興。她示意你將食材交給一位大鬍子男人，他腰上鬆鬆垮垮地繫著一條圍裙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you so much! We'll get them cleaned up and cooking soon. I don't suppose I could trouble you just a little further..?"
msgstr "非常感謝！我們馬上清洗開煮。我能不能再麻煩你一件事……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With...?"
msgstr "什麼事……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... The fire's gone out. It's going to take a bit to wash and cut everything, so if you could get it lit for me, it'd be a huge help."
msgstr "那個……火滅了。我要去洗菜切菜，如果你能幫我把火生起來，那就幫了我大忙了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm on it, but it's going to cost you..."
msgstr "我來生火，不過要收費哦……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh..? Well, that's okay, I suppose. You've worked hard, and the tavern is doing well. How much for everything?"
msgstr "啊……？我覺得沒問題。你辛苦了，酒館現在生意不錯。這些一共多少錢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... I'd say at least two bowls, and two tankards, too?"
msgstr "那個……我覺得至少得兩碗菜，再加兩大杯酒吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And here I thought you were going to ring me dry for saving my business. You get that fire lit and you can drink until I need to get Rowan to come pick you up off the floor."
msgstr "你救了我的生意，我還以為你會狠狠敲我一筆呢。你把火生起來，想喝多少喝多少，醉了我叫羅文來接你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lira gestures to the hearth on the far end of the tavern, and several customers move themselves and their tables away to give you plenty of space to work."
msgstr "利拉指向酒館另一邊的壁爐。幾位顧客挪開身子和桌子，給你留出足夠的空間。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lira has Rowan and a few customers help haul out a large stew pot which has been filled with all sorts of hearty vegetables, meats, and a dizzying blend of spices that begins to make your mouth water as the pot slowly begins to bubble. As you wait, Lira is true to her word, and you rarely find your tankards less than half full.\n\nAfter a couple hours of waiting and a few last dashes of several spices, Lira declares her creation finished. Bowls are distributed and a line quickly forms, everyone eagerly waiting to eat their fill. You enjoy yourself as the tavern becomes more rowdy through the night. Before you know it, you find yourself passed out by the fire, and the tavern mostly empty.\n\nThat was a good night."
msgstr "在羅文和幾位顧客的幫助下，利拉搬出了一口大燉鍋。鍋裡裝滿了各種蔬菜和肉類，還有各種各樣的香料。鍋裡的湯汁開始慢慢沸騰，讓人直流口水。你在等的時候，利拉說話算數，你的酒杯始終都是滿的，就沒少於半杯。\n\n經過幾個小時的等待，鍋裡又加了幾種香料，利拉宣佈說菜做好了。大家拿著分發的碗，快速排起長隊，迫不及待地想要大飽口福。夜深了，酒館變得更加熱鬧，你盡情享受。不知不覺，你在爐火邊昏昏昏欲睡去，酒館也快沒人了。\n\n真是個美好的夜晚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Packing Lunch"
msgstr "準備午餐"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Packing Lunch - A battle-hardened representative from the Slayers Guild has found himself without the majority of his supplies after a band of robbers stripped him of nearly all his possessions. In shockingly high spirits, the man still wishes to embark on a journey to the nearby Corrupted Farmlands, but will need to restock before he can."
msgstr "準備午餐——獵殺工會的一位老成員遭遇了一群盜賊，隨身物品幾乎被洗劫一空。但他精神飽滿，依然想去附近的腐化農地。在出發前，他需要先準備食物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What would a man like him even like? Fish, maybe?"
msgstr "像他這樣的人，喜歡吃什麼呢？可能是魚？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully this will be a suitable enough lunch, then Gol can get on his way."
msgstr "希望這份午餐適合他，這樣戈爾就能出發了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A nearly bare man stands on the side of the road covered by a terrifyingly small loincloth, laughing heartily as a few folks gawk at his form, then rush by while averting their eyes. He flexes in several positions, showing off his incredibly well-built body and empty scabbard, one of the few things the man seems to own. \n\nHapren quickly approaches you, then points in the man's direction."
msgstr "一個幾乎裸體的男人站在路邊，哈哈大笑，身上只有一塊小得可憐的纏腰布。一些路人盯著他看，然後又移開視線，匆匆離去。他擺出各種姿勢，展示自己健碩的體魄，腰間還掛著一個空空的劍鞘，這似乎是他為數不多的物件了。\n\n哈普倫快速走到你身邊，指向那個男人的方向。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[i]{0}[/i], I beg of you, deal with this man."
msgstr "[i]{0}[/i]，求求你，去搞定那傢伙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Deal with him? What do you want me to do, stab him?"
msgstr "……搞定他？你想要我怎麼做？去捅他一刀？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What?! Heavens, no [i]{0}[/i]! I just want you to talk to him and get him to leave. Or, at the very least, cover up a little."
msgstr "什麼？！天哪，當然不是啦[i]{0}[/i]！我只是想要你去跟他說說，讓他走。或者，至少讓他稍微遮一下。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And why aren't you doing that already?"
msgstr "你怎麼還不去？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Look at him! The man looks like a tree uprooted itself from the ground, shed its bark, and is now harassing my good citizens! I'll make it worth your while, so please, go!"
msgstr "看看他！他就像一棵從地裡拔出來的樹，連皮都沒了，現在還在騷擾我們這些好市民！只要你去，我不會虧待你。拜託了，你就去吧！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah! Another comes to admire Gol's form, yes?"
msgstr "啊！又來一個欣賞戈爾身材的人，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're an impressive specimen, but no, I'd actually like you to cover up a bit. What brings you around here?"
msgstr "你這身材不錯，不過我希望你能稍微遮一遮。你到這兒來幹什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, Gol was making his way towards his target when Gol was accosted by bandits!"
msgstr "嗯，戈爾在前往目的地的路上遇到盜賊了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh! I'm terribly sorry then, let's see if we can get you some clothes and then..."
msgstr "噢！我很抱歉，我看看能不能先給你弄身衣服，然後……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "HA! Clothes? Nay, they took Gol's supplies and sword! Gol has no need for anything to shield himself from the blows of his enemies."
msgstr "哈！衣服？不用了，那些盜賊把戈爾的補給和劍都搶走了！戈爾不需要任何東西來抵擋敵人的攻擊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So you just... walk around like this?"
msgstr "所以你就……這樣走來走去？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aye! They robbers took Gol's lunch as well. Once Gol has had a bite to eat, Gol can continue towards his battle!"
msgstr "對！那些盜賊把戈爾的午餐也搶了。等戈爾吃點東西，就能繼續戰鬥了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'll see if I can rustle something up for you to eat, then."
msgstr "……好吧，那我看能不能給你找點吃的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol pats his stomach expectantly as you walk back towards a somewhat relieved Hapren. He gives you a thumbs up and scurries off, leaving you to deal with Gol yourself."
msgstr "當你往回走的時候，哈普倫鬆了一口氣，戈爾期待地拍了拍肚子。哈普倫向你豎起大拇指，然後就匆匆走了，留你一個人應付戈爾。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I need to make sure the bolts are well-made so they'll hold a man of that size, only way to do that is to do it myself."
msgstr "我得確保這些弩箭足夠結實，能應付他這個大塊頭。看來我只能自己動手了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That should do... I hope."
msgstr "這樣應該就可以了……希望可以吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol looks up expectantly as you approach and hand him the fish. One after another, the man sucks them down, then sighs happily. You're not sure if you saw him chew."
msgstr "當你走近並將魚遞給戈爾時，他滿懷期待地抬起頭。他一條接一條地將魚吞下，然後滿足地嘆了口氣。你甚至都沒見他嚼過。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Better now?"
msgstr "好點了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol was pleased by this little snack! The nice lady from the tavern came by with food as well, but battle shall be Gol's main course!"
msgstr "戈爾對這些「小點心」很滿意！酒館的那位好心女士也送了些食物過來，但戰鬥才是戈爾的「主菜」！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd imagine that must have been Lira, yeah? Her food's to die for, but I'd imagine that it'd be hard to pay in your current state."
msgstr "我想那肯定是利拉，對吧？她做的食物美味至極，不過以你現在的情況，恐怕很難付得起錢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Only for now! Gol will make back his fortune tenfold once he has pilfered the nearby dungeon. But Gol is not yet set off."
msgstr "這只是暫時的！等戈爾偷了附近的地牢，就能賺回十倍的財富。但戈爾現在還沒出發。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That would have been too easy, yeah? What's stopping you now?"
msgstr "那也太容易了，對吧？你怎麼還沒走？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Among Gol's possessions was climbing gear that he needed to get to the farmlands. Would you be able to provide some for Gol?"
msgstr "戈爾還缺少一套攀爬裝備，這是去農田必須要帶的。你能給戈爾給予一套嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, that's easy, I think there was some boots and hooks left in Lira's tavern. Let me go ge-"
msgstr "哦，那簡單。我記得利拉的酒館還有一些靴子和鉤子。我去拿——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, no. Traditional gear will neither fit nor hold Gol's magnificent shape. Topaz Bolts will let me climb just fine."
msgstr "不，不。那些傳統的裝備不合適，也撐不住壯碩的戈爾。我用黃玉弩箭就可以爬。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How??"
msgstr "怎麼爬？？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The tips will cut into any surface, if slammed hard enough. Then the iron shafts will hold me!"
msgstr "只要力夠大，釘尖就能扎進任何表面。然後鐵桿就能撐住我！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you sure you don't just want the climbing gear..?"
msgstr "你確定不要那些攀爬裝備嗎……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The large man just gestures to his body once again, before striking another-admittedly impressive-pose. You leave to fetch the man his bolts."
msgstr "這位大塊頭再次指了指自己的身體，然後又擺了一個令人印象深刻的姿勢。你去給他拿他的弩箭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol takes the bolts from you and considers them with a far more meticulous eye than you expected from him. After a while, his face breaks out into a smile as he nods. He claps you on the shoulder hard enough to shake you to your bones, then vows that he will repay you someday. You notice that his loincloth covers even less from behind as he walks away, towards whatever battle he intends to fight.\n\nHapren and Lira scurry out from inside of the nearby tavern once they see that Gol has departed. Lira asks about the man, seemingly saddened by him not sticking around, as she hoped he'd be able to drink half his weight in ale. Hapren shakes your hand once, thanking you taking care of the man, and says a light prayer hoping that he doesn't return."
msgstr "戈爾拿起你手中的弩箭，細細檢視，看得比你想象的更加仔細。過了一會兒，他露出笑容，點了點頭。他重重拍了拍你的肩膀，拍得你骨頭都快散了。他發誓說一定會報答你。他轉身離開，前往他心裡的戰場。這時你注意到，從背後看，他那塊纏腰布確實小得可憐。\n\n哈普倫和利拉看到戈爾離開，從附近的酒館快步走了出來。利拉問戈爾去哪兒，似乎有些失落。她還想戈爾能夠留下，看他喝下相當於一半體重的麥芽酒。哈普倫握了握你的手，感謝你照顧戈爾，低聲祈禱戈爾別再回來了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Morally Ethical Graverobbing"
msgstr "合乎倫理的盜墓"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Morally Ethical Grave Robbing - A long forgotten city filled with treasure, riches, and secrets beyond compare has just been uncovered... maybe. It's quite possible that there's hardly anything at all down there, but there's only one way to find out!"
msgstr "合乎倫理的盜墓——一座被長久遺忘的城市重見天日，裡面或許藏著無與倫比的財寶、財富和秘密……下面也可能什麼都沒有，但要弄清楚真相，只有一個辦法！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Some steel for the heads, and willow logs for the shafts should be plenty strong enough."
msgstr "用鋼鐵做頭，用柳木原木做柄，應該都結實了吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think this should be plenty to outfit the crew with some new tools."
msgstr "我想這應該夠給大家置辦一些新工具了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A scattered group of dwarves mills about a half excavated hillside, clutching broken tools and caring for what looks like some nasty burns and singed beards. Funnily enough, they seem more worried about their facial hair than their wounds.\n\nAn elderly man in a comically large wizard's hat seems surprised, but also pleased, to see you."
msgstr "挖了一半的山坡上有一群矮人，他們拿著破損的工具，看起來正在處理一些嚴重的燒傷，連鬍子都燒焦了。有趣的是，比起身上的傷，他們似乎更擔心自己的鬍子。\n\n一位老人戴著一頂大得滑稽的巫師帽，他看到你之後又驚訝又高興。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why hello there! Say, are you any handy with a pickaxe? Decently strong enough to move rocks from one location to another, maybe?"
msgstr "你好呀！那個……你會用鎬頭嗎？你應該力氣不錯，能不能幫忙搬一下石頭？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, I'm not too bad at either, but it looks like you've got a whole crew here, why aren't they mining?"
msgstr "嗯，我都還行。我看你這兒的人不少，他們怎麼不挖？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Because this talentless hack didn't warn us about the tunnel being trapped. It's a good thing that \"Whudgrath Roksmak's Crew is twice the prize at half the size\"... in case you're lookin' for a crew, stranger."
msgstr "還不是因為這個沒用的廢物，隧道有陷阱都沒提醒我們。好在「伍德格拉斯·洛克斯馬克的隊伍可以一人頂倆」……陌生人，你是在找隊伍嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How dare you sir? I may have wandered off to inspect a few of the enchanted baubles we've found, but I'm far from talentless. Don't you want to learn if it's even worth digging up this hillside before you do so?"
msgstr "你什麼意思？我只是去檢視剛剛目擊的幾件魔法小玩意兒，不是沒用的廢物。難道你在挖掘這片山坡之前，不想知道這裡值不值得挖嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're dwarves, lad. It's always worth diggin', I just hope my folks can live to tell about it!"
msgstr "我們是矮人，小夥子。挖掘沒有什麼值不值，我只希望我的人能夠活下來，把挖掘的故事講給別人聽！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I thoroughly apologize for my tardiness, but the fact that the ruins are trapped means that there's something inside worth getting at! Most of the trinkets we've unearthed have some kind or form of enchantment as well!"
msgstr "是我來晚了，我深表歉意。既然這些遺蹟有陷阱，那裡面一定有值得挖的東西！我們挖出來的很多小玩意兒都帶著某種魔法！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll let you two just sort this out..."
msgstr "你們倆自己處理吧……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait just a sediment. If what Morlin says is true, it sounds like the payday might be worth getting blown up once or twice more."
msgstr "等等，先別急。如果莫林說的是真的，那再炸幾次，也是值得的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "More than enough for all of us! I'm more interested in the history of the place than anything else, anyway."
msgstr "裡面的東西夠我們分了！反正比起別的，我對這個地方的歷史更感興趣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wouldn't mind myself some fancy magic stuff. What do you need from me?"
msgstr "如果能弄些神奇的玩意兒，我也不介意。你需要我做什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My folks will be fine, but our tools... a little less so. You mind getting us some steel to make more, while we patch ourselves up?"
msgstr "我的人沒事，但我們的工具……不太行了。在我們處理傷口的時候，你能不能幫我們找些鋼材？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "我盡力吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I have the feeling I'm going to be here a while..."
msgstr "看來我要在這兒待一段時間了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I must nearly be done..."
msgstr "我應該快弄完了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Whudgrath happily takes the materials from you while his crew gathers round. He snaps his fingers towards Morlin, who quickly heats up the material using few blasts of fire magic.\n\nIn a terrifying display of efficiency and speed, using their bare hands and some well-placed smacks of their hammers, the dwarves work the material into shape. Once Morlin cools them, they're then fit to whittled shafts. The whole assembly line starts and finishes just seconds after you take the last bit of material from your bag."
msgstr "伍德格拉斯高興地從你手中接過材料，他的人也圍了過來。他向莫林打了個響指。莫林使出火焰魔法，迅速將材料加熱。\n\n這群矮人展現出驚人的效率和速度。他們赤手空拳，穩穩地揮動榔頭，把材料打成想要的形狀。莫林將材料冷卻，然後把材料裝到削好的柄上。你從揹包裡提領最後一塊材料，短短几秒之後，整個組裝過程就完成了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right then! Are we ready to dig?"
msgstr "好了！準備好開挖了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Looks like it! I can only imagine what we could find deeper in... Perhaps more about their way of life? Ties to nearby civilizations?"
msgstr "看來是準備好了！我只想看看，再深點兒會目擊什麼……或許能進一步瞭解他們的生活方式？瞭解他們與周邊文明之間的聯絡？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Booze that has been aging for an untold number of years? New, fancy bits and bobs?"
msgstr "目擊陳釀了不知多少年的美酒？目擊新奇的小玩意兒？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Am I the only one concerned about there being more traps? Ancient guardians? Diseases that have been lingering for who knows how long? There is a reason this place is a ruin, right?"
msgstr "只有我擔心這裡可能還有陷阱嗎？還有古老的守護？還有不知潛伏了多久的疫病？這裡變成如今的遺蹟總是有原因的，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That all sounds like fun to me. Time to strike the earth!"
msgstr "聽起來挺有趣的。是時候開始挖了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't suppose I could get you to join them, could I? The sooner this place is dug up, the sooner we can get to exploring it!"
msgstr "我在想，能不能讓你加入他們？這裡挖得越快，我們就能越早開始探索！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Before you can get a word in, a pickaxe is thrust into your hands by a passing dwarf, followed by a helmet and a water flask. You're spun around and placed in front of a bit of rubble. Time to get to it."
msgstr "你還沒開口，一個路過的矮人就將一把鎬頭塞到你手裡，然後又遞來一頂頭盔和一個水壺。有人把你轉過身，推到一堆碎石前。開始幹活吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Morlin really isn't holding back on asking away, is he?"
msgstr "莫林問起問題來真是一點也不客氣，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope that this is everything that Morlin needs to deal with the cursed door."
msgstr "希望這就是莫林應對那扇詛咒之門所需要的一切。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sweat pours down your brow as a cart pulled behind a large star-nosed mole the crew has affectionately named 'Moley' swings by.\nThe crew loads up the rubble you've broken down as you swing your pickaxe once again. But, instead of the typical smack and shock of resistance you're used to when mining, this time, your tool goes THROUGH the rock. A small, unlit cavern lays in front of you. Just as you call out, the clean-up crew crowds around you, yelling about 'rocks and stones,' whatever that means. Shortly after, you're joined by Whudgrath and Morlin, who filter into the cave and immediately start inspecting a large circular door carved into the wall"
msgstr "汗水從你的額頭流下來，這時一輛大車從你身邊經過。拉這輛大車的是一隻巨大的星鼻鼴，大家都親暱地叫它『莫利』。\n你鑿碎的碎石被裝上車，而你再次揮動手中的鎬頭。但這一次，鎬頭擊打之後並沒有像之前那樣產生衝擊，而是穿透了岩石。一個昏暗的小洞穴出現在你面前。你叫了一聲，清理的人都圍了上來，嘴裡喊著『岩石和石頭』之類的話。不一會兒，伍德格拉斯和莫林也來了。他們進入洞穴，立馬開始仔細觀察洞壁上的一扇圓形大門。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well done! Looks like you've found... something! We've got some kinda door here, hm?"
msgstr "幹得好！看來你目擊了……重要的東西！這兒居然有扇門，嗯？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe for a vault?"
msgstr "也許裡面是個寶庫？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Or to seal something off, perhaps? Either way, it's an exciting find! One that is..."
msgstr "或者裡面鎖了什麼東西？不管怎麼樣，這個目擊真令人興奮！那麼……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is... what, exactly?"
msgstr "那麼……裡面到底是什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Trapped, I'm afraid. We're going to have to deactivate it before we go any further."
msgstr "恐怕是陷阱。我們要先把陷阱解決了，才能繼續往前走。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're sure we can't just smack it and run?"
msgstr "你確定我們不能直接打一下，然後趕緊跑嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is that how you blew up last time?"
msgstr "你們上次就是這樣把自己炸飛的吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just like to call it efficiency. I'm coming around to the idea of being blown up, as long as I know it's leading up to a nice payday."
msgstr "這樣做是為了效率。只要有大收成，就算被炸飛，我也能接受。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No... this one's a curse, from what I'm able to tell. One that'll take a while to remove."
msgstr "不……我覺得這是個詛咒。要解除詛咒，得花點時間。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh? Well, okay then, I can come back later, once you've sorted that out?"
msgstr "哦？那好吧，等你弄清楚了，我再回來？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your work is far from done! I'll need you to fetch me some runes required for the spell to lift the curse on the door. I'll have a list done up for you."
msgstr "你的活兒還沒幹完呢！我需要你去弄些符文，用來解除門上的詛咒。我給你列個清單。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Morlin flicks his hands, and a leaf of paper floats out of his pack and hangs in the air. You can see something already written on it... \"Blindfold, velvet rope, three wheels of cheese...\" But Morlin flicks his hands again and another-blank this time-leaf is produced, while the other immediately combusts. \n\nWords form from nothing, and then the paper floats into your hands. You want to ask about the other list, but decide against it."
msgstr "莫林揮了揮手，一張紙從他的包裹裡飛出來，飄在空中。你可以看到紙上寫著……「矇眼布、天鵝絨繩、三塊起司……」但莫林又揮了揮手，那張紙瞬間燒成灰經，出現了另一張空白的紙。紙上的字慢慢浮現，然後飄落到你手裡。你想問問那份清單，但最後還是算了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You are guided down into the dimly lit tunnel as dwarves gather around excitedly, seeing what Morlin has in store. The old wizard gladly takes the runes from you and begins focusing very deeply...\n\nEveryone holds their breath while he works, moving his hands in esoteric swirls and patterns until suddenly, the man... sneezes. But then! With a crack and a flash that bathes the room in cold blue light, a veil of magic slowly rolls off the door and evaporates into the air. Morlin warns everyone not to breathe in the cursed air, and as folks duck and cover their faces with clothes and pulled up shirts, he laughs and swats the air, exclaiming that there's no such thing.\n\nYou hold back the urge to take a pickaxe from the wall and stick it into his back as the door slowly rolls into the side of the wall, revealing... a long, cold hallway lined with suits of armor in remarkable condition. At the feet of these, many offerings were laid out ages ago. Withered flowers and fruits have light stains in the stone, almost completely missed because of the small piles of gems, coins, and other small treasures laid out.\n\nEveryone is quite pleased by the discovery, as the immediate payoff is overshadowed by the looming question: What more could lay further below?"
msgstr "你被帶入一條昏暗的隧道，矮人們興奮地圍過來，想看看莫林準備了什麼。老巫師欣然接過你手裡的符文，開始全神貫注……\n\n在他施法時，大家屏住呼吸，看他的雙手劃出神秘的軌跡和圖案。突然，他……打了個噴嚏。接下來！出現一聲爆裂響和一道閃亮。清冷的藍光照著四周，一層魔法屏障從門上慢慢落下，消失在空中。莫林提醒大家不要呼吸被詛咒的空氣。當大家紛紛躲避並用衣服遮臉時，他笑了起來，揮手驅散空氣，說根本就沒有詛咒。\n\n你真想取下牆上的鎬頭，捅進他的後背，但你忍住了。這時，那扇門慢慢滑入牆的一側，露出了……一條又長又陰的走廊。走廊兩邊有幾套存檔完好的護甲。在護甲的下面，有許多很久以前留下的祭品。凋零的花朵和水果在石頭上留下了淡淡的痕跡。如果沒有那些散落的寶石、錢幣和其他小財寶，這些痕跡根本不會被目擊。\n\n看到這些，大家都很高興。但比起眼前的這些，大家不禁在想：再往裡走，還有什麼呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Life's A Beach"
msgstr "海灘生活"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Life's a Beach - While out for a lovely day of fishing along the Windswept Shores, you managed to find a catch you're not quite sure if you should toss back or not. The grumpy old man is a pain to deal with, but with enough time, he might warm up to you.\n\nOr not."
msgstr "海灘生活——在「風蝕海岸」享受美好的釣魚時光時，你釣上來一個東西。你不確定該不該把它放回去。那個老頭脾氣暴躁，不好對付。但花點時間，他可能會對你態度好些。\n\n也可能不會。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe I'll reel it in, whatever it is."
msgstr "不管是什麼，我先釣上來看看。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait a second, I think I've got something!"
msgstr "等等，好像有東西上鉤了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You spend your day relaxing on the coast of the Windswept Shores, enjoying the waves crashing on the beach and sound of wind... sweeping the shore. Like much of the coastline near Azamire, the rocky outcroppings make for dangerous passage for the numerous boats heading up towards the capital, and another victim seems to have dashed itself along the rocks. The shipwreck calls to you, begging you to see what you can pull up from its depths."
msgstr "你一整天都在「風蝕海岸」悠閒度過，欣賞海浪拍打海岸的景象，聆聽海風吹過海岸的聲音。這裡和阿扎米爾附近的很多海岸線一樣，裸露的岩石讓前往都城的船隻面臨重重危險。似乎又有一艘船撞上了岩石。這艘船在呼喚著你，叫你去一探究竟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any chance I find something useful? Maybe..."
msgstr "我能找到什麼有用的東西嗎？或許是……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A DIY recipe?"
msgstr "一份自制配方？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, no... Who'd toss those out into the water?"
msgstr "不，不……誰會把那種東西扔進水裡？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A magic bucket?"
msgstr "一個魔法水桶？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No... you can only find those in lakes."
msgstr "不……那種東西湖裡才有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe an enchanted book?"
msgstr "或許是一本附魔書？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nah... the pages would be all soggy anyway."
msgstr "算了……紙肯定都溼透了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You continue thinking of strange things you'd never expect to find in the water while you marrily fish away, occasionally dozing off as you pull in fish after fish. You swear that you can see something floating out by the shipwreck, but every time you look closer, you lose sight of it."
msgstr "你一邊愉快地釣魚，一邊在想水裡可能出現的稀奇東西。你偶爾打個盹兒，釣上來的魚一條接一條。你發誓自己看到那艘船附近有東西漂著，可每次細看，卻什麼都沒有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wonder if I should toss him back..?"
msgstr "我想是不是該把它放回去？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe I shouldn't have asked if I could keep him."
msgstr "也許我不該問能不能把它留下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your hook is caught on something! It flails and flops and fights like no other fish you've ever caught before. You think for a moment that you've got the ship itself with as much raw energy as your catch fights back with. As you reel in, you see... A MAN!\n\nWaterlogged and a confusing mix of grumpy and appreciative, the man hacks up half the sea once you've pulled him onto shore."
msgstr "有東西上鉤了！跟你之前釣到的其他魚不一樣，這東西掙扎、撲通、反抗。這劇烈的反抗，讓你一度認為自己把那艘船釣到了。當你收線時，你看見……是個人！\n\n那個人全身溼透，神情複雜，氣惱又感激。你剛把他拖上岸，他就劇烈咳嗽起來，好像要把半個海都咳出來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't suppose you're edible, are you?"
msgstr "你該不會是可以吃的吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd quite seriously doubt your morals if you thought so. My name's Dixon, and it seems I've just barely survived a shipwreck."
msgstr "如果你這麼想，那我嚴重懷疑你的人品。我叫迪克森。看來我剛剛躲過了一場海難。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do I get to keep you?"
msgstr "我可以把你留下來嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You'd think that you were the one who nearly drowned out there with questions like these. Are you going to tell me where I am?"
msgstr "你這樣問，還以為剛才差點淹死的人是你呢。你能不能告訴我，我現在在哪兒？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Currently, you're on my fishing hook, and on the windswept shores."
msgstr "你現在在我的魚鉤上，在風蝕海岸。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Most shores I can think of are windswept, you're going to have to be a touch more specific than that."
msgstr "我能想到的大多數海岸都是風蝕海岸，你要說得再具體一些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, my apologies, I didn't quite emphasize that right. I meant the Windswept Shores. Capital letters n' all."
msgstr "噢，抱歉，我剛才沒說清楚。我說的是「風蝕海岸」。首字母大寫的那種。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Far from my home port then. Mind if I join you for a spell?"
msgstr "這兒離我的母港很遠。我可以在這兒待會兒嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just pulled you out of the sea, and the first thing you can think of doing is fishing?"
msgstr "我剛把你從海里撈上來，你想的第一件事居然是釣魚？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I figured it'd be a good way to get you to pull your damn hook out of my coat."
msgstr "我覺得這是個好辦法，可以把你那該死的魚鉤從我的外套上取下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah... right."
msgstr "啊……好吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You simply pluck your hook from the man's jacket, then lean away as he coughs up a bit more water. Among the debris that washed ashore, the man finds a decent enough rod and sits down beside you. Any attempts at further conversation are met with grumbles or silence. Eventually, he asks about the nearest town he could rest in, and you mention Azamire. He returns to his silence shortly after."
msgstr "你直接把魚鉤從那人的外套上取下來，然後退了幾步，看著那人繼續咳出海水。在衝上岸的東西中，那人找到一根還算湊合的釣竿，坐在你旁邊。後來，不管你說什麼，那人要麼發牢騷，要麼不說話。最後，他問你附近有沒有能歇腳的城鎮，你提到了阿扎米爾。你話一說完，他又沉默了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How do people even use these things?"
msgstr "這些東西到底怎麼用？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll stick with a rod for now. Best to give it to Dixon."
msgstr "我還是先用釣竿吧。把它給迪克森好了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The man stands and cracks his back, then tosses his catch into a loose bag. He seems to debate if he wants to continue talking to you at all, before he nods."
msgstr "那人站起來，活動一下背部，然後把釣到的東西扔進一個鬆垮的袋子。他似乎在猶豫要不要繼續和你說話。隨後他點了點頭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, thank you for pulling me out of the drink. You might be a touch special, but I can't deny that you helped me out of a jam."
msgstr "嗯，謝謝你把我從水裡撈起來。你這人有點不一樣，但我不得不承認，你確實幫了我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Perhaps it was a little insensitive when I asked if I could eat you."
msgstr "我剛才問能不能吃你，可能讓你覺得有點冒犯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And the other thing?"
msgstr "還有呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... I did catch you..."
msgstr "我把你釣上來……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Maybe you should have let me drown."
msgstr "……或許你應該讓我淹死。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm just kidding, I'm just kidding... Mostly."
msgstr "我開玩笑的，開玩笑的……都是開玩笑的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sure, sure. Speaking of catches, I'm sure you'll catch a lot of junk, but if you stick around here, you might find a decent enough net. You may have even found one already."
msgstr "好吧，好吧。說到釣東西，你肯定會釣到很多垃圾，但如果留在這兒，或許還能弄到一張不錯的網。沒準兒你已經弄到了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Interested?"
msgstr "有興趣嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If you wouldn't mind. Usually they run for a decent bit of gold, but perhaps I could offer you a bit of trade instead?"
msgstr "如果你不介意的話……這些東西通常能賣個好價錢。不過，或許我們可以做個交易，怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think we could make something like that work, I'll let you know. I'll find you in town later?"
msgstr "我覺得可以，我回頭再告訴你。我回頭到鎮上找你嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The man nods, seeming content with that, then heads up the road towards Azamire. Maybe you're already feeling wistful, but the shore feels a little bit lonely without his grumbles beside you."
msgstr "那人點了點頭，似乎很滿意。隨後，那人朝阿扎米爾走去。或許你感覺有點傷感。聽不到那人的牢騷，海岸顯得有些冷清。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dixon isn't hard to spot. Shortly after arriving back in Azamire, you find that he's already managed to procure himself a cart and he has started to sell off his catch. You offer up the net and he starts to beam, pleased at the quality of it. He mentions that it'll come in handy as a local tavernkeep just swung by, asking if he'd be interested in providing fresh fish for her tavern in exchange for a place to stay, and a bit of pay on top.\nAs several more folks begin to crowd around, asking about his prices, he talks about how they happen to be the highest quality fish from far off lands, and that he's basically losing money selling them at these prices. You start to wonder if you could do the same, considering you've got the exact same fish, from the exact same place."
msgstr "找到迪克森並不難。回到阿扎米爾後不久，你就目擊那人已經找到了一輛手推車，開始賣釣到的東西。你把網遞給他。他露出笑容，對網的質量很滿意。他說這張網正好有用，因為一家當地酒館的老闆娘來找過他，問他願不願意給那家酒館供應鮮魚，作為交換，他可以有個落腳的地方，還能多賺點錢。\n越來越多的人圍過來詢問價格。他說，這些魚都是從很遠的地方運來的，品質上等，按現在的價格賣就是在虧本。你開始想，自己是不是也可以這樣做，因為你有一樣的魚，這些魚都來自一樣的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Mage in the Making"
msgstr "法師覺醒"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Mage in the Making - A young woman has been trying in vain to cram all of her studies into a few fraught hours before her mentor arrives to town, much to the dismay of Lira and her patrons."
msgstr "法師覺醒——導師即將抵達小鎮，一名年輕女子試圖在短短几個小時內掌握所有功課，結果卻白忙一場。這讓利拉和她的顧客都十分頭疼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sure nothing could possibly go wrong arming her."
msgstr "我想，給她配備武器應該沒問題吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right?"
msgstr "對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You hear a cry ring out from the entire tavern followed by several rapid apologies from a distraught lady in the middle of the Spiced Honey Tavern. A concerningly large scorch mark has been left on the floor, with a table or two completely blown to pieces."
msgstr "香蜜酒館傳來一聲叫喊，隨後一名神色慌張的女子在酒館裡一直道歉。地板上留下了一塊巨大的焦痕，還有一兩張桌子被徹底炸成了碎片。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sorry! I'm sorry, I- I-, I can pay for that!"
msgstr "對不起！對不起，我……我……我可以賠！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's fine, sugar, I was needing to replace those tables anyway, and you've already done me the favor of turning them into kindling."
msgstr "沒關係，親愛的。這些桌子本來就要換了，你直接幫我把它們變成了柴火。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Still, your floor, it-"
msgstr "可是，你的地板……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rowan was going to mop today anyway, don't fuss over it so much."
msgstr "羅文今天本來就要拖地，別太在意了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know a spell! If I just-"
msgstr "我知道一個咒語！只要我——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think my tavern has seen enough of your magic for now, okay?"
msgstr "你的魔法，我想我的酒館已經見識夠了，好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[i]{0}[/i], how lovely to see you! A new mage has come to town and I'm sure you'd be able to help her out, yeah?"
msgstr "[i]{0}[/i]，見到你太好了！鎮上來了一位新法師，我想你能幫她，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, what? Help her out with-"
msgstr "等等，什麼？幫她——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "She says she's practicing! It's lovely, I just need her to do it... not here. Thanks, bye!"
msgstr "她說她在練習！挺好的，只是她能不能別在這兒練？謝謝，再見！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Hi. I'm Magnavous, and I'm... trying to be a mage."
msgstr "……你好。我叫麥格納沃斯，我……在嘗試成為一名法師。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think I've gotten a fair bit of the picture. Your studying is..."
msgstr "我想我大概知道是怎麼回事了。你的學習……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rocky, to say the least. But I think I'm getting close!"
msgstr "可以說是困難重重。但我覺得我快成功了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right. Is there anything I can help with?"
msgstr "好吧。有什麼我能幫忙的嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, I seem to have run out of air runes, do you have any that you'd be willing to spare?"
msgstr "那個，我的風之符文好像用完了，你那兒有多餘的嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll see if I can come up with some."
msgstr "我看能不能給你弄一些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You and Magnavous were rushed out of Lira's tavern as you talked and found yourself on the porch. Through the window, Lira continues to give you concerned glances, worried she'll have to fix up the front of her establishment. You usher her away from the building, and ask her to practice in a small glade near town, and that you'll come with some air runes as soon as you can."
msgstr "你和麥格納沃斯在說話的時候被匆匆趕出利拉的酒館，被趕到門廊。透過窗戶，利拉一直擔憂地看著你，擔心自己要修繕店面。你示意她離開酒館，讓她去鎮子附近的小空地練習，說你會盡快帶著風之符文去找她。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I never fancied myself a teacher, but let's take a stab at it."
msgstr "我從未想過自己會成為一名老師，不過就試試吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope she caught all that."
msgstr "希望她都聽進去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With the few supplies she had left, it'd seem that Magnavous has turned the serene glade you once adored into a smoking crater. A smouldering tree breaks at the middle and crashes to the ground as you approach."
msgstr "麥格納沃斯用她剩下的幾樣東西，把你曾經喜歡的那片寧靜小空地變成了一個冒著煙的坑洞。當你走近時，一棵冒煙的樹從中間破裂，倒在地上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I suppose no more picnics here for a little while..."
msgstr "看來暫時不能在這兒野餐了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I might be hopeless..."
msgstr "我可能沒救了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, no, not at all! Honestly, your magic seems... shockingly powerful, just a touch..."
msgstr "不，不，不是這樣的！說實話，你的魔法看起來……非常強，就是有點……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dangerous to myself and everyone around me?"
msgstr "對我和我周圍的人來說，有點危險？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I was going to say 'uncontrolled'. I think you're plenty powerful, the issue is more so with the fact that I think you're starting a little too big."
msgstr "我本來想說的是『不受控制』。我覺得你已經很強了，問題是你一開始就把動靜搞得太大了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hmm... But starting small would take more runes, and I can't just ask you to fetch me some every time I want to cast a spell."
msgstr "嗯……但如果開始的動靜小，就要更多的符文。我不能每次使用咒語都找你要符文吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Have you considered trying to make your own?"
msgstr "你有沒有想過自己製作符文？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You can do that?"
msgstr "你能做嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Where did you think they came from?"
msgstr "那你以為那些符文是哪兒來的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't know! I was supposed to have a mentor who'd teach me all of this, but he never turned up."
msgstr "我不知道！本來有位導師來教我，但他一直沒出現。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Who was he supposed to be, anyway?"
msgstr "話說回來，他是誰啊？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've only heard the stories I've heard in the capital... His name is Morlin, and he's said to be a dashing man."
msgstr "我只在都城聽過他的一些傳聞……他叫莫林，據說風度翩翩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He's a master of the arcane, has felled countless beasts and has unearthed some of the most powerful relics ever found..."
msgstr "他是位奧術大師，打敗過無數牛羚，還發掘了一些最有影響力的遺物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Um... I think I know him."
msgstr "嗯……我想我認識他。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You've met him!? Is he as wonderful as the stories say? My father sent me here to study under him, and I waited for a long while back in town..."
msgstr "你見過他！？他真的像傳聞說的那樣厲害嗎？我父親送我來這兒拜他為師，我在鎮上等了他好久……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I helped him out for a bit at a dig site nearby... A bit eccentric, but definitely talented."
msgstr "我在附近的一個挖掘場幫過他……他有點古怪，但確實有才華。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Did he mention me at all? That he had to be off soon to meet his apprentice?"
msgstr "他有提過我嗎？有提過很快要去見徒弟嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Uh... No... But the archaeological site he uncovered seems to be quite promising, there's a good chance he's just busy."
msgstr "呃……沒有……不過他目擊的那處考古遺址似乎很有前景，他可能只是太忙了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh... okay, hopefully that's what it is! Once I can control my magic a bit better, I can go and meet him myself!"
msgstr "噢……好吧，希望是這樣！等我能夠更好地掌控魔法，我就能自己去找他了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd like to learn how to make my own runes, can you show me?"
msgstr "我想學怎麼製作符文，你能教我嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You take out a couple of books you had intended to give her and run through the basics of runecrafting. She seems to absorb the information well, nodding along with your explanations even though it was a foreign concept to her just minutes ago."
msgstr "你拿出原本就打算送給她的幾本書，給她講解符文製作的基礎知識。她領悟得不錯，聽著你的講解不斷點頭，儘管就在幾分鐘前，這些概念對她來說還是完全陌生的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe she'll be a bit better now?"
msgstr "或許她現在好點了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fingers crossed."
msgstr "但願吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Magnavous proves to be an exceptionally quick study, and before long she's creating her own air runes with little issue at all. Her propensity to destroy her surroundings with her magic doesn't seem to extend to runecrafting, to which you're incredibly thankful."
msgstr "麥格納沃斯學得特別快。沒過多久，她就能輕鬆鍛造風之符文了。她喜歡用魔法摧毀周圍環境，但她在製作符文時沒有這樣做。對此，你感到很欣慰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is fantastic! Thank you so much."
msgstr "太棒了！太謝謝你了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's not a problem at all, I'm happy to help."
msgstr "不用謝，能幫你我很高興。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now, maybe I can start a bit smaller..."
msgstr "或許現在我可以開始嘗試更小的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, before you do, how would you feel about using a staff?"
msgstr "那在開始之前，你覺得用法杖怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They helped me focus my magic in the past, but..."
msgstr "以前我用法杖來集中魔法，但……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But..?"
msgstr "但……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My father stopped getting them for me since they got blown up so quickly..."
msgstr "我的法杖很快就炸了，所以我父親再也不給我買了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I see. Well, maybe now that you'll be trying with spells a little more suitable to your skill level, it'll go a touch better?"
msgstr "我明白了。不過，既然你這次嘗試的咒語更適合你的技能等級，說不定情況會好一些呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What'll I do if I break it though..?"
msgstr "萬一我把它弄壞了怎麼辦……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll make sure to bring a few spares."
msgstr "我會多帶幾根備用。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll try practicing with the smaller spells in the meantime! Oh! And maybe I'll make a couple extra runes..."
msgstr "同時我還會練習小咒語！噢！順便再多做幾個符文……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you leave Magnavous behind in the crater, you hear a reassuring lack of explosions or other generalized destruction."
msgstr "你把麥格納沃斯留在坑洞裡，周圍一片寂靜，沒有爆炸聲，也沒有其他巨大的破壞聲。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Surely... Surely, teaching her to arm herself can't go wrong."
msgstr "想必……想必沒問題吧。教她裝備自己總不會有什麼問題吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I have faith in her. Kind of."
msgstr "我對她有信心。算是有吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The crater is no better or worse than you left it, which you'll take as progress. You find Magnavous trying to wash away bits of ash and charred trees with a few well-placed water spells. More often than not the spells completely gouge chunks of earth from the ground, but they more-or-less seem to be going where she's aiming, at least."
msgstr "跟你離開時一樣，坑洞沒什麼變化，這也算是一種進步。你目擊麥格納沃斯正試圖用幾個精準的水系咒語沖洗地上的灰燼和燒焦的樹木。這些咒語往往會擊碎地面，但它們基本都落在了她瞄準的位置上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hello! I'm getting better, I almost don't destroy everything now!"
msgstr "你好！我好多了，現在幾乎不會破壞周圍環境！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, that's something! Maybe with these, you'll fare even better!"
msgstr "哦，那不錯！也許有了這些，你會更好！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're beautiful! I think these will be perfect for me."
msgstr "真好看！我覺得都很適合我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you, thank you, I try."
msgstr "謝謝，謝謝，我會努力的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Soon enough, I'll be able to meet Morlin, and then I'll be able to become a mage worth speaking about, with all of my own tales and adventures..."
msgstr "很快我就能見到莫林了，到時候我就能成為一名了不起的法師，有我自己的故事和冒險……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "About that..."
msgstr "關於那個……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's a chance your father may have..."
msgstr "你父親或許……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lied? I know."
msgstr "撒謊了？我知道。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know it might be har-"
msgstr "我知道這可能很——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, what? You already know?"
msgstr "等等，什麼？你已經知道了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah. I mean, look around. This is what my magic was like after years of practice."
msgstr "是的。我想說，看看四周。這是我苦練多年之後的魔法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I got my family into trouble in the capital dozens of times because of my... studies."
msgstr "因為我的……學習，在都城給家人惹了幾十次麻煩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Being exiled out here isn't all bad, and the fact that Morlin is close... Well, just a happy accident, I suppose!"
msgstr "被流放到這兒也未必是壞事，莫林就在附近……嗯，只能說是個「美麗的巧合」！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're still going to go looking for Morlin anyway?"
msgstr "你還要去找莫林嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why not? With your help, I'm actually starting to become a bit competent, and if he's just found some new big site to work on..."
msgstr "為什麼不呢？有你幫忙，我現在也不差了。如果他目擊了什麼新的大型遺蹟……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any hands would be helpful, I'm sure."
msgstr "我想的是，多個人幫忙總是好的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And if you learn a couple things along the way, help him out here and there..."
msgstr "如果你能在過程中學到點什麼，再順便幫幫他……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He might legitimately make me his apprentice!"
msgstr "他可能真的會收我為徒！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's not a half bad idea at all."
msgstr "這主意倒是不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But... before I go... I don't have any more essence. I feel like I'm right on the edge of a breakthrough, could you please get just a bit more for me?"
msgstr "不過……在我出發之前……我的精華沒了。我感覺我就快有突破了，你能幫我弄點精華嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You sigh, but head off to fetch some more essence to keep Magnavous's studies going somewhat smoothly. If she claims she's close to a breakthrough, might as well foster it."
msgstr "你嘆了口氣，但還是動身去弄精華，好讓麥格納沃斯能夠順利學習。既然她說快有突破了，不妨就幫她一把。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you come back with essence for Magnavous, you see that the crater is... substantially better? She looks to you with tears in her eyes, before dropping the remnants of a staff and rushing towards you. She wraps you in a hug as you notice that she managed to-you presume-use a combination of water and air spells to clean the ash and soot from her previous attempts as studying, and remove most of the land back to its original shape.\n\nThe land is damaged, but her efforts to fix it are clear as day, and you congratulate her on her training and give her a brief hug back. She thanks you for acting as her first mentor, and says that she thinks she's ready to trouble Morlin. You check over her gear and give her the essence and send her on her way. She turns back a few times as she walks off, waving and paying you more compliments than you feel you deserve. You feel as if you've learned just as much as her, just in a different way."
msgstr "當你帶著精華回去找麥格納沃斯時，你目擊那個坑洞……好了很多？她眼含淚花看著你，丟下殘破的法杖，向你跑來。她一把抱住你。這時你注意到，她可能用了流水和風咒語來清洗之前學習留下的灰燼和煙塵，將這裡的大部分土地回春原樣。\n\n雖然土地損壞了，但她為修復土地做出的努力都顯而易見。你祝賀她的修煉成果，也抱了她一下。她感謝你做她的第一位導師。她說已經準備好去麻煩莫林了。你檢查她的裝備，把精華給她，送她離開。她邊走邊回頭，向你揮手，不斷讚美你。那些讚美的話，你都覺得受之有愧。你感覺自己跟她一樣，也學到了很多，只是學習的方式不同。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Harvest Festival"
msgstr "豐收節"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Harvest Festival - Azamire's Annual Harvest Festival is right around the corner, and everyone is doing their part to help make it as great as it can be. Of course, the town will need your help to make it happen!"
msgstr "豐收節——阿扎米爾年度豐收節即將來臨，大家都在儘自己的努力，把節日辦好。當然，要做到這一點，小鎮需要你的幫助。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm not too sure how much they'll need... let's get quite a bit."
msgstr "具體需要多少，我也不確定……我們多準備點吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope this is enough."
msgstr "希望這些夠了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "On one of your many frequent outings to Lira's tavern, Hapren sets his sights on you, and immediately beelines over to where you're seated in the corner. He pushes your books aside and flags Lira down, who immediately catches your eye and gives you a sheepish look. She waves away a serving girl who started to walk over, and takes a seat next to you."
msgstr "你經常去利拉的酒館。有一次，哈普倫注意到了你，立馬朝你坐的角落走過來。他推開你的書，示意利拉過來。利拉馬上看了你一眼，有點不好意思。她揮手讓走過來的女服務員走開，然後坐在你旁邊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well well well, isn't it funny running into you here?"
msgstr "哎呀，沒想到在這兒碰見你？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "When I'm not training or adventuring, I'm basically always here, studying a bit... Why would it be funny to run into me here..."
msgstr "我不修煉或出去冒險的時候，基本上都在這兒，研究點東西……在這兒碰見我有什麼奇怪的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, I actually just came in like... two minutes ago. Have you been followin-"
msgstr "等等，我剛剛才進來……兩分鐘前。你一直在跟著——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The specifics aren't important!"
msgstr "細節不重要啦！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What is important is that you deeply care for this town, just like me, right?"
msgstr "重要的是，你和我一樣，都很關心這座小鎮，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...What do you want?"
msgstr "……你想幹嘛？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Harvest Festival is coming up, and we're behind. Please?"
msgstr "豐收節快到了，我們還沒準備好。拜託了，好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...You could have just asked."
msgstr "……你可以直接問我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But where's the fun in that?"
msgstr "但那樣有什麼意思呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Plus... it's kinda a lot. Lira needs help too."
msgstr "再說了……事情太多了。利拉也需要幫忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I was kinda the one who told him when you come in here... sorry."
msgstr "你進來的時候，是我告訴他的……抱歉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's okay, but when this is all done, I want enough ale that I cannot walk out of here. Or hear Hapren begging for more assistance."
msgstr "沒關係。不過等一切都結束了，我要喝麥芽酒，喝到走不動為止。我可不想聽哈普倫求人幫忙了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't ask th-"
msgstr "我沒讓——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Done."
msgstr "好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Alright, what do you need?"
msgstr "好吧，你需要什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of them go through a whirlwind of planning, talking about decor, food, games, and more while you struggle to both keep up and see your part in it all. Eventually you just settle into the corner and continue pouring over a map you bought off a local surveyor some time ago, until finally, Hapren asks if you caught all of that.\n\nYou shake yourself from your stupor and Lira asks if you could bring them enough maple logs to keep the bonfire going, and cook the food for festival. You nod and head out, happy to be away from their prattling."
msgstr "他們倆匆忙地討論裝飾、食物、遊戲等籌備安排。你跟不上他們的節奏，也不知道自己能做些什麼。最後你乾脆回到角落，繼續研究你之前從當地勘查員手裡買來的地圖。後來哈普倫問你，他們說的那些你都聽進去了沒。\n\n你從恍惚中回過神來。利拉問，你能不能弄些楓木原木，讓篝火不斷燃燒，順便做些節日要用的食物。你點點頭，起身離開，總算能從他們的喋喋不休中解脫了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm going to need you to grow... a bit faster."
msgstr "我需要你長得……快些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They haven't been being very specific about how much stuff they want..."
msgstr "關於具體需要多少東西，他們一直沒說清楚……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you drop off the last load of wood, Hapren claps his hands and pats you on the shoulder, pleased with your work."
msgstr "當你卸下最後一批木材時，哈普倫拍了拍手，又拍了拍你的肩膀，對你的工作很滿意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well done! It's genuinely kind of startling just how much you can accomplish."
msgstr "幹得好！你能做這麼多工作，真是令人驚訝。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, if it's for Lira and the festival, I'm happy to do it."
msgstr "都是為了利拉和節日，我很高興幫忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And for me..?"
msgstr "那為了我呢……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Where's Lira at?"
msgstr "……利拉在哪兒？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right over here, just checking out what you dropped off! These will be great for the food."
msgstr "在這兒，正在看你卸下的東西！這些用來做菜太棒了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah? I can't say I've experimented much with the logs I use..."
msgstr "是嗎？說實話，我沒怎麼研究過我用的原木……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "For some dishes, I'd argue it's even more important than the spices you use. These maple logs will give our dish a sweet, smoky flavor."
msgstr "對於有些菜來說，我認為木材比香料更重要。這些楓木原木會給我們的菜增添一股甜甜的煙燻風味。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Speaking of this dish, I assume we're making Azabuns this year?"
msgstr "說到我們的菜，我覺得今年一定要做阿扎小麵包。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well of course! We might as well not have the festival at all without 'em! But... we're missing something."
msgstr "那當然！要是沒有它，節日干脆也別辦了！不過……我們還缺點東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "缺什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, our Harvest Festival is to celebrate... you guessed it, Azamire's harvest, but just like in my pantry, some food has gone missing. But I can't be fussed with that right now."
msgstr "嗯，我們的豐收節是為了慶祝……沒錯，就是慶祝阿扎米爾的豐收。不過跟我的食物存放室一樣，有些食物不見了。但現在我也顧不上這個了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We need a fair bit more corn. I've seen you tending the fields from time to time, is that something you can handle?"
msgstr "我們需要很多玉米。我看你有時候去照料田地，這件事你能處理嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll be back before you know it!"
msgstr "我很快回來！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You set off for the fields, ready to bolster the last bit of Azamire's harvest for the year, with a bit of your own hard work. Hapren looks on expectantly, waiting to see if you say anything about helping him as well, then turns to Lira with a sad face. She only shakes her head and walks away."
msgstr "你前往田地，準備透過自己的辛勤勞動，為阿扎米爾今年的豐收貢獻一份力。哈普倫滿懷期待地看著你，等著看你會不會幫他，後來一臉沮喪地轉頭看著利拉。她只是搖了搖頭，便走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Take one, cook it, pass it on. Take on, cook it, pass it on..."
msgstr "拿一個，煮了，傳下去。拿一個，煮了，傳下去……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think that's almost all of them."
msgstr "我想大概就這些了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You enter the tavern and sling several sacks of corn onto the bar, to which Lira immediately jumps up from her stool, inspects several ears, and nods positively towards you. Without a word, she pushes a tankard of ale into your hands, and waits for you to drink it down."
msgstr "你走進酒館，把幾袋玉米扔到吧檯上。利拉立馬從凳子上跳起來，拿起幾穗玉米檢視，然後向你點點頭。她二話沒說，將一大杯麥芽酒塞到你手上，等你喝下去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you, but what's this for?"
msgstr "謝謝，不過這是？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The start of that payment we talked about."
msgstr "這是我們之前說好的報酬，這是第一杯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You know, you ask for ale as payment... often... I know I'm a tavern keeper, but I care for you. Is everything okay at home?"
msgstr "我說，你總是拿麥芽酒當報酬……雖然我是開酒館的，但我還是擔心你。你家裡一切都好吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What..? Yes, of course! Your ale is just to die for, and you know I like the house blend more than anything."
msgstr "什麼……？當然好啦！你這兒的麥芽酒太好喝了。你也知道，我最喜歡的就是特調款。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you even put in it?"
msgstr "你在裡面加了什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, a bit of coriander, hibiscus, juniper berries, orange peel... But I can't tell you the rest of course, I don't want to lose my leverage over you."
msgstr "嗯……加了點香菜籽、芙蓉花、杜松子、橙皮……還有什麼，我當然不能告訴你，我可不想失去對你的吸引力。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But, speaking of recipes, this corn was the last thing we needed for the Melvor-famous Azabuns!"
msgstr "不過說到配方，這玉米是製作梅爾沃名菜「阿扎小麵包」需要的最後一種原料！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll be calling in some people to help assemble them, but I'll need your help cooking them."
msgstr "我會叫人來幫忙準備，但煮的話還得靠你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't trust these vagabonds to not burn the food, or themselves, but I know you're capable."
msgstr "我不相信那些流浪漢，他們會把食物燒焦，甚至還會把自己燒焦，但我知道你可以的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lira lets out a loud whistle, and like a well-oiled machine the entire tavern pushes the tables together and drapes several clean cloths over them. It'd look like the start of a banquet if it wasn't for the crates of raw ingredients starting to be distributed among the patrons and the couple dozen more citizens that have started filtering in. \n\nThe townsfolk crack open the boxes and barrels of raw food and water and get to work in a show of efficency that shocks you. You wonder if Lira has access to some form of magic to make them work with such a fervor. But as you start to guess at her powers, you see tankards distributed and filled as Lira walks around checking progress. Seems you're not the only one taking drinks as payment."
msgstr "利拉吹了一聲響亮的口哨。整個酒館就像一臺高效運轉的機器，大家把桌子拼在一起，在桌面鋪上乾淨的布。如果不是把一箱一箱的生鮮食材分發給顧客以及隨後陸續進來的幾十位市民，這場景看起來就像要舉辦一場盛宴。\n\n鎮民們撬開裝有食材和水的箱子和桶，以驚人的效率投入工作。你想，利拉是不是用了什麼魔法，大家幹活才這麼賣力。當你開始猜測她究竟有什麼本事時，你看見利拉在人群中走來走去檢視進度，給大家分發和倒滿酒水。看來，用酒水當報酬的不止你一個。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope these turn out nicely."
msgstr "希望最後的結果令人滿意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's see what Hapren thinks."
msgstr "我們看看哈普倫怎麼說吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With a good chunk of the town working on them, and a few of Lira's staff helping cook the buns, the work goes faster than expected. It certainly helps that the townsfolk keep the atmosphere lively with several songs while they work and drink, though most of them would be more applicable to working in fields or mines, instead of assembling cute buns.\n\nAs you finish, Lira tops off your tankard before she notices someone off near the edge of the tavern. She quickly grabs a tankard from someone nearby who knows better than to argue, and then thrusts it into your hands, then hurries away. You down your fresh drink first, wondering why she gave you another, until-"
msgstr "鎮民們齊心協力，還有利拉的幾個人幫忙製作麵包，進度比預期要快。鎮民們一邊幹活喝酒，一邊唱歌，現場氣氛十分熱鬧，儘管這些歌大多更適合在田裡或礦井榦活的時候唱，而不太適合在製作可愛小麵包的時候唱。\n\n你一干完活，利拉就給你的酒杯倒滿。這時，她看見酒館邊上有個人。她迅速從旁邊一個識趣的人手裡拿過一杯酒，塞到你手上，然後就匆匆走了。你把剛倒的酒一飲而盡，心想她為什麼又給你一杯，直到——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hello there! How goes the assembly line? Are you free for a second or several?"
msgstr "你好！組裝那邊的工作怎麼樣了？你有空聊一會兒嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Thanks Lira."
msgstr "……謝謝你，利拉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nothing, nothing. Think we're about finished up here, what else do you need?"
msgstr "沒事，沒事。我們這邊差不多快完了，你還需要什麼嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've got a lovely idea to light up the town square. I hope to fill some lanterns with some gems from the town's treasury, and when they're lit... I hope it'll glitter beautifully."
msgstr "我有個好辦法，能讓小鎮廣場亮起來。我想在燈籠裡裝些小鎮寶庫裡的寶石，等點亮燈籠……那時候肯定很美。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's actually... a pretty good idea. Are you worried about thieves at all, though? Sounds like a lot of loot to be leaving out."
msgstr "這辦法確實……很不錯。不過，你不怕有盜賊嗎？把那麼多寶物放在外面。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They'll be under watch, don't you worry. I've already signed off on the gems being used, but there's just one thing..."
msgstr "會有人護盾，你放心。我已經同意裝寶石了，不過還有一件事……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You don't have the lanterns and want me to make them?"
msgstr "你沒有燈籠，想讓我做？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is why I always come to you for help! You're always one step ahead of everyone else."
msgstr "所以我總來找你幫忙嘛！你總是比別人快一步。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'll try to be a little less competent in the future."
msgstr "……看來以後我要笨點才行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Last thing, I promise. For this event, that is."
msgstr "我保證，這是最後一件事。我是說，這次活動。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You leave the assembly line behind as they begin to tidy up and return the tavern back to its usual configuration. Hapren calls out several thank yous as you leave, but you don't turn, lest he throw on another task or two should you pay him any further mind."
msgstr "你離開組裝現場，這時大家開始打掃收拾，將酒館回春原樣。你走的時候，哈普倫一直說謝謝，但你沒有回頭。要是你再搭理他，說不定他還會給你一兩件事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hapren happily takes the lanterns from you, passing them down a line where a few of Azamire's guards-headed by Jass-drop gemstones into the lanterns and get them hung up. People begin filtering into the square as the sun slowly slips below the horizon. You can't help but start getting swept up in the excitement as more and more of the modest town square is filled with decor, food, and life.\n\nPeople from all walks of life stop by, many from Azamire, but some from the surrounding villages, bringing plenty of their own special dishes, songs, and traditional garb. Many are just variations on one another, but the differences really stand out between each other.\n\nYou dance late into the night and-of course-enjoy your fill of Azabuns and other regional delicacies, pleased with your contributions to the festival, even if you really think Hapren should enlist some more help next time."
msgstr "哈普倫高興地接過燈籠，讓大夥兒傳下去。在傑絲的帶領下，幾名阿扎米爾守護將寶石放入燈籠，然後掛起來。太陽慢慢沉入地平線，人們開始陸續進入廣場。看著各種裝飾、食物和人群慢慢出現在原本冷清的廣場，你忍不住興奮起來。\n\n來自各方的人們匯聚在這裡，有阿扎米爾的，也有附近村莊的，他們帶來了自己特色的美食、歌謠和傳統服飾。雖然很多都大同小異，但不同的地方卻十分明顯。\n\n你跳舞跳到深夜，當然也吃了很多的阿扎小麵包和其他地方美食。對於自己在這次節日中的貢獻，你很高興；儘管你真心覺得，哈普倫下次應該多找點人幫忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Setting Down Roots"
msgstr "落地生根"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Setting Down Roots - The Blackthorn Sisters have made one of their frequent appearances in Azamire, but seem to have brought a bit more than their usual cart of goods. What brings them to town today?"
msgstr "落地生根——黑刺姐妹又來到了阿扎米爾，但這次她們帶的東西似乎比平時要多。她們今天來幹嘛呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wonder what ever happened to this place?"
msgstr "我在想，這裡以前發生過什麼事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Should be cleaned up enough now. [Talk]"
msgstr "現在應該清理得差不多了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You walk up to the large vine and pelt-covered wagon that has parked itself on the edge of town. You see two familiar faces, Petal and Clove, sisters that stop by and sell herbs, potions, pelts, and meat. They sit in front of an old burned-out house on the back of a large wagon packed with furniture, discussing plans for what their new home should look like."
msgstr "你走向鎮子旁邊的那輛大馬車，車身上纏著藤蔓，還蓋著獸皮。你看到了兩張熟悉的面孔：佩塔和克洛夫姐妹。她們經常來這兒賣草藥、藥水、獸皮和肉類。她們坐在一輛裝滿傢俱的大馬車上，馬車停在一棟被燒燬的老房子前。她們商量著新房的樣子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Looks like you've brought a bit more than potions and meat this time, eh?"
msgstr "看來你們這次帶的不止藥水和肉類，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's so nice to see you again, it's been too long!"
msgstr "很高興再次見到你，好久不見了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We finally bit the arrow and decided to set up shop here. It's what Petal wants to do, at least."
msgstr "我們最後決定在這兒開家店。至少，這是佩塔想做的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Come now, you know I'm looking out for the both of us."
msgstr "好了，你知道我這麼做是為了我們兩個。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Plus, Azamire has always been one of our most lucrative stops. Who knows, with how fast this place is growing, maybe we'll do even better than before!"
msgstr "再說了，阿扎米爾一直是我們生意最好的地方之一。誰知道呢，照這裡的發展速度來看，說不定我們的生意會比以前更好！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Azamire might be where I rest, but the woods will always be my home. I can't stay tied down for too long."
msgstr "阿扎米爾或許是我落腳的地方，但森林才是我永遠的家。我沒法一直待在同一個地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, I hope that we'll be able to do our best to make you feel welcome, regardless of where you may be."
msgstr "好吧，無論你在哪兒，我們都會盡最大的努力，讓你感受到我們對你的歡迎。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, don't mind Clove, she's just... trying to appear strong and mysterious."
msgstr "噢，別在意克洛夫，她只是……想裝得強大神秘。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You know, she always gets excited whenever we get close to Azamire, starts trying to take down big game to show off to yo-"
msgstr "你知道嗎，每次我們要到阿扎米爾了，她就特別興奮，想去獵殺大獵物，好在你面前炫耀——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Petal, I prefer animals and monsters, but I can make an exception."
msgstr "佩塔，我更喜歡動物和怪物，不過我可以破例一次。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm just teasing you. Just saying that settling down isn't all bad."
msgstr "我在逗你呢。我想說的是，安定下來也不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's certainly worse places to go, I can tell you that."
msgstr "我敢說，肯定還有更糟糕的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Though... I can't say you two have picked the most... lovely of spots in Azamire."
msgstr "不過……你們選的這個地方，在阿扎米爾不是……最好的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your mayor said that we could have the place for free, as long as we got it all fixed up."
msgstr "你們的鎮長說，只要我們把這兒修好，就可以免費住。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's so much space for a nice little garden in the back as well! I might not have to constantly trek into the woods to get basic herbs anymore."
msgstr "後面還有一大片空地，可以弄個小花園！這樣我就不用總去森林找草藥了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If only there was some strong, helpful individual who'd be willing to help break down all the rubble..."
msgstr "要是有位強壯的好心人願意幫忙清理這些碎石就好了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...For a healthy bundle of herbs and meat when we get established?"
msgstr "……等我們安頓下來，會送上一大捆草藥和肉作為報酬，怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Pass me a shovel, I've got my pickaxe right here."
msgstr "把鏟子給我，我正好帶了鎬頭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Petal claps her hands and motions for Clove to hand you a shovel. She rolls her eyes and scoffs, but noticeably shies away-just a bit-when you take it from her. The house is a mess, but the foundation is still good. With a lot of work, it's in a great spot in town, and could be a wonderful home and shop."
msgstr "佩塔拍了拍手，示意克洛夫把鏟子遞給你。她翻了個白眼，哼了一聲，下意識地往後退了退，雖然只是退了一點。房子雖然破亂，但地基還是好的。房子的地理位置絕佳，只要花點功夫修繕，肯定非常適合居住和開店。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wonder what Clove might find for dinner. [Provide] X/X [Steel Arrows] - [Fletching Tab Link]"
msgstr "我在想，克洛夫會找什麼當晚餐。[Provide] X/X [Steel Arrows] - [Fletching Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These should do nicely. [Talk]"
msgstr "這些應該可以。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Both Petal and Clove work on the house while you break up and remove the rubble. Petal tends to the wild tangle of plants out back, while Clove always seems to be nearby, either breaking down old furniture with a hefty axe, or sweeping up in the spots you've finished. While the two of you work, Clove tries to strike up bits of conversation while Petal stays mysteriously absent, even when she finishes up outside."
msgstr "佩塔和克洛夫負責修整房子，你負責清理碎石。佩塔在屋後打理雜草；克洛夫總是跟著你，要麼用斧子砍舊傢俱，要麼打掃你清理過的地方。幹活的時候，克洛夫會閒聊幾句，而佩塔有點神秘，外面的活兒幹完了也看不到她。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I guess sticking around here won't be all bad."
msgstr "我想，留在這裡也未必是壞事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No? I don't think so. I get out quite a bit, but it's always nice to have somewhere to come back to."
msgstr "不？我不覺得。我雖然經常出門，但回來有個落腳的地方，還是不錯的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It doesn't ever feel... smothering? Knowing that people might wonder where you are, fuss after you..."
msgstr "難道不覺得……壓抑嗎？想到有人可能會惦記你在哪兒，關心你……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Petal doesn't do that already?"
msgstr "佩塔不就是這樣嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, yeah, of course, but she's my sister. I don't know, I guess... I don't want folks to start expecting anything of me."
msgstr "嗯，確實，但我們是姐妹嘛。怎麼說呢，我想……我不想別人對我有什麼期待。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't think you'll need to worry too much about that. There's plenty of odd folks around here, you'll fit right in."
msgstr "我覺得你不用過於擔心。這兒到處都是古怪的人，你會很自在的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gee, thanks, I feel welcome already."
msgstr "呵，謝謝你，我感覺到歡迎了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any time. I'm kidding, of course, but really, unless you're someone like Lira, who runs the tavern, most people just... go about their days."
msgstr "隨時都歡迎。當然，我是開玩笑的。不過說真的，除了像開酒館的利拉，大多數人都……過得平平淡淡。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Plus, you're a hunter, it's kind of normal that you'll head out for days or even weeks at a time, depending on your mark."
msgstr "再說了，你是獵人，你出去一趟就是好幾天甚至好幾個星期，這也很正常，畢竟狩獵目標不一樣嘛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Speaking of which... I don't know the lands too well, I'm used to throwing myself into the woods wherever we travel and just making the best of it."
msgstr "說到這個……我對這兒不太熟。我經常走到哪兒就直接進森林，盡力就行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But... I think I'll actually start being able to hone my craft a bit, sticking in once place for a while... Getting familar with the landscape and hunting grounds."
msgstr "但……如果能在一個地方待一段時間，我或許能好好磨鍊一下自己的技能……也能熟悉一下地形和獵場。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I might look around a little bit now, and find us some dinner, actually. If you think you can manage without me, that is."
msgstr "我打算在附近轉轉，順便找點東西晚上吃。我是說，如果我不在，你能自己應付的話。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll get by, don't worry."
msgstr "我能應付，別擔心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "However... I hope to find us some dinner, too. I know Petal won't let you leave here without feeding you. By any chance, would you happen to have some arrows I could use?"
msgstr "不過……我也想找點東西晚上吃。我知道，佩塔肯定不會讓你空著肚子走的。你那兒有沒有我能用的箭？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We made a long trek to get here, and I've gone through most of my stock."
msgstr "我們長途跋涉才到這兒，帶的東西也快沒了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You chuckle at the idea of needing to manage without her, then having her turn around and ask you for help instead. You head out to find some, and as you do, you walk past Petal, who has a dozen or so people in tow, all armed with various tools or carrying lumber. Shockingly efficient, that one."
msgstr "她本該自己應付，結果卻轉頭讓你幫忙，你忍不住笑了。你去找箭，經過佩塔時看到她身後跟著十幾個人，大家都拿著各種工具或扛著木頭。這效率真高啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This stuff grows worse than most weeds. [Cut] X/X [Ambervine Bush] - [Woodcutting Tab Link]"
msgstr "這東西長得比雜草還多。[Cut] X/X [Ambervine Bush] - [Woodcutting Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Looking a bit better now. [Talk]"
msgstr "現在看起來好多了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The arrows you hand to Clove aren't anything special, yet she still takes plenty of time running through a handful of them, inspecting their quality and bend, along with the arrow tips at the end of each, before giving a self-assured nod. She gives a little wave before heading out."
msgstr "你給克洛夫的箭沒什麼特別，但她還是花了不少時間，仔細檢查這些箭的品質、彎曲度和箭頭，然後滿意地點了點頭。她向你揮了揮手，然後就走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You know, where we come from, giving someone arrows for a hunt is as good as a proposal for marriage?"
msgstr "你知道嗎，在我們那裡，送人箭去打獵，就相當於求婚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Taking an arrow to the shin, I believe it's called, though hardly anyone still believes in that silly custom."
msgstr "有句話這樣說，脛骨中了一箭。現在幾乎沒人相信這種荒唐的習俗了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is that so? And where exactly might that be?"
msgstr "是嗎？到底是哪裡的習俗呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's from a district in the capital I highly doubt you've gotten to, don't worry about following up on it."
msgstr "是都城的一個區。我敢肯定你沒去過那兒，所以別在意了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With your professions, I'm surprised you both came from the capital. What made you turn from the city to being..."
msgstr "以你們的職業來看，沒想到你們是從都城來的。是什麼讓你們離開城市，成了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A couple of women who trek through the boonies and sleep in the dirt?"
msgstr "成了兩個在荒野奔波、睡在泥地裡的女人？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Something like that."
msgstr "差不多這樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Spend that much time around that many people and see what you think of it after a couple decades."
msgstr "在人群裡待著，過個二十年，你就知道是什麼感覺了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think we just wanted out, a bit of room to stretch our legs and see what the world had to offer."
msgstr "我想，我們只是想逃離那裡，找個地方放鬆一下，好好看一看世界。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And now you're settling back down."
msgstr "現在你們又在這兒生根落戶了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, I'm sure we'll still go out and visit all the corners of Melvor from time to time, but you know, neither of us are getting any younger."
msgstr "噢，我們肯定還是會出去，去梅爾沃到處看看。但你也知道，我們都不年輕了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And it's nice to have an occasional bath from time to time. Hard to find that out on the road."
msgstr "偶爾能洗個澡確實不錯。出門在外，想找個地方洗澡太難了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can only imagine. But with how fast your house got put up, I'm sure you could have a whole bathhouse put up in a couple hours if you were so inclined."
msgstr "我完全能想象。不過，你們的房子修得這麼快，如果你們真想的話，幾個小時就能搭一間浴室。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How'd you get those townsfolk to come and help you so fast?"
msgstr "那些鎮民這麼快就來幫忙，你是怎麼做到的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, those farmers have plenty of pest issues, I hear, and I just so happen to dabble in poisons along with my normal stock of potions."
msgstr "哦，我聽說那些農夫想除害蟲，而我除了常備的各種藥水，恰好也懂一些毒藥。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Got anything you think might be handy against... bigger beasts?"
msgstr "有沒有什麼東西，你覺得可以對付……那些大怪獸？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not just yet, but I'll keep you in the know. Along with those, I'm working on some herbicides too... took care of most of the tangle in the back, except for those damn Ambervines."
msgstr "暫時沒有，不過一有我就告訴你。另外，我還在研製除草劑……屋後的大部分雜草都清理了，就剩下那些該死的琥珀藤了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd ask Clove to go whack them with that axe of hers, but you seemed to have scared her off. Be a dear, would you?"
msgstr "我本想讓克洛夫拿斧子把它們砍了，但你好像把她嚇跑了。你能幫我個忙嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You roll your eyes and set to work on the brush behind the house, knocking down the Ambervine where you can. Like Petal claimed, many of the other noxious plants that were back here seem to have withered away."
msgstr "你翻了個白眼，開始清理屋後的灌木，順便砍了那些琥珀藤。跟佩塔說的一樣，這裡的其他有害植物似乎大多已經凋零了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully Petal hasn't severely poisoned the ground. [Plant] X/X [Sunflower] - [Farming Tab Link]"
msgstr "希望佩塔沒有把這塊地毒得太重。[Plant] X/X [Sunflower] - [Farming Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Huh, well, I guess the herbalist knows what she's doing. Who'd guess? [Complete Quest Button]"
msgstr "呵，看來這位草藥師有兩把刷子。誰能想到呢？[Complete Quest Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You wipe your brow and just start to lean back against the wall of the house when Clove comes in the newly constructed gate and drops several birds on the ground and sets her bow on a nearby crate."
msgstr "你擦了擦額頭，準備靠著屋牆歇會兒。這時，克洛夫從新修的大門走了進來。她將幾隻鳥扔在地上，把弓放在旁邊的一個箱子上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "From smacking rocks to whacking bushes, you truly are a menace to the natural world."
msgstr "從擊打岩石到砍伐灌木，你簡直就是自然界殺手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Those birds might say the same about you."
msgstr "那些鳥恐怕也這麼想你吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't think they'd be saying much of anything at all, anymore. I didn't give them the chance."
msgstr "我想它們應該說不了話了。我根本沒給它們說話的機會。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You might have sampled one too many of your sister's potions if you think that bushes are any more talkative."
msgstr "如果你覺得灌木更能說，那你八成是喝多了你妹妹的藥水。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Touché."
msgstr "說得對。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you about done brutalizing the shrubbery?"
msgstr "你摧殘灌木的活兒都幹完了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They'll bother you no longer, m'lady."
msgstr "它們再也不會來煩你了，小姐。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wonderful! Then there's just one final thing for you left to do!"
msgstr "太好了！你還有最後一件事沒做！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Where'd the rest of your helpers go?"
msgstr "你的其他幫手去哪兒了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Back to their homes, but they don't get to have dinner here. You do. "
msgstr "回家了，他們沒機會在這兒吃晚飯。但你有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Plus, it'll put a smile on my dear sister's face. You'd like that, wouldn't you?"
msgstr "而且，這還能讓我親愛的妹妹笑一笑。你也希望這樣，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Goodness Petal, just get on with it!"
msgstr "天哪，佩塔，快動手吧！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Like I mentioned, I want to start growing my own herbs, but I know that blight can be a nasty beast to deal with this time of year."
msgstr "我說過，我想自己種草藥，但我知道，這個時候如果遇到凋零病就麻煩了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A few sunflowers can do wonders at holding it and a surprising amount of other types of corruption off."
msgstr "種幾棵向日葵效果很好，不僅可以預防凋零病，還可以有效預防其他疫病。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And how will that put a smile on Clove's face, exactly?"
msgstr "怎麼才能讓克洛夫開心起來呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They just make me happy... I don't know, always liked 'em."
msgstr "向日葵會讓我快樂……怎麼說呢，我一直喜歡向日葵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But that hardly matters, the garden is going to be important for keeping any kind of livelihood goin' while we get set up."
msgstr "不過這不重要，在我們安頓下來的這段時間，這片花園是我們維持生計的關鍵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just hope Petal's herbicides aren't still lingering around."
msgstr "我只希望佩塔之前用過的除草劑沒有殘留。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They shouldn't be, but if you start to feel strange, please take extensive notes, I might want to replicate it for my poisons!"
msgstr "不應該呀，但如果你覺得不對勁，請記下來，說不定我能照著調配毒藥！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Petal looks a bit too excited at the prospect of you getting sick from her treated land, while Clove occasionally stops by to check if you're feeling off at all before quickly dismissing herself each time."
msgstr "一想到你可能會因為她處理過的土地而生病，佩塔顯得很興奮。克洛夫時不時過來問你有沒有不舒服，問完就走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you finish up with the flowers, you catch a whiff of Petal's cooking and let yourself inside. The place isn't 'homey' just yet, but it's far better than the wreck it was just a bit ago, and trust the two of them will give it the final touch-ups it needs.\n\nClove sets the table and waves you away when you try to help, so you turn to Petal, who brushes past you with three steaming birds balanced on her arm, with a pitcher of... something in the other. \nUsing herbs she'd gathered, Petal seasoned the meat to perfection, and Clove produces a few fruits she collected while she was hunting. They pair beautifully with the... concoction that Petal assures you is safe to drink. It's sickly sweet and could be considered tasty, if it weren't for the fact that it leaves you feeling as though you've plunged into an icy lake, but only for a few moments after each sip\n\nPetal pushes your chair towards Clove's every once in a while, and slowly but surely she begins to turn bright red, but plays it off casually. Eventually, you all finish your meals, and Petal takes down a few notes as to how you felt while you drink her beverage. They both thank you for your time, and encourage you to come back once they've set up shop."
msgstr "忙完花草的活兒，你聞到了佩塔做飯的香氣，於是自己進了屋。雖然這裡還不像家，但跟之前的破敗相比，已經好多了。相信她們會完成最後的修整工作。\n\n克洛夫在擺放餐具。看你想幫忙，她揮手讓你休息。你轉頭看著佩塔。佩塔從你身邊經過，一隻手端著三隻熱氣騰騰的鳥，另一隻手提著一壺……不知道什麼東西。佩塔用她採的草藥給肉調味，味道特別好。克洛夫拿出她在狩獵時採集的果子。這些果子和那壺……喝的很搭。佩塔向你保證，那喝的絕對安全。它的味道甜得膩人。每喝一口都會讓你產生一種墜入冰湖的感覺（儘管這種感覺的時間很短），所以也還算美味。\n\n佩塔時不時地將你的椅子往克洛夫那邊挪動。克洛夫的臉慢慢紅了，但仍然裝作沒事的樣子。吃完後，佩塔記下你喝那壺飲品的感受。她們感謝你的幫助，歡迎你在開店後再來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A Glittering Trap"
msgstr "閃亮的陷阱"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A Glittering Trap - Gol has been tasked with taking down a beast near Azamire, and what good would a battle be without a friend by your side?"
msgstr "閃亮的陷阱——戈爾接到任務項目，要去對付阿扎米爾附近的一頭牛羚。既然要去戰鬥，身邊怎麼能沒有朋友呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's make sure these are sturdy enough to handle... whatever we're fighting. [Provide] X/X [Rune Spear] - [Fletching Tab Link]"
msgstr "我們要確保這些裝備足夠結實，能夠對付……我們要戰鬥的東西。[Provide] X/X [Rune Spear] - [Fletching Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These look good, let's get Gol. [Talk]"
msgstr "這些看起來不錯，我們去找戈爾吧。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A small crowd has gathered around in a tight semi-circle near the front of The Spiced Honey Tavern. There are folks cheering, exclaiming for more or begging to be let into the 'act'. Never one to sit out an exciting moment, you make your way into the throngs of people and find Gol, a towering man with more muscles than sense. He sits under a table and hoists it into the air while several tipsy patrons delicately balance on top of it. He laughs as one of them pours a tankard in his mouth from above, then gently lowers the table back down to the ground. He flexes for the crowd as more people climb onto the table, but he stops mid-pose as his eyes meet yours."
msgstr "香蜜酒館的前面有一小群人，他們緊緊地圍成一個半圓。人群中傳來歡呼聲，有人起鬨說『再來一個』，有人求著要加入『表演』。人人都喜歡看熱鬧。你擠進人群，找到戈爾。他身材高大，肌肉發達，頭腦簡單。他蹲在桌子底下，將桌子高高舉起。幾名醉醺醺的顧客小心翼翼地在桌面上保持平衡。其中一名顧客將一大杯酒倒進他嘴裡，他笑了，然後輕輕地把桌子放下來。他向大家展示肌肉，這時又有人爬上桌子。當他和你的目光交匯時，他停了下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol must cease his entertainment for now, good people, for Gol has found his friend!"
msgstr "各位，戈爾必須暫停表演了，因為他找到他的朋友啦！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Me?"
msgstr "我？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course! You've been instrumental in Gol's rise from a coinless pauper to what he has become today!"
msgstr "當然是你！戈爾從身無分文的窮光蛋變成今天這樣，全靠你的幫助！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I will say, you are looking a bit more... put together than last time."
msgstr "說真的，你看起來……比上次好多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That he is! After Gol's travels, he has found many a coin, armed himself better than before, and is now ready to lead his friend to the same riches!"
msgstr "可不是嘛！遊歷之後，戈爾攢了不少錢，裝備也比以前更好了。現在，戈爾準備帶上朋友一起去發財！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... I can't say that I'm not a little interested in what you had in mind, but really, that's not necessary. I'm just happy to see you on your feet, and a bit more clothed than last time."
msgstr "那個……說實話，我有點好奇你是怎麼想的，不過這沒關係。看到你能站位腳跟，而且穿得也比上次像樣些，我就很高興了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol must insist! Gol has been tasked with slaying a beast just a short jaunt from here, and with your assistance, Gol is sure to be successful once again!"
msgstr "戈爾必須堅持！戈爾接到任務項目，要去屠殺附近的一頭牛羚。有你幫忙，戈爾一定能再次成功！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You may not help Gol fight the creature directly, but setting up a site to fight it is very okay!"
msgstr "雖然你不能直接幫戈爾打牛羚，但幫忙佈置一下場地完全沒問題！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh? And what might it be?"
msgstr "哦？到底是什麼樣的怪獸？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why remember silly details like the beast's name? Gol only remembers where the beast resides, along with its penchant for gems and shiny things."
msgstr "幹嘛要記那些無關緊要的細節，比如牛羚的名字？戈爾只記得牛羚住在哪裡，還有它特別喜歡寶石和閃閃發光的東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'm slightly surprised you used penchant successfully..."
msgstr "……你居然用對了『特別喜歡』這個詞，我有點驚訝……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Depending on the day, I’m not sure I’d use that correctly myself."
msgstr "連我自己有時候都不確定能不能用對。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol is smarter than he looks The brain is a muscle just like all others, and should be exercised to keep it sharp."
msgstr "戈爾比他看起來要聰明。大腦跟身體的其他部位一樣，也是一塊肌肉，需要透過鍛鍊來保持敏銳。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "To become smart like Gol, every day, you must split a log with nothing but your head."
msgstr "要想變得像戈爾一樣聰明，你每天都要用腦袋劈開一根原木。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your vision may go fuzzy... and your sense of smell may never be the same. But nothing beats the first time you're able to stoke a fire with wood you've splintered with your own body."
msgstr "你可能會看不清東西……嗅覺也可能變弱。但當你第一次用自己身體劈開的木頭生火時，一切都值了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do you understand?"
msgstr "你明白了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "More and more by the minute."
msgstr "越來越明白了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But... concerning training aside, it really is good to see you well, Gol. I'm down for your adventure. What do we need?"
msgstr "不過……拋開修煉不說，看到你沒事真是太好了，戈爾。我跟你一起冒險。我們需要準備什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol knew you would be! Gol will lead the way, his sense of direction has been honed as well."
msgstr "戈爾就知道你會來的！戈爾帶路，他的方向感也是練過的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But before we depart, Gol would like spears, and many of them."
msgstr "不過在出發前，戈爾需要長矛，很多的長矛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The beast Gol has been entrusted to slay is a slippery one, and we will need to prepare an arena to fight it in."
msgstr "戈爾要去屠殺的那頭怪獸特別狡猾。我們需要佈置競技場，準備對戰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What'll you be doing in the meantime?"
msgstr "你這段時間打算做什麼呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He will consult with the locals to ensure the best path to the beast. Best of luck, friend."
msgstr "他打算去問問當地人，打聽一下尋找那頭牛羚的最佳路線。祝你好運，朋友。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You watch as Gol dusts himself off and waves to the crowd that has lingered, likely hoping for a bit more amusement before they get on with their days. He calls for Lira with a bit more warmth and familiarity than you were expecting, then the door to the tavern swings shut."
msgstr "你看到戈爾拍了拍身上的灰塵，向周圍還沒走的人群揮了揮手。這些人可能是想在開始一天的忙碌之前，再多看看熱鬧。他招呼利拉過來，語氣比你預料的更親切、更熟悉。隨後，酒館的門關了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I feel like I'm arming Gol for war, I hope whatever it is goes down quickly. [Provide] X/X [Rune Javelin] - [Fletching Tab Link]"
msgstr "我感覺自己像在為戈爾備戰。我希望這一切快點結束。[Provide] X/X [Rune Javelin] - [Fletching Tab Link]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll have a problem if this isn't enough. [Talk]"
msgstr "如果這些不夠，我們就麻煩了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With your rune spears in tow, you enter the Spiced Honey Tavern and find Gol with several maps laid out in front of him, with a surprisingly methodical route planned out for your journey. Lira comes by and tops off his tankard."
msgstr "你帶著符文長矛走進香蜜酒館，目擊戈爾面前有幾張地圖，上面為你們的旅程規劃了一條特別清晰的路線。利拉走過來，給他的酒杯倒滿。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah, and here's your friend now! You two stay safe, okay?"
msgstr "啊，你的朋友來了！你們兩個注意安全，好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol is always safe, but he will also ensure his friend's safety as well. You have Gol's word."
msgstr "戈爾一直很安全，他也會確保自己的朋友安全。這是戈爾的承諾。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll hold you to that. Best of luck!"
msgstr "我記住你的話了。一切順利！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You two seem to get along nicely."
msgstr "你們兩個似乎相處得不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lira appreciates Gol's humor and physique in equal measure, along with his ability to drink as much as half her tavern."
msgstr "利拉欣賞戈爾的幽默，也欣賞他的體格，還有他能喝光半個酒館的酒量。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol also helps move things around, from time to time."
msgstr "戈爾偶爾也會幫忙搬東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I feel as if you could help her relocate the whole building if you set your mind to it."
msgstr "我覺得，只要你願意，你甚至能幫她把整個房子都搬走。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The flimsy building would not hold up to Gol's might. Trust Gol. He has tried before."
msgstr "這房子搖搖欲墜，經不起戈爾的威力。相信戈爾。他之前試過。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You impress and terrify me."
msgstr "我佩服你，也怕你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you a building?"
msgstr "你是房子嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...No?"
msgstr "……不是？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Than you have nothing to fear, friend!"
msgstr "那你沒什麼可怕的，朋友！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol's only enemies are beasts, monsters, and taxes."
msgstr "戈爾的敵人只有牛羚、怪物和稅收。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not the people that robbed you when we first met?"
msgstr "我們第一次見面時，搶你的那些人呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How'd they pull one over on you, anyway? You're a mountain of a man."
msgstr "他們到底是怎麼搶的你？你壯得像座山。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nay. Gol refuses to fight people unless his life depends on it."
msgstr "不。除非有生命危險，否則戈爾不會跟人打架。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol has spilled enough blood of his countrymen, Gol wishes to do so no longer."
msgstr "戈爾手上沾了太多同胞的鮮血，他再也不想這樣了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lucky them, I'd say."
msgstr "那他們可真財運。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Indeed. But this talk has excited Gol. Have you got the spears?"
msgstr "確實。不過，這次交談讓戈爾興奮起來了。你帶長矛了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That I have!"
msgstr "帶了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Excellent. These look good, but..."
msgstr "很好。這些看起來不錯，不過……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Would you be willing to make some that are also... smaller?"
msgstr "你願意再做一些……更小的嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hmmm, you mean like javelins?"
msgstr "嗯，你是說標槍那樣的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol is not familiar."
msgstr "戈爾不太明白。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're... somewhere between bolts and spears, I'd say."
msgstr "怎麼說呢……介於弩箭和長矛之間的那種。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Then yes, that is what Gol desires! Gol will meet you on the outskirts of town when you are done."
msgstr "對，這就是戈爾想要的！等你做好，戈爾在城郊等你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You set off to procure some javelins as well, wondering what kind of beast might need both to take down. You hear a couple passerby call out to Gol, asking if he can spare a moment to help them right an overturned wagon, to which he laughs and asks them to lead the way."
msgstr "你出發去找標槍。你心想，到底是什麼樣的牛羚，要用這些東西才能對付。你聽到有幾個路人叫戈爾幫忙扶一下翻倒的馬車。戈爾笑了笑，讓他們帶路。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope that payout is as good as he claims."
msgstr "希望報酬真像他說的那樣豐厚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This should be enough to fill a chest or two. [Talk]"
msgstr "這些應該夠裝一兩個箱子了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The javelins have a good heft, and feel solid enough for whatever Gol intends. You wish-not for the first time-that you had more information about what you'd be fighting, but shockingly feel that Gol has the situation handled. The man's... unique, but certainly capable.\n\nWhen you meet him, he takes the javelins from you and seems pleased, then leads the way deep into the woods. He seems confident about his heading and leads you to a large outcropping that juts from the sand. "
msgstr "標槍分量很重，特別結實，應該夠戈爾用了。你再次感覺，要是你對即將面對的敵人多一點了解就好了。但令你驚訝的是，你感覺戈爾自己就可以應付。那傢伙……有些古怪，但確實有本事。\n\n戈爾見到你後，接過你手裡的標槍，看起來很滿意。隨後他就帶路向森林深處走去。他似乎很清楚方向，帶你走到了一處冒出沙地的巨大岩石。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This will be an excellent place to lure the sea beast to!"
msgstr "這是引誘那頭海洋牛羚的好地方！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The sand will dry it out, and the rock will give us solid ground to fight upon, as long as the tide is low."
msgstr "退潮時，沙地會吸乾牛羚身上的水分，這塊岩石是我們戰鬥的堅固堡壘。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, you were being literal when you mentioned it being a slippery beast?"
msgstr "噢，你之前說它又溼又滑，說的是字面意思啊？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aye, so Gol was told, at least. A slimy one at that."
msgstr "沒錯，至少戈爾聽說的是這樣。而且它還黏糊糊的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Out of water, its eyesight is poor, and the beast is said to be quite daft. Gol hopes to lure it up here from the water after preparing a battleground of sorts."
msgstr "離開水後，它的視力變差，腦子也會變笨。戈爾打算先佈置戰場，再把它從水裡引過來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll leave the spears with you then, I'm sure you've got something in mind?"
msgstr "這些長矛就交給你了，想必你已經有主意了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol is something of a visionary when it comes to these kinds of things."
msgstr "一遇到這種事，戈爾就變得有遠見。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol has fallen for many a trap in his day, he knows how to think like these beasts."
msgstr "戈爾沒少掉進陷阱，他知道這些牛羚的想法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You mentioned it likes shiny things too, hm?"
msgstr "你剛說它還喜歡閃閃發光的東西，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That it does! Again, much like Gol. The beast has good tastes."
msgstr "對！這一點跟戈爾很像。這牛羚的品味不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We will make it seem as if a ship carrying riches has run aground, and spilled forth its plunder."
msgstr "我們要工藝一種假象：一艘裝滿財寶的船擱淺了，財寶散落一地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There are many wrecks along the coast here, we shall bring them here when the tide rises."
msgstr "這片海岸有很多沉船殘骸，我們等漲潮的時候把那些殘骸弄過來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I uh... Don't think I can move whole chunks of ship, Gol."
msgstr "那個……我覺得我搬不動那麼大的殘骸，戈爾。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, no, of course not. You are better for the finer details, friend, Gol will handle the heavy lifting."
msgstr "不，不，當然不用你搬。你更適合做細活兒，朋友。體力活就交給戈爾吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Could you get the gems while Gol finishes up here?"
msgstr "戈爾在這兒忙。你能把寶石拿過來嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sounds like a plan to me! See you soon."
msgstr "聽起來是個好主意！一會見。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you head off, Gol sets to work on relocating some of the coastal debris. He sinks his fingers into the spongy wood of the back quarter of a wrecked schooner. It's far from a full boat, sure, but even Gol looks small next to it. His feet sink into the sand as he begins to push, and sure enough, the wreck begins to move-slowly but surely-across the sand."
msgstr "等你離開，戈爾開始搬海岸上的殘骸。他將手指插入一艘失事縱帆船的船尾殘骸，那木頭已經軟了。這只是那艘船的一部分，但即便如此，戈爾在它面前也顯得很小。他的腳陷入泥沙，開始用力推。果然，那殘骸開始動了，在沙灘上慢慢移動。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll make this extra messy, so it glows even brighter."
msgstr "我要把它弄得更亂一點，這樣看起來更明顯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This should be everything we need. - [Complete Quest Button]"
msgstr "這些東西應該夠了。[Complete Quest Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You return to the ambush site with enough gems to fill a small chest and find Gol perched on top of his handiwork. The tide is higher than before, sea foam curls and retreats just over the edge of the outcrop. Gol's scene is extraordinarily convincing, with the wreckage arranged to look as though a ship washed ashore and was split on the rocky outcrop. He even seems to have relocated the mast of another ship and propped it up on the wreck, allowing the tattered sail to tangle itself nicely amongst the debris. You carefully wade through the waist-deep water, avoiding the spears jutting out of the sand, and clamber onto the rocky platform."
msgstr "你帶著寶石回到伏擊的地方。這些寶石夠裝一個小箱子了。你目擊戈爾蹲在他的「傑作」上。潮水比先前更高了，海浪卷著泡沫，拍打著岩礁的邊緣。戈爾佈置的場地十分逼真。擺放的殘骸看起來就像一艘船被衝上岸，在岩礁上撞碎了。他甚至還拿了另一艘船的桅杆，插在殘骸上，破爛的帆布自然地纏繞在殘骸周圍。海水到了腰，你小心翼翼地走在水裡，避開冒出泥沙的長矛，爬上那塊岩石。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol... this is scarily good. You've really outdone yourself!"
msgstr "戈爾……這也太棒了。這次比以前還好！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What can Gol say? He has a knack for setting a good scene."
msgstr "戈爾能說什麼呢？他本來就擅長佈置場景。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The gems look lovely as well. If Gol hadn't assembled this himself, Gol may even wander into this ambush."
msgstr "那些寶石看起來也不錯。如果不是戈爾親手佈置的，恐怕他自己也會掉進去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, do your best not to. You mentioned that the beast had a bounty on its head, yeah?"
msgstr "你可千萬別進去。你之前說那頭牛羚有賞金，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That it does! It has been tearing through ships like Gol does ale. That's why Gol had this idea in the first place."
msgstr "對！它破壞船的時候，就跟戈爾喝麥芽酒一樣。所以戈爾是最先想到這個辦法的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good line of reasoning, I'd say. So... will the gems be enough, do you think?"
msgstr "不得不說，這邏輯不錯。那麼……你覺得寶石夠了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Our hook is good, but Gol thinks we lack bait, still."
msgstr "我們的鉤子還行，但戈爾覺得還缺魚餌。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol is a bit more keen on the... pugilistic arts, and rarely has the patience for fishing."
msgstr "戈爾更喜歡……拳腳功夫，對釣魚沒什麼耐心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol wonders if you know a good way to lure the creature into our ambush."
msgstr "戈爾在想，你有沒有什麼好法子，能把牛羚引到伏擊的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If I were to take some Glowfin and cut them up, I'd say the bait would be pretty convincing for a sea-based monster."
msgstr "如果把輝鰭魚切成塊，拿來當魚餌，對海里的怪物應該很有吸引力。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This does sound promising. Gol will put the finishing touches on our battleground while you handle the bait?"
msgstr "這聽起來不錯。你來準備魚餌，戈爾最後再完善一下我們的戰場，怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You nod and set off to gather enough Glowfin bait to lure whatever creature this may be to shore. Gol immediately gets to work on the finer details, putting a surprising amount of care into perfecting the wreck, making it truly look natural."
msgstr "你點點頭，動身去收集足夠的輝鰭魚魚餌，好將牛羚引到岸邊。戈爾馬上開始處理細節，十分仔細地完善殘骸，讓它看起來自然逼真。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol seems positively buzzing with energy, pleased to see the plan come together. Gol did a phenomenal job making the wreck look natural, which was only further helped by the tide coming through and helping the wreckage sink into the sand. \n\nYou do your best to squeeze the glowfin bait's juice all around the chest before tucking it in amongst the gemstones. In the twilight, the chest looks like a burning beacon, with the glowfin juice refracting off the gemstones radiantly.\n\nGol leads you away from the chest and you scrub your hands in the water, careful to avoid impaling yourself on the spears tucked into the sand all around your ambush site. After an hour or so of waiting in the water, a wet, hulking monster slowly lifts itself out of the sea and half walks, half slithers towards the gem-filled chest. \n\nGol slaps your shoulder hard enough to dislocate it, silently yelling in excitment before leaping out of the water and towards the beast, who hardly knows what to make out of the golith running towards it. Gol tosses javelin after javelin, their rune blades sinking into the creature's slimy flesh. He narrowly tucks its large, snapping maw as it turns to retreat towards the water. Like a fish on a barb, the angled spears it walked over now impale it and it shrieks, tearing off long, writhing tail in the process. Gol tries his best to keep hold of the creature, but its thick slime coats him entirely, and it just manages to slip back into the ocean, but not unscathed.\n\nGol is pleased regardless, claiming that the tail is enough to show most of you twos' efforts. True to his word, he finds you in Azamire several days later with your half of the payout, and you feel it was well-worth the time... but part of you wonders if there's a way to track the beast down and take it out once and for all."
msgstr "戈爾顯得格外興奮，對計劃的進展十分滿意。戈爾做得很好，佈置的殘骸看起來很自然。潮水來的時候，殘骸陷入泥沙，看起來更加自然逼真。\n\n你盡力將輝鰭魚魚餌的汁液塗在箱子的四周，然後將箱子塞到一堆寶石裡面。在暮色中，箱子就像一座燃燒的燈塔，魚餌汁液在寶石上閃閃發光。\n\n戈爾帶你離開箱子。你小心翼翼地在水裡洗手，以免被伏擊陷阱周圍泥沙裡的長矛螫刺。在水裡等了大約一個小時，一頭溼漉漉、龐大的怪物慢慢露出水面。它半走半爬，慢慢靠近裝滿寶石的箱子。\n\n戈爾重重拍了一下你的肩膀，差點把你的肩膀拍脫臼。他特別興奮，內心狂叫。他跳出水面，直接向那頭牛羚撲去。牛羚沒想到會有這樣一個巨人撲過來。戈爾連續扔出標槍，標槍上的符文進入牛羚黏糊糊的血肉之中。當牛羚轉身回到水裡的時候，他剛好躲開了那張血盆大口。尖銳的長矛刺入牛羚，就像魚鉤上的一條魚。它尖叫掙扎，扯斷了那條不斷扭動的長尾巴。\n\n戈爾用盡全力，想要抓住那頭牛羚。但它身上有厚厚的粘液，戈爾根本抓不住。最終，那頭牛羚逃回了海里。不過，它也受了傷。戈爾還算滿意，畢竟那條尾巴已經足以證明你們二人的努力了。幾天後，他果真在阿扎米爾找到你，給了你一半的報酬。你覺得這段時間的辛苦非常值得……但你心想，有沒有什麼辦法能追蹤那頭牛羚，把它徹底消滅。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Four Sentries"
msgstr "四位哨兵"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Four Sentries - Morlin and his crew have made substantial progress in unearthing the lost civilization you helped uncover, but have run into another roadblock. With your help, perhaps you'll finally uncover the city proper?"
msgstr "四位哨兵——莫林和他的人在發掘你之前幫忙目擊的那處文明遺蹟時，取得了重大進展。但現在又有了新問題。如果你能幫忙，或許最終能夠揭開這座城市的奧秘？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're asking for stuff without even seeing me, now..."
msgstr "還沒見到我，就跟我要東西……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope this is plenty. [Talk]"
msgstr "希望這些夠了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You stumble across Magnavous bumbling through Azamire's square, asking people if they've seen you. Many either shake their heads or mention your various comings and goings, but few have solid answers as to where she could look next. You stand back and watch as she shakes down a couple others, who point you out. She looks pleased to have come across you, and quite a bit more sure of herself than the last time you saw her. She still firmly clutches one of the staves you made her, but she walks far more proudly and confidently."
msgstr "你偶然看見麥格納沃斯在阿扎米爾廣場上亂轉，到處問有沒有見過你。有人搖頭，有人說看到過你，但沒人明確告訴她應該去哪兒找你。你站在一旁，看她又問了幾個人。那些人指了你。她看見你很高興。跟上次見她比起來，她看起來自信多了。她手裡還緊緊握著你做的那根法杖，走起路來更加昂首挺胸、更加自信。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Having fun standing there and watching me? You could have come and said hello."
msgstr "站在那兒看我挺開心的嘛？你可以直接過來打招呼呀。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You got there eventually! I wanted to see how long it'd take."
msgstr "你總算來了！我還在想，你什麼時候才到。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, if you've had your fun, we must make haste! I have so much to show you!"
msgstr "好了，既然你熱鬧看夠了，那就趕緊吧！我有好多東西給你看！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My mentor Morlin has-"
msgstr "我的導師莫林——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, he's officially your mentor now?"
msgstr "等等，他正式成為你的導師了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Indeed! With no small part thanks to your help, but I will catch you up along the way."
msgstr "對呀！多虧了你幫忙。路上我再跟你細說。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The long and short of it-which you'll see when we get there-is that Whudgrath has uncovered what seems to be the gates to the city."
msgstr "簡單來說，伍德格拉斯目擊了像是城門的東西，等你到了就知道了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But they're locked."
msgstr "但它們都鎖著。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But they-"
msgstr "但它們——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, yes, how'd you know?"
msgstr "等等，沒錯，你怎麼知道？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What? Like one of these would ever be simple."
msgstr "什麼？這種事哪有那麼簡單。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Imagine that. You come out to find me and say, \"Hey [i]{0}[/i], things were incredibly easy and straightforward.\""
msgstr "你真敢想。你跑來找我，跟我說：「嘿，[i]{0}[/i]，事情特別簡單。」"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "\"We've taken care of all the hard work, come and collect as many armfuls of treasure as you desire.\""
msgstr "「所有的苦活累活我們都幹完了，快來拿財寶吧，想拿多少就拿多少。」"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... yeah, when you put it that way...."
msgstr "嗯……好吧，既然你都這麼說了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So, what do ya need?"
msgstr "那你需要什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, the stone is getting harder to work through. Morlin thinks that it may be magically enhanced since we're getting closer to the city."
msgstr "莫林覺得可能是因為我們離城市越來越近，岩石被施了魔法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I have a theory that the properties of Dawnsteel may be enough to get through it but..."
msgstr "我推測，要砸開岩石，或許可以利用黎明鋼的特性，不過……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With all of my magical studies, I wouldn't say I'm particularly suited for mining work."
msgstr "我研究過很多魔法，但採礦的話，我不太合適。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nothing to be ashamed of. There's a reason Morlin hired a dwarven crew, eh?"
msgstr "沒什麼好丟人的。莫林僱矮人來幹活是有原因的，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll meet you on the edge of town when I'm ready."
msgstr "等我準備好了，就去小鎮邊找你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You head off in search of enough material to outfit Whudgrath's crew, and then some. No use needing to come back half a dozen times because they needed more tools. Plus, the more useful you make yourself, you could argue in favor of a bigger cut."
msgstr "你出發去找足夠的材料，不僅要給伍德格拉斯那幫人做裝備，還要留一些。要是他們又缺工具，就不用來回再跑幾趟了。而且，你表現得越有用，就能爭取更多的報酬。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sure this is what I need to do."
msgstr "我確定這是我需要做的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's see if this stops that vapor. [Insert]"
msgstr "看看這能不能止住霧氣。[Insert]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With enough Dawnsteel to outfit a small army, you meet up with Magnavous. She takes you out to the dig site, which has seen some drastic changes since you were here last. The hillside has been completely carved away, revealing that most of what you'd seen previously were ancillary buildings, and possibly even a second, more recent town built over the top of it within the last couple hundred years, according to Magnavous.\n\nWhudgrath meets up with you shortly into your tour of the site, and happily takes the Dawnsteel from you. He leads you on a short walk down a carved out recess in the ground, that ends in two massive doors which rival the capital's famous gate. It’s dim, the ceiling not yet fully carved away, but even so you can make out four enormous slouched statues set into the walls, with all of them being about five times your size, even hunched over as they are. They're all quite weathered, but it's still clear to see they were modeled after wizards of their time, each with painted stone robes and outstretched but empty hands. Most noticeably, they are very obviously not human. They all have four arms and long, rectangular faces. Each has a gemstone set into its forehead and seems to emanate a vapor of some kind..."
msgstr "你帶著黎明鋼和麥格納沃斯會合。這些鋼足夠武裝一支小軍隊了。她帶你來到挖掘現場。跟你上次來相比，這裡的變化很大。山坡已經被徹底挖開，你之前看到的大多是附屬建築。麥格納沃斯說，這上面可能還有第二座城鎮，那是近幾百年才修的。\n\n你參觀挖掘現場沒多久，伍德格拉斯找到你，高興地收下你帶來的黎明鋼。他帶你走到一條開鑿的地下通道，通道盡頭有兩扇大門，跟都城那扇有名的大門差不多。通道里光線昏暗，頂部還沒完全鑿開。即便如此，你還是能認出牆上的四尊巨大雕像。它們彎腰弓背，體型相當於你的五倍。那些雕像飽經風霜，但仍能看出雕刻原型是當時的法師。它們穿著繪有紋飾的石袍，雙臂展開，兩手空空。最引人注意的是，那些雕像顯然不是人類。每尊雕像都有四條手臂，臉型又長又方。它們額頭上都鑲著一顆寶石，似乎在散發某種霧氣……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lovely work you've got here... Don't know if you made these or found 'em, but my boys will appreciate it nonetheless."
msgstr "你這東西真不錯……不知道是你自己做的還是找的。我的夥計們肯定會喜歡。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ha! Won't even make you swing a pick this time, think Morlin's got some more important work for ya."
msgstr "哈！這次就不讓你用鎬頭了，我想莫林還有更重要的事交給你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah? Is it down that same tunnel we found past that cursed door, or... is it... this?"
msgstr "什麼？是要去那扇被詛咒之門後面的隧道里，還是……就是……這裡？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah, that little passage! Turns out, that was a teeny little side exit that workers used to use..."
msgstr "啊，那條小通道啊！原來是工人用過的一個側面小出口……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Think it ended up leading to a bunkhouse or somethin'."
msgstr "好像是通往工人宿舍之類的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We think these doors lead to the city proper."
msgstr "我們推測，這些門通往城市。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And... where our problem lies."
msgstr "而……這就是我們遇到的問題。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll spare you the finer details, but Whudgrath and his crew have carved out the whole hillside, and we haven't found another way in."
msgstr "細節我就不多說了。總之，伍德格拉斯和他的人把整個山坡都挖空了，我們沒找到別的入口。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And I don't assume we can just dig around the doors?"
msgstr "難道我們不能在這些門的周圍挖一條路嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Be a pretty terrible gate if we could, hm?"
msgstr "如果這樣，那門就沒用了，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Much of what Whudgrath’s crew has dug through seems to be more... loose. The stone of the entrance is magically reinforced."
msgstr "伍德格拉斯那幫人挖的地方，大多比較……鬆散。入口的岩石被施了魔法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Morlin has been trying-"
msgstr "莫林一直在試——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And failing."
msgstr "但沒成功。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "To find a way to undo it. So, we're stuck with the door."
msgstr "要想辦法解除魔法。所以，我們被這扇門攔住了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I see. I don't suppose you've tried knocking?"
msgstr "我明白了。你們試過敲門了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It was the first thing Whudgrath did."
msgstr "伍德格拉斯做的第一件事就是敲門。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I blew up a lil' bit."
msgstr "我炸了一下。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you... okay?"
msgstr "你……沒事吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Never better! But now I'm pretty keen on opening it up too. Gotta be something good in there, I'm sure."
msgstr "好得不能再好了！不過我現在也很想開啟看看。裡面肯定有好東西，我敢肯定。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Set into the four statues are a set of passages, which, roughly translated, talk about being sealed, armed, and adorned."
msgstr "那四座雕像上刻著幾段文字，大概是說封印、武裝和裝飾。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, they're wizards, so armed and adorned likely mean... staves and jewelry. As far as sealed though... Maybe it'd stop whatever it is that they're... leaking."
msgstr "既然它們是法師，那武裝和裝飾可能指的是……法杖和珠寶。至於封印……也許是為了阻止什麼東西……洩露出來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah, the vapor. Morlin took a look at it earlier, worried it was poisonous. It was magical in nature, but it’s anyone’s guess what it was."
msgstr "啊，是霧氣。莫林之前看過，擔心霧氣有毒。霧氣本質上是魔法產生的，但到底是什麼，誰也不知道。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any clue on how we can plug them up?"
msgstr "有什麼辦法把它們堵上嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I had a stint in a military company a while back, and it always seemed that the crossbowmen were the best answer to riddling those flimsy little mages with bolts."
msgstr "我以前在軍隊裡待過。當時大家都認為，對付那些身體脆弱的法師，最好的辦法是用弩箭射。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ahem."
msgstr "呃哼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Er... no offense."
msgstr "呃……別介意啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The gemstones of the four mages stick out to you, and make the answer feel rather clear. If you're to make bolts to 'seal' them, they'd likely line up with the gemstone motif they have going on. "
msgstr "那四位法師身上的寶石十分引人注目，所以答案就清楚了。要想製作弩箭來『封印』他們，弩箭的設計可能要跟他們身上的寶石圖案一致。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That seems... pretty sensible, though... morbid."
msgstr "這似乎……挺合理的，但……有點恐怖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll give it a shot, then."
msgstr "那我們試一試。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Before you head out, you inspect each of the statues once more while Magnavous and Whudgrath set to work on their own tasks. The site still needs a lot of work. The gate is barely lit by what little sunlight filters in from outside and the few lanterns at its base. You're sure you'll get a better look at the statues when the chamber is fully prepped, but the gemstones still catch the faint cavern light perfectly as you look them over. Topaz, sapphire, ruby, and emerald - all gemstones that'd fit neatly as tips of your bolts.\n\nFeeling self-assured, you head off to prepare to seal the four sentries."
msgstr "出發之前，你又仔細觀察了每尊雕像。與此同時，麥格納沃斯和伍德格拉斯也開始忙手上的活兒。這裡還有很多活兒。大門那裡光線昏暗，只有外面透進來的微弱日光，以及門底的幾盞燈籠。你心想，等這裡完全收拾好，一定能清楚看看這些雕像。即便洞裡光線昏暗，那些寶石依然閃閃發光。黃玉、藍寶石、紅寶石、祖母綠——在弩箭箭頭上鑲嵌這些寶石，再合適不過了。\n\n你信心滿滿，準備封印四尊雕像。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "At least I know I'm helping her confidence."
msgstr "至少我知道，我能幫她找回信心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Drop off the staves. [Talk]"
msgstr "放下木杖。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gemstone-tipped bolts in-hand, you slowly work your way around each of the statues. Each fits in the openings nicely, and lock into place with a firm and resonate snap. Magnavous begins to do the same while Whudgrath holds a lantern aloft. Soon enough, the vapor that twisted and curled up towards the ceiling has been stopped. All at once, the statues seem to heave and twist. Where they once hunched and gaunt, sealing them seems to have changed the stone outright, causing the figures to warp into more imposing, able-bodied versions of themselves."
msgstr "你拿著鑲嵌寶石的弩箭，慢慢繞著雕像走。弩箭精準射入雕像上的孔洞，清脆的一聲響，箭頭嵌入雕像。麥格納沃斯也開始這樣做，伍德格拉斯高舉著燈籠。沒過多久，之前盤旋上升的霧氣就消散了。這時，雕像好像動了，扭曲變形。封印之後，原本佝僂枯瘦的雕像完全變了，它們扭曲變形，變得更威武、更強壯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, that seems promising."
msgstr "看來效果不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Step one down, two more to go. They seem to be in fighting shape..."
msgstr "第一步完成了，還有兩步。他們似乎可以隨時開始戰鬥……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Time to arm them."
msgstr "是時候武裝了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now, I'm as game for a scrap as anyone, but you don't find it concerning at all, giving them weapons?"
msgstr "其實我也挺好戰的，但要給他們武器，難道你一點兒也不擔心嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just me?"
msgstr "只有我這麼想嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It feels right. Besides, I'd say they feel more like guardians of this place than combatants."
msgstr "我覺得可以。而且，與其說是戰士，我感覺他們更像是這裡的防護者。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right, and... do you think the city's guardians would take too kindly to us plundering their home?"
msgstr "沒錯。那……如果我們洗劫了這些防護者的家園，他們會樂意嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll call Morlin in soon, once we determine what we'll arm them with. He'll be able to protect us, if they decide we're a threat."
msgstr "等我們確定給他們的武器，我就把莫林叫來。如果他們認為我們是一種威脅，他可以保護我們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll do my best to appear... friendly. How's my smile?"
msgstr "我會盡力表現得……友好一些。我笑得怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...It reminds me of a dog baring its teeth..."
msgstr "……看起來像一條齜牙咧嘴的狗……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hmm. Maybe a no on the smile then."
msgstr "嗯。那還是別笑了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The four of them look like mages, just like you Magnavous."
msgstr "他們四個看起來像是法師，跟你一樣，麥格納沃斯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And you made me this delightful staff. Think you could do the same here? One for each of the base elements?"
msgstr "你之前給我做了這根法杖，我很滿意。你能不能再做幾根一樣的？每種元素做一根，怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They'd be a bit more like toothpicks for them, no?"
msgstr "對他們來說，這些法杖就像牙籤一樣，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, Morlin has been teaching me this spell that allows me to take multiple items and combine them into a much larger version of themselves."
msgstr "嗯，莫林一直在教我咒語，可以把幾個東西合在一起，變成一個更大的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How oddly convenient... How'd that come up?"
msgstr "這方便得有點奇怪了……你怎麼目擊這個咒語的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It was in his first published book, \"101 Spells To Make You A Master Wizard!\" I've been trying to get through them all since I got here."
msgstr "在他出版的第一本書裡，書名叫「讓你成為大巫師的101個咒語」！自從我到這兒，就一直試著把書裡的咒語都學一遍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Huh, alright... Seems simple enough. So, you probably just need a couple of each staff, or..?"
msgstr "呵，好吧……聽起來挺簡單的。所以，你可能只需要幾根一樣的法杖，還是……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... I'm not too good at it yet. We've been running all over this dig site for a while now, I haven't had long to practice."
msgstr "那個……我還沒練好咒語。我們在挖掘現場跑來跑去，我沒什麼時間練習。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But you can do it, right?"
msgstr "但你可以做，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes! But... it's just not very efficient yet."
msgstr "對！不過……效率還不是很高。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'll get to work then."
msgstr "……那我就開始幹活了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Part of you wishes that Morlin could just come do the spell, but deep down, you know it'll be good for Magnavous to do this for her training. At the very least, it'll help her feel a bit more confident, even if it does mean you have to make... substantially more staves."
msgstr "你有點希望莫林能直接過來做這個咒語，但轉念一想，這可以讓麥格納沃斯歷練。至少，可以讓她變得更有自信，儘管這意味著你需要……多做好幾根法杖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You know, that old man makes a good point..."
msgstr "你知道，那老頭說的有道理……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope this works...  [Complete Quest Button]"
msgstr "希望這能行得通……[Complete Quest Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you hand the staves to Magnavous one by one, they slowly but surely get combined into one. Eventually, they get big enough that Whudgrath and his crew take over in holding them, and then placing them into the statues’ hands. When the four of them are armed, they slam them into the ground and the orb at the end of each begins to glow.\n\nMorlin enters, and lets out a low whistle when he sees the progress that has been made."
msgstr "你將法杖一根一根遞給麥格納沃斯。那些法杖慢慢合在一起。最後，它們變得足夠大。伍德格拉斯和他的人接過來，把它們放到雕像的手中。當四座雕像都武裝完畢，他們將法杖砸向地面，每根法杖頂端的圓球亮了起來。\n\n莫林走進來，看到眼前的場景，輕輕吹了一聲口哨。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My my my, I see you all have been making good progress!"
msgstr "哎呀，看來進行得不錯嘛！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That we have! And what have you been up to?"
msgstr "確實不錯！你最近在忙什麼呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Taking a nap!"
msgstr "睡了一覺！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've been here for... quite a while."
msgstr "我在這兒待了……很長一段時間。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do you see this beard? Just how old do you think I am? You've got to stay well rested at my age."
msgstr "看到這鬍子了嗎？你覺得我多大年紀？到了我這個年紀，要休息好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Plus, my apprentice is becoming quite capable! Thank you for helping her out, by the way. Both here, and before she found her way to the site."
msgstr "而且，我徒弟現在可能幹了！順便，謝謝你幫她。無論是在這兒，還是她來這兒之前。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think Azamire would be a burning crater if I didn't, but it's my pleasure. She's quite capable."
msgstr "如果我不幫她，阿扎米爾恐怕就是一個冒著煙的大坑了。不過，我樂意幫她。她很能幹。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That she is!"
msgstr "確實能幹！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Enough about me, we've only got one more thing to do before we're done!"
msgstr "不說我了，在徹底結束之前，我們還有一件事要做！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's right, but I have no idea what to adorn them in. They've already got... robes, kind of."
msgstr "沒錯，但我不知道怎麼裝飾他們。他們已經……有長袍之類的東西了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is where a master wizard comes into play, children."
msgstr "孩子們，是時候請出大巫師了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're clearly missing their swag, as the kids say."
msgstr "用年輕人的話說，他們顯然沒有「範兒」。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've never heard a kid say that."
msgstr "我沒聽哪個年輕人說過。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Neither have I."
msgstr "……我也沒聽過。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Have to say I'm in agreement."
msgstr "不得不說，我同意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, you clearly aren't hip, like old man Morlin. Behold!"
msgstr "那你確實不夠時髦，不像老頭莫林。瞧好了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Morlin throws back his robes to show off a concerning amount of jewelry. Dozens of necklaces, bracelets, and rings adorn his body. They sparkle brilliantly in the low-light, so much so that you worry you'd be blinded if it was any brighter in the cavern. He goes on to talk about how most keep it far too simple, limiting themselves to only a few enchanted pieces of jewelry at a time, but that a master wizard such as himself isn't held back by such limitations. Whudgrath asks if they can just use his jewelry, to which he scoffs. He glances over the statues and produces a list.\n\n\nMuch like last time he tried to make a list, the first page is cryptic, detailing something about an excitable lizard housekeeper and her many cleaning adventures, but he burns it before you can get more than a glance as to its contents. He hands the veritable laundry list of jewelry to you, and assures you that your efforts will be reflected in your cut of... whatever may lie inside."
msgstr "莫林掀開長袍，露出琳琅滿目的珠寶。他身上掛了幾十條項鍊、手鍊和戒指。這些珠寶在昏暗中閃閃發光。如果洞裡再亮一點，恐怕你的眼睛都要瞎了。他說，大多數人都太樸素了，每次最多隻戴幾件附魔珠寶。而像他這樣的大巫師，沒有這種限制。伍德格拉斯問能不能用一下他身上的珠寶，他輕蔑地笑了。他掃視了那些雕像，掏出了一張清單。\n\n跟他上次嘗試列清單一樣，第一頁模糊不清，大概是講一位興奮的蜥蜴管家以及她的種種清潔冒險。但還沒等你看清上面的內容，他就燒了。他把那張長長的珠寶清單遞給你，保證你的付出會有一份……至於具體是什麼，就不知道了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everyone begins layering on the amulets as best they can, taking wild guesses as to how many and where they should be placed. The four statues begin to look positively gaudy by the time you finish, and you start to wonder if it would have been better to use the same enlargement spell as you used for the staves... just as the first of the four begins to stir.\n\nThe adornments melt into their stone skin, and each statue's eyes begin to light up one by one, shining with an eerie energy. Magnavous ducks behind you, and Whudgrath behind her, while Morlin waves his staff menacingly at the statues. You all sit in a tense silence as seconds feel as if they stretch into minutes. The statues slam their staves into the ground once again, this time eliciting a shriek from... Morlin, your mighty protector.\n\nIn tandem, the statues take position by the colossal gate, and each hammers their staff against it one after another, the whacks shaking the cavern enough to knock you all to your knees. When the sentries cease, they begin to push arduously against it, the bolts you pressed into them fragmenting and shooting out from the gaps in their facades, letting the vapor they held back rise towards the cavern's ceiling once more. \n\nSlowly but surely, the gate grinds open, and the statues don't let up until the doors scrape to a halt. With that, they wander into the darkness, leaving you all behind, wondering what lies beyond the gate."
msgstr "大家開始努力貼護身符。至於貼多少、貼在哪兒，全靠胡亂猜測。貼完以後，那四座雕像看起來相當俗氣。你心想，如果再用一次將法杖變大的咒語，會不會好些……這時，其中一座雕像動了。\n\n那些裝飾物融入雕像的岩石皮膚，雕像的眼睛陸續亮了，閃著詭異的光。麥格納沃斯躲到你身後；伍德格拉斯躲到麥格納沃斯身後；莫林氣勢洶洶地揮著法杖，指著雕像。你們緊張得不敢說話，一秒就像一分鐘那麼長。雕像再次將法杖重重砸向地面。這一次……莫林，你們那位強大的防護者，竟然尖叫一聲。\n\n與此同時，雕像來到大門前，用手裡的法杖連續擊打大門。撞擊聲讓整個洞震動，你們都紛紛跪在地上。這些守護停止擊打，然後開始用力推門。插入他們身體的弩箭破裂，從雕像表面的縫隙飛出。原本止住的霧氣再次升起來，向著洞頂瀰漫開來。\n\n大門慢慢開啟，發出刺耳的摩擦聲。直到這些門停止不動，雕像才停下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Sealed Grove"
msgstr "被封印的樹林"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Sealed Grove - The leader of Azamire's forces has some concerns about a nearby grove that seems tainted by some kind of dark energy. With the situation beginning the spiral out of control, she has called in the best Azamire has to offer."
msgstr "被封印的樹林——阿扎米爾軍隊的首領擔心附近的一片樹林，那兒似乎受到了某種黑暗力量的侵蝕。眼看局勢即將失控，她召集了阿扎米爾最強的隊伍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These trees almost grow faster than I can chop them down!"
msgstr "這些樹長得太快了，我砍不過來！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think I see a clearing up ahead! [Push]"
msgstr "前面好像開闊了！[Push]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "On a stroll by what was once the Soothsayer's Grove, you find yourself startled as a blue vine whips out and lashes itself around your ankles. Startled by the intrusion, you barely have the chance to think about how this was meant to be a 'safe path' until you're hoisted up into the air and tossed around. Suddenly, a tall, dark-haired woman jumps out from the darkness and cleaves the vines in two with a single swipe of her sword, sending you back towards the ground, where you land with a thud."
msgstr "當你走過曾經的「預言家之林」，一根藍色的藤蔓突然冒出來，纏住你的腳踝，你嚇了一跳。你還沒想這條原本『安全的路』怎麼會有這種東西，整個人就被拖到半空，甩來甩去。突然，一名高個子黑髮女從黑暗裡跳出來，一揮劍就把藤蔓砍成兩段。砰的一聲，你落到地上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ow... Thank you... I think? What are you doing so far from Azamire, Jass? Aren't the militia lost without you?"
msgstr "哎喲……謝謝你……我覺得？傑絲，你從阿扎米爾跑這麼遠來幹什麼？你不在，那些民兵不會亂嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What are you doing near the Soothsayer's Grove? Haven't you seen all the signs I've put up?"
msgstr "你來預言家之林附近做什麼？你沒看到我立在那兒的牌子嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do the signs say, \"Beware dangerous sentient vines?\""
msgstr "牌子上寫的是「有藤蔓怪，當心危險」嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, they say, \"Danger,\" and \"Stay Out!\" Someone or something, is causing everything around this place to go absolutely wild."
msgstr "不，寫的是「危險」和「禁止進入」！有什麼人或什麼東西讓這裡的一切徹底失控。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You should really consider my sign idea, it's a lot less vague."
msgstr "你應該考慮一下我剛說的牌子標語，比你那清楚多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Would you have stayed out if that's what they said instead?"
msgstr "如果真這麼寫，你還會進去嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...No, I would have thought that I could have handled some silly little vines. Point taken."
msgstr "……會。我會覺得，我可以對付幾根可笑的小藤蔓。明白了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "這兒到底怎麼回事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wish I knew. Every attempt I've made to get closer to the grove has been met with vines, trees and the occasional monster."
msgstr "我也想知道。我每次想靠近那片樹林，就會遇到藤蔓、樹木，有時還會遇到怪物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, no one throws me in the air and gets away with it! Plus, I ought to help you, since you saved me."
msgstr "哼，沒人能把我扔到半空還能全身而退！再說了，你救過我，我應該幫你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can you keep me on the ground if I cut a path through to the grove?"
msgstr "如果我開出一條通往那片樹林的路，你能確保我不離開地面嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've done it once already, haven't I? Grab an axe, we're going to make some kindling out of this grove."
msgstr "我已經做過一次了，不是嗎？拿斧頭，我們要把這片樹林砍了燒火。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As if it heard Jass's threat, more vines snaked out from the underbrush and towards you. True to her word, Jass takes a firm stance and chops through them like a butcher hacking through meat, giving you an opening to make your way towards the grove."
msgstr "好像聽到了傑絲的威脅，更多的藤蔓從灌木林裡冒出來，朝你們這邊來。傑絲說到做到，穩穩站好，像屠夫剁肉一樣砍斷藤蔓，為你開出了一條通往樹林的路。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Surely Gol will be able to handle... Whatever is in this forest."
msgstr "戈爾應該能應付……這樹林裡的任何東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Back into the woods we go. [Talk]"
msgstr "我們回到樹林。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The bushes and trees are thick, and for every one you chop down, it feels as though three more shoot up in their place. Their rapid growth would be a lot more impressive if it wasn't for its murderous intent. How they stay out of sight is a mystery, but as you cut deeper into the tangle of plants, thunderous bellows and growls sound from nearby creatures you feel lucky not to encounter.\n\nYou do your best to make your way inward, and eventually, the outer thicket gives way to a calmer bit of forest. Jass catches her breath and wipes the vegetation from her sword and armor. The two of you stand on a ridgeline surrounding a deep crater, filled with plantlife you've never seen anywhere else. It almost looks like a jungle, with dark trees towering from the pit and threatening to spill out. All manner of dark shadows prowl through the vegetation, and you're very happy to be far above it, at least for now."
msgstr "灌木和樹木密密麻麻，砍一棵長三棵。如果不是隱藏殺意，這生長速度確實令人驚歎。他們是如何不被目擊的，沒人知道。當你走進這片雜亂的林子，附近傳來震耳的咆哮聲和低吼聲。財運的是，你沒有遇到這些東西。\n\n你努力向裡面走，穿過茂密的叢林，最後來到一片寧靜的樹林。傑絲喘了口氣，擦去劍上和護甲上的枝葉。你們站在一道山脊上，下面是一個深坑。坑裡長滿了你們從未見過的植物。整個坑看起來就像一片叢林。坑裡的樹木陰暗高大，彷彿就快出來了。各種黑影在叢林中穿梭。幸好你們站得高，至少現在是安全的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're not going to like what I have to say."
msgstr "接下來我要說的話，你可能不喜歡聽。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We are going to have to go down there, aren't we?"
msgstr "我們要下去，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What? No, absolutely not. You can practically see the evil leaking out of the grove."
msgstr "什麼？不行，絕對不行。你也看見了，那片叢林有邪惡的東西出來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're going to have to cut out way back out."
msgstr "我們要原路返回。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Honestly, I like the sound of that a lot better than wandering down there. But why'd we come in here in the first place, then?"
msgstr "說實話，與其到那下面去，我更喜歡這個主意。但我們當初為什麼要進來呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wanted to see for my own eyes how much the jungle in the crater had progressed, before we did."
msgstr "我想親眼看看，在我們行動之前，坑裡的叢林成什麼樣了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's not good. The crater itself was barren at first, except for a singular pale, twisted tree in the very center. This whole jungle has sprouted up in just a few days..."
msgstr "情況不太好。這個坑原來寸草不生，只有最中間長了一棵彎彎曲曲的白樹。短短几天，這片叢林就長出來了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The thicket around the crater-which we just hacked through-as at least four times as dense as the other day."
msgstr "坑周圍的叢林，就是我們剛才砍的那一片，比前幾天茂密了至少四倍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You said there was just a single tree in the center of the crater? That feels... odd. Wasn't this place meant to be a grove at one point?"
msgstr "你說坑的中間有棵樹？這感覺……有點怪。這裡以前不是一片樹林嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Years ago, yes. Until this place was turned into a logging camp and cleared out. Never really had any issues until..."
msgstr "很多年前是。後來這裡改成了伐木營，樹都被砍光了。一直沒出過什麼問題，直到……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Whatever started happening here."
msgstr "這裡發生了一些事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aye."
msgstr "對。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "When we get out, we'll make a plan on what to do about this place. For now, are you ready head back?"
msgstr "等我們出去再商量怎麼處理這個地方。現在，你準備好回去了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll use my other arm this time."
msgstr "這次我會用另一隻手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you cut through the thicket back the way you came, and found less resistance exiting than entering. You make your way to Azamire, and started to form a plan while recharging in Lira's tavern. You set yourselves on sealing the grove, keeping whatever may be inside the crater locked away, and hopefully preventing the spread of the outer thicket as well.\n\nAs you start to wonder who might be helpful, in slaying corrupted beasts and dealing with wild plants before finally sealing the grove, Lira-who has clearly been listening in-swings by and recommends Gol and Petal for the first steps, and Morlin for the last. Without a word from either of you, she sends a couple of her patrons to fetch them. Sure enough, the two of them are more than up for the challenge, and recommend dealing with the beasts first, then tending to the thicket before sealing it. This works out well, as Magnavous sends a message back on Morlin's behalf, saying that he'll come as soon as he's able to return his sense of gravity-whatever that means."
msgstr "你們原路返回，穿過叢林。你們目擊，回去比進來更輕鬆。你們回到阿扎米爾，在利拉的酒館裡一邊休息一邊想辦法。你們的目標是封印那片樹林，將坑裡的所有東西都封鎖起來，設法阻止外面那片叢林繼續蔓延。\n\n要屠殺腐化的牛羚，要應付野蠻的植物，最後還要封印樹林。當你們考慮找誰幫忙的時候，一直在旁邊聽的利拉走了過來。她建議第一步和第二步找戈爾和佩塔幫忙，第三步找莫林幫忙。你們還沒說話，她就讓幾位顧客去找他們了。不出所料，其中兩個人欣然接受挑戰，建議先解決牛羚，再處理叢林，最後封印。事情進展順利。莫林讓麥格納沃斯傳回訊息，說他一旦找回重力感（不知道具體是什麼意思），就馬上過來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This bait positively reeks, but that's kind of the point."
msgstr "這魚餌太臭了，但臭就對了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's see if we can find ourself some monsters. [Bait]"
msgstr "看看能不能引出怪物吧。[Bait]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Excited by the prospect of a new challenge, Gol grips the Dawnsteel javelins tightly, sets off into the outer thicket, and is seemingly swallowed by the vegetation, quickly dipping out of sight. Petal quickly pulls out her poisons while Jass prepares to cut her way through the vines until you hear Gol... laughing?\n\nMuch less concerned for his safety, the three of you eventually make it to a clearing where the plants seem to be retreating from him. Gol lays atop the corpse of a beast several orders of magnitude larger than the mountain of a man, making it even larger than the three of you. "
msgstr "面對即將到來的新挑戰，戈爾特別興奮。他緊握著曙鋼標槍，走進外面的叢林。草木似乎把他吞沒了，他很快就不見了。佩塔馬上拿出毒藥，傑絲準備砍掉藤蔓。這時，你們聽到戈爾……在笑？\n\n你們不太擔心他的安全。你們三人最終走到了一塊空地，這裡的植物好像都在躲著他。戈爾躺在一頭牛羚的屍體上。戈爾像山一樣魁梧，但那牛羚比他還要大幾倍，甚至比你們三人加在一起還要大。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol quite enjoyed that little bout!"
msgstr "戈爾很享受那場小搏鬥。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's a shame about the wee beastie, though."
msgstr "不過，這小東西變成這樣，有點可惜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What, were you hoping for more of a fight?"
msgstr "怎麼，你還沒打夠嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol respects his opponent greatly, it did the best it could."
msgstr "戈爾非常尊重對手。那頭牛羚已經盡了全力了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The thicket impeded it as much as it does the rest of us. Nature is very much not in harmony here."
msgstr "這片叢林阻礙了它，也阻礙了我們。這裡的自然環境一點也不和諧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The creature was in pain, Gol did his best to free it."
msgstr "那頭牛羚當時很痛苦，戈爾盡力幫它解脫。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's... very noble of you. It's clear that something is off here, but... I figured it was kind of the opposite."
msgstr "你……太高尚了。這裡明顯有點不對勁，不過……我原本以為情況相反。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I haven't seen much yet, but it'd make sense that this is more of a matter of corruption than nature running wild."
msgstr "我還不太明白，不過這看起來更像是腐化在作怪，而不是自然失控了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'd best seal this as fast as we can. It will only get worse."
msgstr "我們最好儘快封印起來。否則，情況會更糟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's no way of driving the corruption out?"
msgstr "沒辦法消除腐化嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd need to be five times the herbalist I am, and that's just if it's a poison or plant-based corruption."
msgstr "那我這個草藥師要再強五倍，而且它必須是毒藥或植物類的腐化。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It could be magic, which I can't do much of anything about."
msgstr "這可能是魔法，我也沒辦法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're doing plenty, and we're lucky to have you here. Sealing the grove will be more than enough for now."
msgstr "你已經做得夠多了，有你是我們的財運。現在只要封印這片叢林就好了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As long as we're able to halt its growth, having a single crater in the middle of the woods locked away should be fine, until we figure out how to fix it."
msgstr "在我們找到最終的解決辦法之前，只要能阻止它繼續生長，把林子裡的那個洞封起來就可以了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol recommends putting up some better signs though."
msgstr "不過，戈爾建議多放幾塊像樣的牌子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "See? Gol and I are on the same page, Jass."
msgstr "你看？戈爾和我想的一樣，傑絲。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Though, on second thought I'm not sure if that's a good thing."
msgstr "不過轉念一想，這到底是不是件好事，我也不好說。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... ugh."
msgstr "我……唉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So, we can't just throw Gol into the forest and hope that he's able to get every single one of the corrupted beasts."
msgstr "所以，我們不能把戈爾扔進森林，指望他把那些腐化的牛羚全部消滅。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, but it was good to come. We let Petal get her potions and herbs ready. She mentioned needing a fair bit of time to prepare to tame the outer thicket."
msgstr "這樣不行，但這次來還是有收成的。我們讓佩塔準備好藥水和草藥。她說要控制外面的那片叢林，需要多點時間準備。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's right. I'm making a special brew for this... My hope is that I can stunt the plants' growth, not just poison the land into inhabitability. Not to mention it'd take a lot more poison for that."
msgstr "沒錯。我在做一種特別的藥水……我希望能抑制植物的生長，而不是用毒藥把這片土地變成無法生存的地方。況且，那需要的毒藥多得多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "While you work on that, Gol and I can bait the creatures back into the crater. That way when we seal it, they'll be locked inside."
msgstr "你做你的，戈爾和我可以把那些東西引回洞裡。等我們把洞封印了，它們就出不來了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sounds sensible. We'll let you know if Morlin manages to find us as well."
msgstr "聽起來可以。如果莫林找到我們，我們會通知你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The corpse that Gol left behind was staggeringly large, so anything less than bait that is equally large won't do. I'll see what I can come up with, then come back to camp."
msgstr "戈爾留下的那具屍體大得驚人。除非用一樣大的魚餌，否則根本沒用。我先想辦法弄點東西，然後再回營地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rosemary is normally pretty pleasant. Will it really repel monsters with Petal's solution?"
msgstr "迷迭香花一般挺討人喜歡的。用佩塔的法子，真的能驅趕怪物嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll let her know I'm about done. [Talk]"
msgstr "我會告訴她，我快弄好了。[Talk]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Giant Fish Bait packed in your spare bag sounded fine and dandy, until you realized that you'd have to walk along the edge of the rampant forest. Gol, by some miracle or stroke of luck, just so happened to be nearby when one of the same beasts as before just about grabbed you in its massive jaws. It let out a terrifying howl, and followed after the two of you. Worried about your pace, eventually Gol decided to throw you over his shoulder and run towards the edge of the crater as the vegetation pulls out of Gol's path, which would have felt a lot more disheartening if it weren't for the scores of eyes following after you. \n\nAs the two of you crash through the treeline, you toss the bait-filled bag and send it careening into the crater. Gol dashes to the side and doesn't stop running, even as the beasts go lurching over the edge towards the pack. He doesn't set you down until the forest stops moving, which you don't mind one bit. Eventually, you deem it safe to return to camp, and do so quickly."
msgstr "把巨魚魚餌裝進你的備用包聽起來不錯，可當你意識到自己要沿著那片瘋狂蔓延的森林邊緣走時，就不行了。不知道是奇蹟還是運氣好，之前那頭牛羚差點用血盆大口咬你的時候，戈爾恰好就在附近。它發出一聲恐怖的咆哮，跟在你們身後。戈爾怕你太慢，最後決定把你扛在肩上，向洞邊跑去。兩邊的草木向後退，給戈爾讓路。如果不是身後有無數雙眼睛盯著你們，這場面或許更加令人沮喪。\n\n你們衝出樹林，你將那包魚餌甩了出去，滾進了洞裡。戈爾迅速閃到一邊，繼續奔跑。那群牛羚跌跌撞撞地翻過洞邊，撲向那袋魚餌。直到森林不再晃動，他才把你放下來。對此，你一點也不介意。過了一會兒，你覺得可以安全回營地了，於是便趕快回去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Friend, Gol fears your bait was a bit more effective than intended!"
msgstr "朋友，戈爾怕你的魚餌比預想更有效。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But it worked! I hope. There shouldn't be more than a couple stragglers if anything."
msgstr "但它確實有效！希望吧。就算有漏掉的，最多就一兩個"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol thinks you should work on your cardio before trying something like that again."
msgstr "戈爾覺得，下次這樣做之前，你應該先練練身體。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I only got to see a glimpse of it, but it was rather entertaining."
msgstr "我只瞄了一眼，但那場面確實挺有意思的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's kinda cute how small you look cradled in Gol's arms."
msgstr "你在戈爾的懷裡看起來小小的，還挺可愛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wasn't cradled, I was heroically and tactically placed on his shoulder."
msgstr "不是懷裡，是肩上，英勇、有戰術的那種。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If anything, the elevated position was probably even better for making sure the corrupted wildlife smelled the bait."
msgstr "而且，高一點可能更能讓那些腐化的牛羚聞到魚餌。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It was a smart plan, Gol just wishes you communicated it ahead of time."
msgstr "計劃確實不錯，不過戈爾希望你下次能提前說一聲。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sorry Gol, it was a kind of... improvised plan."
msgstr "不好意思戈爾，這算是……臨時計劃。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, one way or another, I think we're about ready for the next step. Petal?"
msgstr "總之，不管怎麼說，我想我們已經準備好進行下一步了。佩塔？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[i]{0}[/i], you're rather handy on the farm, no? I remember you helping me with my garden."
msgstr "[i]{0}[/i]，你在農場幹得不錯，對吧？我記得你幫過我打理花園。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Clove still loves the sunflowers, by the way."
msgstr "順便提一下，克洛夫還是喜歡向日葵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I believe that if you plant rosemary along the rim of the crater, with a bit of a boost from one of my infusions, it should be more than enough to keep most of the critters at bay while Morlin seals the grove."
msgstr "我覺得，如果你在洞邊種上迷迭香花，再加上我的藥劑，應該足以抵擋大多數小動物了。這時候，再讓莫林把那片樹林封印了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seems like a good plan to me. But... has Morlin gotten here yet?"
msgstr "這辦法聽起來不錯。不過……莫林到了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The man with the bushy beard floated into the sky!"
msgstr "那滿嘴鬍子的傢伙都飄到天上去了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is he... okay?"
msgstr "他……沒事吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He said he would be, still just dealing with some issues from his spell, apparently."
msgstr "他說沒事，看來只是在處理咒語留下的一些問題。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He'll be back... eventually."
msgstr "他會回來的……遲早而已。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You look to Petal and Gol, who shrug-seemingly not too concerned with the flyaway wizard. You make your way back through the growth once again, the hacking motion and dodging of vines becoming quite routine at this point."
msgstr "你看向佩塔和戈爾，他們聳了聳肩，似乎並不擔心那位飄走的法師。你再次穿過那片叢林，非常熟練地砍伐和躲避藤蔓。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The runes the old man is asking for... This barrier seems like some nasty work."
msgstr "那老頭要的符文……這道屏障看起來不太好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think we're finally ready to put up the barrier. [Complete Quest Button]"
msgstr "我想，我們終於可以佈置屏障了。[Complete Quest Button]"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you finish planting the last bit of rosemary into the ground, Petal comes by and dashes it with her solution, making the seed instantly spring up and twist into a much larger bright blue version of itself. Being next to it starts to make your eyes water, and as you turn your head and cough, you notice Jass and Gol hacking their way through the thicket, clutching vials of Petal's mix that should halt the growth of the plants.\n\nJust then, a scream comes from the sky, and hurtles towards Gol. Morlin the Mage seems to-just barely-slow himself as he reaches Gol, and quickly settles into his arms as the large man catches him."
msgstr "當你種下最後一棵迷迭香花時，佩塔走過來，灑下她的藥劑。那粒種子瞬間長了出來，扭扭曲曲，變成了一棵亮藍色的巨大迷迭香花。你在旁邊開始流淚。當你轉頭咳嗽時，你看見傑絲和戈爾正在叢林裡砍伐。他們拿著佩塔的幾瓶藥劑，這些藥劑應該可以抑制草木的生長。\n\n就在這時，天上傳來一聲尖叫，衝向戈爾。在快要撞到戈爾的時候，法師莫林勉強慢了一些，直接落到戈爾的懷裡，被戈爾一把接住。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I was wondering when you might turn up. We just finished up with our part, you were just about late."
msgstr "我還在想你什麼時候出現呢。我們剛忙完，你來的真是時候。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A Morlin is never late, nor is he early. He arrives precisely when his anti-gravity spell decides to send him hurtling towards the ground and straight into this strong man's arms."
msgstr "莫林不遲到，也不早到。他的反重力咒語決定讓他衝回地面並直接落到這位壯漢懷裡的時候，他就恰好到了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Also, I must say, this is exquisitely comfortable. You all really should try this."
msgstr "另外，我不得不說，這感覺真舒服。你們都應該試試。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "One of us already has."
msgstr "已經有人試了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Then good, shall we get this all wrapped up then? What do you need of this masterful mage?"
msgstr "很好，那我們就把這事兒辦了吧？這位大法師能為你做些什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can you call yourself a master if you can't control your spell?"
msgstr "連自己的咒語都控制不了，還自稱大法師。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Considering I haven't seen anyone so much as levitate more than a couple feet off the ground, I'd have to say yes."
msgstr "我沒見過有誰能讓物體離地漂浮幾英尺，我覺得這稱呼沒問題。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think we're about ready to seal the grove. Petal?"
msgstr "看來我們可以封印這片樹林了。佩塔？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We have a bit more of the solution to halt the thicket's growth outside of the crater, but just about. Did either of you see any more beasts?"
msgstr "我們還有能抑制洞外面叢林生長的藥劑，應該夠了。你們倆看到還有牛羚嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not one! [i]{0}[/i]'s bait did its job well."
msgstr "沒了！[i]{0}[/i]的魚餌效果不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah, well, good, because I seem to have misplaced... all of my runes."
msgstr "啊，那好……因為我好像把……我所有的符文弄丟了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How?!"
msgstr "怎麼會？！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How do you think you would keep hold of your worldly possessions while flying towards the ground, hm?"
msgstr "你說在衝向地面的時候，怎麼才能保住身上的東西呢，嗯？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please, [i]{0}[/i]?"
msgstr "拜託了，[i]{0}[/i]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gol can send the old man back into the sky if you'd like, friend! Gol does not need a spell for this."
msgstr "如果你願意的話，戈爾可以把這老頭送回天上，朋友！戈爾不需要什麼咒語"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No! No no no. Please, could you fetch me some runes? I need a bit of time to reacclimate to the ground..."
msgstr "不！不不不。拜託，你能幫我弄些符文嗎？我需要點時間來重新適應地面……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You glare at the old wizard before finally letting out a sigh and asking for a list of runes he needs for the spell. He goes to produce a page from his bag, but realizes that it is also missing, so he opts to just list them aloud instead, with little fanfare."
msgstr "你生氣地看著老巫師，然後嘆了口氣，問他要咒語需要的符文清單。他從包裡掏出一張紙，但目擊紙也不見了。於是他乾脆直接用嘴說。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "On your way back through the thicket-hopefully for the final time-you notice that Petal's solution must be working. The blue vines from before seem... placated, and barely twitch as you walk by, taking care not to step on them. You make it past the worst of the vegetation with little issue, and find yourself back on the rim of the crater. \n\nYou find Morlin tied to a tree, the rope seeming to be the only thing stopping him from drifting back skyward. He happily takes the runes from you and gets to work while the rest of the crew finishes applying the last of Petal's solution to the most agitated bits of the forest. With a shout, Morlin claps his hands and a dome begins to materialize over the lip of the crater. Jass starts putting up new signs, taking advice from Gol all the while. Soon enough, warnings of a deadly barrier, evil beasts, and a corrupted array of flora lay below, along with certain death.\n\nAs you peer through the translucent barrier, you see that the jungle below looks wild and untamed, just as before. You hope that one day, you'll be able to return to discover what made it grow so rampant in the first place, and maybe even fix it, if you're lucky.\n\n"
msgstr "你再次穿過叢林，希望這是最後一次了。你目擊佩塔的藥劑明顯奏效了。之前那些藍色的藤蔓好像……被安撫了，你經過的時候一動不動。但你還是小心翼翼地走，沒踩它們。你順利穿過最危險的那片草木，回到洞邊。\n\n你目擊莫林被綁在樹上。好像全靠那根繩子，他才沒飄回天上。他高興地接過符文，然後就開始搗鼓。這時，其他人將佩塔的藥劑灑在森林中最躁動的那片區域。傑絲開始佈置新的警示牌，還不時聽取戈爾的建議。沒過多久，警示牌就立好了，上面寫著「有致命屏障」、「有兇惡牛羚」、「下面有腐化草木」、「擅入者必死無疑」。\n\n透過那道半透明的屏障，你看到下面狂野的叢林，跟之前一樣。你希望有一天能回來找到這片叢林瘋狂蔓延的原因；如果運氣好的話，或許還能徹底解決。\n\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Pointy Preparation"
msgstr "尖銳的準備"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A concerned citizen wants to scrape together some semblance of a fighting force for Azamire's defense against any would-be bandits or those black-robed figures looking to finish the job, but she's barely in fighting shape herself."
msgstr "一位憂心的市民想湊出一支像樣的戰鬥隊伍，保衛阿扎米爾免受強盜或那些想斬草除根的黑袍人侵擾，但她自己的身體狀況也幾乎無法作戰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just putting some pointy rocks on some wood, nothing too tough."
msgstr "只是把尖石頭綁在木頭上而已，沒什麼難的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think they've gotten the idea."
msgstr "我想他們已經懂了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The cinders from the assault on Azamire have only just fizzled out, much like many of the survivors' will to go on. Everyone that remained had lost something. Their homes. Family members. Friends. You and [Companion Name] sit on the soot covered cobbles that once made up the town's main thoroughfare, watching another family carry what little they have left and shuffle out of town, hoping that some nearby village may have been spared. Neither of you blame them.\n\nA woman with a bloodied stump where her hand should have been approaches the two of you and falls to the ground beside you with a sigh."
msgstr "阿扎米爾遭襲後的餘燼才剛熄滅，許多倖存者活下去的意志也一樣。留下來的每個人都失去了些什麼。家園、家人、朋友。你和 [Companion Name] 坐在曾是鎮上主要大道、如今滿是煤灰的鵝卵石上，看著又一戶人家帶著僅剩的家當，拖著腳步離開小鎮，盼望附近某個村莊能倖免於難。你們都不怪他們。\n\n一名女子走向你們，她的手本該在的地方只剩下血淋淋的斷肢。她嘆了口氣，在你們身旁坐倒在地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well. You two headed out as well?"
msgstr "唉。你們兩個也要走了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can't turn my back on Azamire. Too many folks have done too much for me, growing up."
msgstr "我不能背棄阿扎米爾。我從小到大，太多人為我付出太多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Doubt many of 'em are left."
msgstr "我懷疑他們還剩下多少人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The town still is, though."
msgstr "但小鎮還在。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not much of it."
msgstr "也剩沒多少了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I take it you're leaving, then? Can't blame you, but this is home for the both of us. Even if... Home's looking a little worse for wear."
msgstr "看來妳要離開了？我不怪妳，但這裡是我們倆的家。即使……家看起來有點殘破了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gods no! No shame to those who are, but those rotters took more than just my hand. Teri... didn't make it."
msgstr "天哪，不！我沒有看不起他們，但那群混蛋砍掉的不僅僅是我的手。泰瑞……沒能活下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh Jass... I'm so sorry."
msgstr "噢，傑絲……我很遺憾。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fool of a man got between me and one of those wretches' beasts. Seemed like he was going to pull through... but then he didn't."
msgstr "那個傻男人擋在我和那些惡徒的野獸之間。原本看起來他撐得過去……但最後還是沒有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...We'll make them pay, Jass. [Companion Name] and I won't let this go unanswered."
msgstr "……我們會讓他們付出代價的，傑絲。我和 [Companion Name] 不會就這樣算了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're not alone in your sentiment. I came by to see if you two might be interested in a little project."
msgstr "有這種想法的不只你們。我來是想看看你們兩個會不會對一個小計畫有興趣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A couple of people who aren't running for the hills want to fight back. But they're farmers. Builders."
msgstr "有幾個沒逃走的人想要反擊。但他們是農夫、工匠。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I used to be pretty good with a bow, but it'd be a bit tough with this hand... or lack thereof."
msgstr "我以前弓箭用得還不錯，但這隻手……或者說沒有這隻手，會有點困難。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Want us to show them the ropes? Been a little while since I shot a bow, but I can show a couple of farmers where to point it and how not to shoot their friends."
msgstr "要我們教他們入門嗎？我有一陣子沒射箭了，但我可以教幾個農夫該往哪瞄，還有怎麼不射到自己的朋友。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Are you forgetting what happened a couple of years ago? I still feel the need to duck every time you-"
msgstr "……你忘了幾年前發生的事了嗎？每次你一拉弓我還是會想趴下——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Okay, fine, [Player Name] can do the teaching, maybe I'll learn something too. Is there anything else that I could help with?"
msgstr "好啦好啦，讓 [Player Name] 來教，說不定我也能學到點東西。還有什麼我能幫忙的嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Actually, yes. Like I said, most of these folks hardly know anything outside of their trade. Showing them how to put together a couple of arrows could go a long way towards making them self-sufficient."
msgstr "其實有。就像我說的，這些人大多除了自己的本行之外幾乎什麼都不懂。教他們怎麼做幾支箭，對讓他們自給自足會很有幫助。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The three of you chat back and forth for a while, putting together the idea of a lesson plan, putting up some ramshackle targets meant to resemble a humanoid figure, and some scavenged gear. Jass brings back a dozen or so dusty villagers from town who seem to carry a wide range of emotions. Some, determined to fight back against the cloaked figures who destroyed the town, some who looked lost and aimless, and some somewhere in between.\n\n[Companion Name] takes half of them and gets to work showing them how to make bows, something they were always better at than actually firing them, while you take the other half and get to work showing them how to make arrows."
msgstr "你們三個來回討論了一陣子，擬出了一份教學計畫，架起幾個勉強像人形的簡陋靶子，還湊了些撿來的裝備。傑絲從鎮上帶回十幾個灰頭土臉的村民，他們的情緒各不相同。有些人決心向摧毀小鎮的斗篷人反擊，有些人看起來茫然無措，還有些介於兩者之間。\n\n[Companion Name] 帶走一半的人，開始教他們製作弓——這向來是他們比實際射箭更擅長的事——而你則帶著另一半，開始教他們製作箭矢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If I didn't know better, I'd say they were aiming at me."
msgstr "要不是我比較清楚，我會說他們在瞄準我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I knew they'd be bad, but wow."
msgstr "我知道他們會很爛，但哇。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Many of the folks picked up your teaching pretty quickly. Even Jass, just managing with a single hand, did a fine job putting together some flight-worthy arrows. [Companion Name]'s lesson seemed to go about as smoothly, and they produced a few bows to share amongst themselves for the next bout of training. The villagers quietly, but excitedly, show off what they managed to make, or laugh about how poorly their creations turned out, depending on their results."
msgstr "許多人很快就學會了你教的東西。就連只用一隻手的傑絲，也做出了幾支能飛的箭。[Companion Name] 的課似乎也進行得差不多順利，他們做出了幾把弓，供下一輪訓練時大家輪流使用。村民們安靜卻興奮地展示自己的成果，或是依結果而定，笑著自己的作品做得有多糟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you two for all of this, by the way."
msgstr "順帶一提，謝謝你們兩個做的這一切。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course. It'll be important for us to not get caught out like this again."
msgstr "當然。我們不能再像這樣措手不及了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This group has a long way to go, still. We had guards, but they lasted all of a few minutes before those things started cutting through the town."
msgstr "這群人還有很長的路要走。我們之前有守衛，但那些東西開始在鎮上大開殺戒後，他們沒撐幾分鐘就倒下了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's a start, though. And besides, keeping these people busy is just as important as making sure they're trained."
msgstr "不過這是個開始。再說，讓這些人有事可忙，跟確保他們受過訓練一樣重要。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dwelling on everything that happened... Well, that's no good for anyone."
msgstr "一直沉湎於發生過的事……那對誰都沒好處。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Anyway. Shall we get to shooting?"
msgstr "總之，我們開始射箭吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As long as [Companion Name] doesn't stick me with an arrow, sure."
msgstr "只要 [Companion Name] 不拿箭射我就好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] glares at you, but you've known them long enough to know there's no real anger there, just like they know you have no malice in your light banter.\n\nThough, you start to think otherwise when the villagers pick up their bows and start trying to hit the targets. You feel as though their arrows pass by you more often than the targets. You get to work quickly, trying to show them how to draw, aim, and fire, before they really hurt someone."
msgstr "[Companion Name] 瞪了你一眼，但你們相識夠久，你知道那眼神裡沒有真正的怒意，就像對方也知道你輕鬆的玩笑話不帶惡意。\n\n不過，當村民們拿起弓開始試著射靶時，你開始改變想法了。你覺得他們的箭從你身邊飛過的次數比射向靶子還多。你趕緊動手，在他們真的傷到人之前，教他們如何拉弓、瞄準和放箭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You certainly lost a bit of skin from arrows that passed by a bit too close for comfort, but after a while, the villagers' shots start to resemble straight flight paths. A couple folks pick it up faster than the others, among them, [Companion Name], though you still could hardly say you felt safe just yet.\n\nInitially, Jass seemed to be a bit frustrated at not being able to join in the demonstration, but fell into her own role guiding people and repeating your instructions to those that seemed to struggle the first few times around, or giving pointers that even you started to incorporate into your own shots.\n\nBy the end of the day, the villagers didn't seem to actively be putting one another in danger, and looked far more determined than they did at the start of the drill, and you entrust them into Jass's tutelage, for better or worse."
msgstr "有些箭擦身而過，近得讓人不太舒服，你確實因此掉了點皮，但過了一陣子，村民們射出的箭開始有了筆直的軌跡。有幾個人學得比別人快，[Companion Name] 也是其中之一，不過你還是很難說自己已經覺得安全了。\n\n一開始，傑絲似乎因為無法參與示範而有些沮喪，但她很快找到了自己的角色：引導大家，向前幾輪似乎有困難的人重複你的指示，甚至給出連你都開始在自己射擊時採用的建議。\n\n到了傍晚，村民們看起來已經不會主動讓彼此陷入危險，而且比訓練開始時堅定得多。無論好壞，你把他們託付給傑絲指導。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fishin' for Trouble"
msgstr "釣出麻煩"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "While out on a fishing trip, a little girl has gone missing with only her fishing pole and a single tooth left behind. Not much to go on, except one small detail. It isn't a human tooth."
msgstr "一個小女孩外出釣魚時失蹤了，只留下她的釣竿和一顆牙齒。線索不多，只有一個小細節：那不是人類的牙齒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Swords are plenty sharp, that'll do."
msgstr "劍夠鋒利了，這樣就行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's hope they can figure out how to swing 'em."
msgstr "希望他們搞得懂怎麼揮劍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You just start to drift off to sleep before a frantic pounding at your door makes you jump up and start grabbing for something nearby to protect yourself. Your door opens a bit more gently than you'd expect considering the knocking, and you find [Companion Name] looking worried with a young woman behind her. She holds up something about as thick as your finger with a sickly pale yellow hue."
msgstr "你才剛要入睡，一陣急促的敲門聲就讓你跳了起來，伸手去抓身邊能防身的東西。考慮到那陣敲門聲，門被打開的力道比你預期的溫和許多，你看到 [Companion Name] 一臉憂心，身後站著一名年輕女子。她舉起一個約有你手指粗、泛著病態淡黃色的東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Her daughter was out fishing near the river and didn't come home for dinner. Sorry to interrupt your sleep, but I figured you'd want to help."
msgstr "她女兒在河邊釣魚，晚餐時間都沒回家。抱歉打擾你睡覺，但我想你會想幫忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're not wrong. And the thing you're holding?"
msgstr "你說得沒錯。那你手上拿的是？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Golbin tooth. The only... blood, that was there was blue, so..."
msgstr "哥布林的牙齒。那裡唯一的……血跡是藍色的，所以……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The girl is okay, at least for now, I'd imagine."
msgstr "我想那女孩沒事，至少目前是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good, good. Then, just the two of us are headed out?"
msgstr "很好，很好。那就只有我們兩個出發？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thankfully, no. Jass has been making a bit of progress with her 'militia' and they want to join us."
msgstr "還好不是。傑絲的「民兵」有了點進展，他們想跟我們一起去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's anyone's guess how many Golbins there will be. It'd be smart to let them come to us."
msgstr "沒人知道會有多少哥布林。讓他們主動找上我們會比較聰明。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What if we set the same scene as... the incident, have Jass's people waiting for them?"
msgstr "如果我們重現……事發時的場景，讓傑絲的人埋伏等著他們呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just please... hurry. I'm hopeful my little Ana is safe, but... it's not like they took her for a fun little stroll around the woods. I know she must be so frightened..."
msgstr "拜託了……快點。我希望我的小安娜平安，但……它們把她帶走，肯定不是帶她去樹林玩。我想她現在一定很害怕……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't worry, we'll do everything that we can."
msgstr "別擔心，我們會盡一切努力。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You gather your things and leave your bed behind, meeting up with Jass and a couple of folks just outside. Some of them hold the bows [Companion Name] helped them make, some holding new ones they must have created themselves. However, any decent force has variety - archers wouldn't fare well if the Golbins got in their ranks - and their inventiveness hasn't improved in the short time since you helped them last. Jass asks for a couple of new toys for the folks that haven't taken well to the bow."
msgstr "你收拾好東西離開床鋪，在門外與傑絲和幾個人會合。有些人拿著 [Companion Name] 幫他們做的弓，有些人拿著自己新做的。然而，任何像樣的隊伍都需要多樣性——如果哥布林衝進隊伍裡，弓箭手可撐不了多久——而自從你上次幫忙後，他們的創造力在短短時間內並沒有進步。傑絲請你為那些不擅長用弓的人做幾件新玩具。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just catch some fish and don't look suspicious. Easy."
msgstr "釣幾條魚，別看起來可疑就好。簡單。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr "那是什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The folks take up their new weapons eagerly. Though it has only been a short time since Jass gathered them, the combined militia now totaled a couple dozen. You notice as you hand out swords, though most don't have any conventional fighting experience, these people tend to lean capable. Lumber Workers and farmers who've built functional bodies through years of hard labour. Against a trained fighting force, sure, they'd hardly stand a chance. But against a group of ragtag Golbins? You like their odds."
msgstr "大家熱切地拿起新武器。雖然傑絲召集他們才沒多久，整支民兵已有二十幾人。你在發放劍時注意到，雖然大多數人沒有正規的戰鬥經驗，但這些人頗有能耐。伐木工和農夫們經過多年粗活，練就了結實的身體。對上訓練有素的軍隊，他們當然毫無勝算。但對上一群烏合之眾的哥布林？你覺得他們勝算不小。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Jass, you sure about this?"
msgstr "傑絲，妳確定嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They might not have much experience, but the folks that couldn't hit the broad side of a barn - or just otherwise hated trying to use the bows - I've had running drills with sticks and leftover tools."
msgstr "他們也許經驗不多，但那些連穀倉大門都射不中的人——或是就是討厭用弓的人——我已經讓他們拿棍子和剩下的工具練習過了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They got a long way to go, but they know enough to hold their own. I'm not sending them in to die, don't worry."
msgstr "他們還有很長的路要走，但已經足以自保。我不會派他們去送死的，別擔心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good, good. Azamire can't get much smaller if we want to keep calling ourselves a town. "
msgstr "很好，很好。如果我們還想自稱是個小鎮，阿扎米爾可不能再小下去了。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If this ambush goes well, they won't need to fight much. Just need to look scary and grab one or two of the Golbins to tell us where they brought the girl."
msgstr "如果這次伏擊順利，他們就不需要怎麼戰鬥。只要看起來嚇人，然後抓一兩隻哥布林問出他們把女孩帶去哪裡就好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If everyone's ready, let's head out to the river, then?"
msgstr "如果大家都準備好了，那我們就出發去河邊吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] leads you to the river where the girl went missing. You fondly recall learning to swim with [Companion Name] here, years ago, and wish you were here under less dire circumstances. The militia disperses through the surrounding forest, headed by Jass who quietly gives orders, trying to get people hidden as best she can.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] settle in by the riverbank, and pull out your rods, hoping to catch a bit more than just a few fish. You're a bit too nervous for idle conversation, so you both quietly fall into a rhythm, just trying to look like two innocuous people fishing late into the night."
msgstr "[Companion Name] 帶你來到女孩失蹤的河邊。你懷念地想起多年前和 [Companion Name] 在這裡學游泳的時光，真希望這次來不是在如此危急的情況下。民兵們在傑絲的帶領下分散到周圍的森林中，她低聲下達命令，盡可能讓大家藏好。\n\n你和 [Companion Name] 在河岸邊坐下，拿出釣竿，希望釣到的不只是幾條魚。你緊張得無心閒聊，於是你們倆都安靜地進入節奏，只是盡量看起來像兩個深夜釣魚的無害路人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm not going to let [Companion Name] beat me!"
msgstr "我可不會讓 [Companion Name] 贏過我！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That should be about all of them."
msgstr "應該差不多就這些了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You worry for a moment that one of the militia members is being too loud before you see it. A group of Golbins, sauntering up with hardly a care in the world, barking orders at one another, trying to surround you and [Companion Name]. It's... more than you expected, and as you start to get up to defend yourself, an arrow sinks right between the leading Golbin's shoulder blades. "
msgstr "你一度擔心有民兵發出太大聲響，接著就看到了。一群哥布林大搖大擺地走過來，毫不在意，互相吆喝著命令，試圖包圍你和 [Companion Name]。數量……比你預期的多，就在你起身準備自衛時，一支箭正中帶頭哥布林的兩肩胛骨之間。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everyone, now!"
msgstr "大家，就是現在！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Make sure to leave a couple breathing!"
msgstr "記得留幾個活口！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bet you I'll kill more than you. Try not to die."
msgstr "我打賭我殺得比你多。盡量別死啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're on."
msgstr "一言為定。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name]'s look of anxiety hidden under bravado is quickly replaced with confidence as the woods explode with movement. The militia lets loose a volley of arrows that pepper the unprepared Golbins, scattering them and sending a few more to the ground. What's left of them gather themselves and charge towards you and your friend, or the quickly approaching villagers armed with swords."
msgstr "隨著樹林中爆發出一陣騷動，[Companion Name] 隱藏在逞強之下的焦慮神情，很快就被自信取代。民兵射出一波箭雨，打得毫無防備的哥布林四處逃竄，又有幾隻倒地。剩下的哥布林重整旗鼓，衝向你和你的朋友，或是那些手持長劍、迅速逼近的村民。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You look around as the movement begins to settle. The Golbin force was larger than you had anticipated, but your efforts went as well as could be expected. Among the bodies littering the forest floor, from what you could see, only a couple were human, which was better than expected considering their experience.\n\nYou rush over as you hear a shout from Jass, who managed to pin a dark green Golbin to ground. The beast would have hardly came up to your hip had it been on its feet, and you could hear it whimpering and begging not to be hurt. It quickly rattles off fragments of information that it thinks could be useful, detailing how its clan was taken over by a rival group led by someone it called the 'Ringleader', its own name - Gloob - and how it really really wants to live. Jass slaps her hand over its mouth and asks it where the girl they kidnapped was, and why they took her. Gloob goes one step further, and says that it'll lead you all there to its nearby camp, and that they were going to try and paint him and sell him off too, whatever that may mean.\n\nYou discuss it briefly together, and decide to 'trust' it to do as it says. Surely enough, the camp is close, and the leftover defenders quickly scatter as they see they're vastly outnumbered, leaving their camp behind. You and [Companion Name] quickly find Ana in one of their tents and take her home, while Jass and the militia handle a dozen or so other folks who had been captured from elsewhere throughout the countryside. Ana's mother meets you just outside of Azamire with tears in her eyes, thanking you over and over again for saving her daughter."
msgstr "戰鬥逐漸平息，你看了看四周。哥布林的數量比你預想的要多，但你們的攻擊跟預想的一樣好。看著躺在地上的屍體，只有幾具是人類的。考慮到大家的戰鬥經驗，這比預想的結果要好。\n\n你聽到傑絲大喊一聲，趕快跑了過去。傑絲把一隻深綠色的哥布林死死按在地上。這牛羚要是站起來，恐怕還沒你的腰高。它低聲抽泣，求你們不要傷害它。為了活命，它說了一些資訊。它說，它的氏族被一個敵對氏族控制了，領頭的『首領』叫格魯布。它還說，自己非常、非常想活命。傑絲打了它的嘴，問它被綁架的小女孩在哪兒，為什麼要抓小女孩。格魯布先開口了。它說帶你們去它附近的營地，還說它們原本打算把他塗上顏色，然後賣掉。具體什麼意思，不知道。\n\n你們簡單商量了一下，決定『相信』它的話。果然，營地就在附近。營地的守護目擊自己的人太少，丟下營地，迅速逃走了。你和[Companion Name]很快在一個帳篷裡找到了安娜，把她帶回家。傑絲和民兵們負責處理從其他地方抓到的另外幾十個人。在阿扎米爾的外面，安娜的母親滿眼淚水，一遍又一遍地感謝你們救了她女兒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Boarish Bonfire"
msgstr "野豬篝火"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Azamire has slowly but surely begun to get back onto its feet, and that's cause for celebration. The town's impromptu mayor, Hapren, has thought of just the thing to get folks together, a bit of warmth and food in the center of town."
msgstr "阿扎米爾已經緩慢但穩定地開始重新站起來，這值得慶祝。鎮上臨時的鎮長哈普倫想到了一個能讓大家聚在一起的好點子：在鎮中心來點溫暖和食物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A little cleanup could go a long way to making things feel a bit more put together."
msgstr "稍微清理一下，就能讓這裡看起來整齊許多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Looking a lot nicer."
msgstr "看起來好多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A handful of people you haven't seen before walk past, likely another group of refugees from one of the nearby villages that fared even worse than Azamire, attacked around the same time. The town's new mayor - the son of the previous mayor that was lost in the attack - welcomes them and directs them towards one of the newly repaired buildings that they were using to shelter people before more buildings could be made to house them. Once he wraps up, he sets his eyes on you and [Companion Name]."
msgstr "幾個你從沒見過的人走過，可能是附近某個村莊的另一批難民，那裡大約在同一時間遭到襲擊，下場比阿扎米爾更慘。鎮上的新鎮長——在襲擊中喪生的前任鎮長之子——歡迎他們，並指引他們前往一棟剛修好的建築，在蓋好更多房屋之前，那裡被用來收容人們。他處理完後，便將目光投向你和 [Companion Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hey there, you two. I hope that things have been as good as they can be, considering..."
msgstr "嘿，你們兩個。希望一切都還算好，考慮到……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everything?"
msgstr "所有的事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Exactly... There's no easy way to put such a tragedy, huh?"
msgstr "沒錯……這種悲劇真的很難用三言兩語說清楚，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There really isn't. You inherited quite the mess, didn't you?"
msgstr "確實。你接手了一個大爛攤子，不是嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't suppose either of you would be willing to take over, would you?"
msgstr "我想你們兩個應該都不願意接手吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Afraid not. Never had the decorum to fit into a role like that. "
msgstr "恐怕不行。我從來就沒有擔任那種角色的禮數。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Didn't figure. Well, would you two mind helping me out with a little project, then?"
msgstr "我想也是。那麼，你們兩個介意幫我一個小忙嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you have in mind, exactly?"
msgstr "你具體在想什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hapren brings the two of you over to the center of town, which has been piled with debris from Azamire's cleanup efforts. He talks about how he'd love to throw a little gathering for the town, just so folks can get to know one another and feel a bit of normalcy despite how hard the last while has been. A few people try their best to break down the rubble into movable chunks, but progress is slow, and Hapren asks for help before starting to work on the pile himself."
msgstr "哈普倫帶你們兩個來到鎮中心，那裡堆滿了阿扎米爾清理工作留下的瓦礫。他說他很想為鎮上辦個小聚會，好讓大家互相認識，在最近這段艱難的日子裡感受一點日常。有幾個人盡力把瓦礫敲成能搬動的碎塊，但進展緩慢，哈普倫在親自動手處理之前先請你們幫忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nothing too flashy, just gotta pull up enough fish to show them how it's done."
msgstr "不用太花俏，只要釣上足夠的魚，示範給他們看就行了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Huh, there really is a lot of junk in the water. Wonder where it's coming from?"
msgstr "咦，水裡真的有好多垃圾。不知道是從哪來的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With you and [Companion Name]'s help, you manage to break up the debris in short order, and Hapren directs much of the salvageable materials to be stored for reconstruction efforts, and the wood that is too mangled to be used to be left in the square to be used for the bonfire.\n\nJust as you set your tools down, a few tired looking folks make their way into the center of town, fishing gear in hand."
msgstr "在你和 [Companion Name] 的幫助下，你們很快就把瓦礫清理完畢。哈普倫指示將大部分可回收的材料存放起來供重建使用，至於損壞得無法使用的木頭，則留在廣場上當作篝火的柴薪。\n\n就在你放下工具時，幾個看起來疲憊不堪的人拿著釣具走進了鎮中心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If I couldn't see them swimming around, I'd swear the stock of fish had run dry."
msgstr "要不是我看得到牠們在游，我會發誓魚都被釣光了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Feels like we're pullin' more junk out of the water than fish."
msgstr "感覺我們從水裡拉上來的垃圾比魚還多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rough day?"
msgstr "今天不順？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You could say that. I see that the town square is just about ready, but I'm sorry... It'll take us a week to have enough fish at this rate."
msgstr "可以這麼說。我看到廣場差不多準備好了，但很抱歉……照這個速度，我們要一個禮拜才能湊到足夠的魚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, you're using Mackerel Bait, right? Only way I've managed to pull anything out of there."
msgstr "等等，你們用的是鯖魚魚餌吧？那是我唯一能從那裡釣到東西的方法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...No. Honestly, don't think I've ever used much more than a worm, really."
msgstr "……沒有。老實說，我好像從來沒用過蚯蚓以外的東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, you don't need it, but it sure doesn't hurt."
msgstr "嗯，不一定需要，但用了絕對沒壞處。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Since we're just about done here... While we get things set up, would you mind lending them a hand?"
msgstr "既然我們這邊差不多好了……在我們布置的時候，你們介意幫他們一把嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] looks to you and searches your face, trying to gauge your reaction. You shrug, and then offer to help. Getting together a bit of bait to help the fishers out, then showing them how to work with the river shouldn't take too long, and it'd be nice for the town to be able to keep itself fed."
msgstr "[Companion Name] 看著你，打量你的表情，想知道你的反應。你聳聳肩，然後主動表示願意幫忙。準備一些魚餌幫助漁夫，再教他們如何應對這條河，應該花不了多少時間，而且如果鎮上能自給自足會很不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's no helping it, then!"
msgstr "那就沒辦法了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe Hapren would appreciate the meat?"
msgstr "也許哈普倫會想要這些肉？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You all spend awhile on the pebble bank, sitting and waiting for a fish to bite, as one typically does while fishing. You and [Companion Name] talk to the fishermen for a while and learn that they used to be able to pull out enough fish to feed half the town, even without the bait. When you dump bait in the water, and start using some on your hooks, things pick up, but it's still rather slow. You watch even more junk float by. Bits of tree branches, huge clumps of soil, and then, a dead Golbin. The fishers point out that it's been like this for a few days, minus the Golbins at least."
msgstr "你們在卵石河岸上待了好一陣子，坐著等魚上鉤，就像釣魚時常有的那樣。你和 [Companion Name] 跟漁夫們聊了一會兒，得知他們以前就算不用魚餌，也能釣到足夠餵飽半個鎮的魚。當你把魚餌撒進水裡，並開始在魚鉤上使用時，情況有所好轉，但還是相當緩慢。你看著更多垃圾漂過。樹枝碎片、大塊泥土，然後是一隻死掉的哥布林。漁夫們指出，這種情況已經持續好幾天了，至少哥布林是第一次。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Something must be going on up river, this is just odd."
msgstr "上游一定發生了什麼事，這太奇怪了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You all can keep fishing. Try not to reel in... anything green."
msgstr "你們繼續釣吧。盡量別釣到……任何綠色的東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're going to go check it out, aren't you?"
msgstr "你要去查看一下，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course we are. You're coming too, obviously. Unless you want to see me floating by, next?"
msgstr "當然。你也要來，這還用說。除非你想下次看到我漂過去？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I haven't shown them how I usually tie my hooks yet, I really-"
msgstr "我還沒示範我平常怎麼綁魚鉤，我真的——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They stop their protesting as you grab their shoulder and pull them behind you. You know from all your time together they'd never really let you go by yourself, but as they grumble behind you, it's clear they're not pleased about running off to find... whatever is, up river.\n\nAfter a few minute jaunt upstream, you see it. A massive boar standing over a group of dead Golbins. It pulls against ropes that had been tied to trees along the river, and then thrown over the top of the beast. As you approach it catches sight of you both, assumes and breaks the last of its restrains as it charges towards you!"
msgstr "你抓住對方的肩膀把人拉到身後，對方這才停止抗議。從你們相處的這些時間，你知道對方絕不會真的讓你一個人去，但聽著身後的嘀咕聲，顯然對方對於跑去上游找……不管那是什麼，並不太高興。\n\n往上游走了幾分鐘後，你看到了。一頭巨大的野豬站在一群死掉的哥布林旁。牠拉扯著綁在河邊樹上、再拋過牠身上的繩索。當你們靠近時，牠發現了你們，掙斷最後的束縛，朝你們衝了過來！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With the help of some villagers and their carts, you manage to bring back the Golbin's pet taming project. Hapren is shocked, then pleased, as he realizes that this is a far better catch than a few fish from the river.\n\nAs the sun sets, the wooden debris from the square is burnt and thick slabs of boar are grilled and given out to everyone in attendance. More and more curious folks poke their heads into the square and are met with warmth and light conversation.  A few folks even start up with light songs as the night progresses and Azamire's paltry stores of booze are enjoyed by those who indulge.\n\nAzamire's attack is far from forgotten, but this quiet moment amongst the survivors does well to begin healing the towns aching wounds."
msgstr "在一些村民和他們的推車協助下，你們成功把哥布林的寵物馴服計畫帶了回來。哈普倫先是震驚，接著很高興，因為他意識到這比從河裡釣到的幾條魚要好得多。\n\n夕陽西下時，廣場上的木頭瓦礫被點燃，厚厚的野豬肉片被烤好分給每一位到場的人。越來越多好奇的人探頭進廣場，迎接他們的是溫暖與輕鬆的談話。隨著夜色漸深，有些人甚至唱起了輕快的歌，願意小酌的人則享用著阿扎米爾少得可憐的酒類存貨。\n\n阿扎米爾 遭受的襲擊遠未被遺忘，但倖存者之間這片刻的寧靜，為小鎮痛楚的傷口開始癒合帶來了很大的幫助。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Misty Reconnaissance"
msgstr "迷霧偵察"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gloob and Jass have been 'working' together for a while, and now need your help to launch a daring mission... or stupidly walk into a Golbin's trap."
msgstr "格魯布和傑絲已經「合作」了一段時間，現在需要你協助展開一項大膽的任務……或是愚蠢地走進哥布林的陷阱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I should be able to follow Gloob's schematics easy enough."
msgstr "我應該能輕鬆照著格魯布的設計圖做。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "These should work!"
msgstr "這些應該行得通！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you walk back into Azamire, you feel a swell of pride at the number of newly constructed buildings. They're small, and it hardly takes you long to count them on two hands, but still, Azamire is rebuilding, bit by bit.\n\nYour delight is interrupted by a shriek as you hear a... Golbin run by, chased by the newly appointed Militia Captain - Jass. The chase doesn't last long, and Gloob is held down while Jass berates it, talking about how she's no fool and knows a trap when she sees one."
msgstr "當你走回阿扎米爾時，看著那些新蓋好的建築，你心中湧起一股自豪。它們很小，兩隻手就數得完，但無論如何，阿扎米爾正一點一點地重建。\n\n你的喜悅被一聲尖叫打斷，你聽見一隻……哥布林跑過，被新任命的民兵隊長——傑絲——追著跑。追逐沒持續多久，格魯布就被壓制在地，傑絲一邊斥責牠，一邊說自己可不是傻瓜，看得出什麼是陷阱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I see that things are going well."
msgstr "看來事情進展得很順利嘛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "SHE'S GOING TO EAT ME, PLEASE HELP!"
msgstr "她要吃掉我，救命啊！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're keeping you here because you were meant to help us, beast!"
msgstr "我們把你留在這裡是因為你應該要幫我們，你這畜生！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What I said was true! You should be able to sneak into the Ringleader's fortress at night, it'd be fine!"
msgstr "我說的是真的！你們晚上應該能潛入首領的堡壘，不會有事的！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The guards have wood for brains! You'll see what I mean!"
msgstr "那些守衛腦袋都是木頭做的！你們看了就知道我的意思！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll do no such thing! We ought to string you up for what your little pack did to Ana!"
msgstr "我們才不去呢！你們那幫傢伙對安娜做的那些事，真該把你吊起來！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's happening, exactly?"
msgstr "到底發生什麼事了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This beast, is trying to get us to sneak into its boss's hideout tonight. Says all the Golbins will be out escorting a shipment."
msgstr "這個畜生想要我們今晚潛入牠老大的藏身處。說所有哥布林都會出去護送一批貨。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A shipment of..."
msgstr "一批什麼貨……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...humans. That's what the Ringleader wants from all of the Golbin tribes he subjugates!"
msgstr "……人類。那就是首領從所有被他征服的哥布林部族那裡想要的東西！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I told you that when you saved me from that group days ago!"
msgstr "幾天前你們把我從那群傢伙手中救出來時，我就告訴過你們了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you mean, saved you?"
msgstr "你說我們救了你，是什麼意思？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm... little. Never been useful for much, the other Golbins said. Too 'so-fist-uh-cated', they'd say."
msgstr "我……很小隻。其他哥布林說我從來就沒什麼用。太「憂-雅」了，他們會這麼說。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They were going to tie me up and try to put me in one of the shipments, too, since I wanted to 'act like a human'. "
msgstr "因為我想「表現得像個人類」，他們本來也要把我綁起來，想辦法把我塞進其中一批貨裡。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And why the blazes would they do that?"
msgstr "他們到底為什麼要那樣做？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Because if a tribe doesn't pay up with enough people, the Ringleader takes his tithe in other ways. Turns us into ents. "
msgstr "因為如果一個部族交不出足夠的人，首領就會用其他方式收取貢品。把我們變成樹人。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Something about needing a creature's lifeforce. But I wasn't even ever part of that tribe, I got outcast from my own years ago."
msgstr "好像是需要生物的生命力什麼的。但我根本從來不屬於那個部族，我好幾年前就被自己的部族放逐了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And then they captured you again sometime after the Ringleader took over?"
msgstr "然後在首領接管之後，他們又抓到你了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why were you in the group that attacked us, then?"
msgstr "那你為什麼會在襲擊我們的那群傢伙裡？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "One of the Golbin's fancied himself a knight and wanted to use me as a squire. Carry his weapons n' stuff."
msgstr "有隻哥布林自以為是騎士，想讓我當他的侍從。幫他扛武器之類的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We don't even have knights. But everyone thought it was funny, so they let him until it was going to be time to lump me in with a shipment."
msgstr "我們根本沒有騎士。但大家都覺得很好笑，所以就由著他，直到要把我塞進一批貨裡的時候。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So... You've never even hurt a person?"
msgstr "所以……你從來沒傷害過人？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No! I even traded with some of your people up north. I would make stuff, then sell it for books. I learned lots."
msgstr "沒有！我甚至跟你們北邊的人做過交易。我會做些東西，然後拿去換書。我學了很多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Jass... A moment?"
msgstr "傑絲……借一步說話？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You believe this little green booger, don't you?"
msgstr "你相信這隻綠色小鼻屎，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You manage to pull Jass aside long enough to get her to calm down. She apologies, first to you, then even to Gloob, and says that when she learned that they were capturing people to 'send them somewhere' it sent her over the edge. She asks Gloob to fill you in on what he told her. Every full moon, a bunch of robed figures end up coming to the Ringleader's fortress within the Elder Grove. They come with large, wooden wagons, and leave with people that the surrounding Golbin tribes have captured.\n\nHe goes on to say that the Golbins at the fortress leave with the robed figures, escorting them... wherever they go, he doesn't know. With the nearing full-moon, it'd be a great chance to get a peek into the fortress, and that he'd even go, but that he'd need some climbing gear and hooks to scale the fort's outer wall. Either hopefully or foolishly, you decide to trust him, and he details how he'd go about making the equipment. You and Jass decide it'd be good to bring [Companion Name] along as well, and that they'd go over Gloob's memory of the fort to plan the scouting mission while you make the gear."
msgstr "你設法把傑絲拉到一旁，讓她冷靜下來。她先向你道歉，接著甚至向格魯布道歉，說當她得知他們抓人是要「送去某個地方」時，她就失控了。她請格魯布把告訴她的事情跟你說一遍。每逢滿月，就會有一群穿長袍的人來到位於長老樹林中的首領堡壘。他們帶著大型木製篷車前來，離開時帶走周圍哥布林部族抓來的人。\n\n牠接著說，堡壘裡的哥布林會跟著那些長袍人一起離開，護送他們……至於去哪裡，牠也不知道。滿月將近，這會是窺探堡壘的大好機會，牠甚至願意一起去，但牠需要一些攀爬裝備和鉤子才能翻越堡壘的外牆。不知是懷抱希望還是愚蠢，你決定相信牠，牠也詳細說明了要如何製作這些裝備。你和傑絲決定最好讓 [Companion Name] 也一起去，在你製作裝備的同時，由對方根據格魯布對堡壘的記憶來規劃偵察任務。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You, Gloob, and [Companion Name] set off into the Misty Thicket on the night of the full moon. Gloob brings you through the woods quickly, and it's tough to keep up with his speed. You and [Companion Name] find yourselves huffing and puffing just outside of the Ringleader's Fortress. In the moonlight, you all see a train of wagons and hobgolbins heading to the north along an old dirt road, but quickly lose track of it as they slip into the dense thicket.\n\nWith them gone, the three of you use the gear you prepared and scale the walls, landing quietly on the other side. Gloob brings you to several spots throughout the relatively open grounds. A small, ramshackle prison, with several ents patrolling just outside. You pass by a handful of sleeping areas for the fort's living guards, until you reach a large wooden hut Gloob says is the Ringleader's home. Finally, he leads you to a stockpile of various bits that a Golbin would find valuable, taken as tribute or looted from nearby towns. Hides, half-rotten food, weapons and armor, gold, and most notably, dozens upon dozens of caskets of flammable oil and booze.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] wait for Gloob to lead you into an ambush, but the trap never comes. True to his word, once he finishes with the important parts of the fortress, the three of you scale back over the wall and head back to Azamire. When you return, you immediately begin talks with Jass about launching an assault on the fortress with what you've learned, and set plans into motion to get the town ready. Clearing a path to bring wagons to the fort, and securing an exit route for prisoners will be essential before launching an attack. Plus, it gives Jass more time to get her people ready, too."
msgstr "滿月之夜，你、格魯布和 [Companion Name] 出發進入迷霧灌木林。格魯布帶著你們快速穿越樹林，他的速度讓人很難跟上。你和 [Companion Name] 在首領堡壘外氣喘吁吁。在月光下，你們看到一列篷車和大哥布林沿著一條老舊的泥土路往北前進，但它們一鑽進茂密的灌木林，你們很快就失去了蹤影。\n\n他們離開後，你們三個用準備好的裝備翻過牆，悄悄落在另一側。格魯布帶你們走過相對空曠的場地上的幾個地點。一座簡陋的小監獄，外面有幾個樹人在巡邏。你們經過幾處堡壘活人守衛的睡覺區，最後來到一間格魯布說是首領住所的大木屋。最後，牠帶你們來到一處堆放著各種哥布林眼中有價值之物的地方，都是作為貢品收取或從附近城鎮掠奪來的。獸皮、半腐爛的食物、武器和盔甲、金子，最引人注目的是，數十桶易燃的油和酒。\n\n你和 [Companion Name] 等著格魯布把你們帶進埋伏，但陷阱始終沒有出現。正如牠所說，在介紹完堡壘的重要部分後，你們三個翻回牆外，返回阿扎米爾。一回來，你們就立刻與傑絲商討，根據所得情報對堡壘發動攻擊，並著手讓小鎮做好準備。在發動攻擊前，開闢一條讓篷車通往堡壘的道路，並確保囚犯有撤離路線，將是至關重要的。此外，這也讓傑絲有更多時間讓她的人做好準備。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rocky Rumble"
msgstr "岩石轟隆"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The old Northern Road will take Azamire's wagons close to the Ringleader's Fortress, but due to a rockslide, it's unusable. With a bit of effort, it should be usable once again!"
msgstr "舊北方大道能讓阿扎米爾的篷車接近首領的堡壘，但由於落石坍方，道路已無法通行。只要花點功夫，應該就能讓它恢復通行！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Chisel first, then make them into volatile bombs. Easy."
msgstr "先鑿，再做成易爆的炸彈。簡單。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't drop them don't drop them don't drop them."
msgstr "別掉了別掉了別掉了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gloob - who is now allowed to freely roam the town after your scouting mission proved his loyalty - fetches you and brings you to Jass's newly constructed 'barracks'. In reality, it was just an enclosed room with some storage for gear and a few targets set up, but it was coming along nicely. Within her office, a map of the surrounding lands was laid out, recently purchased from one of the infrequent caravans that just started to come by once again."
msgstr "格魯布——在偵察任務證明了牠的忠誠後，現在獲准在鎮上自由走動——來找你，帶你到傑絲新蓋好的「兵營」。實際上，那只是一個封閉的房間，有些存放裝備的空間和幾個靶子，但進展得很不錯。在她的辦公室裡，攤開著一張周邊地區的地圖，是最近從一支剛開始恢復往來、偶爾經過的商隊那裡買來的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah, [Player Name], you're here. We're planning our path to the fortress, but our scouts ran into a bit of a snag."
msgstr "啊，[Player Name]，你來了。我們正在規劃前往堡壘的路線，但我們的斥候遇到了一點麻煩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh? Is everyone alright?"
msgstr "噢？大家都還好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No one is hurt. But a bit of the Old Northern Road that passes through the Foggy Canyon has been buried under a rock slide. "
msgstr "沒人受傷。但穿過霧谷的舊北方大道有一段被落石埋住了。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Then it seems we should just find another path, no?"
msgstr "那看來我們只要另找一條路就好了，不是嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That'd be great, but this is the only feasible way to bring wagons up to the fortress. We'll need them to carry gear, and... wounded, after the battle."
msgstr "那當然最好，但這是唯一能讓篷車通往堡壘的可行路線。我們需要篷車來運送裝備，還有……戰鬥後的傷患。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't fret though! I know how to clear it! I just need a bit of help from you."
msgstr "不過別擔心！我知道怎麼清除它！只需要你幫點小忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just... you and me, clearing a rockslide? How well can you swing a pick?"
msgstr "就……你和我，去清除落石？你的鎬子揮得怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No no, I have something far better."
msgstr "不不，我有更好的東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gloob gives you the rundown on an idea he's tried before. With a bit of effort, careful chiselling, and sulfur, fire runes could be made into shaped bombs could carefully carve a path through the rockslide. Not only that, he's actually already prepped some runes they traded for, but needs help with the chiselling and then... putting a bit more volatile fire energy into them."
msgstr "格魯布向你簡述了一個他以前試過的點子。只要花點功夫、仔細鑿刻，再加上硫磺，就能把火焰符文做成定向炸彈，小心地在落石堆中炸出一條路。不只如此，他其實已經準備好一些換來的符文，但需要人幫忙鑿刻，然後……再往裡面注入更多不穩定的火焰能量。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't suppose they're interested in talking this one out."
msgstr "我想他們應該沒興趣好好談一談。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That seems like all of them, for now."
msgstr "目前看來應該全解決了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You carefully bring the volatile runes down to the Foggy Canyon along with Gloob and set to work tucking them into the rock. Gloob lights them as you move away, and sure enough, they work exceedingly well. Gloob stands triumphantly as bits of rock pelt the two of you after the series of explosions."
msgstr "你小心翼翼地帶著不穩定的符文，和格魯布一起來到霧谷，開始把它們塞進岩石中。你離開後格魯布點燃了它們，果然，效果好得驚人。一連串爆炸之後，碎石紛紛砸在你們兩個身上，格魯布得意洋洋地站著。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And that is why reading is cool! "
msgstr "這就是為什麼閱讀很酷！ "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, what does this have to do with reading?"
msgstr "等等，這跟閱讀有什麼關係？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I got the idea for these bombs after reading about a wizard that was banished from her family for blowing up half her estate. Tough luck, right?"
msgstr "我是讀到一個巫師因為炸掉半座莊園而被家族放逐的故事，才想到做這些炸彈的。運氣真差，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wow, do you think it was on purpose?"
msgstr "哇，你覺得她是故意的嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No clue! But it got me thinking about what happens when magic goes wrong, you know?"
msgstr "不知道！但這讓我開始思考，魔法出錯時會發生什麼事，你懂吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I should... be a little more careful with fire spells in the future."
msgstr "我以後……使用火焰法術時應該小心一點。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's always good to practice caution! Shall we get back to bombing the crap out of this canyon now?"
msgstr "小心謹慎總是好事！那我們現在可以回去把這座峽谷炸個稀巴爛了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course! It actually seems that some of the rocks are already moving out of the way in fear, should be a bit less to handle."
msgstr "當然！看起來有些石頭已經嚇得自己讓開了，應該可以少處理一些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait."
msgstr "等等。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why are the rocks moving?"
msgstr "石頭為什麼會動？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As the question leaves your lips, several golems rise from the piles of rock, doubtlessly less than pleased with your explosive intrusion on their turf. They seem quite keen on smashing you into the ground so they can return to their nap."
msgstr "話才剛說出口，好幾個石像從碎石堆中站了起來，顯然對你們在牠們地盤上的爆炸入侵非常不滿。牠們似乎很想把你砸進地裡，好回去繼續睡午覺。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe I should ask someone in the mines..? Nah, what's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr "也許我該去礦坑問問人……？算了，最糟又能怎樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think that should hold!"
msgstr "我想這應該撐得住！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The golems now lay crushed at your feet. Gloob held his own well, using his speed to distract them and a few carefully placed bombs to take out a few of his own. As the two of you catch your breath, one of the walls of the canyon cracks and Gloob jumps back and wraps himself around your leg in fear. A massive sheet of stone falls to the ground in front of you. After the dust settles, Gloob removes himself from your leg and clears his throat while dusting himself off."
msgstr "石像們如今已被擊碎，倒在你腳邊。格魯布表現得很好，利用速度分散牠們的注意力，還用幾顆精準放置的炸彈解決了幾隻。就在你們倆喘口氣時，峽谷的一面岩壁裂開了，格魯布嚇得往後一跳，緊緊抱住你的腿。一大片岩石在你們面前轟然落地。塵埃落定後，格魯布從你腿上下來，一邊拍掉身上的灰，一邊清了清喉嚨。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, uh... That's certainly not great."
msgstr "呃，嗯……這可真不妙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Shouldn't be hard to break up and move, but if the canyon walls keep collapsing, we'll hardly have a road left here at all."
msgstr "要把它敲碎搬走應該不難，但如果峽谷岩壁一直崩塌，這裡就根本不會剩下什麼路了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Or... Even worse, it could come down while people are travelling through. "
msgstr "或者……更糟的是，可能在有人經過時塌下來。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Then we've got to support the walls, yeah? I... haven't read much on building stuff like that, yet."
msgstr "那我們就得加固岩壁，對吧？我……還沒讀過多少關於蓋那種東西的書。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] and I have actually helped out in Azamire's mines a few times through the years."
msgstr "其實這些年來，我和 [Companion Name] 在阿扎米爾的礦坑幫過幾次忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll need some rock bolts, which we can make out of steel, then we drive them into the walls."
msgstr "我們需要一些岩栓，可以用鋼來做，然後把它們打進岩壁裡。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You walk Gloob through finding good spots for the bolts, and leave him to mark spots in the canyon that'll work well. Then you start to work out how to create strong enough rock bolts to keep the canyon walls from collapsing in on themselves."
msgstr "你教格魯布如何找到適合打岩栓的位置，讓他去峽谷裡標記合適的地點。接著你開始研究如何製作足夠堅固的岩栓，防止峽谷岩壁崩塌。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The sides of the Foggy Canyon hold once you and Gloob finish up hammering the bolts into its walls. Even as you finish up blowing up the last of the rock that remains along the old Northern Road, your handiwork holds, and after you've finished your work, you no longer fear having a sheet of stone land on your head. You look down to the little Golbin by your hand who beams with pride at a job well done, ecstatic to have been able to put his mind to something and see something tangible come out. The two of you head back to Azamire to report a job well done, and that the Northern Road is clear to use once again."
msgstr "你和格魯布把岩栓錘進岩壁後，霧谷兩側便穩固了。就連你把舊北方大道上殘留的最後一點岩石炸掉時，你的成果依然屹立不搖，完工之後，你再也不用擔心會有一大片岩石掉到頭上。你低頭看著手邊的小哥布林，他為出色完成的工作感到自豪，能夠專心投入一件事並看到實際成果，讓他興奮不已。你們倆返回阿扎米爾，回報任務圓滿完成，北方大道再度可以通行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dungeon Breakout"
msgstr "地城突圍"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A path must be cleared for the prisoners to get out of the Misty Thicket fortress when you launch the attack against the Ringleader, lest they get caught in the crossfire between you and the fortresses' guard."
msgstr "在你對首領發動攻擊時，必須為囚犯開闢一條逃出迷霧灌木林堡壘的路，以免他們被捲入你們與堡壘守衛之間的交火。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gold coins aren't good enough, eh?"
msgstr "金幣還不夠好，是吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully Gloob's contacts pull through."
msgstr "希望格魯布的門路靠得住。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The moon was completely hidden by clouds on the night you found yourself outside of the Ringleader's fortress, yet again. The scouting trips had gotten more frequent, though you only had time to go on a few of them lately. But Jass hadn't brought you out for a scouting mission, this time. The two of you wait for a patrol to pass and she brings you to the covered end of a tunnel. You two climb in and follow it for a while, until hitting what must be the wooden wall of the fortress. Gloob is crouched down here, inspecting the wall, not needing any light to see it clearly."
msgstr "在你再次來到首領堡壘外的那晚，月亮完全被雲層遮住。偵察行動越來越頻繁，不過你最近只有空參加其中幾次。但這次傑絲帶你出來並不是為了偵察。你們等一支巡邏隊經過後，她帶你來到一條隧道被遮蓋起來的入口。你們爬進去走了一段時間，直到碰到應該是堡壘的木牆。格魯布正蹲在這裡檢查牆壁，不需要任何光線就能看得一清二楚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not sure how far down the wall goes, but we can't just dig down further."
msgstr "不確定這面牆往下延伸多深，但我們不能就這樣繼續往下挖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If it goes all the way down to stone, I wouldn't even know how start trying to get through the stone. I'm no rockhound."
msgstr "如果它一路延伸到岩層，我根本不知道該怎麼穿過岩石。我又不是採礦的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And forget about keeping it quiet. I know your people have been at this for a while, right? I'm sure moving all this soil is tough."
msgstr "更別提要保持安靜了。我知道你們的人已經做這件事一陣子了，對吧？搬這麼多土一定很辛苦。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You'd bet. We've got to carry it all out and then sprinkle it through the woods. If a patrol came across a random pile of dirt, that'd be... suspicious."
msgstr "那還用說。我們得把土全部搬出去，然後撒在樹林裡。要是巡邏隊碰到一堆莫名其妙的土，那就……太可疑了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Makes sense. So, you need to get through this wall. Any ideas?"
msgstr "有道理。所以，你們需要穿過這面牆。有什麼想法嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, Gloob says he can get a tool to get through it... Right Gloob?"
msgstr "嗯，格魯布說他能弄到一個穿牆的工具……對吧，格魯布？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah, I'm... know to locate some stuff, from time to time."
msgstr "對，我……偶爾能找到一些東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I made a lot of contacts when I was traveling about. We'd have to trade for it."
msgstr "我四處旅行時結識了很多門路。我們得拿東西去換。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What would you... contacts, want?"
msgstr "你的……門路，會想要什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, they typically deal in silver bars. I think it'd usually be about seven or eight bars, but this tool is special item."
msgstr "嗯，他們通常收銀錠。一般大概七、八錠，但這個工具是特別的物品。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's say ten bars even."
msgstr "就算整數十錠吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ten it is."
msgstr "就十錠。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You ask what the tool even is, and Gloob starts to describe a magical length of metal fashioned after a knife that, when activated, starts to vibrate rapidly. It should be enough to quietly carve away at the wall, albeit slowly. You leave Gloob to his inspection of the wall, and head off to get some silver."
msgstr "你問那到底是什麼工具，格魯布開始描述一把仿造刀子形狀的魔法金屬條，啟動後會快速振動。雖然慢，但應該足以安靜地切開牆壁。你讓格魯布繼續檢查牆壁，自己出發去弄些銀錠。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just press it into the wall and cut, no problem."
msgstr "只要壓進牆裡切開就好，沒問題。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't think anyone heard me."
msgstr "我想應該沒人聽到。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You hand off the bars to Gloob back in Azamire, and not long after, he shows up on your doorstep, carrying a sheet wrapped around the vibrating knife he described. He happily hands it over."
msgstr "你回到阿扎米爾把銀錠交給格魯布，沒過多久，他就出現在你家門口，帶著一塊布包著他描述的那把振動刀。他開心地把刀交給你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thankfully, it shouldn't take you too long to get through with this."
msgstr "還好有了這個，你應該不用花太久就能切穿。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just kinda... press it into the wood and it'll activate. I've marked the hole you need to cut in red paint, okay?"
msgstr "只要……把它壓進木頭裡，它就會啟動。我已經用紅漆標出你需要切的洞了，好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you, Gloob. This is really helpful. I know it might feel a bit odd helping us humans out, but I just wanted to let you know that we appreciate your help."
msgstr "謝謝你，格魯布。這真的很有幫助。我知道幫我們人類可能讓你覺得有點奇怪，但我只是想讓你知道，我們很感謝你的幫忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope that folks aren't giving you too much trouble around town, are they?"
msgstr "希望鎮上的人沒給你添太多麻煩吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not at all, actually. Maybe a couple weird looks here and there, sure, but they've been more than welcoming."
msgstr "其實一點也沒有。當然，偶爾會有幾個怪異的眼神，但他們都非常歡迎我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Even your mayor! Sounds like he's going to try and get me set up with a workshop of sorts!"
msgstr "連你們的鎮長也是！聽起來他要幫我弄一間類似工坊的地方！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh and I'm really starting to grow on Jass, and [Companion Name] is having me do a few things around, and also..."
msgstr "噢，還有傑絲真的開始喜歡我了，[Companion Name] 也讓我幫忙做一些事，還有……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gloob starts to run through... more of his social life than you bargained for, and around the twenty minute mark you cough and mention that you really ought to get going to the fortress. Completely oblivious, he wishes you luck, and you set off. Back down at the end of the tunnel, sure enough, Gloob has marked a large cutout for you to follow."
msgstr "格魯布開始滔滔不絕地講起……超出你預期的社交生活，大約二十分鐘後，你咳了一聲，說你真的該出發去堡壘了。他完全沒察覺，祝你好運，你便出發了。回到隧道盡頭，果然，格魯布已經標出了一大塊要切割的區域。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're able to cut through the wall after a fair bit of effort, and finally, the chunk of wood settles. You set the tool down beside you and decide to leave it there, in case anyone needs to improve upon your work. Once you're done, you carefully leave the tunnel and cover the entrance once again, before reporting back to Jass. She sends for a few people to go continue with the rest of the tunnel and assures you that it'll be ready for when you need to get the prisoners out."
msgstr "費了好一番功夫，你終於切穿了牆，那塊木頭也落了下來。你把工具放在身旁，決定留在那裡，以防有人需要改進你的成果。完成後，你小心地離開隧道，再次遮蓋好入口，然後向傑絲回報。她派了幾個人去完成剩下的隧道，並向你保證，等你需要救出囚犯時一定會準備好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tree Trimming"
msgstr "修剪樹木"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] has been strangely absent lately, and on the rare chance you do see them, they usually quickly excuse themselves. What's going on?"
msgstr "[Companion Name] 最近奇怪地不見人影，難得見到對方時，對方通常也很快就找藉口離開。到底怎麼了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good food always makes you feel better."
msgstr "美食總是能讓人心情變好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe I should have gone for something more nutritious..."
msgstr "也許我該選更營養一點的東西……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Late in the evening, you head to the recently built home for [Companion Name]. It's nothing fancy - like most of the new constructions in Azamire - but all of the folks who've been contributing the most were given priority in separate lodgings, and they've done wonders for bringing back a bit of normalcy.\n\nWhat hasn't been normal is how little you've seen [Companion Name] lately. You've had plenty of times where you weren't attached at the hip over the years you've known one another, but you know they've been around. It almost feels as if they've been avoiding you.\n\nYou knock several times to no avail. Just as you turn to go, you see a limping figure approach, notice you, and then turn away."
msgstr "深夜，你前往 [Companion Name] 新蓋好的家。那房子並不豪華——就像阿扎米爾大多數的新建築一樣——但所有貢獻最多的人都被優先分配到獨立住所，這為找回一點日常生活帶來了奇蹟般的效果。\n\n不尋常的是，你最近很少見到 [Companion Name]。在你們相識的這些年裡，你們也有很多時候不是形影不離，但你知道對方一直都在附近。這次幾乎讓人覺得對方在躲著你。\n\n你敲了好幾次門，都沒有回應。就在你轉身要走時，你看到一個一瘸一拐的身影走近，發現了你，然後轉身離開。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...[Companion Name]?"
msgstr "……[Companion Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ohhhh..! Hello there, ol' buddy ol' pal. I'm just... gonna, go... this way..."
msgstr "噢噢噢……！嗨，我的好兄弟好夥伴。我只是……要，往……這邊走……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Forgot that I needed to chat with... Hapren! That's right, needed to chat with Hapren."
msgstr "忘了我得去找……哈普倫 聊聊！對，我得去找哈普倫聊聊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name], I'm not really sure what's going on, but if I did something, please... Let me know, okay?"
msgstr "[Companion Name]，我不太確定發生了什麼事，但如果我做了什麼，拜託……告訴我，好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I didn't forget your birthday or anything, did I? I'm sorry, okay..?"
msgstr "我沒忘記你的生日之類的吧？對不起，好嗎……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Player Name]..."
msgstr "[Player Name]……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, I've just been..."
msgstr "不，我只是一直在……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I..."
msgstr "我……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] turns towards you and wobbles on their feet. Even in the low light, you notice the dark red patch blood on the front of their cloak, and trailing down their arms. You rush towards them and manage to catch your best friend before they hit the ground. You quickly run through a list of places you could bring them before settling on their own place. You quickly fish their key out of their pocket and carry them inside. You'd complain about them being heavy if it weren't for the fact your heart was beating out of your chest, knowing how hurt they are and having no idea on why or how.\n\nDigging through both their supplies and yours, you find enough to get them patched up. Across their chest is a large gash with bits of... wood, sticking out of it? You extract it all, bit by bit, in the lantern light, and stitch them back up before wrapping them in gauze. The rest of their wounds are comparatively minor, and take much less time to deal with, but they are numerous, and in various states of healing, some old, some fresh.\n\nOnce you're done, [Companion Name] looks more mummy than person, but they'll live. You cover them up to let them rest, and decide to help along their recovery with their favorite food."
msgstr "[Companion Name] 轉向你，腳步搖搖晃晃。即使光線昏暗，你也注意到對方斗篷前方有一大片暗紅色的血跡，還沿著手臂往下流。你衝過去，在你最好的朋友倒地之前接住了對方。你迅速想過可以帶對方去哪些地方，最後決定就去對方家裡。你很快從對方口袋裡摸出鑰匙，把人扛了進去。要不是你的心臟跳得快要蹦出胸口——知道對方傷得多重，卻完全不知道原因和經過——你大概會抱怨對方很重。\n\n翻遍了對方和你自己的物資，你找到足夠的東西幫對方包紮。對方胸前有一道很大的傷口，上面插著一些……木頭碎片？你在提燈的光線下一點一點地把它們全部取出，縫合傷口後再用紗布包起來。其餘的傷相比之下都算輕微，處理起來快得多，但數量眾多，癒合程度也各不相同，有些是舊傷，有些是新傷。\n\n處理完後，[Companion Name] 看起來更像木乃伊而不是人，但性命無虞。你幫對方蓋好被子讓對方休息，並決定做對方最愛吃的食物來幫助康復。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Time for a little bit of payback."
msgstr "該小小報復一下了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're still... moving a bit."
msgstr "它們還在……稍微動著。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] manages to quietly eat the cake you give them, and you decide to wait a while before beginning your round of questioning. Once they finish the first half, your questioning begins, and they fake passing out. You roll your eyes, and threaten to take the rest of the cake away and they spring back up, but quickly nurse their wounds after the sudden movement. You ask what happened, how they feel, and what they why they've been avoiding you, but [Companion Name] remains silent for all of it. When you finally ask why they didn't bring you, tears well up in their eyes."
msgstr "[Companion Name] 安靜地吃著你給的蛋糕，你決定等一會兒再開始盤問。等對方吃完一半，你開始提問，對方卻假裝昏倒。你翻了個白眼，威脅要把剩下的蛋糕拿走，對方立刻彈坐起來，但因為突然的動作而馬上護住傷口。你問發生了什麼事、感覺怎麼樣、為什麼一直躲著你，但 [Companion Name] 對每個問題都保持沉默。當你最後問對方為什麼不帶你一起去時，對方的眼眶湧出了淚水。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... I couldn't put you in danger, [Player Name]."
msgstr "我……我不能讓你陷入危險，[Player Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you mean, you couldn't put me in danger?"
msgstr "你說不能讓我陷入危險，是什麼意思？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If you were doing something dangerous, then I especially should have been there!"
msgstr "如果你在做危險的事，那我更應該在場才對！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What were you thinking?"
msgstr "你到底在想什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That I didn't want to lose you too!"
msgstr "我在想我不想連你也失去！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That I had to keep Azamire safe and if I brought you with me, you might not come back!"
msgstr "我在想我必須保護阿扎米爾的安全，如果帶你一起去，你可能就回不來了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We've already lost twenty more people on the route to the Ringleader's fortress in the past couple weeks."
msgstr "過去這幾週，我們在通往首領堡壘的路上又失去了二十個人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "All but two of them were to a single weird ent. Way bigger than the rest, and covered in these weird... talismans."
msgstr "除了兩個人以外，全都是被同一個怪異的樹人殺死的。牠比其他樹人大得多，身上掛滿了奇怪的……護符。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's what did this to you?"
msgstr "你身上的傷就是那東西造成的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I didn't want to bring you in case... It had something we couldn't handle."
msgstr "我不想帶你去，以防……牠有我們應付不了的能力。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We lost so much in the attack, but at least... I still had you. I couldn't lose you, too."
msgstr "我們在那次襲擊中失去了太多，但至少……我還有你。我不能連你也失去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So you tried to fight it on your own? [Companion Name] why-"
msgstr "所以你就想自己一個人跟牠打？[Companion Name]，為什麼——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just wanted to see it! I've been practicing on the smaller ones all this time."
msgstr "我只是想去看看牠！這段時間我一直在拿小隻的練習。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tonight, I figured that I could get a look at the big one, learn what it could do, come back to town, and come up with a plan against it."
msgstr "今晚，我想說可以去看看那隻大的，了解牠能做什麼，然後回鎮上想個對付牠的計畫。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So... what happened?"
msgstr "所以……發生了什麼事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They detail the events of the night. How they came across the creature, and the talismans in its branches flashed with a bright blue light as they tried to run away. How they floated up into the air and were sucked towards the ent while they flailed about in the air, and then how the ent sent them flying after the talismans in its branches flashed bright blue. [Companion Name] was sure they were going to die, until they saw that the talismans in the ent's branches matched the similar charms forming a line in the nearby treeline. The giant ent shuffled back and forth at that line, but wouldn't cross it. Then, they limped all the way back to Azamire.\n\nAfter a through amount of ridicule and chastisement, you hug them and tell them you're glad they're okay.\n\nIn the morning you detail everything that happened to Jass, who gathers up the archers of her militia and send them out with you and a wounded [Companion Name], who leads you to the grove with the giant ent. It seems that it has been joined by several of the smaller ones, but you aren't dissuaded. "
msgstr "對方詳細描述了那晚發生的事。對方如何遇上那隻怪物，當對方試圖逃跑時，牠枝幹上的護符閃起刺眼的藍光。對方如何飄到半空中，在空中掙扎時被吸向樹人，接著在牠枝幹上的護符再次閃起藍光後，被樹人一擊打飛。[Companion Name] 本以為自己必死無疑，直到看見樹人枝幹上的護符，與附近林線上排成一列的類似符咒相符。巨大的樹人在那條線前來回挪動，卻不肯越過。之後，對方一路一瘸一拐地走回了阿扎米爾。\n\n在一番徹底的嘲笑和責備之後，你抱住對方，告訴對方你很高興對方平安無事。\n\n早上，你把發生的一切詳細告訴傑絲，她召集了民兵中的弓箭手，派他們和你以及負傷的 [Companion Name] 一起出發，由 [Companion Name] 帶你們前往巨大樹人所在的樹林。看來牠身邊多了幾隻較小的樹人，但你並沒有因此退縮。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's make them a bit smaller, turned into ash."
msgstr "讓牠們變小一點，燒成灰燼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Think that's everything!"
msgstr "我想就這些了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The ents are all down, and the archers do their best to shoot the talismans out of the trees incase they do... anything bad. [Companion Name] holds their bow at their side, pleased to have gotten a little payback, then kicks at an ent's branch that seems to be trying to crawl away."
msgstr "樹人全都倒下了，弓箭手們盡力把護符從樹上射下來，以防它們做出……什麼壞事。[Companion Name] 把弓垂在身側，很高興能小小報復了一下，接著踢了一腳一根似乎想爬走的樹人枝幹。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Thank you... I'm sorry I tried to play the hero."
msgstr "謝謝你……對不起，我想逞英雄。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If you didn't... I probably would have. I don't want to lose you either."
msgstr "如果你沒那麼做……我大概也會。我也不想失去你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please, don't do something like that again, okay? I need you too."
msgstr "拜託，別再做那種事了，好嗎？我也需要你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Okay okay... You too, alright? Promise?"
msgstr "好啦好啦……你也是，好嗎？說好了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Promise."
msgstr "說好了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Me too."
msgstr "我也是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seems the trees aren't quite 'dead' yet, huh?"
msgstr "看來這些樹還沒完全「死透」，是吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Doubt they'll survive being turned into ash, don't you think?"
msgstr "我想牠們被燒成灰之後就活不了了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everyone gathers up the ent parts. They don't seem dangerous anymore, but you do notice that - slowly but surely - they're starting to gain new growth. If you waited long enough, they'd likely become a threat again. The archers help by snapping off new branches and tossing them back into the pile, and occasionally making sure that none have managed to crawl away."
msgstr "大家把樹人的殘骸收集起來。它們看起來不再危險，但你確實注意到——緩慢而確實地——它們開始長出新的枝芽。如果等得夠久，它們很可能會再次成為威脅。弓箭手們幫忙折斷新長出的樹枝，把它們丟回堆裡，偶爾也確認沒有任何一塊爬走。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The last bit of smoke goes out as the final pile of burning ent runs out of fuel. You were almost tempted to start trying to grill something, but the idea of the smoke being evil and getting into the food dissuaded any attempts. [Companion Name] leans against you, both for comfort, and because they are far from recovered from their wounds. You tease them lightly about getting smacked around by kindling, to which they reply by driving the butt of their bow into your foot. You tussel their hair and give them a hug, and tell them that you're glad they're safe."
msgstr "最後一堆燃燒的樹人燒盡時，最後一縷煙也散去了。你差點想試著烤點東西，但一想到那煙可能是邪惡的、會跑進食物裡，就打消了念頭。[Companion Name] 靠在你身上，一方面是為了安慰，一方面是因為傷勢還遠遠沒有痊癒。你輕輕調侃對方被柴火打得落花流水，對方則用弓柄戳了你的腳作為回應。你揉亂對方的頭髮，給了對方一個擁抱，告訴對方你很高興對方平安。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "In the Thick of It"
msgstr "深入其中"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Azamire is as ready as it ever will be to take down the Ringleader. The old Northern Road is clear, Jass's crew has finished the tunnel to the prison, and you have defeated the worst of the Misty Thicket's roaming guards. Now, all that's left to do is burn the fortress to the ground."
msgstr "阿扎米爾已經做好了擊垮首領的萬全準備。舊北方大道已經暢通，傑絲的團隊完成了通往監獄的隧道，你也擊敗了迷霧灌木林中最難纏的巡邏守衛。現在，只剩下把堡壘燒成平地了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If I want any supplies, I should take them from the cart before the attack starts in earnest."
msgstr "如果我需要任何補給，應該在攻擊正式開始前從推車上拿。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's time."
msgstr "時候到了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you walk through Azamire, the town is abuzz with nervous energy. Several wagons are lined up and everyone who isn't fighting have come out to wish you well. Hapren approaches, and mentions that the town has gotten together and prepared some combat supplies into the back of one of the carts for you, and hopes that it helps.\n\nYou all set off, and as the sun begins to set, the cold mist of the thicket starts to seep into your clothes. The militia is tense, but ready. There are people to save, and taking out the Ringleader would go a long way towards making everyone safer."
msgstr "當你走過阿扎米爾時，整個小鎮瀰漫著緊張的氣氛。幾輛篷車排成一列，所有不參戰的人都出來為你們送行。哈普倫走過來，說鎮上的人一起在其中一輛推車後面為你準備了些戰鬥補給，希望能派上用場。\n\n你們出發了，太陽開始西沉時，灌木林冰冷的霧氣開始滲進你的衣服。民兵們很緊張，但已做好準備。有人等著被救，而除掉首領將大大有助於讓所有人更安全。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everyone's ready?"
msgstr "大家都準備好了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's get this done."
msgstr "我們把事情解決吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't have any qualms with this, Gloob?"
msgstr "對這件事沒有任何顧慮嗎，格魯布？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I might be green, but I'm no Golbin. Let's take him out."
msgstr "我也許是綠色的，但我可不是那種哥布林。我們去幹掉他。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You okay, [Player Name]?"
msgstr "你還好嗎，[Player Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Never better. Plan is the same, still?"
msgstr "好得很。計畫還是一樣嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's right. The tunnel under the prison is ready to get the prisoners out, and we'll have people posted at the exit."
msgstr "沒錯。監獄下方的隧道已經準備好讓囚犯逃出，我們會派人守在出口。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As soon as people start escaping down the tunnel, the guards will notice everyone's missing and sound the alarm."
msgstr "一旦有人開始從隧道逃走，守衛就會發現人不見了並拉響警報。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Once that happens, archers will try to hit that stockpile you mentioned with flaming arrows."
msgstr "一旦發生這種情況，弓箭手就會試著用火箭射中你說的那個物資堆。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Should deal with most of the ents inside, and make a ton of noise. You'll be providing the fire, of course, we need several braziers lit."
msgstr "這應該能解決裡面大部分的樹人，還能製造一大堆噪音。當然，火就由你負責，我們需要點燃好幾座火盆。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "After that, we head to the gate and hack it down. The archers will keep us covered."
msgstr "之後，我們前往大門把它砍倒。弓箭手會掩護我們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And then we're in. Try to avoid the fire, and head for the Ringleader?"
msgstr "然後我們就進去了。盡量避開火，直奔首領？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Exactly. Can't miss 'em. Big blue fella, covered in every gaudy fabric he fancies."
msgstr "沒錯。不會認錯的。藍色的大塊頭，身上披滿了他喜歡的各種俗氣布料。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Things are going to get really hectic once this starts."
msgstr "一旦開始，場面會變得非常混亂。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Stay safe, everyone."
msgstr "大家都要注意安全。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You too, [Player Name]. You too."
msgstr "你也是，[Player Name]。你也是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you finish your conversation, the fortress's outer wall comes into view. Gloob and small group of the militia break off and head for the tunnel while the rest of you set up on the hillside just outside. Several braziers are set up, and everyone starts to load them with wood while you and [Companion Name] get to work."
msgstr "當你們結束對話時，堡壘的外牆映入眼簾。格魯布和一小群民兵脫隊前往隧道，其餘的人則在外面的山坡上就位。幾座火盆已經架好，大家開始往裡面添木頭，你和 [Companion Name] 則開始動手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We have to get through this gate!"
msgstr "我們必須突破這道門！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There! A hole!"
msgstr "那裡！有個洞！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Alarms start to sound as the militia's arrows are lit. You clutch your weapon in anticipation, wishing you could to go check on the tunnel to see how Gloob's breakout went, but there's no time. The hillside is lit up with the fires you and [Companion Name] started, and hobgolbins on the wall begin to shoot towards you. But it's too late. Burning arrow after arrow soar up and over the wall, towards where you pointed out the stockpile. No one can see over the wall, so it's tough to tell if anyone is on target until a resounding BOOM make you cover your ears, even from this far away.\n\nMany of the defenders are thrown from the wall entirely, and as you and the militia charge, the swordsmen dispatch the stunned hobgolbins that fell on the wrong side of the wall. Arrows start to fall again, as the fort's guards gather themselves, and they're met with your militia's own volleys."
msgstr "民兵的箭被點燃時，警報聲開始響起。你緊握武器蓄勢待發，真希望能去隧道看看格魯布的突圍進行得如何，但沒時間了。山坡被你和 [Companion Name] 點燃的火光照亮，牆上的大哥布林開始朝你們射擊。但已經太遲了。一支又一支燃燒的箭矢越過城牆，飛向你指出的物資堆位置。沒人能看到牆後的情況，所以很難判斷是否有人命中，直到一聲響亮的「轟」讓你即使在這麼遠的地方也得摀住耳朵。\n\n許多守衛直接被震下城牆，當你和民兵衝鋒時，劍士們解決了那些摔落到牆外、被震暈的大哥布林。隨著堡壘守衛重整旗鼓，箭雨再次落下，迎接它們的是你們民兵的齊射。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "FOR AZAMIRE!"
msgstr "為了阿扎米爾！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't stop running until you hit the gate! "
msgstr "衝到大門之前都別停下來！ "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We can do this! Push on!"
msgstr "我們做得到！繼續前進！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You and [Companion Name] reach the gate first and take out your axes, followed by a small group of other militia members who follow suit and get to work. Another group comes with large shields that they hold with both hands, more table than shield. But they work well as the shield group form a defensive shell around you and overhead, giving you room to work without worrying about an arrow finding its way in your unprotected back."
msgstr "你和 [Companion Name] 第一個抵達大門，拿出斧頭，隨後一小群民兵也跟著動手。另一群人帶著需要雙手持握的大盾牌趕來，與其說是盾牌，不如說更像桌子。但效果很好，盾牌隊在你周圍和頭頂組成一道防禦外殼，讓你有空間工作，不必擔心有箭射進你毫無防護的背後。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We will not fall. Not this time."
msgstr "我們不會倒下。這次絕不會。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's... done."
msgstr "結……結束了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The occasional pained grunt, or worse, the painted gurgles of someone who was struck somewhere lethal, dampen your mood. You knew people would fall today. You can only imagine how the people on the hillside are faring. Just as your mind starts to lose focus, thinking about those you'd lose, you see a burning light at the end of your axe. As you pull it back, you realize you're through! You give a cheer that turns into a battlecry, and your group follows suit. A few more axe strikes and enough holes are opened to let Azamire's troops push through the gate.\n\nThe fort grounds are... hellish. Most of the ent guardians already crawl on the ground, crying out with groaning wails as they burn, with nearly every structure already completely engulfed in flames. You wonder for a moment if there's even a point of being inside until a massive blue Golbin covered in singed fabric cries out as he locks eyes with you. The rest of the fort's surviving defenders stand in the middle of the blazing stronghold with the Ringleader, smashing weapons against their shields, waiting for orders. "
msgstr "偶爾傳來的痛苦悶哼，或更糟的——某人被擊中要害時發出的咯咯聲，讓你的心情愈發沉重。你早知道今天會有人倒下，也只能想像山坡上的人們情況如何。正當你的思緒開始渙散，想著那些你將失去的人時，你看見斧頭盡頭透出一道燃燒的光芒。當你將斧頭抽回，你發現自己砍穿了！你發出一聲歡呼，隨即化為戰吼，你的隊伍也跟著齊聲吶喊。再砍幾斧，打開的缺口已足以讓阿扎米爾的部隊衝過大門。\n\n要塞內部宛如……地獄。大多數樹人守衛早已在地上爬行，燃燒中發出呻吟般的哀號，幾乎每座建築都已被烈焰完全吞噬。你一時懷疑進來是否還有意義，直到一隻披著燒焦布料的巨大藍色 哥布林 與你四目相對，發出怒吼。要塞其餘倖存的守軍與首領一同站在熊熊燃燒的據點中央，用武器敲擊著盾牌，等待命令。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Humans want to be hand delivered to masters?"
msgstr "人類想被親手送到主人那裡？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ringleader need new stock, others just ran out."
msgstr "首領需要新貨，其他的剛用完。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Come to me. Time for you to die."
msgstr "過來。你的死期到了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Keep the rest of them off [Player Name] and [Companion Name]! "
msgstr "別讓其他人靠近 [Player Name] 和 [Companion Name]！ "

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Know that we fight not just for those back home, not just to save yourselves..."
msgstr "要知道，我們不只是為了家鄉的人而戰，也不只是為了拯救自己……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But for everyone we've lost!"
msgstr "更是為了我們失去的每一個人！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Together! Go! Now! Kill them all!"
msgstr "一起上！衝啊！現在！殺光他們！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Player Name], I'm with you. Trust me! I'll keep you safe!"
msgstr "[Player Name]，我與你同在。相信我！我會保護你的！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not a single person falters as they stream past you, charging with weapons and heads held high. You don't turn away as you see some being driven through as the Ringleader's forces crash into your own. Time slows as you push through, trusting your people to keep you safe. As you make it through the bodies, the Ringleader stands with a gnarled smirk, holding what must be half a burning tree as its weapon, seemingly unbothered by the flames that flicker up its arm.\n\nYou hear people roar in the battle behind you, some in victory, others... likely as their last act of defiance against the opposing force. You steel yourself and step forward, challenging the Ringleader."
msgstr "當眾人從你身旁湧過，沒有一個人退縮，他們揮舞著武器、昂首向前衝鋒。當首領的部隊與你們的人馬撞在一起，你看見有人被刺穿，但你沒有別過頭去。時間彷彿變慢了，你奮力向前推進，相信你的同伴會保護你。當你穿過人群，首領帶著扭曲的獰笑站在那裡，手持一截似乎是燃燒中的半棵樹作為武器，對沿著手臂竄升的火焰似乎毫不在意。\n\n你聽見身後的戰場上傳來陣陣怒吼，有些是勝利的吶喊，有些……恐怕是對抗敵軍的最後一搏。你穩住心神，向前踏出一步，向首領發起挑戰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Before you lies the broken body of the Ringleader, sickly purple blood spilling from his wounds. You finally spare a glance to those around you, and you realize... it's over. Less than half the attacking force remains, but Azamire's people still stand.  Gloob stands among the militia, deep green body covered in the blue blood of hobgolbins, and he lets out a cheer, one that the remaining militia proudly meet. Jass barks out orders, pointing out wounded with the stump of her arm, then starting to pull one of the wounded towards the gate with her other.\n\nHalf a dozen emotions cross [Companion Name]'s face the second you look at them, but most among them all, relief. They embrace you for naught but a moment before heading towards the Ringleader, who barely manages a ragged breath. As you approach, the beast lets out a throaty cackle before it devolves into a choking cough. You ask it two questions. Where did the shipments go, and who are the people it works for?\n\nHe just sits and smirks, the flames of his burning fortress dancing in his eyes.\n\n\"They'll come back soon.\""
msgstr "首領殘破的身軀倒在你面前，病態的紫色血液從傷口湧出。你終於有空環顧四周，然後意識到……結束了。進攻的部隊剩下不到一半，但阿扎米爾的人們依然屹立。格魯布站在民兵之中，深綠色的身體沾滿了大哥布林的藍色血液，他發出一聲歡呼，倖存的民兵也驕傲地回應。傑絲大聲下達命令，用斷臂指出傷患，接著用另一隻手將一名傷者拖向大門。\n\n當你望向 [Companion Name]，對方臉上閃過好幾種情緒，但其中最多的是如釋重負。他們短暫地擁抱了你一下，隨即走向奄奄一息、幾乎喘不過氣的首領。當你們走近，那頭野獸發出一陣沙啞的狂笑，隨後變成嗆咳。你問了牠兩個問題：那些貨物運到哪裡去了？牠替誰賣命？\n\n牠只是坐著冷笑，燃燒要塞的火光在牠眼中跳動。\n\n「他們很快就會回來。」"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sand in the Wind"
msgstr "風中的沙"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "After a short stay back in Amazire, you and [Companion Name] find it hard to rest. There's still so much to be done. The Ringleader was merely the first step."
msgstr "回到阿扎米爾的這段時間裡，你和[Companion Name]很難靜下心來。還有很多事要做。首領只是開始。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They travelled a long, long way."
msgstr "他們一路上走了好遠。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Like, really long."
msgstr "真的，很遠。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The day following your attack on the Ringleader's fort is met with a mixture of joy, relief, grief, and... uncertainty. \nWhile the assault was successful, casualties number in the range of a few dozen, a large blow to the already wavering population of your home.\n\nHowever, with the number of refugees coming and going nowadays, ebbs and flows in the local populace are getting hard to keep track of. While callous, you are thankful that no one you knew well fell - through a few of the original militia recruits you and [Companion Name] were among the bodies you brought back on the wagons.\n\nYesterday's events weren't enough to keep you or [Companion Name] down for long, though. The two of you set off back to the fort at first light, searching for tracks of the caravan you saw leave the fort on your first scouting mission. The set of buildings behind their thick wall still smouldered from the night before, reminding you both of the battle."
msgstr "在你們攻擊首領堡壘的第二天，大家的心情很複雜，有喜悅，有輕鬆，有悲傷，還有……迷茫。雖然這次襲擊成功了，但還是有幾十個人受傷或死亡。小鎮的人本來就不多，這些傷亡是很大的鈍擊。\n\n但是，現在難民來來往往，當地人口數量的變化很難追蹤。戰爭很殘酷，但你慶幸的是，你認識的人都還活著。在你和[Companion Name]用馬車運回來的屍體裡，有幾個是民兵隊伍的新兵。\n\n不過，昨天發生的事並沒有讓你或[Companion Name]傷心太久。天剛剛亮，你們倆就出發返回堡壘，尋找那隻車隊。在第一次偵察時，你看到他們離開了堡壘。牆後面的建築還在燃燒，這讓你們想起了昨晚的那場戰鬥。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Time to stomp around the forest a bit, eh?"
msgstr "去森林裡轉轉吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Heading north... been a while since we've been this far from home."
msgstr "向北走……我們已經好久沒走這麼遠了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You've always wanted to see the world. "
msgstr "你一直想看看外面的世界。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Couldn't ask for better company, either. Though... wish the circumstances were a bit less..."
msgstr "有你陪我，就再好不過了。不過……要是情況沒那麼……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dour?"
msgstr "嚴重？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We first scouted the fortress out... what, two weeks back?"
msgstr "我們第一次去偵察堡壘……是兩個星期以前嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Feels like it could have been yesterday, or half a year ago."
msgstr "感覺像是昨天，又像是半年前。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's been a long two weeks."
msgstr "這兩個星期太長了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Think we'll still be able to track them?"
msgstr "你覺得我們還能找到他們嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With several wagons and a pack of hobgolbins, I don't see them as being particularly sneaky."
msgstr "他們有幾輛馬車，還有一群大哥布林。我看他們就沒想偷偷摸摸的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And I doubt this stretch of woods sees much traffic, either. Let's see what we can find."
msgstr "再說，這片林子平時恐怕也沒什麼人經過。看看我們能目擊什麼吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sure enough, the prisoner caravan cut a long, winding trail that isn't too hard to follow. Torn up grass and foliage here, a few trees moved aside there. Concerningly, the path looks... well-travelled. You're glad Azamire was able to put a stop to the Ringleader's export of people from the area, but you can't help but wonder how many towns fared a similar fate to your own. "
msgstr "果然，押送囚犯的車隊留下了一條長長的、彎彎曲曲的痕跡。要追蹤不難。這裡的草木被毀了，有幾棵樹被挪到了一邊。令人擔心的是，這條路看起來……經常有人走。你很高興，阿扎米爾成功阻止了首領把人運走。但你忍不住想，有多少城鎮跟你的小鎮一樣，面臨同樣的遭遇。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fishing & Farming (Mitigating food issues)"
msgstr "釣魚和農耕（緩解糧食問題）"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Following the caravan takes you ages. You travel north, out of the Elder Grove and just an hour's walk outside of the town of Hirane until the tracks stop. Several wagons were stopped here and burned, presumably by the hobgolbins bringing them. It seems that several captives were killed, though for what reason, you don't know. From what you're able to gather, the group split into well over thirty different parties, all heading off in different directions. Doubtlessly impossible to follow them all, even without the added difficulty of being much harder to track than the wagons.\n\nYou worry for a moment about Hirane's safety until you realize that the golbins would have to have a small army to raze a town of their size. Being situated on the Heartroad - one of the main throughputs to the capitol of Melvor - certainly had its advantages. Being able to trade for finely crafted arms and armor were chief among them, but the Golbin's presence still gave you pause.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] decide to head into town, and the general mood of the place is... tense. Folks who seem to be citizens quickly hurry past haggard, haunted-looking villagers. It's a sight you're well acquainted with, though you're surprised to see it here. You and [Companion Name] are quickly approached by a fussy-looking man with a immaculately cared for mustache and a permanent scowl etched on his face."
msgstr "追蹤那隻車隊花了你很長時間。你向北走，離開長者之林，在距離平根小鎮一小時路程的地方，痕跡沒了。這裡停了幾輛被燒的馬車，想必是押送囚犯的大哥布林做的。似乎還有幾名俘虜被殺了，但你不知道具體原因。根據你掌握的資訊，這支車隊分成了三十多支小隊，向不同的地方走了。要追蹤每一支小隊是不可能的。況且，這些人比馬車還難追蹤，那就更難了。\n\n你有點擔心平根的安全，但轉念一想，要毀掉這麼大的一個城鎮，至少要有一支小軍隊。平根在心路上，而這條路是通往梅爾沃都城的主幹道之一。所以，平根確實有優勢。一個主要優勢是能夠買到精良的武器和護甲。不過，哥布林的存在還是讓你有點擔心。\n\n你和[Companion Name]決定去鎮上。這裡的氣氛……很緊張。鎮民們行色匆匆地經過那些憔悴、驚恐的村民。你對這一幕很熟悉，只是沒想到會在這裡看到。這時，一名男子向你和[Companion Name]走來。他留著精心打理的鬍鬚，看起來緊張不安，總是愁眉苦臉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If you wish to seek refuge within the town's walls, you must go to the registrar's office and submit your documentation."
msgstr "如果你想去牆裡面避難，必須先去登記處提交統計。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You can expect a wait time of-"
msgstr "你可能需要等一段時間——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And it's a pleasure to me you too. I am [Companion Name], this is [Player Name]."
msgstr "很高興見到你。我是[Companion Name]，這是[Player Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...That's usually how a conversation starts, at least."
msgstr "……至少對話的開頭應該是這樣的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I simply do not have the time for idle-chit chat. You two are just one group of many flowing into town."
msgstr "我實在沒時間閒聊。除了你們，還有很多人來這兒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I apologize if I come off as rude, I am simply trying to be as efficient as I can be in these trying times."
msgstr "抱歉，我剛才無禮了。在這樣的艱難時段，我只想盡可能地提高效率。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And what exactly ails your town so?"
msgstr "那麼，你們的鎮子怎麼了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...The same as everywhere, this side of the sands."
msgstr "……和這片沙地另一邊的其他地方一樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Cloaked figures attacking with beasts never before seen or heard of."
msgstr "我們被襲擊了，一群黑袍人，還有一群沒看過、沒聽過的牛羚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're razing farmland, attacking trade caravans, and burning hamlets to the ground."
msgstr "他們破壞農田，襲擊商隊，還燒了村莊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You'd think we were at war, with how frequent and destructive the attacks are."
msgstr "他們不斷襲擊，到處破壞，就像打仗一樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Anywhere outside of a walled-in town seems to be fair game to them. That... is, why you're here, no?"
msgstr "在圍著圍牆的小鎮外面，到處都是他們攻擊的目標。這……就是你們來這兒的原因吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, yes, but not for refuge. We were tracking a convoy belonging to a group of them from the south, but they dispersed about an hour outside of town."
msgstr "對，但我們不是為了避難。我們在追蹤一支車隊。他們是從南邊過來的。在距離小鎮大約一小時路程的地方，他們就散開了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That'd be by... the Elder Grove, no? Nasty business with Golbins down there right now, I hear."
msgstr "那是在……長者之林附近，對吧？聽說那兒有哥布林，麻煩得很。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not anymore, thankfully."
msgstr "幸好現在已經沒事了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unsurprisingly, Curo had no idea what [Companion Name] was talking about, until the two of you walk him through Azamire's attack on the fortress and the defeat of the Ringleader. While skeptical, he sends out a scouting party to confirm your claims. Through an only slightly more pleasant conversation with the man after a light change in disposition, you learn that people have begun flocking to Hirane out of fear, or lack of options.\n\nThey've done what they can, but are quickly being stretched short with many of the nearby villages being attacked, and much of the farmland nearby being abandoned out of fear. When you and [Companion Name] press him for more details, he's dismissive, and says he may be able to help, should you prove useful and your claims of razing the Ringleader's fort prove true."
msgstr "果然，庫羅不知道[Companion Name]在說什麼。你們倆給他講阿扎米爾攻擊了堡壘，打敗了首領，這時他才明白了。他還是有些懷疑，於是派了一支偵察隊去確認你們說的話。他的態度緩和了一些，你們又愉快地聊了一下。你得知，因為害怕，或者沒有其他選擇，人們都來了平根小鎮。\n\n他們已經盡力了。但附近很多村莊遭到了襲擊，附近的很多農田沒有人敢種，平根小鎮也快撐不住了。你和[Companion Name]想多問他一些細節，但他並不在意。他說，如果你們能證明自己有用，而且你們真的摧毀了首領的堡壘，那他或許可以幫你們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wow, they're well stocked. That's helpful, at least."
msgstr "哇，他們的物資儲備很多嘛。至少這就很有用了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seems like they've got it mostly handled, now."
msgstr "看來他們現在基本能夠應付了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You and [Companion Name] drop off another package of supplies, hopeful that what you've been able to provide lightens Hirane's burdens a bit. One of the women in charge of the relief tent cheerfully accepts, a bit surprised by the weight of your goods.\n\nJust as you turn to go, Curo approaches you and [Companion Name] with an uncharacteristic smile, holding a leaflet of paper and being flanked by two people who seem to be scouts. He waves off a few people who vie for his attention."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]又放下一批物資，希望能幫平根減輕一點負擔。負責救災帳篷的一名女性開心地收下物資，對物資的重量有些驚訝。\n\n正當你和[Companion Name]準備離開時，庫羅走了過來。他笑得不太正常，手裡拿著一張傳單，身邊還跟著兩個人，看樣子像是偵察員。他揮了揮手，把幾個想引起他注意的人打發走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wasn't expecting the two of you to get to work so quickly."
msgstr "沒想到你們倆這麼快就開始幹活了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Honestly, I only wanted to put you to work since I thought you were full of it, talking about rising up against that fortress."
msgstr "說實話，我只是想給你們找點事做，因為我覺得你們在說謊，說什麼攻擊堡壘。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Believe us now?"
msgstr "現在信了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Believe you? Based on the reports I've gotten, I feel like I best start commissioning portraits of you to hang in the mayor's home."
msgstr "信你們？根據我收到的報告，我覺得我最好找人給你們畫幾幅肖像，掛在鎮長家裡。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't know how a couple of villages out in the boonies managed to mount such a force, but I say, I'm impressed."
msgstr "我不知道你們這些偏遠村莊是怎麼湊上一支隊伍的，不過說真的，我挺佩服的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That fortress being taken care of makes all of us safer."
msgstr "堡壘沒了，大家都更安全了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And I'd say... one good deed deserves another, hm?"
msgstr "依我看……好事就該有好報，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That it does. I already have my people working on providing a report, worry not. They'll bring it to you in a few hours."
msgstr "沒錯。我已經讓手下去報告了，別擔心。幾個小時內就會交到你手上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Make yourselves at home, I'll have the guards know not to give you any trouble. And uh..."
msgstr "不必拘束，我會交代守護，不會找你們的麻煩。還有……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not used to doing this... I'm sorry for how we first met."
msgstr "不太習慣這樣……我們第一次見面就那樣，我很抱歉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Curo purses his lips at that, seemingly a bit lost on what to say after that. He opts for a slight nod and then excuses himself, his caprones following quickly after.\n\nThe woman you dropped off your goods with politely, but shyly, asks if the two of you could lend just a bit more help since it sounds like you'll be stuck here anyway. You look to [Companion Name], who just shrugs. Might as well. She quickly leads you off to a nearby cooking tent, where a line of hungry refugees waits eagerly. It seems that the current staff are struggling to keep up."
msgstr "庫羅撅了一下嘴，似乎不知道該說些什麼。他點了點頭，然後就走了，幾名隨從緊緊跟著他。\n\n剛才接你們物資的那名女子禮貌又害羞地問你們，能不能再幫一下忙，因為你們似乎暫時不會走。你看著[Companion Name]，他只是聳了聳肩。那就幫吧。她立馬帶你們來到附近一個煮飯的帳篷。那裡排著隊，飢餓的難民在焦急地等待食物。看樣子，現在人手不夠了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You and [Companion Name] find yourselves breathless and exhausted after providing as many warm meals as you could. The crowd has been quelled substantially, with only a few stragglers coming up every half an hour or so. The head chef dismisses you, and thanks you dearly for your help, while making sure that you don't leave without a warm meal yourselves.\n\nThe two of you start to dig in, right as one of Curo's earlier companions wordlessly jogs up to you and holds out a sealed scroll. Once you take it from his hands, he gives a small salute and turns back the way he came.\n\nYou read over the scroll in the dim evening light to see a collection of detailed notes from months of observations. You read of the guard's clashes with armed groups, freed captives, and even a few raids on encampments of the unnamed group. Finally, you find what you're looking for.\n\nYou read an entry regarding a skirmish that took Hirane's scouts far to the east, to the edge of a town called Clearwater. The scouts continued to assail a caravan of these armed bandits until a massive sandstorm blew into the region and forced their retreat.\n\nIt wasn't much to go off of, but it's a start. The two of you finish your meals quickly and ready yourselves to head east."
msgstr "在發完熱氣騰騰的食物後，你和[Companion Name]累得氣喘吁吁。難民的情緒已經基本穩住了。每隔半小時左右，偶爾會有幾個難民來要吃的。主廚讓你們去休息，感謝你們的幫忙，叮囑你們走之前先吃一口熱乎的。\n\n你們倆正準備大吃一頓，剛才庫倫的一名隨從跑到你們面前，沒說一句話，把一個封好的卷軸遞給你。你接過卷軸。他行了一個禮，轉身就回去了。\n\n在昏暗的夜色中，你開啟卷軸，裡面詳細記錄了幾個月的觀察情況。你讀到守護和武裝隊伍的衝突、獲救的俘虜，還有對某個無名組織的幾次突襲。最後，你找到了想要的內容。\n\n你讀到一條資訊，說一次小衝突把平根的偵察員引向了遙遠的北邊，最後到了一座名叫清水鎮的小鎮附近。那些偵察員一路追擊一群武裝匪徒的車隊，後來遇到了一場巨大的沙塵暴，他們不得不撤退。\n\n雖然線索不多，但總算是個開始。你們倆迅速吃完飯，準備去東邊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Path to Melvor"
msgstr "通往梅爾沃之路"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "After pouring over the reports from Hirane's scouts, you're sure of one thing. The hooded figures that attacked Azamire and seem to be kidnapping and transporting townsfolk have headed far to the east. To what end, you couldn't even begin to wager a guess."
msgstr "在仔細閱讀了平根偵察員的報告之後，你確定了一件事。那些攻擊阿扎米爾、綁走鎮民的兜帽人，已經往遙遠的東邊走了。至於他們的目的，你沒辦法推測。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With enough of these, we should be able to make it to Clearwater!"
msgstr "有了這些資訊，我們應該可以到清水鎮了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wow... they're... really sweet."
msgstr "哇……它們……真的好甜啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You exit Hirane's gate and find yourself deep within the countryside. You travel east along the Heartroad, knowing that if you go far enough, it should be next to impossible to miss Clearwater. From what you were able to gather from folks in Hirane, Clearwater acts as the major waystation between the east and west sides of the Desert Plains. You heard of many small resting points and hamlets between here and there, but few were notable enough to commit to memory.\n\nThe Heartroad is generally well constructed and maintained - even this far from the capitol - but as grass turned to arid soil, and then eventually sand, the Heartroad becomes harder to keep track of. Despite what the locals in Hirane said about there being places to rest between there and Clearwater, most of the buildings you pass are abandoned, swallowed by the sands.\n\nThe sun beats down on you overhead in a way you're unfamiliar with except for on Azamire's hottest summer days. There's no reprieve from the heat, just sand stretching out in what seems endless waves of gold."
msgstr "你走出平根的大門，來到一望無際的鄉野。你沿著心路向東走。只要一直走，肯定能到清水鎮。你聽平根的人說，清水鎮是沙漠平原的東側和西側之間的重要中轉點。你聽說沿途有很多小的休息站和村莊，但能記住的沒幾個。\n\n心路離都城很遠，但總體上修建和維護得不錯。一路上，從草地變成乾旱的土地，最後變成沙地，心路上的痕跡越來越難追蹤。平根的當地人說，去清水鎮的路上有休息的地方，但你經過的大多數建築都已經荒廢，被黃沙吞沒了。\n\n頭頂的太陽熱得很，這種熱只有阿扎米爾夏天最熱的那段時間才有。烈日下一片空曠，只有無邊無際的黃金沙之波浪。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is... a little warmer than I expected."
msgstr "這……比我想的熱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do we have any water left?"
msgstr "我們還有水嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "About one more flask between us. Want it now?"
msgstr "大概還有一壺水。現在要喝嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Already? Wow..."
msgstr "這麼快就沒了？哇……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I didn't think so few of the waystations would be abandoned. We'd have had to carry more than both our weights in water to make it to Clearwater without stopping..."
msgstr "沒想到廢棄的中轉點這麼少。要想直接到達清水鎮，我們要帶的水比我們倆的重量還要重……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm not saying it's time to panic, but-"
msgstr "我不是說現在就該慌了，不過——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I refuse to lose to the sun, just days after we took down the Ringleader."
msgstr "我才幹掉了首領，我可不想輸給太陽。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Got an oasis in your back pocket that I don't know about?"
msgstr "你是不是還藏著什麼我不知道的「綠洲」啊？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You grab [Companion Name] and pull her to the side, off the Heartroad and crest over one of the dunes. Your eyes don't deceive you - or your mind can't conjure up particularly appealing mirages - the small green crowns you saw from the road belong to large cacti. You stick one with your knife and a miserably thin trickle of slightly sappy water pours out. It isn't white, and after a small taste, it doesn't seem acidic or leave your tongue tingling. It doesn't seem poisonous, and that's good enough. Beats frying to death, anyway."
msgstr "你抓著[Companion Name]，把她拉到一邊，離開心路，翻過一道山丘。你的眼睛沒有騙你——或者說，你的腦子無法幻化出什麼特別吸引人的海市蜃樓。你在路上看到的綠東西，其實是巨大的仙人掌。你用刀插進一株仙人掌，慢慢流出一點點汁液。那汁液不是白色。你嚐了一點，目擊不酸，舌頭也不痛。看來沒毒。這就夠了。總比曬死要好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That hurt, but I guess it's fair."
msgstr "雖然很疼，但我想，這也是公平的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You wipe the cactus water from your mouth. The two of you tapped into many of the ones nearby and start to stray from the original patch. You find yourselves giggling and swaying too and fro, despite definitely being more hydrated. You're worried that something may be wrong, but how could it be? You feel so good. [Companion Name] nearly collapses against you in a fit of giggles, the sand undulating in mesmerizing patterns underneath you."
msgstr "你擦掉嘴邊的仙人掌汁液。你們倆喝了附近的很多仙人掌，不知不覺就走遠了。水分補充好了，但你們咯咯地笑，身體搖搖晃晃。你擔心有點不對勁，可到底是什麼問題呢？你感覺還不錯。[Companion Name]笑得差點倒在你身上。腳下的沙地起起伏伏，形成迷人的圖案。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You are the best, you know that, [Player Name]?"
msgstr "你是最棒的，你知道嗎，[Player Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nooooooo, no. You are!"
msgstr "不——不。你才是！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, stop it, stop it. I mean it. I never would have been able to come out all this way if it weren't for you."
msgstr "不，別這樣說，別這樣說。我是認真的。要不是你，我不可能走這麼遠。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And nowwwww I feel so so so good."
msgstr "而且我現在……感覺好極了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do you think *hic*, that maybe, the cactus water is..."
msgstr "你說*嗝*，該不會是因為那些仙人掌汁液……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Pffffft. Nooooo. This is how I NORMALLY am. Look at how normal I'm being right now."
msgstr "噗。不會的。我平時就是這樣的。你看，我現在多正常呀。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The cacti that stand in front of you now seem... bigger. And they move. But everything is moving, so that's not particularly strange. What is strange is that one of the cacti swing one of it's spiny arms at your head when you try to cut into it with your axe. The needles in the side of your face snap you out of the cactus water's hallucinogenic effects.\n\nEverything around you stops moving, except for the... angry cactus in front of you. And all of the ones behind it. They shift through the sands and reach out with their arms. They're real. You call out to [Companion Name] who seems to be having a similar revelation."
msgstr "眼前的仙人掌似乎……變大了。而且還在動。所有東西都在動，沒什麼特別奇怪的。但奇怪的是，當你準備用斧頭砍一株仙人掌的時候，它揮動長滿刺的手臂，打在你的頭上。你的臉刺痛無比，這時你從仙人掌汁液造成的幻覺中醒了。\n\n你周圍的一切都停了，除了你面前的那株……憤怒的仙人掌。還有它後面的那些。他們在沙裡遊走，伸出它們的手臂。它們都是真的。你呼喚[Companion Name]，她似乎也目擊了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Individually, these aren't too bad."
msgstr "單看這些，也不是什麼大麻煩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That was worth free passage for life? Huh."
msgstr "就這，能換來終身免費通行？呵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The cacti's spines are rough to content with, and require a far more protective approach to fighting than you're used to employing, but all is well. The patch of cacti lays slain at your feet, and the... effects of the cactus water seem to have subsided.\n\nYou press on to Clearwater, only taking occasional, small sips of the cactus water you collected when you absolutely need to. You're definitely more giggly than usual and sway lightly on your feet, but the worst of the effects never take hold with your moderate approach.\n\nThe town of Clearwater is a sight for sore, sun-baked eyes. Your feet ache, your skin is sunburnt, and you're absolutely parched. A small crowd of townsfolk gather about, laughing at your misfortune and warning of some of the dangers you may see deeper within in the desert.\n\nWhen you ask about the figures, much of the levity is replaced by fear. A good chunk of the population here seems to have come from the abandoned exterior towns fleeing the... Soulsmiths. It feels weird to finally have a name to the group that destroyed your home. Here, dealing with them has been a constant, and the name holds no gravitas. The townspeople say they've seen the caravans head east, towards the capitol, and warn you to stay far away from the eastern Heartroad for now. When you and [Companion Name] tell tales of Azamire and the Ringleader, and your goal of seeing the Soulsmiths brought to justice, it seems like half the town opens their homes to you, keeping you fed and hydrated as you two recover.\n\nAfter some well-deserved rest, the two of you continue east finally out of the dunes and back into grassy fields. You pass into rockier terrain as you approach the Flinkcrest Highlands. Large jagged boulders dot the rocky soil, jutting out at odd angles."
msgstr "仙人掌的刺不好對付。要對付它們，你要比平時更加註意防禦。不過好在一切順利。那些仙人掌全都倒在了你腳下，而……仙人掌汁液帶來的「效果」，似乎也已經消退了。\n\n你繼續前往清水鎮。萬不得已時，你偶爾抿一點收集的仙人掌汁液。你比平時更愛笑，身體也有些搖晃。但你喝的不多，那些最糟糕的「效果」沒有出現。\n\n熬過了炎炎烈日，你終於看到了清水鎮。此時你的雙腳痠痛，皮膚曬傷，非常口渴。一群鎮民圍了過來。他們嘲笑你的不幸，提醒你注意沙漠更深處可能存在的一些危險。\n\n當你打聽那些兜帽人時，氣氛從輕鬆變成了恐懼。這裡很多人似乎都是從外面的廢棄城鎮逃來的，而他們閃避的原因……是煉魂師。你終於知道了摧毀家園的那群人叫什麼，這感覺有點奇怪。這裡一直都在對付那些人，所以這個名字聽起來並不沉重。鎮民們說，他們看到那些車隊往東邊，也就是都城的方向走了。他們提醒你暫時遠離東邊的心路。你與[Companion Name]講述阿扎米爾和首領的故事，還說你們的目標是將煉魂師繩之以法。這時，似乎有一半的鎮民為你們敞開家門，給你們吃的喝的，讓你們休息。\n\n休息好了以後，你們倆繼續向東走，終於走出了沙丘，回到了草地。你們越靠近弗林克克雷斯特高地，路上的石頭就越多。地上全是嶙峋的巨石，呈現出各種奇特的角度。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How do you think they... got like that?"
msgstr "你覺得它們……是怎麼變成這樣的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What, the boulders?"
msgstr "你是說那些巨石嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah. Kinda... random, how they're all over the place, no?"
msgstr "是的。到處都是，有點……奇怪，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Maybe. But what, it's not like someone would haul them out here, right?"
msgstr "……也許吧。不過，不會是有人搬來這兒的吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "To what end?"
msgstr "目的是什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With that, [Companion Name] continues to peer over the boulders as the two of you travel along the Heartroad, as if they'd spring to life and tell her where they came from. You've had enough of sentient things that should otherwise not be, so you try to avoid staring too much.\n\nFinally, you arrive at a little inn that seems to have been built into a stone wall and garrison that takes up the expansive entrance of the Broken Pass. The Sleeping Stone is legendary, and for good reason. Not only is it the home of the Slayers Guild for the eastern region of the continent, it attracts world renowned adventurers who wish to venture into the Perilous Peaks to prove themselves to be the best of the best.\n\nThe Broken Pass is the quickest way to the capitol, but it's typically travelled by highly armed caravans that can both pay the toll to pass the gate, and can fend off any beasts that travelled down from the mountain proper. When you hear of caravans being rerouted south - around the mountain range - due to a particularly feisty pack of Stonehoppers, you're quick to offer you and [Companion Name]'s services. \n\nThe owner of the Sleeping Stone does you one better, saying that if you take care of them, you'll get free passage through the Broken Pass for life. The deal's too good to pass up."
msgstr "你們倆沿著心路繼續走，[Companion Name]時不時地探頭看看路邊的巨石，彷彿那些巨石會活過來，告訴她來自哪裡。你對這些本來就不該有意識的東西沒興趣，所以儘量不去多看。\n\n最終，你到了一家小客棧。 這家客棧似乎直接建在石牆裡面。旁邊是一處要塞，位置在粉碎關口寬敞的入口。沉睡之石非常有名，而且名副其實。這裡是大陸東部地區「獵殺公會」的總部，吸引了世界各地的著名冒險者。他們都想進入「險惡山脈」，證明自己是頂尖中的頂尖。\n\n粉碎關口是前往都城最快的路，但通常只有裝備精良的車隊才會走。這些車隊付得起通行費，也能夠抵禦山裡的牛羚。聽說有一群特別兇猛的石跳獸，逼得車隊改變方向往南走，繞過大山。你立刻提出要和[Companion Name]一起解決麻煩。\n\n沉睡之石的老闆提出了更誘人的條件：只要你能搞定那群傢伙，以後就可以終身免費透過粉碎關口。這筆買賣太划算了，不能錯過。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully this will persuade them to come out and say hello."
msgstr "希望這能引它們現身，打個招呼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ugh. My eyes are watering."
msgstr "呃。我的眼淚都快出來了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You tally up the bodies of the tall, awkward beasts. Stonehoppers were a bit of an odd blend of creatures. They were scaly like a lizard and use a long whip-like tail for stability. They have two large wings that aid them in jumping from rock to rock - hence their name - but they were technically flightless. The 'birds' walk on two powerful legs that they used to kick at their prey, which fortunately made it easy to get them tangled up in traps.\n\nWhat surprised you about them was their number. It felt like every time you caught one, you'd see two more jumping overhead."
msgstr "你清理那些牛羚的屍體。它們又高又笨。石跳獸是一種奇特的生物。他們長著蜥蜴般的鱗片，還有一條鞭子似的長尾巴，用來保持平衡。它們有一對大翅膀，讓它們能夠在岩石間跳躍。它們的名字就是這樣來的。但嚴格來說，它們不會飛。這些『鳥』行走時用兩條強壯的腿，捕獵時用腳踢獵物。好在這些特點可以讓它們輕鬆落入陷阱。\n\n令你驚訝的是它們的數量。感覺你抓一隻，頭上又有兩隻略過去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They're getting a bit more wily the further into the pass we go."
msgstr "我們越往關口裡面走，它們就越狡猾。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bigger, too."
msgstr "個頭也越大。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And there's so many of them. What do you think they even eat?"
msgstr "而且數量很多。你說它們平時吃什麼呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully not us. "
msgstr "但願吃的不是我們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Speaking of eating... how do you think they taste?"
msgstr "說到吃……你覺得它們吃起來怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Like chicken, hopefully. They're about thirty times the size, though. Hopefully not too stringy, with all their muscles."
msgstr "希望是雞肉味的。不過，它們的個頭是雞的三十倍大。全身都是肌肉，希望肉別太柴了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But do you think you could eat something that maybe would eat people, if they had the chance?"
msgstr "但你覺得，如果有機會，你會吃那種可能會吃人的東西嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh without a doubt. I wouldn't do it if it ate someone recently, of course."
msgstr "那肯定會啊。不過，如果它剛吃過人，我不會吃。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But what, are you telling me you'd turn down the chance to try dragon?"
msgstr "怎麼，難道你會放棄品嚐龍肉的機會嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Depends on the type, you know."
msgstr "那得看是什麼品種了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Some of them breathe poison, can't imagine that meat would do your body any favors."
msgstr "有些會噴毒，那種肉吃了估計對你的身體沒什麼好處。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fire-breathing dragons may be a bit burnt tasting..."
msgstr "噴火的龍吃起來可能會有股焦味兒……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "OR their meat is naturally smoked with a perfect sear on the inside... imagine slicing one open and being able to dig in..."
msgstr "或者說，它們的肉是天然燻過的，裡面還帶著完美的焦香……想象一下，切開一塊，直接咬下去……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just know, there's probably something out there talking about doing the same to you and me."
msgstr "你要知道，或許也有東西在琢磨怎麼對付你我呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fair's fair, if you ask me. Eat or be eaten, n' all that. Literally."
msgstr "依我看，這很公平。要麼吃，要麼被吃，就是這樣。字面上的「吃」。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you go back and forth on what creatures may or may not taste good, chatting idly back and forth as you collect the last of your traps.\n\nAs you finish prepping the last of the Stonehoppers you caught, you see one that's easily twice the others' size bounding along the cliffside. It jumps downward and pushes into a cave carved into the rock without paying you any mind. [Companion Name] looks to you eagerly.\n\nYou both clamber up the rocky wall of the Broken Pass and nearly catch a taloned foot to the face as another of the beasts head back inside to rest, seemingly not very bothered by your presence. Crawling into a beast den would be ill-advised, especially one that can kick so hard it could shatter your bones and send you bouncing around the cavern's walls. Best to smoke them out."
msgstr "你們倆一邊閒聊哪些生物可能好吃，哪些可能不好吃，一邊收拾剩下的陷阱。\n\n當你處理完抓住的最後幾隻石跳獸，你看見一隻石跳獸在懸崖邊跳躍，它的個頭是其他石跳獸的兩倍。它向下跳進了岩石上的一個洞穴，根本沒注意到你。[Companion Name]急切地看著你。\n\n你們倆努力爬上粉碎關口的巖壁。此時，又有一隻牛羚回到洞穴裡休息，似乎根本不在乎你們。它腳上的爪子差點抓到你的臉。爬進牛羚窩不是好辦法，畢竟這些傢伙一腳就能踢碎你的骨頭，讓你在洞壁上撞來撞去。還是用煙燻吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You really better to taste good."
msgstr "你們最好味道不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How many did I get?"
msgstr "我弄到幾隻了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Stonehoppers living within the cave are... much larger than the little ones you managed to catch with your traps. The one that passed by as you were climbing must have done so because it didn't even register you as a threat. Now that their den is filled with smoke and the two of you stand with weapons at the ready, they seem to have changed their minds about whether or not they want to take you seriously."
msgstr "住在洞穴裡的石跳獸……比你之前用陷阱抓的那些小東西要大得多。你剛才爬的時候，有一隻從你旁邊經過。它應該根本沒把你當成威脅。牛羚窩裡面都是煙，你們倆拿著武器站著等。看來，他們已經決定要不要認真對待你們了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any chance I can go back to catching the comparatively smaller ones, and you can handle these... monsters?"
msgstr "我還有機會回去抓那些小的嗎？你來對付這些……怪物？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As long as you pay me, every time we come back through the Broken Pass."
msgstr "只要你給我錢，每次我們回來經過粉碎關口時，都要付。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can hardly say that you earned free passage for life if I get to have all the fun to myself."
msgstr "如果所有的樂子都給我了，那可不能算你可以終身免費通行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fine then. Let's make it a bet, then. Whichever of us takes down the least cooks dinner of of them, then."
msgstr "行吧。那我們打個賭。誰打的牛羚最少，誰做晚飯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hope you brought your apron!"
msgstr "希望你帶了圍裙！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're both a touch nervous, despite the friendly wager. It's hard to feel particularly confident when you only come up to the Stonehoppers' thighs, but fortunately, the beasts are mostly leg. As you dodge out of the way of one of their kicks, you flinch when you see the cracks left in the stone where their foot connected.\n\nYou're beginning to understand why free passage for life was put on the table. Surely someone would have taken it sooner or later with the inn's usual clientele, but it's no cakewalk, that's for sure."
msgstr "雖然只是一場友好的打賭，你們倆心裡都有點緊張。你們的身高才到石跳獸的大腿，確實很難有信心。不過，好在這些牛羚的大半個身子都是腿。你躲開踢來的一腳，看到石頭上留下的裂痕，感覺有點害怕。\n\n你終於明白，為什麼「終身免費通行」會被當作籌碼。這家客棧的常客中，遲早會有人接下這樁差事。但可以肯定的是，這差事不簡單。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I mean... They won't mind if we borrow them, right?"
msgstr "我是說……借用一下它們，應該沒關係吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Suits them right."
msgstr "都是它們自找的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You and [Companion Name] tally up your kills and... somehow, it's a dead tie. You clean your bodies and do a once-over of the den, just to make sure you got them all and neither of you could squeak out a last minute victory, but you really did get them all.\n\nYou both throw up your hands and congratulate one another on a job well done and camp out in the Broken Pass, cooking a meal together. Usually you just dig into your travel rations, but this is about as good of a chance as you'll get on the road. With some local herbs and a generous bit of seasoning... yeah, it does taste like chicken. Quite a bit more gamey, and virtually zero fat, but a great meal nonetheless.\n\nYou settle into your sleeping roll and watch the embers of the fire float up into the sky."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]清點各自的戰果……結果打成平手。你們清理了屍體，又把牛羚窩搜了一遍，確認都抓完了。你們都想在最後一秒反超，但實際上，牛羚都抓完了。\n\n你們倆拍拍手，互相祝賀取得的戰果，然後在粉碎關口紮營，一起做飯。你們平時都簡單吃口乾糧，但現在是路上改善伙食的好機會。配上當地的草藥，撒上足量的調料……嘿，吃起來像雞肉。野味比較重，幾乎沒什麼油水，但這頓飯還是不錯的。\n\n你鑽進睡袋，看著火慢慢熄滅，飄到天上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Long way from Azamire."
msgstr "離阿扎米爾好遠啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't miss it. Much."
msgstr "我不想那兒。不是很想。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Always felt just a little too small, didn't it?"
msgstr "總覺得那兒太小了，不是嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah, a bit. I'll be happy when we do go back, but I'm not in any rush."
msgstr "是啊，是有點小。我們回去的時候，我會很開心。但現在也不急。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll finally be in the capitol, soon. I've dreamed about it ever since I was a kid."
msgstr "我們快到都城了。我從小就一直夢想著這一刻。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Me too. But next time, let's charter a boat, hm?"
msgstr "我也是。不過，下次我們租個船，好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, without a doubt."
msgstr "噢，沒問題。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "After a bit of shuteye, the rest of the trip is... uneventful in a positive way. You pass by the eastern gate to the Broken Pass and tell them how you've dealt with the Stonehoppers and show them proof, to which the guards are both impressed and thankful, and promise to let those at the Sleeping Stone know.\n\nYou pass by a few villages along the rest of the Heartroad, many of them clearly prospering due to their proximity to the capitol. As you pass over the Bridge of Kings, you see the grand gates of Melvor before you, with a long trail of people waiting to be let inside.\n\nThrough talking with the crowd and a few guards who do their best to keep the peace, it sounds like the city has been under a light lockdown to new travellers because of an influx of smuggled goods. Only those bearing visitor passes or proof of citizenship are allowed entry. Visitor passes are sold for... rather exorbitant amounts.\n\nAs a group of pompous aristocrates wave their passes and bottles of wine about flamboyantly. They let out strings of taunts and insults as they walk past the line of those looking to be let into the capitol. You and [Companion Name] look to one another with wry smiles."
msgstr "睡了一會後，接下來的旅程……平靜順利。你們經過粉碎關口的東門，告訴守護說你們解決了石跳獸，還拿出了證明。他們既驚歎又感激，承諾會通知沉睡之石那邊的人。\n\n沿著心路繼續走，你們經過了幾個村莊。因為靠近都城，許多村莊都很繁華。跨過「國王大橋」，你看到了梅爾沃的大門。門口排著長隊，都是等待進去的人。\n\n你跟那群人還有努力維持秩序的幾名守護聊了一下，聽說因為流入了大量的走私貨，這座城市已經封鎖了，限制外來者進入。只有持訪客通行證或市民身份證明，才能進去。訪客通行證的價格……高得離譜。\n\n一群自大的貴族揮著通行證和酒瓶，十分張揚。他們經過排隊等待進城的人群，嘴裡一直在嘲諷和羞辱。你和[Companion Name]互相看了看，無奈地笑了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You follow the group along for a while until one of the richly dressed men smacks a wide-eyed child on the nose with their pass, then hurries along. The child's mother shouts after them, and the angry line of onlookers finally snaps at the mistreatment. Some of the drunken nobles cower in fear, afraid of the consequences of their own actions, while others egg the crowd on further, clearly enjoying the attention. The guards try to keep the peace, though they are clearly fed up with the 'social elite' as well, judging by their glares.\n\nTaking advantage of the situation, you bump into one of the nobles in the and slip your hand into their coat, withdrawing a sleek sky blue visitor's pass. You keep walking as its original owner shouts after you for daring to touch them, but they're drowned out by the angry mob soon enough. [Companion Name] slides in right beside you, holding one of her own. The two of you open them up, realizing that there's no identifying information that is required, the pass alone is proof enough that you may enter.\n\nJust like that, the gates of the capitol won't stop you. You don't even feel a little bad."
msgstr "你跟著人群走了一會兒，這時一名穿著華貴的男子用通行證打了一個孩子的鼻子，那孩子的眼睛瞪得很大。然後，那名男子就走了。孩子的母親在後面大聲喊。看見孩子受欺負，圍觀人群的憤怒徹底爆發。一些醉醺醺的貴族害怕了，擔心自己的行為會造成什麼後果。還有一些貴族煽動情緒，顯然很享受被關注的感覺。守護努力維持秩序，但從他們憤怒的眼睛來看，顯然他們煩透了這些『社會精英』。\n\n趁著混亂，你撞上一名貴族，把手伸進他的外套，掏出了一張天藍色的訪客通行證。這張通行證原來的主人在你後面大喊，罵你摸他，但他的聲音很快就被憤怒的人群淹沒了。你沒有回頭，繼續走。[Companion Name]溜到你旁邊，手裡也拿著通行證。你們倆開啟通行證，目擊上面不需要任何身份資訊。單憑這張通行證，你們就可以進城。就這樣，都城的大門沒能攔住你。你甚至沒覺得不好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Big City"
msgstr "大城市"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "By following crumbs of information regarding the group you now know as the Soulsmiths, you've found yourself thrust into the middle of the capitol of Melvor with hardly a clue on what to do or where to go next."
msgstr "順著關於那群人（現在你知道他們叫煉魂師）的一些線索，你目擊到了梅爾沃的都城。接下來該做什麼、該去哪兒，你也不知道。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Here they come!"
msgstr "他們來了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's grab some feathers and go."
msgstr "拿幾根羽毛，走吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You'd heard tales of the capitol many times by those who'd travelled the continent and happened to stop by Azamire for trade or rest, but their stories hardly even begin to scratch just how... much was laid out before the two of you. Thousands of people, many speaking languages that you couldn't even begin to place. Buildings that stretch so high into the sky that you have to crane your neck to fully see. Market stalls filled with an endless number of trinkets and clothes, while some on the other side of the random plaza you'd entered emit smells so strange and tantalizing you involuntarily start to drool.\n\nYou try your best to take in everything, excitedly chatting with [Companion Name] as you both try to point out the endless rush of... everything, until you find yourself pushing out of the crowds for the first time. You're thankful for the space, until you feel a strong hand clamp down on your shoulder and yank you backwards. Your hand goes to the weapon at your side until you realize you... walked onto a firing range! An arrow whizzes past your nose as you turn to the person who grabbed you. A tall, tanned man dressed in a gaudy purple cloak and a longbow strapped to his back pulls you out of danger, to [Companion Name] who breathlessly catches up to you."
msgstr "從那些遊歷大陸的人口中，還有那些為了生意或休息經過阿扎米爾的人口中，你很多次聽說關於都城的故事。但他們講的和你們倆親眼看到的相比，簡直連冰山一角都不算。成千上萬的人，很多人說的語言你根本不懂。建築高聳入雲，你要仰起脖子才能完全看清楚。集市攤位上擺滿了數不清的小玩意兒和衣物。你來到廣場的另一側，聞到的氣味奇特又誘人，讓你忍不住流口水。\n\n你努力想要感受眼前的一切，興奮地和[Companion Name]聊天，指著周圍……各種各樣的景象。這時，你第一次擠出了人群。你慶幸終於不擠了，突然一隻強有力的手抓住你的肩，把你往後拽。你伸手去摸腰間的武器，但你目擊自己……進了一個射擊場！當你轉身去看抓你的人，一支箭從你的鼻子旁邊飛過去。抓你的是一名身材高大、皮膚黑黑的男子。他披著一件鮮豔的紫色披風，背上揹著一把長弓。他幫你擺脫危險，把你交給氣喘吁吁趕來的[Companion Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "New to the capitol, I presume?"
msgstr "看來你剛到都城吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's a few dozen things I'd recommend to newcomers for their first day, but getting skewered in the middle of the archery contest is not one of them. But meeting me is at the top of the list. Talm. The pleasure is yours."
msgstr "對於剛來的人，我有幾十條建議，但不建議「在射箭比賽中被射成串兒」。不過，遇到我是第一條建議。塔爾姆。遇到我是你的榮幸。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... I..."
msgstr "我……我……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There you are! I took my eyes off you for two minutes!"
msgstr "你在這兒啊！我才兩分鐘沒盯住你！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sorry, I was a bit distracted by... all of this."
msgstr "抱歉，我被……這些吸引了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can't blame you. Melvor is a real bute, ain't it?"
msgstr "不能怪你。梅爾沃的確是個好地方，不是嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It is, you have a wonderful city... Thank you for making sure I wasn't impaled."
msgstr "確實是，你們這城市真棒……謝謝你，我差點就被射穿了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course! Can't have one of my golden geese taken out before you get the chance to help me win!"
msgstr "那當然！可不能讓你們——我的「金鵝」，在幫我贏得比賽之前就沒了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...What do you mean?"
msgstr "……你什麼意思？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My lovely wife has shown me a vision. Me on top of the podium, being crowned the winner of this year's archery contest, with the two of you gleefully cheering me on! Under normal circumstances, about a zero percent chance I'd win..."
msgstr "我可愛的妻子給我占卜了一個幻象。我站在領獎臺的最高處，獲得今年射箭比賽的冠軍。你們倆為我歡呼喝彩！正常情況下，我贏的機率幾乎是零……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But, between you two and I, I plan on cheating as much as I possibly can, and the two of you will help me with that."
msgstr "不過我跟你們倆說，我會想盡一切辦法作弊，你們倆幫幫我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...What makes you think we would do that?"
msgstr "……你為什麼覺得我們會幫你？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, first and foremost, Era's visions are never wrong. But secondarily, ask around. Some random noble's family wins this every year, and it's not because they're the most dedicated to their craft, I can tell you that."
msgstr "嗯，首先，艾拉的預知不會錯。其次，你們去打聽一下。每年贏的都是一些貴族。我敢說，他們能贏不是因為他們的技術有多好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A combination of bribes and the best bows and arrows that money can buy turn mediocre into world-class talent, apparently. And I'm sick of seein' it."
msgstr "看來，只要賄賂，再加上用錢能買到的頂級弓箭，就能把平庸的人變成世界級人才。我真是受夠了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...And let's say we do help you, because we care about the little guy sticking it to the city's nobility oh-so-much, what's in it for us?"
msgstr "……就算我們幫你，我們能得到什麼呢？畢竟我們很欣賞你這種敢於挑戰城中貴族的小人物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A reading from my lovely wife, of course. One each. Assuming I win, of course. Trust me, you couldn't afford it, normally."
msgstr "當然是讓我可愛的妻子給你們占卜。每人一次。當然，前提是我贏。相信我，正常情況下，你們可付不起。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I appreciate you making sure that [Player Name] didn't become an archery target, but-"
msgstr "感謝你沒讓[Player Name]變成靶子，不過——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...You know, a vision might just even help you with your little Soulsmith problem."
msgstr "……你知道嗎，或許占卜的幻象還能幫你解決煉魂師的問題。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm winks at the two of you and then holds a finger to his lips, clearly giving no further information than he's already provided. Based on how quickly you and [Companion Name] looked to one another at the mention of Soulsmiths, he knew he had you hooked. Without even asking if you'd be interested, he talks about how arrows fashioned with the feathers of a Sea Griffon always seem to find their mark, and would quite fancy having some of the arrows for himself. Unfortunately, he has no feathers, just the location of one that has been terrorizing a few fishing boats.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] leave the capitol as quickly as you came, and after a few hours of travel, find the windy cliffside that the nest was said to be. And sure enough, a large pack of the beasts swoop overhead, clearly upset by your arrival."
msgstr "塔爾姆向你們眨了眨眼，然後豎起一根手指放在唇邊。顯然，他不能再透露更多的資訊了。一提到煉魂師，你和[Companion Name]迅速交換了一個眼神。他知道，你們有興趣了。他甚至沒問你們有沒有興趣，就說用海獅鷲羽毛製作的箭矢總能射中目標。他自己也很想有幾支這樣的箭矢。可惜，他沒有羽毛，只知道有一隻海獅鷲在恐嚇幾艘漁船。\n\n跟來的時候一樣，你和[Companion Name]快速離開都城。幾個小時後，你們找到了巢穴所在的懸崖邊。懸崖邊風很大。果然，一大群牛羚從你們頭上飛過。顯然，你們的到來讓它們很生氣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He'd better win."
msgstr "他最好能贏。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll get that reading one way or another."
msgstr "無論如何，我們一定要占卜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Feathers gathered, the two of you make the trek back to the capitol. The city is just as overwhelming as before, but the clear goal of finding Talm again manages to help you push through the enthralling nature of the new sights and smells with ease. Talm is amongst the competitors, warming up. He's doing a remarkable job even without the feathers, nearly splitting his own arrows far down the range, and you begin to wonder why he feels the need to cheat at all."
msgstr "收集到羽毛後，你們倆回到都城。城裡的景象還是那麼眼花繚亂。但你們有了明確的目標，那就是再次找到塔爾姆。有了這個目標，你們能夠輕鬆應對那些吸引人的新奇景象和氣味。塔爾姆正在進行參賽熱身。即使沒有羽毛，他依然表現得很棒。在遠處的靶子上，他的箭幾乎可以將自己之前射的箭劈成兩半。你不禁在想，他為什麼覺得自己需要作弊呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah, just who I wanted to see! Hopefully the coastline is one oversized bird safer, thanks to you two?"
msgstr "啊，正巧！多虧了你們倆，海岸少了一隻巨鳥，現在更安全了，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Try a pack. We've got your feathers. Now, it'd be nice to know how you-"
msgstr "……是一群。這是你要的羽毛。那麼，我想知道你是怎麼——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, what am I to do with feathers? I can't very well throw them to the target, you know."
msgstr "唉，我要這些羽毛幹什麼？總不能直接扔到靶子上，你說是吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd appreciate it if you fashioned them into some arrows. Steel tips are fine, that's what everyone else is using, don't want to stick out too much."
msgstr "要是能做成箭，我感激不盡。鋼的箭頭就行。大家用的都是這種，我不想太太扎眼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait, we said that we'd get the feathers, not make them for you."
msgstr "等等，我們說的是弄羽毛，沒說還要做箭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're an archer, you should know how to do that."
msgstr "你是弓箭手，應該知道怎麼做吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, yes, of course I know how, but I have to make sure my aim is true regardless."
msgstr "嗯，對，我當然知道。但無論如何，我要確保能射中目標。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Isn't that what the feathers are for?"
msgstr "羽毛的作用不就是這個嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Remember, we're going up against other cheaters too. Every little advantage counts."
msgstr "別忘了，我們的對手也有作弊的。任何一點小小的優勢都很重要。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You don't get your readings if I don't win."
msgstr "我要是沒贏，你們就不能占卜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm's sing-songy taunt elicts a glare from [Companion Name], but after a brief standoff, she sighs and hauls you away, grumpily beginning to cut some arrow shafts. You get the impression she'd rather use that knife elsewhere, but has decided to behave, for now."
msgstr "聽著塔爾姆戲謔地嘲諷你們，[Companion Name]生氣地瞪了他一眼。但糾結了一會兒，她嘆了口氣，把你拉到一邊，暴躁地開始削箭桿。看得出來，她更想把那把刀用在別的地方，但眼下還是決定安分一點。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "None of this looks too rare, thankfully."
msgstr "好在，這東西看起來不是很少見。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This better be enough."
msgstr "希望這些夠用了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you make your way back to Talm, this time with a bundle of arrows, to which he recieves with a small and a small, polite show of clapping. He takes one and inspects it carefully, before bending it so far that it snaps in two. He tuts to himself and shoves the splintered arrow back into your hands."
msgstr "你們倆回到塔爾姆那裡，這次帶了一捆箭。他接過箭，禮貌地輕輕拍了拍手。他提領一支箭仔細檢視，然後用力一掰，箭斷成兩段。他嘖了一聲，把斷了的箭塞回你們手上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now now, this simply won't do. My bow may also be a bit special. Like I said, I really want to win this. The with the force I'll be sending these arrows down range, they don't stand a chance."
msgstr "哎呀，這樣不行啊。我的弓或許也有點特別。我說過，我這次真的想贏。以我射出這些箭的力道，其他人沒有機會贏。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you want us to do? Make the shafts out of metal, too?"
msgstr "你想讓我們怎麼做？難道箭桿也要做成金屬的嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No no, of course not. Thankfully, Era came through for us and provided me with a little... somethin' somethin' ahead of time."
msgstr "不不，當然不是。多虧艾拉幫我們，提前給我們弄了個……東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And now, I leave the responsibility to the two of you. No need to thank me."
msgstr "接下來的重任就交給你們倆了。不用謝我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...You'd better win."
msgstr "……你最好能贏。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've never been more sure of anything in my life."
msgstr "我這輩子都沒這麼篤定過。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm hands you a scrap of paper that looks more akin to a grocery list than anything that'd directly help win the competition. A handful of ingredients, brought up to temperature and then distilled into a potion called 'True-Shot', could be imbued into the arrows to give them incredible strength and flexibility."
msgstr "塔爾姆遞給你一張紙條，看起來更像是一份購物清單，而不是什麼能直接幫忙贏得比賽的東西。將幾種原料加熱，再蒸餾製成一種名為『精準射擊』的藥水。把藥水塗在箭上，就能有驚人的威力和韌性。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You head back to find Talm, hopefully for the final time. Just as you manage to finish applying the solution, Talm is called to the range to take his shots. Each of his arrows finds their mark at the other side of the range, faster and more powerful than any of his opponents. The competition rages on and gets more fierce as competitors are eliminated. Talm's near permanent smile is slowly replaced by a look of genuine concentration his six remaining competitors do their best to outdo one another. Criteria for each shot begin to change as the distance and size of the targets can no longer be changed. The seven of them started shooting at pea-sized targets a few rounds back, so now, they begin to fire upside-down. On horseback. Blindfolded.\n\nEvery few rounds, Talm manages to stick around as another competitor misses their mark. Even knowing how much help Talm is getting, you cannot help but cheer with each shot he lands. Unless he's going up against the best archers the world has even seen, you start to believe they have just as much assistance as he does. Talm makes it to the final round. One target, a hair-thin string gently dangling on the other side of the range. Both him and the other competitor fire at the same time, but Talm's blue-feathered arrow knocks the competitor's arrow out of the air, and severs the string on the other side.\n\nThe crowd erupts into cheers, and you find yourself cheering as well, as Talm is brought up to the top of the podium and given a trophy about a quarter of his size. After ample celebration, he finds his way back to you and [Companion Name], and after a combination of gloating and thanks, tells you to find him when you're ready for your rewards."
msgstr "你回去找塔爾姆，希望這是最後一次了。你剛把藥水塗在箭上，塔爾姆就被叫去靶場準備射箭。他射出的每一箭都正中靶心，速度和威力比他的所有對手都強。參賽者陸續淘汰，比賽越來越激烈，進入白熱化階段。之前塔爾姆總是一臉笑，現在慢慢變得全神貫注。剩下的六名對手用盡全力，相互比拼。目標距離和大小無法再進行調整，所以每次射擊的標準也開始變了。幾輪之後，七名參賽者開始射擊豌豆大小的目標。所以現在，他們開始用倒立的姿勢射擊。在馬背上。蒙著眼。\n\n每過幾輪，當其他參賽者紛紛脫靶時，塔姆爾總能留下來。明知塔姆爾有外力相助，但每次他命中目標，你還是忍不住歡呼。除非他的對手是世界上最厲害的弓箭手，否則你難免會認為，對手獲得的外力恐怕和他差不多。塔爾姆成功進入決賽。靶子是一根和頭髮一樣細的線，線輕輕掛在靶場的另一端。他和另一名參賽者同時射出，但塔爾姆那支綠色羽毛的箭在空中將對方的箭擊落，割斷了另一端的線。\n\n人群開始歡呼，你也忍不住跟著一起歡呼。這時，塔爾姆被帶上領獎臺，獲得的獎盃相當於他身體大小的四分之一。盛大的慶祝活動之後，他回到你和[Companion Name]身邊。他說了一些得意和感謝的話，然後讓你們在準備好領取獎勵以後去找他。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Ivory Athenaeum"
msgstr "象牙藏書院"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "After helping Talm win Melvor's archery competition, you've done your part. Now, it's time for him to honor his side of the deal and hopefully provide information regarding the Soulsmiths."
msgstr "在幫助塔爾姆贏得梅爾沃射箭比賽後，你完成了自己的那部分任務項目。現在，他該履行約定了，希望他能給予有關煉魂師的資訊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This mission might be next to impossible."
msgstr "這項任務項目可能幾乎是不可能的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now we just... take a little mould of the lock."
msgstr "現在我們只是……做一個鎖的小模具。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Even in a city as bustling as Melvor, Talm is a remarkably easy figure to find. After just a few minutes of asking around the range, you find yourself face to face with the tall, smiling man. Without a word he gestures for you to follow him, so you do, trusting he knows what you're after. You're lead deep within the alleys and byways of the capitol, some better, some worse. As you round a corner you find yourself at the back entrance of a brightly painted stone building, door already open for you to enter. As the three of you enter, the door quietly shuts behind you without any prompting.\n\nYou're brought before an absolutely stunning woman who greets the three of you with a wordless smile, and gestures for you to sit on cushions laid out in front of her. You do, and the room quickly fills with a twinkling blue fog. You panic for a moment before deciding that they don't seem to mean you harm, and you inhale deeply.\n\nYour vision fades away, then comes back to you as you're flying far overhead a large white building, whose doors seem to suck you in. You fall through the floor of the building and weave through shelf and shelf of books, all the way to a large vault made of a blend of metals and magic you instinctively know as you pass through its walls. Within, you find a gilded tome that seems to glow with power. The moment you touch it, you snap back awake next to [Companion Name]. She seems... upset, seemingly a bit disturbed by whatever she saw."
msgstr "在梅爾沃這座繁華的城市裡，要找到塔爾姆很簡單。四處打聽了一會兒，你就看到了那個身材高大、面帶微笑的男人。他沒說一句話，示意讓你跟著他。你照著做，相信他清楚你的來意。他帶你走進都城巷道的深處，一路上的環境時好時壞。轉過一個角落，你來到一棟顏色鮮豔的石頭建築的後門。門已經開了，正等你們進去。等你們三人進去，身後的門自己就悄悄關上了。\n\n你被帶到一名驚豔的女子面前。她沒說話，笑著和你打招呼，然後示意你坐在她前面的墊子上。你坐下來，房間裡很快就飄滿了閃著微光的藍色霧氣。你有點驚慌，但心想他們似乎沒有惡意，於是便深吸了一口氣。\n\n你的視線慢慢模糊，然後又慢慢清楚。這時，你飛在高高的空中，下面是一棟巨大的白色建築。那棟建築的大門彷彿要把你吸進去。你落下來，穿過那棟建築的地板，在一排排的書架之間穿梭，最後到了一個大寶庫。當你穿過寶庫的牆壁，直覺告訴你這個寶庫是金屬和魔法混合構成的。寶庫內，你目擊了一本閃著力量光芒的鍍金古書。在你觸碰古書的一瞬間，你突然驚醒，身邊是[Companion Name]。她看起來……不太高興，似乎被她看見的景象困住了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What... was that? Did you see the same thing, [Companion Name]？"
msgstr "那……是什麼？你看到了嗎，[Companion Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I uh... doubt it. What'd you see?"
msgstr "呃，我……好像沒看到。你看到什麼了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A large white building with what was almost a maze under it, and then a vault."
msgstr "一棟巨大的白色建築，下面好像有個迷宮，還有一個寶庫。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah. You saw the Abyssal Vault, did you?"
msgstr "啊。你看到深淵寶庫了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Best of luck getting inside, I've only been a few times, myself."
msgstr "那祝你好運，進去可不容易，我自己只去過幾次而已。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Era, you can't spoil it. That's half the fun."
msgstr "艾拉，別劇透啊。這才是有趣的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They have much ground to cover, and little time."
msgstr "他們要走的路還很長，可時間不多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Isn't that right, [Companion Name]?"
msgstr "你說對吧，[Companion Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What do you mean? [Companion Name] are you alright?"
msgstr "你這是什麼意思？[Companion Name]，你沒事吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... will be, I promise."
msgstr "我……會沒事的，我保證。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's this about a vault?"
msgstr "什麼寶庫？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Since my dear already spoiled the surprise, it sounds like you two need to engage in a little..."
msgstr "既然我親愛的已經把驚喜劇透了，看來你們倆要來一場小小的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Heist. Of sorts. Should be a cakewalk."
msgstr "搶劫。算是吧。應該很簡單。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We just got to town. I don't think jail is on my list of places I'd like to see."
msgstr "我們才剛到鎮上。我可不想去監獄玩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It shouldn't have to be, if you're careful."
msgstr "只要小心點，就沒事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The vault requires a key, but before you can make one, you'll have to obtain a mold of the lock."
msgstr "寶庫需要鑰匙，但在製作鑰匙之前，你得先弄到鎖的模具。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And if we were to do something so unscrupulous, which we aren't by the way, how are we to know you wouldn't turn us in?"
msgstr "再說了，如果我們真做了這種不光彩的事——當然我們不會做，我們怎麼知道你不會轉頭就把我們舉報了呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If you're after information on the Soulsmiths, and it has lead you to the vault, stopping you would be... unwise."
msgstr "既然你們在找煉魂師的線索，現線上索指向了寶庫，那不去的話……可不明智。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Feel free to try and gain lawful access to the vault if you wish, I promise you it would not be fruitful."
msgstr "如果你們願意，可以用正當手段進入寶庫。不過我保證，這樣不會有什麼收成。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And how do the two of you know about them? And that we're... interested?"
msgstr "你們倆怎麼知道這些的？又怎麼知道我們……有興趣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Era and I indulge in the visions she can provide quite often, really. "
msgstr "艾拉和我確實經常沉浸在她呈現的幻象中。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "One of them showed you two, and through that, what you've been up to."
msgstr "其中一個幻象有你們倆，我們就知道你們最近的動向。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And what you must face. Go now, return when you've gotten what you need."
msgstr "還有你們必須面對的挑戰。去吧，等拿到需要的東西再回來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And with that, Talm helps Era up and takes her to a room behind a nearby curtain. It doesn't seem like you're invited. You check on [Companion Name] once again, about the vision she had. She gently, tells you that she'll talk about it later, just that it was a bit scary. \n\nThe two of you wander around the city, a bit less awestruck than when you first arrived, and soon enough, find yourselves on the doorstep of the Ivory Athenaeum. From what you learn, speaking with some of the guests and staff, it'd seem that the titanic structure holds the largest compilation of humanity's knowledge ever created, with a near endless number of books on every subject one could think of.\n\nYou ask about the lower floors, and learn that they are restricted to the general public, needing a direct invitation from the King himself to be let inside, since the books down there contain dangerous information. The process of obtaining an invitation is told to you through a long, well-rehearsed deluge of information. What sticks out to you is the time involved. An average of thirty years for those prestigious enough to be allowed a chance. Too long."
msgstr "說完，塔爾姆扶起艾拉，把她帶進附近一道簾子後面的房間。好像沒讓你們一起去。關於她看見的幻象，你再次詢問[Companion Name]。她低聲說等會兒再細講，只是那幻象有點嚇人。\n\n你們倆在城中閒逛，沒有剛來時那麼驚歎。沒過多久，你們來到象牙藏書院的門前。你們跟這裡的訪客和工作人員交談，聽說這座宏偉的建築裡有人類有史以來最龐大的知識彙編。這裡面的書數不勝數，涵蓋人們所能想象的所有領域。\n\n你詢問底層的情況，得知那裡不對公眾開放。要想進去，需要國王本人的直接邀請，因此那裡的書中有危險的資訊。他們向你介紹獲得邀請的流程。那一長串的介紹就像是反覆排練過的，滔滔不絕。你最關心的是需要的時間。即使是有機會獲得邀請的名門望族，平均也要等三十年。太久了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The vision proved particularly useful, didn't it?"
msgstr "那段幻象確實很有用，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This looks about right. Back down we go."
msgstr "看來就是這裡。我們下去吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You want to let out a cheer as the Abyssal Vault comes into view, but you obviously know better than that. You put [Companion Name] up on your shoulders and she slowly but surely presses a wedge of clay into the arcane locking mechanism. The vault is exactly as it appeared in your vision, and you do your best to memorize the magic that courses through it as [Companion Name] deals with the mould. You know from your vision that you'll have to imbue the key with the same magic for it to actually work when you come back and let yourself in.\n\nNow that you've properly mapped out the route to the vault, you're able to get back to the entrance with little trouble. Understandably, the patrolling guards are both few and number and a bit inattentive, it's not like many people would be crazy enough to try this. You and [Companion Name] make it back out of the Ivory Athenaeum, and finally allow yourself to breathe."
msgstr "看見深淵寶庫的時候，你很想歡呼一下，但你當然知道，現在不能歡呼。你把[Companion Name]扛在肩上，她穩穩地將一塊黏土擠進秘鎖裝置。寶庫和你在幻象裡看到的一模一樣。[Companion Name]忙著製作模具，你則盡力記住流轉其中的魔力。你從幻象裡得知，得給鑰匙注入同樣的魔力，等你們回來時，它才能真正開啟這扇門。\n\n現在，通往寶庫的路線已經摸清，回到入口倒沒費多少工夫。巡邏的守護不僅人數少，還有些心不在焉。這也難怪，畢竟沒幾個人會瘋到來幹這種事。你和[Companion Name]終於走出象牙藏書院，這才敢鬆口氣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can't believe it!"
msgstr "真不敢相信！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I can't believe we'll have to do it again."
msgstr "……真不敢相信，我們還得再來一趟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We already made it in once, what's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr "都成功進去過一次了，還能出什麼大事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't even want to humor that question with a guess."
msgstr "這種問題，我連猜都不想猜。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll be fineeee, I'm sure of it. 50 gold say we make it back down there without a problem."
msgstr "肯定沒事的啦，我有把握。我賭50金幣，咱們肯定能順順利利再下去一趟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How about we bet bail on it, hm? I can't even imagine how many years we'd get."
msgstr "要不賭保釋金，怎麼樣？我都不敢想，抓住了得判多少年。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, you don't need to imagine. Because we just did it! Let's get started on that key, hm?"
msgstr "好了，不用想。咱們這不是成功了嗎！來做那把鑰匙吧，怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You take the mould and start to jot down everything you'll need onto a piece of paper. Everything for the perfect alloy to match the material of the vault, along with what you remember of the magical barrier that surged through the exterior of the vault."
msgstr "你拿出模具，開始在紙上記下需要的東西。要配出和寶庫材質一致的合金，材料一樣都不能少。還有寶庫外層湧動的魔法屏障，你也把記得的細節一一寫了下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't think he's going to let us out of here."
msgstr "我看他是不會放我們出去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sorry, big fella."
msgstr "對不住了，大傢伙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sure enough, the patrols and traps seem to be exactly the same as the first time you came down here. It isn't particularly a surprise, but it still lets you relax a bit as you slink through the endless rows of bookshelves, back to the door of the vault. Your dark clothes and molded face-mask restrict your breathing a little bit, but on the off-chance that someone sees you, you'll be glad for the anonymity it provides.\n\nYou reach up and slide your key into the lock, and with a clunk - one that's a bit louder than you would have hoped for - the Abyssal Vault door cracks open, just a pinch. You and [Companion Name] slip inside and find row after row of plinths, holding not just books, but what look like dangerous phials of liquid, weapons, and maps. [Companion Name] whispers across the vault to you."
msgstr "果然，巡邏和陷阱的佈置，看起來和你們上次來時一模一樣。這倒不算意外，不過，當你們悄悄穿過一排排望不到頭的書架，再次摸到寶庫門前時，你還是稍稍放鬆了些。深色衣服和貼臉的面具讓你有點喘不過氣。不過，萬一真被人看見，你會慶幸有這身打扮遮住身份。\n\n你抬起手，把鑰匙插進鎖孔。咔嗒一聲，比你希望的響了那麼一點，深淵寶庫的大門裂開了一道窄縫。你和[Companion Name]溜了進去。裡面一排排陳列臺上擺著的，不只有書，還有一瓶瓶看著就危險的液體，以及武器和地圖。[Companion Name]在寶庫那頭壓低聲音問你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's the title of the book again? There's dozens of them."
msgstr "那本書叫什麼來著？這裡有好幾十本呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I didn't see... It was just bound in black leather, and gilded with gold. Bout... this big."
msgstr "我沒看見……只知道是黑皮封面，鑲著金邊。大概……這麼大。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll let you know if I see it. Don't die."
msgstr "找到了我叫你。可別死了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You too."
msgstr "你也是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you quickly search through the displayed items until you find what you're looking for. The black, gilded tome from your vision. Amongst everything else in the vault, you'd almost call it unassuming. \n\nIt hums with some unknown magic, and you give it a ginger touch with your hand. When you don't immediately get vaporized by some unknown power, you lift it from its resting place and crack it open. The first page says... Something in a language you've never seen before. You snap it closed and gently wave it for [Companion Name] to see. She carefully crosses the vault and takes the book, and the two of you head back to the entrance. However, the moment your hand touches the metal of the door to push to back open, it snaps shut. A loud hum fills the room, along with what sounds like an alarm outside of the vault.\n\nAs you look to [Companion Name], a large golem seems to coalesse from the ground, made of the same alloy as the rest of the vault. [Companion Name] readies her weapon, and you follow suit."
msgstr "你們飛快地翻找陳列的物品，終於找到了要找的東西。正是幻象裡那本鑲著金邊的黑色厚書。和寶庫裡的其他東西比起來，它甚至算得上不起眼。\n\n書裡湧動著某種未知的魔力，發出低低的嗡鳴。你小心翼翼地伸手碰了碰。既然沒有當場被什麼神秘力量化成灰，你便把書拿了起來，輕輕翻開。第一頁寫著……一種你從沒見過的文字。你啪地合上書，輕輕晃了晃，示意[Companion Name]看過來。她小心穿過寶庫，接過書，你們一起往入口走去。然而，你的手剛碰到金屬門，想把它推開，門就猛地合上了。響亮的嗡鳴充斥著整個房間，寶庫外似乎也響起了警報。\n\n你轉頭看向[Companion Name]，只見一具巨大的魔像正從地面凝聚成形，身上的合金和寶庫其他地方的材質一模一樣。[Companion Name]握緊武器，你也做好了戰鬥準備。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As the golem falls and melts back into the floor, the door to the vault blessedly clicks open once again. You and [Companion Name] gather yourselves to see... roughly fifty guards running in your direction down the hall, likely with many more behind them."
msgstr "魔像倒下，重新融進地面。謝天謝地，寶庫的門也咔嗒一聲，再次開啟。你和[Companion Name]剛緩過勁，就看見……走廊裡大約有五十名守護正朝你們衝來，後面恐怕還跟著更多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You owe me fifty gold!"
msgstr "你欠我50金幣！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I said we'd get down here safe. I didn't say anything about getting back out!"
msgstr "我說的是能平安下來。可沒說能平安出去！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now run!"
msgstr "快跑！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you begin scaling the bookshelves outside of the vault and run as fast as you can. Fearful of destroying the collection, the guards refuse to fire upon you but give chase back down the halls, slowed by the same traps meant to stop intruders. The tops of the shelves have just as many, if not more traps."
msgstr "你們攀上寶庫外的書架，撒腿狂奔。守護怕毀了藏品，不敢朝你們開火，只能沿著走廊一路追趕。那些原本用來攔住入侵者的陷阱，反倒拖慢了他們的腳步。書架頂上的陷阱也一點不少，甚至可能更多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you run like your lives depend on it, because they likely do. Every time you're singed by a magical barrier or narrowly dodge a guardsman's pike, you just think about how many lifetimes you'd likely spend in Melvor's jails. That is, if they didn't just outright execute you. You make sure not to hurt anyone, because murder wouldn't likely get you any better treatment if you were to be captured.\n\nBy some miracle, you manage to make it to the stairwell leading up out of the lower floors. Stunned guardsmen scramble to bring their weapons at the ready - clearly not anticipating any intruders actually making it back to the entrance - and the two of you manage to burst back out into the main floor of the athenaeum.\n\nYou rush outside and into the throngs of people being evacuated outside. Guards point and shout at the two of you as you melt into the crowds but fail to give chase as you quickly slip deeper and deeper into the mass of concerned citizens. The two of you find yourselves at the edge of a canal and jump in, swimming under the water all the way to an exposed sewer grate. You let yourselves inside and strip off your disguises and toss them into the water, both silent as the adrenaline slowly works it way through your bodies. You quietly laugh and lean against the wall of the sewer with a sick squelch you don't even notice. You did it. You got out, somehow."
msgstr "你們拼了命地跑，畢竟這多半真是在逃命。每次被魔法屏障燎一下，或是險險躲過守護的長槍，你都會想到，要是落網，自己大概得在梅爾沃的牢裡蹲上幾輩子。前提是，他們沒有直接把你處死。你儘量不傷到任何人。真被抓住了，再背上一條人命，只會更慘。\n\n簡直是奇蹟，你們竟然跑到了通往上層的樓梯間。守護顯然沒料到入侵者還能活著跑回入口，愣了一下，才手忙腳亂地舉起武器。趁著這工夫，你們衝回了藏書院的主層。\n\n你們衝到外面，混進正在疏散的人群。守護指著你們大喊，可你們轉眼就鑽進了人群深處。四周都是惶惶不安的市民，他們根本追不上來。你們來到一條運河邊，縱身跳下，潛在水裡，一直游到一處露在外面的下水道柵口。鑽進下水道後，你們脫下偽裝，扔進水裡。兩個人都沒說話，方才逃命時的那股亢奮勁還沒過去。你低低地笑了起來，往下水道牆上一靠。黏糊糊的一聲響，你卻渾然不覺。你們做到了。不管怎麼說，總算逃出來了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unfortunate Teller"
msgstr "倒黴的占卜師"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "After the miraculous heist of the Abyssal Vault, it's time to return to Era and Talm. Maybe they'll be able to tell you something about the book you managed to steal, considering you haven't the slightest clue on what it says."
msgstr "你們奇蹟般地從深淵寶庫偷出了東西，現在該回去找艾拉和塔爾姆了。偷來的書上寫了什麼，你一個字也看不懂。也許他們能告訴你些什麼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I doubt Talm will let us take his equipment after this. The recipe won't do us any good afterwards."
msgstr "這事過後，塔爾姆恐怕不會讓我們把他的器材拿走。到時候，有配方也派不上用場。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As useful as it might otherwise be..."
msgstr "雖然這東西本來還挺有用的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] flicks the gilded tome open and closed, looking at it from every angle she can, and trying a few different pages. Like you, she hasn't the foggiest clue about what the book says, and the place that would likely know, is still searching high and low for it. You and [Companion Name] have left your little sewer hideaway and sure enough, the disguises you donned before the heist worked. No one comes to put you in shackles and haul you off to some dark dungeon. As far as anyone else is concerned, you're just one of the many thousands of tourists to the capitol.\n\nYou head back to Era and Talm's home and find it... in flames. Talm worriedly tries to douse the flames with many other passerby, until a capitol mage buries the building under a deluge of water. You rush to Talm. Your presence gives him pause, and he gestures for you two to follow him."
msgstr "[Companion Name]把那本鑲金邊的厚書翻來覆去地看，開啟又合上，還換著翻了幾頁。和你一樣，她也完全看不懂。至於那個可能看得懂的地方，現在還在滿城找這本書。你和[Companion Name]離開了下水道里的臨時藏身處。果然，行動前那身偽裝沒白穿。沒人過來給你們戴上鐐銬，拖進什麼暗無天日的地牢。在旁人眼裡，你們不過是都城成千上萬遊客中的兩個。\n\n你們回到艾拉和塔爾姆家，卻目擊那裡……著火了。塔爾姆正和一群路人焦急地撲火，直到一名都城的法師召來傾盆大水，將整棟房子澆了個透。你連忙跑向塔爾姆。看見你，他愣了一下，隨後示意你們跟上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Come on. We need to see what's left!"
msgstr "快來。得看看還剩下什麼！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm, what happened? Is Era with you?"
msgstr "塔爾姆，出什麼事了？艾拉和你在一起嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No! She's... she's been taken."
msgstr "沒有！她……她被抓走了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "She knew she would be, of course... We just didn't know when."
msgstr "當然，她早就知道會有這麼一天……我們只是不知道具體是什麼時候。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The visions aren't always... precise. Come with me, please."
msgstr "幻象不總是那麼……準確。跟我來，求你們了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The urgency and pain in his voice spur you and [Companion Name] to follow. The three of you push into the smoking building and find the back room drenched, but relatively untouched by the flames. The room is a disaster and there's signs of a scuffle that are clear even despite the water and fire. Talm sighs, but seems more calm than he was before the two of you arrived.\n\nHe opens a chest tucked in a corner and pulls out what seems to be alchemy equipment. He laments how Era will feel about him giving away trade secrets, but shows you how to make the same vision-inducing smoke you inhaled before your heist, saying that it should be able to help the three of you find Era. You think about bringing up the book, but figure it can wait for now."
msgstr "他的聲音裡滿是焦急和痛苦，你和[Companion Name]趕緊跟上。你們三個擠進還在冒煙的房子。後面的房間被水澆透了，倒沒怎麼被火燒到。屋裡一片狼藉。即使又燒又淹，打鬥過的痕跡還是清清楚楚。塔爾姆嘆了口氣，不過，比起你們剛來時，他似乎冷靜了些。\n\n他開啟角落裡的一個箱子，提領一些像是鍊金器材的東西。他念叨著，要是艾拉知道他把秘方傳了出去，不知會怎麼想。不過，他還是教了你調製那種能讓人看見幻象的煙的方法，也就是你們潛入寶庫前吸入的那種。他說，這應該能幫你們找到艾拉。你本想提一提那本書，又覺得還是先等等吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm crowds around as you burn the large pouches of the specialized herbal blend. It doesn't seem as strong as the last time you had it, and you're unsure of if you did something wrong or if it's just part of a building tolerance.\n\nNevertheless, you find yourself feeling much of the same sensation as before, but this time, you float over a small, ramshackle hut deep within what you presume are Melvor's slums. The only distinguishing characteristic is a single crescent-shaped grey marking by its door. As you come back to, Talm blinks his eyes, seemingly coming back to reality as well. [Companion Name] holds her hands over her face, waving the smoke away and asking if you two saw what you needed to."
msgstr "你點燃幾大包特製的草藥混合料，塔爾姆也湊了過來。這次的煙似乎沒有上次那麼濃烈。你不確定是自己哪一步做錯了，還是身體已經開始適應它了。\n\n不過，那種熟悉的感覺還是來了。只不過這次，你飄在一間破舊小屋上方。小屋藏得很深，你猜那裡應該是梅爾沃的貧民窟。唯一能認出來的，就是門邊那道灰色的月牙形標記。你回過神時，塔爾姆眨了眨眼，似乎也剛從幻象中清醒。[Companion Name]用手擋著臉，揮開煙霧，問你們有沒有看到要找的東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You didn't use the smoke, [Companion Name]?"
msgstr "你沒吸入那些煙霧嗎，[Companion Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I will if I need to... but..."
msgstr "有必要的話，我會的……不過……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd really rather not."
msgstr "我實在不太想。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's understandable, I'm sorry, I didn't think about..."
msgstr "能理解。對不起，我沒想到……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's okay, really."
msgstr "沒關係，真的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I saw a building out in the slums. There were... probably hundreds just like it. I'm sorry, but that's all I got."
msgstr "我看見貧民窟裡有間房子。那樣的房子……大概有幾百間。抱歉，我只看到了這些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's okay. The Sightsmoke shows you... whatever you need to see. Era would know how to explain it better."
msgstr "沒事。視覺之煙會讓你看見……你需要看見的東西。艾拉比我會解釋。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But don't worry, I saw the path to the area. Just point out if you can, okay?"
msgstr "不過別擔心，我看到了去那一帶的路。到時候認出來了，就指給我看，好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The three of you set off, leaving the burned building behind. Talm leads you through the city with such ease and purpose you get the feeling he's been here a long, long, time. As you travel, the people you see become less friendly, and more dirty. Desperate. The slums were doubtlessly going to be here, like any other large city, but to see them up close was a staunch difference to when you first arrived in the capitol a few weeks ago.\n\nRougher looking folks give you a large berth when they lock eyes with Talm. The generally friendly man now walks with murderous intent, his bow now set aside for a longsword and shield that he carries openly. He looks back to you frequently, making sure you're looking out for the shack as diligently as he'd hope for. And sure enough, you see it. The crescent shaped by the door - just like in your vision - is so loud to your eyes, you almost don't understand how [Companion Name] and Talm don't see it.\n\nYou point it out, and without a word, Talm approaches the door and sends it off its hinges with a startlingly powerful kick. You eye [Companion Name], who charges in right behind him. Swords clash almost immediately."
msgstr "你們三個動身，把燒燬的房子留在身後。塔爾姆帶著你們穿過城市，熟門熟路，連半點猶豫都沒有。你感覺，他在這裡一定住了很久。越往前走，遇到的人就越不友善，身上也越髒。眼裡滿是絕望。和其他大城市一樣，這裡當然也會有貧民窟。可真走進來，親眼看到這一切，和幾周前剛到都城時的感覺簡直天差地別。\n\n那些看著不好惹的人，一對上塔爾姆的眼睛，便遠遠讓開。這個平日裡和氣的人，此刻渾身都是殺氣。他已經收起弓，明晃晃地拿著長劍和盾牌往前走。他頻頻回頭看你，確認你還在認真尋找那間小屋。果然，你看見了。門旁的月牙和幻象裡一模一樣。它在你眼裡醒目得不得了，你幾乎不明白，[Companion Name]和塔爾姆怎麼會看不見。\n\n你指了指。塔爾姆一聲不吭地走上前，一腳踹開了門，力道大得驚人，連門軸都被踹脫了。你看向[Companion Name]，她已經緊跟著他衝了進去。刀劍碰撞聲幾乎立刻響起。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just like you remember, all that time ago. Hooded figures with beasts you've never seen or heard of, clash with you and your companions. However, unlike back at Azamire, you don't fall. You drive them back into the building, where more of their beasts materialize from nothing, following a few quickly spoken words and a flash of light. They bare down on you, but you push them back, again and again, until the last of the hooded figures falls.\n\nYou worry about the commotion until you realize that... the guards likely don't make it out this far.\n\nYou search the building and find many of Era's things. Books and scrolls in a similar script to the gilded tome you took from the Abyssal Vault, and many others in different writing that seems to flow and move like water on the page. But the woman herself doesn't seem to be here. Talm slams his fist into a nearby table in anger, splintering the wood.\n\nYou look to the man, who hardly seems to notice the few small cuts he took to his arms and side. He doesn't look back to you as he reaches a hand out to one of the dead figures. Their body begins to contort, cracking and lurching with sickening jolts, as the body seems to right itself once again. The man rises, standing on his feet once again despite several wounds that should have left him as nothing but a corpse.\n\n[Companion Name] says it before you can. Soulsmith. Talm turns to you both, finally snapping out of his pure drive to find his wife. He sputters out an apology, and promises to explain everything, he just needs a little time. He begs you to come back in just a little bit, if you can stomach it. [Companion Name] backs away slowly before pushing into you, bringing you both outside, leaving the man alone. "
msgstr "和你記憶裡，那場許久之前的災難一樣。戴著兜帽的人帶著你從未見過、甚至從未聽說過的牛羚，和你們廝殺起來。不過，這次和在阿扎米爾時不同。你沒有倒下。你把他們逼回屋內。幾句急促的咒語過後，光芒閃過，更多牛羚憑空出現。它們撲向你，可你一次又一次將它們擊退，直到最後一個戴兜帽的人倒下。\n\n你還在擔心鬧出這麼大動靜會不會惹來麻煩，隨即意識到……守護多半根本不會來這麼偏的地方。\n\n你搜查屋子，找到了不少艾拉的東西。有些書和卷軸上的文字，和你從深淵寶庫拿來的鑲金邊厚書很相似。另一些則用不同的文字寫成，字跡彷彿流水，在紙面上緩緩遊動。可艾拉本人似乎不在這裡。塔爾姆憤怒地一拳砸向旁邊的桌子，砸裂了木板。\n\n你看向他。他胳膊和腰側捱了幾下，留下幾道小傷口，可他似乎根本沒在意。他沒有回頭，只是向其中一具屍體伸出手。那具屍體開始扭曲，骨頭咔咔作響，伴著令人作嘔的抽搐，一點點重新挺了起來。那人站起身，再次用雙腳立在地上。可他身上有好幾處傷口，隨便哪一處都足以讓他死的透透的。\n\n[Companion Name]搶在你前面開了口。煉魂師。塔爾姆轉向你們，這才從一心尋找妻子的執念裡回過神來。他結結巴巴地道歉，保證會把一切解釋清楚，只求你們給他一點時間。他懇求你們，過一小會兒再回來，只要你們還受得了。[Companion Name]慢慢退後，隨後推著你一起出了門，把他獨自留在屋裡。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Starlit Sky"
msgstr "星蝕滿天"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm has revealed himself to have some form of control over the dead, just like the Soulsmiths who burned your home. While he may hold no love for them after the kidnapping of Era, he has a lot to explain. Quickly."
msgstr "塔爾姆顯露出了某種操縱死人的能力，和燒燬你們家園的煉魂師一樣。艾拉被擄走後，他或許確實恨透了他們。但他還有一大堆事情需要解釋。越快越好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] and you are still reeling from Talm's reveal. What is he? What'd he do to that Soulsmith? If he has the same powers as them, why is he against them? The two of you bounce questions off one another in an endless, confusing jumble of words until you realize you have none of the answers, and can hardly even begin to guess.\n\nThere's only one way to learn. You both enter the shoddy hut on the edge of Melvor's slums, weapons in hand, and find Talm right where you left him. His hands are covered in blood as he seems to be patching the least damaged clothes of the hooded figures together, piling them on top of the... walking corpse until it resembles a living person. Talm seems almost surprised to see you again, manages a few attempts of pleading his allegiance, but then sucks in a deep breath and just... tells you to ask away."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]還沒從塔爾姆剛才露的那一手裡緩過來。他到底是什麼人？他對那個煉魂師做了什麼？如果他和他們有一樣的力量，又為什麼要與他們為敵？你們倆你一言我一語，越說越亂，問題卻一個接一個。直到最後才目擊，誰也答不上來，連猜都無從猜起。\n\n想弄清楚，只有一個辦法。你們拿著武器，重新走進梅爾沃貧民窟邊緣那間破屋。塔爾姆還在原來的地方。他雙手沾滿鮮血，似乎正把那些兜帽人身上破損較少的衣服拼湊起來，一層層套在那具……行屍身上，直到它看起來像個活人。塔爾姆看見你們回來，似乎還有些意外。他試著解釋了幾句，想讓你們相信他是自己人，隨後深吸一口氣，只說……想問什麼，就問吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why'd you turn on the Soulsmiths?"
msgstr "你為什麼背叛煉魂師？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... I didn't turn on them, I've never been on. I'm a Summoner. A very old one, at that."
msgstr "我……我沒背叛他們。我從來就不是他們的人。我是個召喚師。而且，已經活了很久。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My clan has... had, similar powers to this upstart band of wannabes."
msgstr "我的氏族有……曾經有過和這幫剛冒頭的半吊子相似的力量。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The things we could do back in the day... The Soulsmiths don't even come close. Yet."
msgstr "想當年，我們能做到的那些事……煉魂師還差得遠。至少現在是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you evil?"
msgstr "你是壞人嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've been called devilish. And I am currently enthralling the corpse of my enemy to take me to my kidnapped wife."
msgstr "倒是有人說過我不是個好東西。而且，我眼下確實正在操縱敵人的屍體，讓他帶我去找被綁走的妻子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But, for the intention of your question, no. I'm not."
msgstr "不過，我知道你真正想問什麼。不是，我不是壞人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If anything, I'm rather aligned against the Soulsmiths, and most who seek to use Summoning, for that matter."
msgstr "真要說起來，我反對煉魂師。其實，大多數想動用召喚術的人，我都反對。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You said you're old. How old?"
msgstr "你說自己活了很久。到底多久？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I was around before... this capitol. And the one before it. Era too."
msgstr "這座都城還沒建起來的時候……我就在了。上一座也是。艾拉也一樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How?"
msgstr "怎麼做到的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What I, and the clan you know as the Soulsmiths use, is a form of magic called Summoning. You've likely heard bits and pieces of it since you started your journey."
msgstr "我，還有你們所說的煉魂師一族，使用的都是一種叫作召喚術的魔法。你們踏上旅途以來，應該零零碎碎聽說過一些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Summoning is broken into many different disciplines. My clan is gone, but our discipline, clearly, is not."
msgstr "召喚術分成很多不同的流派。我的氏族已經不在了，可顯然，我們這一派的法術還在流傳。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What they use is an offshoot of what I use. My people were called Lifebinders. People after us will call it something else."
msgstr "他們用的，是我這一派的分支。我的族人被稱為生命縛誓者。以後的人，可能又會換個叫法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can more-or-less reverse the effects of aging, and I've done so for myself and Era for many... many years."
msgstr "我基本上能逆轉衰老。這麼多……這麼多年來，我一直在給自己和艾拉用這種法術。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's the book we got from the Abyssal Vault?"
msgstr "我們從深淵寶庫拿來的，到底是什麼書？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well it's..."
msgstr "這個嘛……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Go on then."
msgstr "說啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Promise not to be mad?"
msgstr "先保證不生氣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...sure?"
msgstr "……行？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You raided one of the most secure locations in the capitol for... what's basically a children's history book."
msgstr "你們闖進都城戒備最森嚴的地方之一，拿回來的……基本上就是一本給小孩子看的歷史書。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Next question. Can you use that summoning magic on yourself? Because you might need to."
msgstr "下一個問題。你那召喚術能用在自己身上嗎？因為你可能馬上就用得著了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You clearly knew parts of what our visions were going to be. You didn't think to tell us THAT?"
msgstr "你明明提前知道，我們會在幻象裡看到些什麼。就沒想著把這事也告訴我們？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's an IMPORTANT children's history book!"
msgstr "這是一本很重要的兒童歷史書！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It details one of the most defining events in our world's history... I... literally cannot tell you what, though. The few of us from... Those times, are magically bound against it."
msgstr "它詳細記載了一件對我們這個世界影響極其深遠的大事……不過，我……真的沒法告訴你們是哪一件。我們這幾個從……那個年代活下來的人，都受了魔法束縛，不能說。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Era can help you with reading it more than I can, but suffice to say, if you want to learn about the Soulsmiths and what they want to do, this book is as good as you're going to get for now."
msgstr "要讀懂這本書，艾拉比我更能幫上忙。不過，你們只要知道，如果想了解煉魂師，還有他們到底想幹什麼，眼下沒有比這本書更好的線索了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Why us? For... all of this."
msgstr "……為什麼是我們？為什麼……這些事都落到我們頭上？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Era's visions may have holes, and may be hard to interpret at times, but they're never wrong."
msgstr "艾拉看到的幻象或許不完整，有時候也很難解讀，但從來不會錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "From what I've seen... I needed to help you. The whole thing with the archery contest, meeting you two... It wasn't an accident."
msgstr "從我看到的情況來說……我得幫你們。射箭比賽的事，還有認識你們兩個……都不是巧合。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, I didn't expect you to try and get yourself shot, but beyond that, all planned out. For what, I cannot say."
msgstr "當然，我沒料到你會差點讓人射上一箭。除此之外，都安排好了。至於為什麼，我不能說。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Right. Magic binding."
msgstr "好吧。魔法束縛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now. This thrall is about as pretty as I can make him. Shall we see if he can take us to Era?"
msgstr "好了。這具屍僕，我也只能收拾成這樣了。看看他能不能帶我們找到艾拉吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You caught [Companion Name]'s flinch when Talm said that Era's visions are never wrong. But why? What'd she see? You've tried asking, gently, over the last couple of weeks, but you've hardly gotten anything other than it being 'bad'.\n\nTalm utters a command in a language you cannot understand to the thrall, and it shutters for a moment, before walking off at a leisurely pace. The three of you follow close behind until you get to the main gates of the capitol. You flinch as you approach the guards and Talm pulls the thrall between you and him. He takes on a drunken sway and starts slurring gibberish as the guard looks your party over. The woman pinches her nose and remarks that you 'smell like death' and waves you off.\n\nYou do your best to wipe off the thrall's blood that leaked through his pilfered robes once you're out of eyeshot, cursing quietly to yourself. The thrall leads you far out of town and out into the countryside. Once you hit the treeline of a nearby forest, Talm curses and releases his command of the thrall, who slumps to the ground. He says he knows where they went.\n\nYou're lead to a large stone tower that blends well into the rocky landscape. It once had a large wooden door that now lays splintered in a dozen large chunks on the ground. Talm exclaims that they attacked his 'real' home, and that the security system was set off."
msgstr "塔爾姆說艾拉的幻象從不會錯時，你注意到[Companion Name]瑟縮了一下。為什麼？她到底看到了什麼？過去幾周，你也試著小心地問過幾次，可除了「很糟糕」，幾乎什麼也沒問出來。\n\n塔爾姆用你聽不懂的語言，對屍僕下了道命令。它抖了一下，隨後不緊不慢地走了出去。你們三個緊跟其後，一直來到都城的大門前。快走到守護面前時，你不由得縮了一下。塔爾姆把屍僕拉到你和他中間。他裝出一副醉醺醺的樣子，搖搖晃晃，嘴裡含糊地胡言亂語，任由守護打量你們。女守護捏著鼻子，嫌你們「一股死人味」，揮手趕你們走了。\n\n離開守護的視線後，你一邊低聲咒罵，一邊盡力擦掉沾到身上的血。那些血從屍僕偷來的袍子裡滲了出來。屍僕帶著你們遠離城鎮，走進鄉野。走到附近一片森林的邊緣時，塔爾姆罵了一聲，解除了對屍僕的控制。它頓時癱倒在地。他說，他知道他們去哪兒了。\n\n他帶著你們來到一座巨大的石塔前。塔身藏在岩石遍佈的地形中，幾乎融為一體。這裡原本有扇巨大的木門，如今卻碎成十幾大塊，散落在地。塔爾姆驚呼，他們襲擊了他「真正的家」，還觸發了防禦機關。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Having dodged your way through an impressive array of traps, you slowly made it up to the tower's uppermost floor. Era lays in a pool of blood at the foot of a large arcane telescope, made of a metal you can't even begin to place."
msgstr "一路躲過一連串令人咋舌的陷阱後，你們慢慢登上了石塔的頂層。艾拉倒在一架巨大的魔法望遠鏡下，身下滿是鮮血。那架望遠鏡是金屬製的，可用的是什麼金屬，你完全認不出來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...None of you will live to regret this."
msgstr "……我會讓你們悔不當初。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seeing Era on the ground, Talm wordlessly launches himself against the group of Soulsmiths occupying the floor, not seeming to pay any mind to whether or not you and [Companion Name] join him. Of course, you follow right behind. Soulsmiths deserve no quarter."
msgstr "看見倒在地上的艾拉，塔爾姆一言不發，直撲佔據這一層的煉魂師，似乎根本沒在意你和[Companion Name]會不會跟上。當然，你們緊隨其後。對煉魂師，沒必要留情。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What does Era wish for us to see?"
msgstr "艾拉想讓我們看什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh... oh my..."
msgstr "天啊……這……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You lower your weapon as your last opponent falls, with [Companion Name] finishing up right after you. Talm pushes a Soulsmith against the wall of the ringed tower and the man brings his hands up in fear. He chokes out a plea for his life before Talm rams his blade into the man's chest and into the stone behind him, pinning him to the wall.\n\nThe three of you breathe silently, taking in the sight around you before... a slight cough sounds from over by the telescope. Talm leaves his weapon in the wall and runs over to his wife's body, immediately reaching out to perform... some form of magic on her, like he did with the man back in the shack. You and [Companion Name] turn away from them, leaving the couple to their privacy, or as much as they can have, considering the circumstances."
msgstr "最後一個對手倒下，你放下了武器。[Companion Name]也緊接著解決了她那邊的敵人。塔爾姆把一個煉魂師逼到圓塔的牆邊，那人驚恐地舉起雙手。他剛哽咽著開口求饒，塔爾姆的劍便刺穿了他的胸膛，又刺進背後的石牆，將他釘在牆上。\n\n你們三個一時無言，喘著氣，望著眼前的一切。忽然……望遠鏡那邊傳來一聲輕咳。塔爾姆連劍也顧不上拔，徑直跑向妻子，立刻伸出手，對她施展……某種魔法，就像剛才在小屋裡對那具屍體做的一樣。你和[Companion Name]轉過身，儘量給這對夫妻留點獨處的空間。至少，這種情況下能留多少算多少。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So... me..."
msgstr "真……亂……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What was that, my love?"
msgstr "你說什麼，親愛的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Messy... You have all... Gotten the place so bloody..."
msgstr "好亂……你們幾個……把這裡弄得到處都是血……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... Yes. Sorry."
msgstr "我……是。對不起。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hur... hurry up."
msgstr "快……快點。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sorry dear."
msgstr "抱歉，親愛的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] and you look at each other, grimacing a bit as the following silence is punctuated by the sounds of tearing flesh and sickening gurgles. You feel a bit faint listening to Talm work on his... not dead wife. If one can reverse the effects of aging then... perhaps mending wounds falls under that domain as well. You see [Companion Name] shoot a glance in their direction then quickly avert her eyes, clutching her mouth after a quiet heave. You think better of it.\n\nYou nearly leap out of your skin when you feel a couple of light taps on your shoulder and come face to face with the incredibly pale visage of Era. Her wounds stitched together, the only remnant of them being the tears in dress from which any number of weapons pieced her. \n\nShe welcomes you to her home and starts to apologize for the mess, before then frowning, realizing your part in its current state. The fact that she was on death's door just moments ago seemingly not bothering her in the slightest. If they're truly as old as Talm claims, you wonder how many times someone could have crossed a similar scene.\n\nEra gestures for [Companion Name] and has Talm bring a chair over, to which she practically slumps in. She runs her hands over the book with fondness, then gives a few directions for adjustmenting telescope. She invites the both of you to use it."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]面面相覷，不由得皺起臉。隨後的寂靜裡，不時傳來血肉撕裂聲，還有令人反胃的咕嚕聲。聽著塔爾姆給他那位……還活著的妻子療傷，你有點頭暈。既然連衰老都能逆轉，那……治好傷口，或許也在這種法術的能力範圍內。你看見[Companion Name]往那邊瞥了一眼，隨即趕緊移開目光，捂著嘴，低低乾嘔了一聲。你決定還是別看了。\n\n肩膀忽然被輕輕拍了兩下，你差點嚇得跳起來。一回頭，正對上艾拉蒼白得嚇人的臉。她的傷口已經癒合，只剩裙子上被各種武器刺破的口子，還能看出她剛才傷得有多重。\n\n她歡迎你們來家裡做客，剛要為屋裡的凌亂道歉，又皺起眉頭，想起來你們也出了一份力。至於幾分鐘前還在鬼門關前轉悠這件事，她似乎一點也沒放在心上。如果他們真像塔爾姆說的那麼長壽，你不禁好奇，這樣的場面，他們究竟經歷過多少次。\n\n艾拉朝[Companion Name]示意，又讓塔爾姆搬來一張椅子，整個人幾乎癱了進去。她愛惜地撫過書頁，又告訴你們該怎麼調整望遠鏡。隨後，她請你們兩個都來看看。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars stretch out before you, incalculable in number. As you peer up at them through Era's telescope, they twist and turn in so many beautiful arrays and patterns you almost want to weep. As you try to commit them to memory, they dance ever so carefully out of reach again and again. You take breaks when the floor beneath you sways like the gentle rocking of a ship at sea. [Companion Name] takes your place in these bits of downtime. You chat here and there with Era and Talm, who both look at you with a degree of fondness that comes off as... almost warm, though the feeling almost feels misplaced.\n\nThe sight is punctuated by that of Talm's new thralls, the broken bodies of the Soulsmiths being twisted to work on... repairs and cleanup. The sight is as macabre as it is absurd. A pair of thralls mop up after one another in a circle, each trying to clean the trailing blood from their comrade. You shudder at the sight. When one of the thralls tries to remove Talm's sword from the wall and ends up tearing its arm out of its socket. \n\nYou nearly faint. Talm curses softly, and Era simply chuckles. You make note to never get on either of their bad sides. Ever. You know the Soulsmiths are truly wretched and you'd never spill a tear over them, but the level of... flippance that Era and Talm have at seeing their undead bodies lerch about feels unnerving, at least for now.\n\nYou rest and recuperate in their home, taking turns with [Companion Name], peering through the telescope and trying to glean insight from the stars. Once the thralls were disposed of and the traps turned off, the tower really was nice. Though, some of the things you saw may sit with you for a long while."
msgstr "星辰在你眼前鋪展開來，多得數也數不清。透過艾拉的望遠鏡仰望星空，群星流轉，交織出無數美麗的圖案，幾乎讓你想落淚。可每當你想把它們記住，它們便輕巧地舞開，一次又一次，怎麼也抓不住。腳下的地板開始搖晃，彷彿置身海上輕輕搖盪的船隻。這時你便歇一會兒，換[Companion Name]來看。你們時不時和艾拉、塔爾姆聊上幾句。兩人看著你們的眼神帶著幾分喜愛，幾乎稱得上……溫暖，只是這份溫暖總讓你覺得有點不合時宜。\n\n畢竟，旁邊還有塔爾姆新收的屍僕。那些煉魂師殘破的身體被驅使著扭動起來，忙著……修繕和打掃。這場面既瘮人，又荒唐。兩具屍僕繞著圈，一個跟著另一個拖地，都在擦對方一路淌下來的血。看得你直打寒戰。其中一具屍僕想把塔爾姆的劍從牆上拔出來，結果把自己的胳膊從肩頭扯了下來。\n\n你差點暈過去。塔爾姆低低罵了一聲，艾拉只是輕笑。你默默提醒自己，以後絕對別惹這兩個人。絕對。你知道煉魂師壞透了，也絕不會為他們掉一滴眼淚。可看著他們死後的身體踉踉蹌蹌地走來走去，艾拉和塔爾姆卻如此……不當回事，還是讓你心裡發毛。至少現在是這樣。\n\n你們留在他們家休息調養。你和[Companion Name]輪流使用望遠鏡，想從星辰中看出些門道。等屍僕被處理掉，陷阱也都關了，這座塔其實還挺不錯。不過，有些畫面，你恐怕很久都忘不掉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Cold Plunge"
msgstr "寒地探秘"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stars have finally shown you what you needed to see. A lone cold point, deep within the mountain range west of the capitol. That is your next target."
msgstr "群星終於為你指明瞭方向。都城西邊的群山深處，有一處孤零零的寒冷所在。那就是你的下一個目的地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Melting alone won't do it. We'll need to hack away at the ice, too."
msgstr "光把冰融化還不行。還得動手鑿。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think I can just about crack the door open."
msgstr "我看應該能把門撬開一道縫了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your head feels fuzzy, at each breath - if you even are still breathing anymore - feels shaky and labored. You've grown far more accustomed to Era's telescope, but it still makes you feel as if something within your very being is shifting after long enough. You can practice astrology without it, but as you've learned through numerous conversations, Era's telescope is special. While Talm's summoning domain is Soul, Era's is knowledge and divination. You can't even begin to imagine what kind of creatures she can bring forth. The smoke and telescope are just two tools that allow her to practice.\n\nAnd now you have done so as well. Similarly to how you felt with the Sightsmoke, you feel as if you raise from the tower and pass through its walls. You grasp for the shingled roof, but your hands pass through it without so much as grazing it. You careen up into the sky, far beyond the tower and up amongst the clouds. Your body rights itself, and you feel yourself slingshot towards the Broken Pass, then turn north, to an inlet in the mountains covered with frost and snow. As you shoot towards a stone door carved into the cliffside, you close your eyes... and end up back on the floor of the tower.\n\nYou are covered in ice, and your teeth chatter violently, but you feel so... so warm."
msgstr "你腦子裡昏昏沉沉，每次呼吸都又費力又不穩，如果你現在還在呼吸的話。你已經漸漸習慣使用艾拉的望遠鏡，可看得久了，還是會覺得身體深處有什麼東西在悄悄變化。不用它也能研習占星。不過，聊過這麼多次，你已經知道，艾拉的望遠鏡很不一般。塔爾姆的召喚術專攻靈魂，艾拉則擅長知識和占卜。你實在想象不出，她能召喚出什麼樣的生物。煙霧和望遠鏡，只是她施展這門法術的兩種工具。\n\n如今，你也學著用上了。和吸入視覺之煙時一樣，你感覺自己從塔裡飄了起來，穿過了牆壁。你伸手想抓住鋪著木瓦的屋頂，手卻直接穿了過去，連碰都沒碰到。你猛地衝上天空，將石塔遠遠甩在下方，一頭扎進雲間。身體重新穩住，你感覺自己像被彈弓射了出去，直奔破裂山口，隨後轉向北方，飛向群山中一處覆滿霜雪的凹地。眼看就要撞上崖壁鑿出的石門，你閉上眼睛……再睜眼時，人已經回到了石塔的地板上。\n\n你渾身結滿了冰，牙齒抖得直打架，卻覺得好暖……好暖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Welcome back, child."
msgstr "回來了，孩子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Player Name]! Are you okay? You were here, there was a flash of light, and now you're..."
msgstr "[Player Name]！你沒事吧？你剛才還好好待在這兒，忽然閃了一道光，現在就……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A block of ice?"
msgstr "變成冰塊了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...yeah."
msgstr "……對。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know where we need to go."
msgstr "我知道該去哪兒了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't know why we need to go there, but I know we do."
msgstr "雖然還不知道為什麼非去不可，但我知道，咱們得去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You think we'll finally be able to read our children's book if we go risk our lives somewhere?"
msgstr "你的意思是，再找個地方拼一回命，就能看懂那本兒童讀物了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think so. And... so much more, possibly. You interested?"
msgstr "應該是吧。而且……說不定還能弄明白更多事。想去嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course I am!"
msgstr "那還用說！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You'll finally be leaving us behind, hm?"
msgstr "終於要丟下我們，自己走了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aw. Are you feeling sentimental, dear?"
msgstr "哎呀。捨不得啦，親愛的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, they did help me win that competition."
msgstr "畢竟，他們可是幫我贏了那場比賽。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wasn't your win already foretold?"
msgstr "你會贏，不是早就預見到了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well yes, but it was foretold that I'd win because you two helped!"
msgstr "是啊，可預見到的就是你們兩個幫我贏啊！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And look at us now."
msgstr "結果現在倒好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Was there something in those visions about... using a thrall to serve me breakfast in bed?"
msgstr "那些幻象裡，有沒有說你會……派具屍僕把早飯端到我床邊？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, that was a Talm original."
msgstr "沒有，那是塔爾姆自己的主意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know you two are rather squeamish, but you'll be seeing a lot more death before you're through this all."
msgstr "我知道你們兩個看不慣這些。不過，等這一切結束之前，你們還會見到更多死人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't mind corpses, or even making a few myself. But when they show up with a platter of bacon, I might just lose my appetite."
msgstr "屍體我倒不怕，真要動手殺幾個也沒什麼。可它們要是端著一盤培根走過來，我大概就吃不下了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Era and Talm laugh at that, while you and [Companion Name] may feel a bit more genuinely about the situation. Nevertheless, your goodbyes are heartfelt. The two of them wish you well on your travels, and you get the feeling that this is the last of them you'll see for quite some time.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] head west, stopping in a small town by the name of Riverbend to resupply, then make the trek north, to what the locals call Rimeriver Crevice. The place is an uncharacteristically cold bit of land that stretches far into the mountains with 'not much of note'.\n\nYou are glad you stocked up, as green, grassy hillocks turn to freezing glaciers and rolling snow dunes over the course of hours. There's doubtlessly something unnatural about the weather, as even you can tell that the sleet is magically enhanced. Each flake seems to chill you to the bone. Your bundled forms eventually reach the doorway you saw, etched into the cliffside, shielded from the weather... mostly. The door itself has immense braziers on either side, and seems to be frozen shut. You wager a guess that it needs to be thawed."
msgstr "艾拉和塔爾姆聽得笑了起來。不過，你和[Companion Name]這話可不全是在開玩笑。儘管如此，到了分別的時候，你們還是有些不捨。兩人祝你們一路平安。你隱隱覺得，這一別，恐怕很久都見不到他們了。\n\n你和[Companion Name]一路向西，在一個叫河灣鎮的地方補充物資，隨後跋涉北上，前往當地人所說的霜河裂縫。那裡冷得反常，一直延伸到群山深處。按當地人的說法，「沒什麼好看的」。\n\n才走了幾個小時，滿眼翠綠的小山丘便變成了冰川和連綿的雪丘。你慶幸自己備足了物資。這天氣顯然不正常。連你都看得出來，魔法讓這裡的雨雪變得更加兇猛。每一片落在身上，那股寒冷幾乎要鑽進你的骨頭裡。你們裹得嚴嚴實實，終於來到幻象裡的那扇門前。門開在崖壁上，好歹能擋住……大部分風雪。門兩旁各有一座巨大的火盆，門本身似乎已經凍死了。看來，得先把冰化開。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good morning?"
msgstr "早上好？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good night."
msgstr "晚安。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The ice melts agonizingly slowly, but eventually, with some prodding with your pickaxes between the two stone doors, you're able to push your way inside. Inside the cave is comparatively balmy. The interior is well-furnished, but certainly abandoned. Many of the doorways along the single stone hall you travel are shut and bound by some form of magic that reminds you of the Abyssal Vault, but... much, much older. \n\nThe few rooms that are open seem to have once been living quarters, built more for capacity than for luxury. However, there's not a single hint of where anyone could have gone. No bodies. No messages.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] push further inside, to a room at the end of the hall that opens up into a large open cavern that seems naturally made. You walk up and bump [Companion Name] with your shoulder as you head deeper into the room."
msgstr "冰融得慢得讓人心焦。好在你們最後還是用鎬頭在兩扇石門之間撬出了一點空隙，總算推開門，擠了進去。比起外面，洞裡暖和多了。裡面的陳設一應俱全，不過，顯然早已無人居住。你們沿著唯一的石砌走廊前行。兩側大多數門都緊閉著，還被某種魔法封住。那魔法讓你想起深淵寶庫，只是……古老得多。\n\n少數敞著門的房間，以前似乎是住人的。從佈置來看，講究的是能多住幾個，舒不舒服倒在其次。可這裡的人去了哪裡，半點線索也沒有。沒有屍體。也沒有留言。\n\n你和[Companion Name]繼續深入，來到走廊盡頭的一間屋子。穿過那裡，眼前是一處寬闊的大洞窟，看起來像是天然形成的。往裡走時，你湊到[Companion Name]身邊，用肩膀輕輕撞了她一下。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It feels like it's been a bit, since it was just you and I, doing something for ourselves."
msgstr "好像很久沒有這樣了。就咱們兩個，做點自己的事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I would never have guessed we'd have gotten wrapped up in something so... much bigger than ourselves."
msgstr "真沒想到，會捲進這麼大一攤事裡……大得遠遠超出了咱們能管的範圍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Neither would I. But it's cool, travelling the world together, no? We always talked about how we wanted to."
msgstr "我也沒想到。不過，能一起到處闖闖，不也挺好嗎？咱們以前不是老唸叨著想出來走走？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe under different circumstances, but yeah. It's hard to think of just how much has happened in so little time."
msgstr "雖然和當時想的不太一樣，不過，也對。才過了這麼點時間，居然就發生了這麼多事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You can say that again. I missed this."
msgstr "可不是嘛。我還真想念這種感覺。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "When this is all over, let's do a bit of travelling under better circumstances, hm?"
msgstr "等這些事都結束了，咱們再好好出去玩一趟，怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd drink to that. Where would you want to go?"
msgstr "這話值得喝一杯。你想去哪兒？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Somewhere where it doesn't feel like something is going to eat me or stab me every couple of minutes. How about-"
msgstr "找個不用隔三差五就擔心被吃掉、被捅一刀的地方。那不如……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With that, a loud rumbling roar tears through the cavern and sends the both of you to your knees. You clamp your hands to your ears and turn your head up to see the call's source. A yeti. The shaggy beast lumbers over, its blue knuckles dragging across the floor as it seemingly wakes from a slumber that must have spanned countless years.\n\n[Companion Name] gives you one of her signature glares, as if your words brought the creature into being. So much for wishful thinking."
msgstr "話音未落，一聲雷鳴般的怒吼響徹洞窟，震得你們雙雙跪倒在地。你死死捂住耳朵，抬頭尋找聲音的來源。一隻雪人。渾身長毛的牛羚邁著沉重的步子走了過來，藍色的指節拖在地上，像是剛從一場不知持續了多少年的沉睡中醒來。\n\n[Companion Name]又拿她那熟悉的眼神瞪你，彷彿這東西是被你一句話說出來的。得，白日夢也該醒了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The beast staggers back with a cry as your blows connect with its hard flesh. It falls to the ground with a mighty crash, and slumps back against the cavern wall. It releases a breath and begins to... fade away to crystals of ice that melt shortly afterward. Whatever the beast was, it wasn't natural. As you begin to look over the murals etched and painted into the wall, you feel quite sure of that assumption.\n\nThe murals depict the group that once inhabited the cavern. Little blue figures of people living in a beautiful blue forest. Then... the forest burning due to some unknown red assailants riding on similarly colored creatures. After that, there are far fewer blue figures in a blackened forest. The numbers dwindle further and further with each section of wall. Until the blue figures leave the charred forest. The murals show them travelling far... very far. Almost half the cavern wall depicts them travelling from one place to another, in all manner of places. They settle for short periods of time, with each move always predicated by a clash with some new color of figure. Brown, grey, green, red, orange, and even a lighter color blue towards the end. These figures are accompanied by beasts. All drawn simply in nature, but clearly terrifying to those who lived here. You catch yourself wiping your eyes more than once as you spend over an hour trying to follow their story.\n\nFinally, in the last tenth of the wall, it shows the figures... finding what you presume to be this place. They find a book. They create their own creatures. The figures leave the wall and travel across the floor, to spires of ice that jut out from the ground, one nearly touching the ceiling.\n\nYou realize, the center of the the room looks... similar to a page of the book you cannot read. You lay it out and [Companion Name] holds the her lantern overhead as you trace out places that line up. Two pages of the book, when lined up with the central pillar of ice, resemble the eastern portion of the continent. And within that map, a shining tower lays just off the coast. Comparing it to current maps, it'd be far north of the capitol. Your next destination.\n\nYou spare a last glance to the figures on the ground, crowded around the spire of ice. It's the last of their journey, none left their last destination. You can only imagine what the spire represents, but it's a mystery for another time."
msgstr "你的攻擊落在牛羚堅硬的皮肉上。它痛吼一聲，踉蹌著往後退。隨後，它轟然倒地，癱靠在洞壁上。它吐出一口氣，身體開始……散成冰晶，沒多久，那些冰晶也融化了。不管這東西到底是什麼，都不是自然生長出來的。你開始檢視洞壁上雕刻、繪製的壁畫，越看，越覺得自己的猜測沒錯。\n\n壁畫講的是曾經住在這裡的那群人。小小的藍色人影，生活在一片美麗的藍色森林裡。接著……一群來歷不明的紅色人影，騎著同樣顏色的生物襲來，森林燃起了大火。再往後，森林只剩一片焦黑，藍色人影也少了許多。每看過一段壁畫，人影就更少一些。最後，藍色人影離開了燒焦的森林。壁畫裡，他們走了很……遠。幾乎半面洞壁，都在畫他們從一個地方輾轉到另一個地方，什麼樣的地方都有。每到一處，他們只能短暫停留。每次又要離開，都是因為和一種新顏色的人影起了衝突。棕色、灰色、綠色、紅色、橙色，到了後面，甚至還有淺一些的藍色。那些人影身邊，都有牛羚相伴。畫得雖然簡單，卻看得出來，對曾經住在這裡的人來說，那些牛羚都可怕極了。你花了一個多小時，沿著壁畫讀他們的故事。回過神來，才目擊自己已經抹了好幾次眼睛。\n\n終於，在最後那一小段，大約只佔整面壁畫的十分之一，畫裡的人們……找到了一處地方。你猜，就是這裡。他們找到了一本書。他們創造出了自己的生物。那些人影從牆上延伸到地面，一直通向從地裡突起的冰柱，其中一根幾乎頂到了洞頂。\n\n你忽然目擊，洞窟中央的版面配置……很像那本讀不懂的書裡的某一頁。你攤開書，[Companion Name]舉高燈籠，讓你逐一比對相互吻合的地方。書裡的兩頁圖畫，和中央的冰柱對照起來，勾勒出的正是大陸東部。在那幅地圖上，離海岸不遠的地方，立著一座閃閃發光的高塔。拿現在的地圖一比，它應該在都城很遠的北邊。下一個目的地找到了。\n\n你最後看了一眼地面上的人影。他們密密地圍在冰柱四周。旅途到這裡便結束了。再沒有人離開這最後的落腳處。冰柱代表什麼，你也只能猜測。不過，這個謎只能留待以後再解。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ship Shape"
msgstr "修船出海"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "In their quest to find the shining tower shown to them by the history book stolen from the Ivory Athenaeum, [Player Name] and [Companion Name] find themselves travelling far north of the capitol, to a lonely little fishing village tucked into the coast."
msgstr "為了找到從象牙藏書院偷來的歷史書上那座閃亮高塔，[Player Name]和[Companion Name]一路遠赴都城以北，來到海岸邊一個偏僻的小漁村。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Head inland enough, should be able to grow something."
msgstr "往內陸多走一段，應該能種點東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That should be enough. Let's see our vessel."
msgstr "這些應該夠了。去看看咱們的船吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Having made it to Tidebreak, PC seek the help of an young fisherman, who is willing to trade his boat in exchange for helping him change his livelihood since he cannot stand the sea or fish. PC help him plant fields of crops (Farming) and he trades them his boat, a horrendously trashed little dingy. PC fix it up, with Player creating a new keel for it to withstand the rocks (Smithing), along with a sail (Crafting). (3 Steps)\n\nAn old cobbled road takes you and your companion far north, just outside of a town by the name of Tidebreak. The population is said to be rather reclusively, mostly prefering to keep to their own and subsist on what they can fish up. The sea breeze goes from refreshing to... almost sour the further north you get. You get why not many people decided to live up this way, and question the motives of those that do. You push on ahead as the sun begins to set.\n\nThe town itself is... quaint. You feel eyes on you everywhere you go, and kids are pulled inside ahead of your path. You find yourself on the coast, where a lone young man works a length of rope, hardly sparing you a glance. Another man, who almost seems like he could be his brother, looks on and even gives you a smile, which you almost find weirder. You try your chances with the rope worker first."
msgstr "抵達破浪鎮後，PC向一名年輕漁夫求助。他受夠了大海和魚，願意用自己的船，換取玩家幫他改行謀生。PC幫他種了幾片田地（農耕），他則把自己的船交給他們，那是一條破得不成樣子的小艇。PC著手修船，打造了一根新龍骨，讓船能經得住礁石磕碰（鍛造），又做了一面船帆（工藝）。（3個步驟）\n\n一條古老的石鋪路帶著你和同伴一路北上，來到一座叫破浪鎮的小鎮外。聽說這裡的人不太愛與外界來往，大多隻願和自己人打交道，靠出海打撈、捕魚過活。越往北走，原本清爽的海風裡，越是帶著一股……近乎酸腐的味道。你算是明白為什麼沒多少人願意住在這邊了。至於還住在這裡的那些人，你倒想問問，他們到底圖什麼。太陽漸漸落下，你們繼續往前走。\n\n小鎮本身……倒挺古樸。可走到哪兒，你都覺得有人盯著自己。還沒走近，路上的孩子就被大人拉回了屋裡。你們來到海之邊緣。一個年輕人正擺弄著一截繩子，幾乎沒抬頭看你們。另一個男人在旁邊看著，兩人長得像是兄弟。他甚至還衝你們笑了笑，反倒讓你覺得更奇怪了。你決定先找擺弄繩子的那個碰碰運氣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A pleasure."
msgstr "幸會。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aye. I'm sure."
msgstr "對。確實。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You've got a lovely little town here, might I say."
msgstr "你們這小鎮還真不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ya' might, if ya' blind."
msgstr "那你怕是眼神不太好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fortunate enough to still have my vision..."
msgstr "還好，我眼神還行……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Friendly lot, you are, hm?"
msgstr "你們這兒的人可真熱情啊？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, leave the poor boy be. Joshry's always grumpy when he gets shown up at the Hauling."
msgstr "行了，別為難這小子了。每次打撈會上被人比下去，喬什裡就這副臭脾氣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't not. "
msgstr "才沒有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes ya do, and the rest of 'em too."
msgstr "你就有，其他人也一個樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Shove off, Rommard."
msgstr "一邊去，羅馬德。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The what now?"
msgstr "什麼會？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Hauling. Weekly little get together when all us sailors show off whatever we managed to scrape off the ocean floor."
msgstr "打撈會。每週聚一聚，我們這些跑船的，都把從海底撈上來的東西拿出來亮亮相。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not to inner-esting less you's an academic."
msgstr "除非是做學問的，不然也沒什麼好看的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's why everyone here cares so much. Bunch of scholars, we are."
msgstr "所以這兒的人才這麼上心。我們可都是學者。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bet our findings will get added to that big ivory building in the capitol, soon enough. Should go take a look at it yourself someday, real purdy."
msgstr "用不了多久，我們的目擊準能送進都城那棟象牙色的大樓。哪天你也該去看看，漂亮得很。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You could say we're... familiar."
msgstr "那地方嘛……我們還挺熟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How bout yourself, stranger?"
msgstr "你呢，這位朋友？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, I'm quite over it all, myself. No one here seems to care much about pulling up ten corpses for every half rusted spoon they can dredge out of the ocean."
msgstr "我啊，早就受夠這些破事了。為了撈半把生鏽的勺子，先拖上來十具屍體，這裡的人居然誰都不在乎。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No one but yours truly. Can't stand it."
msgstr "除了我。我是真受不了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Then why do you?"
msgstr "那為什麼還幹？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tidebreak look like a place where we've got an abundance of career diversity?"
msgstr "瞧破浪鎮這模樣，像是有一大堆活兒任我們挑嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everyone that's been here has been doing what they do for more years than ol' Josh and I put together."
msgstr "這裡的人幹現在這行的年頭，比我和老喬加起來的歲數都長。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Opening comes up when they kick the bucket."
msgstr "等他們兩腿一蹬，才輪得到別人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fancy making some gold by ferrying us around, then?"
msgstr "那載我們一程，賺點金幣，怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What, you two come here for a bita sightseeing?"
msgstr "怎麼，你們兩個是來遊山玩水的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Close. We want to go to the island way off the coast."
msgstr "差不多吧。我們想去遠海的那座島。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...oh. We don't go other there. Gloomstone's a ba-"
msgstr "……哦。那邊我們可不去。幽暗之石可不是什麼好……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now now now, I'm sure our friends here are well aware of the risks."
msgstr "哎哎哎，我相信兩位朋友早就知道有風險了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just a bit of choppy water n' the like, of course. Couple beasties if you're tasty. Nothin' they can't handle."
msgstr "無非就是水急浪大之類的，當然啦。沒準還有幾隻小牛羚，想拿你們打打牙祭。都難不倒他們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But tell you what. You can have my boat, if you do me a lil' favor."
msgstr "不過，這樣吧。幫我個小忙，我的船就歸你們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rommard goes into detail about grand visions for the town. All the little things he wants to do to 'give back'. Neither you nor [Companion Name] buy it for a second, of course, but you feel as though the man in front of you is the best option you'll get. As dire as that sounds.\n\nHis ire for having to fish out Gods know what from the sea seems true, as he'd rather work the land and earn his keep that way. Only issue, Tidebreak has never bothered trying to trade for seeds. 'The sea will provide' is something you hear around, often.'"
msgstr "羅馬德滔滔不絕地說起他對小鎮的宏偉打算。還有他想為「回報鄉親」做的那些小事。當然，你和[Companion Name]一個字都不信。但眼前這個人，恐怕已經是你們能找到的最佳人選了。雖然這話聽著就讓人心涼。\n\n不過，他說自己受夠了從海里撈那些鬼知道是什麼的東西，這點倒像是真的。他更願意種種地，靠這個養活自己。唯一的問題是，破浪鎮從來就沒想過要買種子。「大海自會養活我們。」這句話，你在這裡聽到了好幾遍。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll need to make something that'll help it weather the rocky shore."
msgstr "得做點東西，讓它能經得住岸邊礁石磕碰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This ought to do it. Let's see how [Companion Name] is coming along."
msgstr "這下應該行了。看看[Companion Name]那邊怎麼樣了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] and you plant row after row of crops, then run through the details of crop rotations and how to care for seedlings. To his credit, Rommard does actually pay attention and even takes some pretty extensive notes. He does leave the two of you do actually do all the work, though.\n\nOnce you're done, Rommard jumps upright and brings you back over to the docks, detailing how all deals are final, and that his boat's a bit of a fixer-upper, but will get you to the island. Probably.\n\nThe only 'boat' left on the docks could be mistaken for a wreck that someone tethered to the pier. Rommard presents it with a flourish, then turns on his heel, setting off into town. He calls out to you one last time."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]一排排地種好莊稼，又仔細講了該怎麼輪作，怎麼照料幼苗。還算羅馬德有點良心，聽得確實認真，甚至記了不少筆記。不過，動手幹活的，自始至終還是你們兩個。\n\n你們一忙完，羅馬德就一躍而起，帶著你們回到碼頭。一路上，他反覆強調交易敲定了就不能反悔，還說他的船是得修修，但肯定能把你們送到島上。大概吧。\n\n碼頭僅剩的那條「船」，怎麼看都像是有人把一堆殘骸拴在了棧橋邊。羅馬德煞有介事地伸手一指，介紹完，便轉身往鎮上走。走前，他還不忘衝你們喊最後一句。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The F.V. Not My Problem Anymore!"
msgstr "漁船「總算不歸我管號」！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Enjoy!"
msgstr "你們慢慢折騰吧！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That slimy little..."
msgstr "這奸商……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's not... that bad. Is it?"
msgstr "也沒……那麼糟吧。對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Player Name], it might be easier to start from scratch. I'm shocked the thing's even floating to begin with."
msgstr "[Player Name]，我看從頭造一條都比修它省事。這東西居然還沒沉，我都覺得稀奇。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's just... do our best."
msgstr "咱們就……盡力吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Judging by the coastline, the island's gonna be rocky. And, I don't fancy paddling to a place I can't even see."
msgstr "看這海岸，島邊肯定也少不了礁石。而且，連島影都看不見，我可不想一路划過去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll work on a keel and a sail."
msgstr "我來做龍骨和船帆。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I'll see what I can do about getting this thing... sea-worthy."
msgstr "……那我想想辦法，至少讓這東西……能出海。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's the spirit."
msgstr "這就對了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] grumbles to herself and begins prodding at the boat. It drops concerningly low under the water when she puts her weight on it, which elicits a string of curses."
msgstr "[Companion Name]一邊嘀咕，一邊開始擺弄那條船。她剛把重量壓上去，船就猛地往下一沉，眼看就要進水，惹得她連罵了好幾句。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It can't be that hard, can it?"
msgstr "應該沒那麼難吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It was."
msgstr "還真有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You arrive at the docks to see something akin to a miracle. The boat - if you could even call it that - has been worked into a proper skiff. It wasn't fancy, but it looked like it could support a couple of people and make it more than two minutes off the shore without capsizing, which is leagues better than it used to be. [Companion Name] beams with pride."
msgstr "你回到碼頭，眼前簡直是個奇蹟。那堆勉強能叫作船的東西，已經被修成了一條像模像樣的小艇。雖說不氣派，但看著至少能載兩個人，不至於離岸兩分鐘就翻。這可比之前強太多了。[Companion Name]滿臉得意，笑得燦爛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How's this?"
msgstr "怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't know how you made it down to the capitol and bought a proper boat, but I'm glad you did!"
msgstr "我都不知道你什麼時候跑去都城買了條正經船回來，這船真不賴！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As if I was going to let that gross little creature pull one over on us. He'll be begging for this boat back when we're done."
msgstr "我還能讓那噁心的小人把咱們耍了？等咱們弄完，他保準哭著喊著想把船要回去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Start thinking of a name, hm?"
msgstr "想想給它取個什麼名字吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Spite is quite the motivator, ain't it?"
msgstr "看來，憋著一口氣，幹活都格外有勁啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you get to work, fitting the keel to the boat. It takes ages, replacing the scrap metal that used to serve the same purpose. Once the worst of it is over, [Companion Name] waves you off, telling you to get to weaving or knitting or whatever you need to do for creating a sail."
msgstr "你們開始動手，把龍骨裝到船上。原來頂在那個位置的，是一堆廢鐵。光把它換掉，就費了好半天。最難的活兒幹完後，[Companion Name]便揮手趕你去做船帆，至於是織是編還是怎麼弄，她就不管了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You bring you sail to the dock and find [Companion Name] floating in the water, treating the boat with what you presume to be waterproofing. You set the sail on the ground and help haul them out of the brine, to which they shake like a dog and get you drenched. You threaten to shove them in, so they wrap their arms around you and threaten to haul you both back in. You shove them off and roll your eyes, to which they give one of the first genuinely laughs you've heard from them in a long while.\n\nWhy they decided that smelling like stale water and rotting wood was their happy place, you may never know, but you can't help but smile after seeing them happy. The two of you fit the sail to your skiff and sit on the dock, admiring your handiwork. You each carve your name into its railing, and give it a firm pat. It's ready for its journey. Are you?"
msgstr "你把船帆帶回碼頭，看見[Companion Name]正泡在海水裡，往船身上塗東西，估計是在做防水。你放下船帆，把她從海水裡拉上來。結果，她像狗一樣抖了抖身子，甩了你一身水。你威脅要把她推回去，她便一把抱住你，說要下水就一起下。你推開她，翻了個白眼。她笑出了聲，你已經好久沒聽見她笑得這麼痛快了。\n\n為什麼渾身沾著陳水和爛木頭味，反倒能讓她這麼開心，你大概永遠也想不明白。不過，看見她高興，你也忍不住地笑。你們給小艇裝好船帆，坐在碼頭邊，欣賞自己的成果。兩人各自在船舷刻下名字，又結結實實地拍了拍。它已經準備好啟程了。你們呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Sunken Tower"
msgstr "沉沒之塔"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "All signs point to Gloomstone, and you're as ready as you'll ever be. It's time to learn what the Soulsmiths are after, or sink somewhere far off the coast."
msgstr "所有線索都指向幽暗之石，能做的準備，你們也都做了。該去弄清煉魂師到底想幹什麼了。要不，就沉在遠海某個不知名的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Astrology (Following stars through rocks)"
msgstr "占星 (循著星辰指引穿過礁石)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Glass shatters as you break a bottle of wine over the ship's bow. [Companion Name] holds her steady as you jump aboard, cutting the rope loose and gracefully landing on the deck, your momentum carrying the boat out into the water. The sheepish townsfolk of Tidebreak silently watch as you set off, several of them actually tracing marks of good fortune in the air. You're pleasantly surprised.\n\nThe two of you move about the skiff, setting the sail and getting it as ready as you can to sail."
msgstr "你把一瓶葡萄酒砸在船頭，玻璃應聲碎裂。[Companion Name]穩住小艇，你躍上船，割斷纜繩，利落地落在甲板上。藉著這股勁，船身滑進了水裡。破浪鎮的鎮民有些侷促，默默看著你們出發。幾個人居然還抬起手，在空中畫了些祈求好運的符號。破浪鎮的鎮民有些侷促，默默看著你們出發。幾個人居然還抬起手，在空中畫了些祈求好運的符號。這倒讓你有些受寵若驚了。\n\n你們在小艇上忙來忙去，升起船帆，把能準備的都準備妥當。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Guess they don't want to haul any fresh bodies out of the water, hm?"
msgstr "看來，他們也不想從海里撈上來兩具新鮮屍體，是吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's anyone's guess. Maybe Rommard put in a good word for us?"
msgstr "誰知道呢。沒準羅馬德替咱們說了幾句好話？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's probably your thing."
msgstr "還是你前面那個說法比較像真的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nice thought, though."
msgstr "不過，想得倒挺美。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So. How many days of stuff do we got?"
msgstr "說起來。咱們帶的東西能撐幾天？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A week, at least. I really hope it doesn't take that long though."
msgstr "至少一週。不過，我真希望用不了那麼久。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I hope the tower is actually out there."
msgstr "我只希望那座塔真在海上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The cavern was fine, sure. But this is a bit more... hostile of an environment."
msgstr "洞窟那次是沒錯。可這回，地方就有點……不太好待了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll see when we get there!"
msgstr "到了不就知道了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...if we get there."
msgstr "……要是能到的話。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'lllllll get there."
msgstr "肯定能到啦。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...In one piece is a maybe."
msgstr "……能不能全須全尾地到，就不好說了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You two chat back and forth, enjoying the pretty peaceful trip. The shore slowly fades further... and further... and further away, until it's just the two of you gliding across the dark blue water. You're long past the point of being able to swim back to shore. Even without your gear on, the water is cold, and hypothermia would set in long before you made it even a tenth of the way back, assuming the current was cooperating with you.\n\nThe two of you catch sleep in waves, each trading off, hoping that you're vaguely headed in the right direction. From what you were able to find, Gloomstone is... quite large but even still, half a day into sailing, you start to wonder if you missed it, or if a children's book in a dead language may have not been the best reference material.\n\nYou awake to [Companion Name] calling for you. Something is ahead. A lot of somethings. Giant pillars jut from the icy waters like fingers of stone that threaten to pull you into the depths. [Companion Name] mans the sails, and pleads for you to get them through this safely. With the pillars being barely lit by the moon, you turn to the stars."
msgstr "你們有一搭沒一搭地聊著，享受這段還算平靜的航程。海岸漸漸遠去……越來越遠……越來越遠，直到深藍的海面上，只剩你們兩個乘著小艇前行。現在，早就不可能再游回岸邊了。就算脫掉所有裝備，海水還是冷得要命。即使水流肯幫忙，恐怕連十分之一的路程都遊不到，你就已經失溫了。\n\n你們輪流打盹，換著掌船，只盼前進的方向沒有偏得太離譜。按你查到的統計，幽暗之石應該……相當大。可出海半天后，你還是開始懷疑，是不是已經錯過了，又或者，拿一本用失傳文字寫成的兒童讀物當指引，本來就不是什麼好主意。\n\n你被[Companion Name]的呼喚聲叫醒。前面有東西。而且，有很多。巨大的石柱聳立在冰冷的海水中，宛如一根根伸出的手指，彷彿隨時都會將你們拖入深海。[Companion Name]忙著掌帆，急切地催你找條安全的路穿過去。月光昏暗，只能勉強照出石柱的輪廓。你抬頭望向群星，希望借星蝕找到出路。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think we're doing them a favor."
msgstr "我覺得，這對它們來說也是種解脫。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rest easy."
msgstr "安息吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your boat bumps and scrapes against the rocks, and you're glad you spent so long forging its keel. Wind whips at the sail, pulling the two of you through the stone spires at a breakneck pace. While nothing like using Era's telescope, your skills in astrology prove fruitful, guiding you through the pillars relatively unscathed.\n\nThe two of you float further and further into the cluster of rocks until you can make out... land. You scrape along the shore a bit harder than you're comfortable with, but the two of you and your boat seem to be intact. [Companion Name] shouts with joy and nervous energy leaving her body."
msgstr "船身一路磕碰、刮擦著岩石。你慶幸自己花了那麼多工夫鍛造龍骨。狂風扯著船帆，帶著你們在石柱間飛馳，快得讓人心驚。雖然和使用艾拉的望遠鏡時完全不同，你學來的占星還是派上了用場，引導你們穿過石柱，沒受什麼大損傷。\n\n你們乘著小艇繼續駛入礁石群深處，終於看見了……陸地。船底擦上岸邊，動靜大得讓你心裡一緊。不過，船和人似乎都沒事。[Companion Name]歡呼起來，繃了一路的神經終於鬆了下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh by the Gods we made it! I can't believe it."
msgstr "諸神保佑，我們到了！真不敢相信。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "By the Gods? Not used to you referring to them."
msgstr "諸神保佑？難得聽你提起他們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We've been talking with two immortals that play with the dead and fighting against a force that creates monsters from darkness."
msgstr "咱們跟兩個擺弄死人的不死之身聊過天，還跟一群能用黑暗造出怪物的傢伙交過手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We fought a golbin horde and travelled across most of the continent. "
msgstr "打過成群的哥布林，走遍了大半個大陸。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We've saved dozens of people in our travels, and now, we just pulled off one of the most miraculous feats of sailing I've ever seen or heard of."
msgstr "一路上救了幾十個人，現在又開著船闖過了這種地方。我見過的、聽說過的航海奇蹟，恐怕都沒幾個比得上這回。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We live in interesting times. If the Gods just so happened to pop out of the sea and ask us for tea, I'd call that a boring day, at this point."
msgstr "咱們這日子過得，可真夠精彩的。事到如今，就算諸神突然從海里冒出來，請咱們喝杯茶，我大概都不會覺得奇怪。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We... really did make it. That was some fine steering you did."
msgstr "我們……真的過來了。你掌舵的本事真不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're the one that pulled it out of the stars. You pointed, I moved. Let's just call it a joint effort, eh?"
msgstr "還不是你看著星星找到了路。你指哪兒，我就往哪兒開。算咱倆的功勞，好吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You nod and give out a shout of your own, happy to have your feet on dry land. You anchor the boat and pull it as far ashore as you can. The skiff is large, and the moment the majority of it leaves the water, you can't pull it any further.\n\nThe two of you grab what you need and head inland. One spire stands out amongst them all, and this one is much larger than the rest. After a small trek, you enter into the old tower, its doors surprisingly open, as if something was waiting for you. And once you're inside, you realize... something is. Piles of bodies shift towards you. It reminds you of Talm's thralls on a much larger and more horrific scale. The amalgamations of flesh and metal twist and moan in horrific fashion, and doubtlessly hostile intent."
msgstr "你點點頭，也忍不住歡呼了一聲。能重新腳踏實地，真好。你們下了錨，又盡力把船往岸上拖。這艘小艇個頭不小，大半個船身剛離開水面，你們就再也拖不動了。\n\n你們帶上需要的東西，朝島內走去。一座尖塔格外顯眼，比周圍的石柱都要高大得多。走了沒多久，你們便來到古塔前。塔門竟然敞開著，彷彿有什麼東西正在等你們。進去後，你才目擊……還真有。一堆堆屍體蠕動著，向你們逼近。你想起了塔爾姆的屍僕，可眼前這些東西要龐大得多，也駭人得多。血肉與金屬拼湊成的怪物扭動著身體，發出令人毛骨悚然的呻吟，顯然來者不善。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This feels... right."
msgstr "感覺……應該就是這樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bottoms up."
msgstr "幹了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The piles of corpses stop moving, the which is as good to dead as you can imagine they can get. It's not just the bodies, though. The whole tower seems... still. Stale. As if it was frozen in time. \n\nDespite its incredible height, you can only see a single floor, the one you're on. The two of you search high and low, finding... nothing. The place is decorated with stone benches and tables and lit with pale yellow-green lights that make you feel sick, but little else. You sit by the pool in the center of the room, watching the corpse piles slowly turn to ash."
msgstr "屍堆不再動彈。對這些東西來說，這大概就算是死透了。不過，靜下來的不只是它們。整座塔似乎都……沉寂了。透著一股陳腐的氣息。彷彿時間在這裡停住了。\n\n這座塔明明高得驚人，你卻只能看見眼前這一層。你們把四下翻了個遍，結果……什麼也沒找到。這裡擺著些石桌石凳，泛黃的淺綠色光芒照著四周，讓你隱隱作嘔。除此之外，幾乎再沒有別的東西。你在房間中央的水池旁坐下，看著那些屍堆慢慢化為灰燼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They must be summoned beasts, like the Yeti we fought."
msgstr "它們肯定也是召喚獸，跟咱們之前打過的雪人一樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Reminds you of Talm, doesn't it?"
msgstr "讓你想起塔爾姆了，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You read my mind. I wonder... Do you think this tower belonged to the..."
msgstr "我正想這麼說。你說……這座塔以前會不會屬於……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What'd he call them?"
msgstr "他管那些人叫什麼來著？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lifebinders..? Could be."
msgstr "生命縛誓者……？有可能。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How many ages have those miserable piles of souls haunted this place?"
msgstr "那些可憐的靈魂被拼成那副模樣，也不知道在這裡徘徊了多少年。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "At least they can rest now. Whoever or whatever they were."
msgstr "至少現在，它們能安息了。不管它們生前是什麼人，或是什麼東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can't say the same for us, though. I refuse to have come all this way just for a creepy little tower with no answers."
msgstr "可咱們還歇不了。跑了這麼遠，總不能就找到這麼座陰森森的小塔，什麼答案也沒撈著。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Surely not..."
msgstr "應該不至於吧……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you trail off, you take a deeper look into the pool. Unlike the rest of the tower, it almost exudes warmth. It's inviting. You pull out the gilded black book and flip through the pages of scrawl you cannot read. Several pages after the map shows the tower. Several pages after that, an overhead view of a circular room. Within that room a smaller circle of... paradise, is the only word that comes to mind.\n\nOn the next page, the page is cut in half. On the top half, people stand in water on the 'real' side of the world. These people seem sad, angry, and some even sport wounds in a way that's a bit surprising for what's meant to be a children's book. Among them are people holding purple vials, who seem to be in the process of passing out. Some of the tables in the illustration seem to be open in the center.\n\nThe other half of the page is lovely, mirroring the top half. These people are upside down, holding hands and smiling with one another. You look to the sheet of placid water in the center of the room once again, and motion for [Companion Name] to sit beside you.\n\nYou come to the same conclusion. You need to pass through. After splashing about in the warm water for a while feeling no different - as crazy as it may be - you come to the same conclusion. You need to find and make the purple vials. You wedge blades into the center of tables around the room until one gives way, revealing the same vials as the book held, along with herbs and ingredients you assume go inside."
msgstr "你話音漸低，又仔細朝池中望去。與塔裡的其他地方不同，這池水彷彿透著暖意。讓人忍不住想靠近。你提領那本鑲金的黑皮書，翻過一頁頁看不懂的文字。地圖後面隔了幾頁，畫著這座塔。再往後翻幾頁，是一個圓形房間的俯檢視。房間裡還有個小圓圈，裡面的景象……你只能想到「樂園」這個詞。\n\n下一頁的畫面分為上下兩半。上半頁裡，人們站在水中，身處這個世界「真實」的一面。他們有的悲傷，有的憤怒，甚至還有人身上帶著傷。這樣的畫面出現在一本兒童讀物裡，多少有些出人意料。其中幾個人手裡拿著紫色的小瓶，看起來正要失去意識。圖中有幾張桌子，中央似乎是開啟的。\n\n下半頁的景象則美好得多，與上半頁如同映象。那裡的人上下顛倒，彼此牽著手，臉上帶著笑容。你再次望向房間中央平靜的水面，示意[Companion Name]到你身邊坐下。\n\n你們得出了同樣的結論。你們得穿過去。你們在溫暖的池水裡撲騰了一陣，卻毫無變化。雖然這念頭有些瘋狂，你們還是想到一塊兒去了。得找到那些紫色小瓶，配出裡面的藥水。你們把刀刃插進一張張桌子中央的縫隙，終於撬開了其中一張。裡面放著書中畫的那種小瓶，還有些草藥和材料，想必就是用來配藥的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The moment the liquid hits your tongue, you feel... nothing. Your body falls backward into the water, but you're not in it any longer. You watch as the liquid washes over you, then [Companion Name]. You scream, but hear nothing. You want to try to push yourself back into your body, but cannot seem to will yourself forward. You feel still, but your mind cries out over and over again that what's happening is wrong.\n\nBit by bit you see your body wither away, like the rotting of a fruit sped up a hundred-fold. You feel regret at everything you never got the chance to do. Bitter over falling for such a stupid trick. Remorse for getting [Companion Name] involved. Calm, over knowing that it's... out of your hands now. Warmth for the hundreds of happy memories you've made through the years, even if it was cut short. Thankful for everyone you've gotten to know, good and bad. You're a mixture of countless emotions, good and bad, but this is all you've got. Nothing left to be done about it.\n\nYou pass through the other side, your consciousness slamming back into your body. You feel your body materialize and peel away from the sickly sweet membrane of the mirrored pool. You fall through the air and weightlessly hit the stone ground. Feeling slowly returns to your body as you remember how to move. How to breathe.\n\nYou rub your eyes as you sit up... You're... in paradise.\n\nGrey flesh coats the walls and pulses like the beat of a heart. The stone beneath you is an endless path of mottled bone held together with sinew. You hear screams echo out around you as you move to your feet. But where is it-"
msgstr "藥液碰到舌尖的那一刻，你……什麼感覺也沒有了。你的身體向後倒入水中，可你已經不在那具身體裡。你看著池水漫過自己的身體，又漫過[Companion Name]。你尖叫起來，卻聽不到任何聲音。你想鑽回自己的身體，卻怎麼也無法向前挪動。你動彈不得，腦海裡卻有個聲音一遍遍地喊著：不該是這樣的。\n\n你眼看著自己的身體一點點凋零、腐爛，就像一顆果子，卻比正常腐爛快了上百倍。還有那麼多事沒來得及做，你滿心遺憾。竟然中了這麼蠢的圈套，你又恨又不甘。還把[Companion Name]牽扯進來，你愧疚不已。可想到如今已經……無能為力，你又漸漸平靜下來。這些年留下的無數美好回憶，讓你心頭泛起暖意，儘管這一生就這樣匆匆結束了。那些與你相識的人，無論好壞，此刻你都心懷感激。種種滋味湧上心頭，有好有壞，如今你也只剩下這些了。再也做不了什麼。\n\n你穿到了另一邊，意識猛地撞回身體。你感覺自己的身體重新凝聚成形，從另一側水池那層泛著甜膩氣息的薄膜上剝離。你從空中落下，輕飄飄地撞上石地。知覺慢慢回到身體裡，你重新想起該怎麼活動。怎麼呼吸。\n\n你揉著眼睛坐起身……你來到了……樂園。\n\n灰色的血肉覆滿牆壁，像心臟一樣一下一下地搏動。身下的「石地」，是一條望不到盡頭的路，由筋腱連著斑駁的骨頭拼成。你站起身，四周迴盪著聲聲慘叫。可它到底在哪……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Player Name]!!!"
msgstr "[Player Name]！！！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "WE HAVE TO MOVE! NOW!"
msgstr "快跑！現在就跑！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "PLEASE! I WILL NOT LEAVE YOU HERE BUT YOU NEED TO GET UP!"
msgstr "求你了！我不會把你丟在這裡，可你得站起來！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your eyes snap open. [Companion Name]'s eyes are wide in fear, in a way you haven't seen since the Soulsmiths first attacked Azamire.\n\nYou look back and see it. A twisted being formed of... human matter. The creature drags itself down pathway and towards you with frightening speed. Everything about it seems... incompatible with life. With each movement its claws tear into the walls of this hellscape and it pulls itself towards you. Closer. \n\nYou grab [Companion Name] by the arm and drag her with you, knowing that if you opened your mouth you'd fail to produce anything other than screams.\n\nYou need to leave."
msgstr "你猛地睜開眼。[Companion Name]驚恐地瞪大了雙眼。自從煉魂師第一次襲擊阿扎米爾以來，你就沒見她怕成這樣。\n\n你回頭，看見了那東西。一個由……人的血肉拼成的畸形怪物。它拖著身軀沿通道爬來，速度快得嚇人。怎麼看，這東西都……不該是活的。它每動一下，利爪便撕進這地獄般的牆壁，把身體往你這邊拖。越來越近。\n\n你一把抓住[Companion Name]的胳膊，拉著她就跑。你知道，只要一張嘴，自己除了尖叫，什麼聲音也發不出來。\n\n得逃出去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What happened to you..?"
msgstr "你到底經歷了什麼……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...is it dead?"
msgstr "……它死了嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Arms of gray skin and bone reach out to grab you from the corridor walls. You and [Companion Name] run through the fetid halls along the only path laid out for you. There's nothing else you can do. Each step becomes heavier and heavier as the bone beneath you turns spongy and slick with blood that pours from the ceiling and walls.\n\nYou lost track of time ages ago, and focus on your breathing. In. Out. In. Out. You reach out to steady [Companion Name]. Flinch back as she cuts a hand away from your throat.\n\nThe tunnel grows more narrow, and all the while, the beast crawls towards you faster and faster. Its breath curls down your back as you sprint through the halls, the feeling reminds you of how you the purple vial touching your lips and bringing you to this nightmare. You feel the beast's nails bite into your skin. Just a glancing blow, but you know the next time it touches you, it will be fatal.\n\nYou see light up ahead. You jump off the bridge.\n\nAnd then... it ends.\n\nYou reach a large room made of the same stone as the tower that brought you here. Your lungs burn and tears stream down your face. [Companion Name] lands beside you with a thud.\n\nYou look back, and the tunnel you came from isn't there.\n\nMaybe it never was.\n\nYou turn back and see Talm, arm in arm with his wife Era. The two of them look at you with so much hatred that you almost feel like you deserve it, though you haven't the slightest idea on why. Their fingers elongate into claws that scrape against the stone floor, while their bodies twist into malformed ideas of human anatomy."
msgstr "一條條灰皮包骨的手臂從通道兩側伸出，想要抓住你們。你和[Companion Name]沿著眼前唯一的路，在惡臭的通道里狂奔。你們別無選擇。頭頂和牆壁不斷湧出鮮血，腳下的骨頭變得鬆軟溼滑，每邁一步都比上一步更費力。\n\n你早已不知道跑了多久，只顧著調整呼吸。吸氣。呼氣。吸氣。呼氣。你伸手扶穩[Companion Name]。她揮刃斬斷了伸向你喉嚨的一隻手，你驚得猛地往後一縮。\n\n通道越來越窄，身後的牛羚卻越爬越快。你在通道中拼命奔跑，它的吐息已經拂上你的後背。那感覺讓你想起紫色小瓶碰上嘴唇的那一刻，正是那一口藥水，把你帶進了這場噩夢。牛羚的指甲刺進了你的皮膚。只是擦了一下，可你知道，再被它碰到一次，你就沒命了。\n\n前方有光。你縱身跳下橋。\n\n然後……一切都結束了。\n\n你落進一間寬敞的房間，四周的石材與先前那座塔一模一樣。你的肺像燒起來一樣，眼淚止不住地往下淌。[Companion Name]砰的一聲落在你身旁。\n\n你回頭望去，來時的通道已經不見了。\n\n也許它從來就不存在。\n\n轉回頭，你看見塔爾姆和他的妻子艾拉挽著手臂，站在面前。他們望著你，眼裡滿是恨意。那目光幾乎讓你覺得自己罪有應得，可你根本不知道為什麼。他們的手指不斷伸長，化作刮擦石地的利爪，身體也扭曲變形，漸漸沒了人樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is where my people went, all those years ago!"
msgstr "多年前，我的族人就是去了這裡！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is the culmination of everything they worked towards."
msgstr "他們為之付出的一切，最後換來的就是這個。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Look upon it and weep."
msgstr "看吧，哭吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's all we have left."
msgstr "我們能做的，也只剩這些了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You pull [Companion Name] to her feet. She is breathless, but her body moves on instinct as Era swipes towards her. You hear a clash of metal and hope it was enough. \n\nYou barely have time to defend yourself as Talm's full weight slams into you, sending the two of you careening towards the edge of the stone platform. You now see that you stand on disk, and that over the edges of the platform lead to... nothing.\n\nYou turn back towards Talm, ready to face him... it... head on."
msgstr "你把[Companion Name]拉起來。她還沒喘過氣，艾拉已經揮爪撲來。她的身體本能地做出了反應。你聽見金屬相撞的聲音，只盼她擋住了這一擊。\n\n你幾乎來不及招架，塔爾姆便整個撞了上來，帶著你一起衝向石臺邊緣。這時你才看清，腳下是一座圓形平臺，而平臺之外……空無一物。\n\n你轉向塔爾姆，準備正面迎戰他……不，是它。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm's broken body lays before you. You hold your weapon in front of you, knowing that the moment you look away, it'll lunge for you, looking to take advantage of your weakness. Your breaths come in ragged heaves. The chance that you'd even be able to fend off a casual swat of Talm's claws is bordering on zero, but you stand at the ready regardless. You lost track of [Companion Name] ages ago, and can only hope that she was able to hold Era off.\n\nYou stare at the corpse as long as you can, your whole body threatening to collapse. You risk a blink of your eyes... and he's gone. Replaced by the Talm you know. Mostly.\n\nThe man before you wears a bright white crown of bone, and regal garb made of blackened leather. You can tell that it's... alive. But life may be be a stretch for the sorrowful creature wrapped around his body. He lets gives you a slow clap, before turning to Era, who dons similar 'clothes'. He whispers something you cannot hear to her, and she smiles slightly.\n\nYou take a step back, consciousness fading. Your weapon wavers, but does not fall.\n\nThe platform beneath you shifts and begins to descend into darkness."
msgstr "塔爾姆殘破的軀體倒在你面前。你把武器橫在身前，知道只要移開視線，它就會趁虛而入，再次撲上來。你大口喘著氣，呼吸斷斷續續。此刻，塔爾姆哪怕隨手揮上一爪，你恐怕都擋不住，可你仍然擺著迎戰的架勢。你早已顧不上留意[Companion Name]，只能盼著她擋住了艾拉。\n\n你拼命盯著那具屍體，渾身卻已經快撐不住了。你冒險眨了一下眼……他不見了。站在那裡的，換成了你熟悉的塔爾姆。至少大致還是那副模樣。\n\n眼前的男人頭戴瑩白的骨冠，身披黑色皮革製成的華貴衣袍。你看得出來，那身衣服……是活的。可裹在他身上的那個可悲生物，如今這樣，恐怕也很難說是「活著」。他慢慢拍了幾下手，隨後轉向艾拉。她也穿著類似的「衣服」。他湊過去低聲說了句什麼，你聽不清。艾拉微微一笑。\n\n你退了一步，意識漸漸模糊。手中的武器晃了晃，卻始終沒有放下。\n\n腳下的平臺開始移動，緩緩沉入黑暗。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What Comes After - After surviving Talm's initial onslaught, what will become of you next?"
msgstr "此後何往——你挺過了塔爾姆的第一輪猛攻，接下來又將面臨什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What can you tell me? (Divination)"
msgstr "你能告訴我什麼？（占卜）"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I feel it coming to me. (Divination)"
msgstr "……我感覺到了。（占卜）"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The chamber's walls shift as the platform you stand upon descends. Talm's regal form slowly begins to bleed into the darkness as the ground shifts beneath you, descending lower and lower. You try to keep your eyes trained on him, but without moving he fades from your vision. Fatigue sets in as your tense body begins to give out without a target in front of you.\n\nAs the gloom begins to swallow you, you feel... warm. At peace. Mentally, you lash out, knowing that something is wrong, but you've pushed yourself beyond your limits. Your weapon slips from your grasp as you collapse sideways. You don't even feel the cold stone floor as you fall. Only warmth.\n\nYou dream.\n\nYou wear dark grey robe made of a material that dances and swirls chaotically whenever you take your eyes off of it. You stand amidst an endless sea of bodies. Your chest wracks with silent sobs as you gaze upon them, not at all comforted by their peaceful smiles. As you walk amongst them, you make it to your king and lift the pearly white bone crown from his cold brow.\n\nThe weight it holds is incomparable to that which still rests on your shoulders. There's still so much work to do.\n\nYou awaken with a start and find yourself warm... but not cloying so. You're wrapped in devilishly silken sheets and buried in a bed so plush you fear your worn body won't be able to rise. Era stands far on the opposite corner of the room, stoking a fireplace of smooth, black stone.\n\nYou try to move, but every inch of your body screams in protest, and your groan catches her attention. She looks at you with... what'd seem to be genuine concern had she and her husband not just tried to kill you. You involuntarily shudder as she drops her bundle of wood and rushes to your side. She tries to begin speaking several times, before sighing and offering a small chuckle."
msgstr "腳下的平臺緩緩下降，四周的牆壁也隨之移動。平臺越降越深，塔爾姆那身華貴的裝束也漸漸隱入黑暗。你竭力盯住他，可他明明站著沒動，身影卻從你眼前一點點消失了。眼前沒了需要提防的敵人，疲憊頓時湧了上來，緊繃的身體再也支撐不住。\n\n黑暗漸漸將你吞沒，你卻感到……溫暖。安寧。你知道不對勁，拼命想要抗拒，可身體早已撐過了極限。武器從手中滑落，你向一旁倒去。倒下時，你甚至感覺不到石地的冰冷。只有溫暖。\n\n你做了一個夢。\n\n你穿著一件深灰色長袍。只要目光稍稍移開，袍子的布料便會瘋狂地翻湧、旋動。你站在無數躺倒的人中間，一眼望不到盡頭。望著他們，你無聲地抽泣，胸口陣陣痙攣。他們臉上安詳的笑容絲毫不能讓你好受一些。你從他們之間走過，來到國王身邊，從他冰冷的額上取下那頂珍珠般潔白的骨冠。\n\n骨冠的分量，遠不及你肩上仍未卸下的重擔。還有太多事等著你去做。你猛然驚醒，身上暖暖的……這次卻沒有那種令人不適的感覺。裹著你的床單滑軟得不可思議，床鋪柔軟得讓你整個人都陷了進去。你甚至擔心，這副疲憊不堪的身體還能不能爬起來。艾拉站在房間另一頭的角落，正在撥弄壁爐裡的火。壁爐由光滑的黑石砌成。\n\n你試著動了動，渾身上下卻無一處不疼。你呻吟了一聲，引起了她的注意。她望向你，眼神裡透著……關切。要不是她和丈夫剛剛還想殺了你，你幾乎會相信那是真心的。她放下懷裡的木柴，快步趕到床邊。你不由自主地打了個寒戰。她幾次欲言又止，最後嘆了口氣，輕輕笑了一聲。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hello darling... How do you feel?"
msgstr "你醒了，親愛的……感覺怎麼樣？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...what do you want? Why am I here? Is..."
msgstr "……你想幹什麼？我為什麼會在這裡？她……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Is [Companion Name] still..?"
msgstr "[Companion Name]還……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes. She's alright. Recovering, like you, though she got it a bit rougher than you did."
msgstr "還活著。她沒事。跟你一樣，還在回春。不過她傷得比你重些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm and I will explain in more detail as we can, but I know you must have several thousand questions, my child. I will do my best to answer them, but you'll come to learn more in time. Even here, there are laws that dictate against what I can and cannot speak."
msgstr "孩子，我知道你一定有無數個問題。能解釋的，我和塔爾姆都會慢慢向你解釋。我會盡力回答，剩下的，你以後也會逐漸明白。即使在這裡，我能說什麼、不能說什麼，也仍受法則約束。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Welcome to Respite. We're within the domain of the Lifebinders, a... world between worlds, so-to-speak. It was created as a safe haven during the calamity that brought Talm and I together."
msgstr "歡迎來到安歇之境。這裡是生命縛誓者的領域，可以說是……世界之間的另一個世界。當年那場災難讓我和塔爾姆走到了一起，這裡也是在那時建成的，為的是給人們一處避難之所。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I presume you found the entrance from your pilfered book, yes? The book came from here, and was written for Lifebinder children to act as a source of comfort while the world fell apart around them."
msgstr "我想，你們是從偷來的那本書裡找到入口的，對吧？那本書出自這裡，是寫給生命縛誓者的孩子們的。外面的世界正在分崩離析，大人們希望它多少能給孩子們一些安慰。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How could that book, or this place, bring anyone comfort?"
msgstr "那本書，還有這個地方，到底哪裡能讓人覺得安慰了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What you've seen of Respite was it's entrance. The beast at the front, its guardian. There are many that would have wished to see Respite burn."
msgstr "你們先前看到的，只是安歇之境的入口。入口處的那頭牛羚，是這裡的守護。當年，想毀掉安歇之境的人可不少。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The chamber's walls shift as the platform you stand upon descends. Talm's regal form slowly begins to bleed into the darkness as the ground shifts beneath you, descending lower and lower. You try to keep your eyes trained on him, but without moving he fades from your vision. Fatigue sets in as your tense body begins to give out without a target in front of you.\n\nAs the gloom begins to swallow you, you feel... warm. At peace. Mentally, you lash out, knowing that something is wrong, but you've pushed yourself beyond your limits. Your weapon slips from your grasp as you collapse sideways. You don't even feel the cold stone floor as you fall. Only warmth.\n\nYou dream.\n\nYou wear dark grey robe made of a material that dances and swirls chaotically whenever you take your eyes off of it. You stand amidst an endless sea of bodies. Your chest wracks with silent sobs as you gaze upon them, not at all comforted by their peaceful smiles. As you walk amongst them, you make it to your king and lift the pearly white bone crown from his cold brow.\n\nThe weight it holds is incomparable to that which still rests on your shoulders. There's still so much work to do.\n\nYou awaken with a start and find yourself warm... but not cloying so. You're wrapped in devilishly silken sheets and buried in a bed so plush you fear your worn body won't be able to rise. Era stands far on the opposite corner of the room, stoking a fireplace of smooth, black stone.\n\nYou try to move, but every inch of your body screams in protest. You try not to make a sound, but your involuntary groan catches her attention. She looks at you with... what'd seem to be genuine concern had she and her husband not just tried to kill you. You involuntarily shudder as she drops her bundle of wood and rushes to your side. She tries to begin speaking several times, before sighing and offering a small chuckle."
msgstr "腳下的平臺緩緩下降，四周的牆壁也隨之移動。平臺越降越深，塔爾姆那身華貴的裝束也漸漸隱入黑暗。你竭力盯住他，可他明明站著沒動，身影卻從你眼前一點點消失了。\n\n眼前沒了需要提防的敵人，疲憊頓時湧了上來，緊繃的身體再也支撐不住。黑暗漸漸將你吞沒，你卻感到……溫暖。安寧。你知道不對勁，拼命想要抗拒，可身體早已撐過了極限。武器從手中滑落，你向一旁倒去。倒下時，你甚至感覺不到石地的冰冷。只有溫暖。\n\n你做了一個夢。\n\n你穿著一件深灰色長袍。只要目光稍稍移開，袍子的布料便會瘋狂地翻湧、旋動。你站在無數躺倒的人中間，一眼望不到盡頭。望著他們，你無聲地抽泣，胸口陣陣痙攣。他們臉上安詳的笑容絲毫不能讓你好受一些。你從他們之間走過，來到國王身邊，從他冰冷的額上取下那頂珍珠般潔白的骨冠。\n\n骨冠的分量，遠不及你肩上仍未卸下的重擔。還有太多事等著你去做。\n\n你猛然驚醒，身上暖暖的……這次卻沒有那種令人不適的感覺。裹著你的床單滑軟得不可思議，床鋪柔軟得讓你整個人都陷了進去。你甚至擔心，這副疲憊不堪的身體還能不能爬起來。艾拉站在房間另一頭的角落，正在撥弄壁爐裡的火。壁爐由光滑的黑石砌成。\n\n你試著動了動，渾身上下卻無一處不疼。你想忍住不出聲，還是不由得呻吟了一聲，引起了她的注意。她望向你，眼神裡透著……關切。要不是她和丈夫剛剛還想殺了你，你幾乎會相信那是真心的。她放下懷裡的木柴，快步趕到床邊。你不由自主地打了個寒戰。她幾次欲言又止，最後嘆了口氣，輕輕笑了一聲。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Given [Companion Name] and I's reception, I see that peaceful nature has died out."
msgstr "看你們招待我和[Companion Name]的方式，這地方如今也沒多平和了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I won't ask for either of you to forgiven Talm and I's transgressions against you, only explain why we chose this path."
msgstr "我不會求你們原諒我和塔爾姆的所作所為，只想解釋我們為什麼選擇這麼做。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My people sought to ascertain the fates through communion with the stars, as you've gathered by now. Our use of summoning itself was rather limited, and focused on the practical, usually creating messengers to help us made sense of the fates."
msgstr "你應該已經知道，我的族人會與群星溝通，藉此探知命運。我們很少使用召喚術，用途也大多很實際。通常只是召出一些信使，幫我們解讀命運。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We were called the Fateseekers, and we learned of the calamity far before it ever was set into motion."
msgstr "我們被稱為尋命者。早在災難開始醞釀之前，我們就已預見了它。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You'll hear more of this calamity as you rest here, I promise you that."
msgstr "你在這裡休養的這段日子，會慢慢了解那場災難。我向你保證。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nevertheless. The Fateseekers' visions all culminated in one final premonition of the future."
msgstr "說回正題。尋命者看到的種種幻象，最終都指向了同一個未來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A creature so vile, born of a nation of sacrificed life. As it let out its first breath, the world in its entirety twisted and died."
msgstr "舉國生靈被獻祭，孕育出一個邪惡至極的怪物。它吐出第一口氣息時，整個世界便隨之扭曲、滅亡。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My people's visions can be esoteric at times, but this was seen with perfect clarity across my entire clan."
msgstr "族人們看到的幻象有時晦澀難懂，但這一次，全族上下都看得清清楚楚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is what the calamity would culminate in."
msgstr "那就是災難最終會帶來的結局。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But this 'calamity' you cannot speak of happened already, no? That's why there aren't many summoners left, outside of the Soulsmiths."
msgstr "可你不能說的那場「災難」，不是早就發生了嗎？所以除了煉魂師，如今才沒剩下幾個召喚師。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unless the world underwent some kind of rebirth afterward, assuming your clan was even correct in the first place, what does this have to do with why you attacked us?"
msgstr "先不說你們預言得準不準，總不能是世界毀滅之後又重生了吧？而且，這跟你們襲擊我們有什麼關係？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...My people were correct. The only thing we were unsure of was the timeframe."
msgstr "……我的族人沒有看錯。我們唯一無法確定的，是它發生的時間。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This creature... It is what the Soulsmiths seek to bring about."
msgstr "那個怪物……正是煉魂師想要造出來的東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...why?"
msgstr "……為什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Before you can understand, you must learn this history of Respite."
msgstr "想明白這一點，你得先了解安歇之境的過去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But I've already kept you so long, I thank you for your patience. I'll explain more to you, in time, but please, acquaint yourself with this place first. Leave if you must, just come and find me. You may always return later."
msgstr "不過，我已經拉著你說了這麼久，謝謝你耐心聽我講完。往後我會繼續向你解釋。現在，先熟悉一下這裡吧。如果非得離開，就來找我。以後你隨時都可以回來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Era rises from the bedside and offers a small curtsy. Your next question is answered before it even leaves your mouth. [Companion Name] is in the next room over, but hasn't yet awakened.\n\nYou follow Era out, who wanders off down the hall. You knock on [Companion Name]'s door before letting yourself in. Like you were, she rests in a large bed and is seemingly unharmed, but you see that she's restless, perhaps having strange dreams like yours before you awoke.\n\nYou go to her and speak her name softly, and hold her hand. You feel the first bit of relief you have since you woke, Era's earlier words having more of the opposite effect on you.\n\nYou stay for a long while, before heading to the window and pulling open the curtain. You weren't sure what you'd find, but you weren't expecting... endless rows of white lily-like flowers amidst a field of grey grass that stretch out further than you can see. In their own small clusters are other flowers, almost always another distinct color. You see blues, greens, browns, and occasional bright reds as well. They all seem pristine, and the field of dark grass is free from any other growth.\n\nAs you look at the sky, the dark purple sky feels alien to you, the stars burn a deep, lush green, their patterns completely unfamiliar to you."
msgstr "艾拉從床邊起身，微微屈膝行禮。你還沒來得及問出下一個問題，她便給出了答案。[Companion Name]就在隔壁，只是還沒醒。\n\n你跟著艾拉走出房間，她隨後沿著走廊離開了。你敲了敲[Companion Name]的房門，推門進去。和剛才的你一樣，她躺在一張大床上，看起來沒有受傷，卻睡得並不安穩。也許她也和你醒來前一樣，正做著奇怪的夢。\n\n你走到床邊，輕聲喚她的名字，握住她的手。醒來之後，你頭一次稍稍放下心來。艾拉先前那番話，反倒讓你更不安了。\n\n你陪了她很久，才起身走到窗邊，拉開窗簾。你不知道窗外會是什麼景象，卻怎麼也沒想到……灰色的草地上，一片片形似百合的白花綿延不絕，直鋪到視線盡頭。其間還散佈著一小簇一小簇的花，每一簇幾乎都是另一種鮮明的顏色。有藍的、綠的、褐色的，偶爾還能看見一抹鮮紅。每一朵花都完好無瑕，暗色的草地上也沒有別的雜草雜木。\n\n你抬頭望去，深紫色的天空陌生得讓你恍若身處異世。群星閃著濃郁的綠光，排列成你從未見過的模樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bring me back to what you wish to show me. (Divination)"
msgstr "帶我回去吧，讓我看看你想讓我看見的。（占卜）"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just... hope I can understand it. (Divination)"
msgstr "我只希望……這次能看懂。（占卜）"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you practice the divination methods Era taught you back in her tower, the green stars push themselves into your mind. Unlike your out-of-body experience then, you find yourself... back in your earlier dream. The bone crown feels more comfortable on your head now, and you feel more... at peace.\n\nYou walk amongst the bodies and realize that they aren't corpses. Yet. They lay somewhere between life and death, much like the plane you currently reside.\n\nThis was the dream your people, the Lifebinders, chose for themselves. To fall into an endless, beautiful dream, far removed from the horrors the world faces.\n\nAlongside your people are others, from more clans. Respite was open to all who chose it.\n\nYou want so desperately to lay down and join them in the grass, but... you know you can't. The ritual isn't complete, and you're the only one who can see it to its end.\n\nYou'll pulled out of the dream as you feel a hand on your real shoulder. [Companion Name] looks at you with concern."
msgstr "你按照艾拉在塔裡教過的方法開始占卜，綠色的群星隨即湧入腦海。這次，你沒有像當初那樣靈魂出竅，而是……回到了先前的夢中。頭上的骨冠似乎不再那麼彆扭，你的心也……平靜了些。\n\n你從那些躺倒的人之間走過，才意識到他們並不是屍體。至少還不是。他們徘徊在生死之間，正如你此刻身處的這片天地。\n\n這是你的族人，生命縛誓者，為自己選擇的夢。沉入永不終結的美夢，遠離世間的一切苦難。\n\n躺在族人身旁的，還有來自其他氏族的人。只要願意，任何人都能來到安歇之境。\n\n你恨不得也在草地上躺下，加入他們。可是……你知道自己不能。儀式還沒有完成，而能將它完成的，只剩下你。\n\n有人把手搭在了你現實中的肩上，將你從夢中喚回。[Companion Name]正擔憂地望著你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Player Name]? Oh... I'm so happy to see you."
msgstr "[Player Name]？啊……能見到你真好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you okay? Why are you crying?"
msgstr "你沒事吧？怎麼哭了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... I don't know. But I'm so glad that you're okay."
msgstr "我……我不知道。不過，你沒事真是太好了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You are okay, right?"
msgstr "你沒事，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I think Era killed me."
msgstr "……我覺得，艾拉把我殺了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "She clearly didn't do a good enough job, though, since I'm still... here. Wherever here is."
msgstr "不過她顯然沒殺徹底，不然我怎麼還在……這裡。雖然我也不知道這是哪兒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Back in that dark chamber, after that flesh monster?"
msgstr "是在那間黑漆漆的大廳裡？咱們逃過那頭血肉怪物之後？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah. She ran her claws through my chest. But uh... I don't seem to have so much as a scratch on me."
msgstr "嗯。她的爪子刺穿了我的胸口。可，呃……我身上好像連道傷口都沒有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We saw Talm bring Era back from the dead, or close to it. Maybe they did the same for you?"
msgstr "咱們見過塔爾姆把艾拉救活。就算她當時沒死，也差不多了。也許他們對你做了同樣的事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I passed out shortly after fighting Talm off."
msgstr "我抵擋住塔爾姆之後，沒過多久就昏過去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So, you beat your opponent, huh? You're gonna make me look bad."
msgstr "這麼說，你還打贏了？這可顯得我太沒用了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...You know, for a dead woman, you seem to be taking things in stride."
msgstr "……你這剛死過一回的人，倒是挺想得開。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, I feel like I've gotten the best sleep I've had in months, and you're here, so... I figure we're somewhat safe."
msgstr "我感覺自己好幾個月都沒睡得這麼舒服了，而且你也在，所以……我想，咱們暫時應該還算安全。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But I do hope you'll fill me in on how exactly we got here."
msgstr "不過，咱們到底是怎麼到這兒來的，你可得跟我說說。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You wipe your face and join [Companion Name] on the bed, and do your best to fill her in on everything you know. She nods along, and asks dozens of questions that you don't have the answers to. Yet, you hope to yourself.\n\nYou talk about your dreams, and [Companion Name] speaks of hers. She has seen flashes of time, all over the world in lands neither of you can even begin to guess the location of. In each, clans of summoners from endless walks of life all fighting to survive against... each other.\n\n[Companion Name] describes battle after battle. Some with large armies of man and beast, others... darkly similar to the attack on Azamire, but with creatures far different to those of the Soulsmiths'.\n\nWhen she finishes, she mentions how it feels like she's been stopped mid-sentence, and needs to know how the stories end. She figures that if you continued to dream while looking at the stars outside, she plans to do the same soon.\n\nYou both return to the window and find that the sky has shifted from purple to a hazy pink, with the stars taking on a lighter hue. Whether it's due to the passage of time or what, you cannot begin to tell, but as you gaze at them together, you feel the same draw as before."
msgstr "你擦了擦臉，和[Companion Name]一起坐到床邊，盡力把知道的事都告訴她。她邊聽邊點頭，問了一大堆你答不上來的問題。但願只是暫時答不上來，你心想。\n\n你說起了自己的夢，[Companion Name]也講起了她的。她夢見了世界各地不同時段的片段，那些地方究竟在哪裡，你們誰也猜不出來。每一個片段裡，都有不同出身的召喚師氏族為了生存而戰。他們的敵人……正是彼此。\n\n[Companion Name]講了一場又一場戰鬥。有的是人與牛羚組成的大軍交鋒，有的……則像極了阿扎米爾遇襲時的慘狀，只是其中的怪物與煉魂師造出的截然不同。\n\n講完之後，她說那感覺就像話聽到一半突然斷了，非得知道後面的結局才行。既然你望著窗外的群星，就能繼續先前的夢，她也打算儘快試試。\n\n你們一同回到窗邊，目擊天空已由紫色變成朦朧的粉色，星蝕也淡了些。你無從判斷這是時間流逝所致，還是另有原因。不過，當你們一同仰望群星時，你再次感受到了先前那股牽引。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "After a long while, you're able to urge yourself back into your dream, but find yourself in a distant land, completely unfamiliar to you. \n\nYou clutch a wooden railing tight enough to splinter the wood as you look out over the city in front of you.\n\nBrightly painted wooden structures fly high above a jungle canopy, suspended in the air as if held on strings tied to passing clouds. People float to-and-fro, passing between buildings calmly, living their lives blissfully untouched by the battles their people raged against your own halfway across the world. You're the last of the Lifebinders, all others now peacefully awaiting you to deliver to them the paradise they were promised. An endless dream where they'll never again be subject to the ongoing horrors of the world.\n\nAs you withdraw the black gemstone from your cloak, you know you're dooming these people. It doesn't stop you. With shaking hands, you piece the stone with a blackened dagger made exclusively for this day. Dark mist begins to leak from the stone, curling around your hands and forming a thick cloud in front of you. It's not enough for you to release it.\n\nThe hungry beast needs guidance. Direction.\n\nYou will it forward."
msgstr "過了很久，你終於設法重回夢中，卻目擊自己身處一片遙遠而陌生的土地。\n\n你望著眼前的城市，雙手緊緊扣住木欄，幾乎要把木頭捏裂。\n\n漆著鮮豔色彩的木製建築高懸在叢林樹冠之上，彷彿有細線將它們系在飄過的雲朵上。人們在樓宇之間悠然飄行，過著安逸的生活。半個世界之外，他們的族人正與你的族人廝殺，可戰火絲毫沒有波及這裡。你是最後一位生命縛誓者。其他人如今都已安然睡去，等著你將他們送入許諾中的樂園。在那裡，美夢永不終結，他們也再不必承受世間無休無止的苦難。\n\n你從披風裡提領那顆黑色寶石，知道自己將給眼前這些人帶來滅頂之災。可你沒有停手。你雙手顫抖，用那把專為今日打造的烏黑匕首刺入寶石。黑霧從寶石中滲出，纏上你的雙手，在面前聚成一團濃霧。只是放出它，還不夠。\n\n這頭飢餓的牛羚需要引導。需要一個方向。\n\n你用意念驅使它向前。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Price of Paradise - Little by little, Respite has begun to show you what it took to build, yet, you've only scratched the surface of what summoning has wrought upon the land."
msgstr "樂園的代價——安歇之境正一點點向你揭示建築它所付出的代價。然而，召喚術究竟給這片土帶來了什麼，你所知的仍只是冰山一角。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Damn him."
msgstr "這個混蛋。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That should be enough."
msgstr "這些應該夠了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You feel... wrong. The body you inhabited was doubtlessly Talm's, though untold centuries past. What... how could someone be so driven to do something they know is so horrifically wrong. You felt his very being recoil as he carved into the gemstone, but... it didn't stop him.\n\nYou need to know.\n\nYou leave the room and [Companion Name] behind you, who still seems lost within her own mind.\n\nThe halls are lined with endless murals and depictions of the world, but you hardly see them as you're driven forward with righteous purpose. You find yourself outside. The monster you seek sits far out in the field of grey grass, in front of a set of two white flowers.\n\nThe path through the grass is well-worn, seemingly travelled countless times."
msgstr "你心裡……很不是滋味。夢中你附身的那個人，無疑就是塔爾姆，只是不知道那是多少個世紀以前的他。怎麼……怎麼會有人明知一件事錯得如此可怕，還執意去做？匕首刺入寶石時，你分明感到他從心底抗拒著這一切，可……他還是沒有停手。\n\n你非弄清楚不可。\n\n你離開房間，留下[Companion Name]獨自待著。她似乎仍沉浸在自己的思緒中。走廊兩側滿是壁畫，描繪著世間的種種景象，可你幾乎無心去看，只一心想找他問個明白。不知不覺，你已走到了外面。你要找的那個怪物坐在遠處的灰色草地裡，面前是兩朵白花。\n\n草間的小徑已被踩得平整，顯然有人在這裡走過無數次。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...What did you do?"
msgstr "……你究竟做了什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm afraid you'll need to be a bit more specific than that."
msgstr "恐怕得說清楚些，我才知道你指什麼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The floating city. The gemstone. I saw it."
msgstr "那座浮在空中的城市。那顆寶石。我都看見了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah. And here I thought you'd be a bit more interested in why I tried to kill you."
msgstr "啊。我還以為，你會更想知道我為什麼要殺你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll get to that."
msgstr "這筆賬待會兒再算。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can't even recall the name of the city anymore."
msgstr "我已經記不起那座城叫什麼了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But the people, the Brazi..."
msgstr "但那裡的人，布拉齊人……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Amongst the dozens of clans my people fought, none were more... through in their eradication on the Lifebinders."
msgstr "當年與我們交戰的氏族有幾十個，可論起對生命縛誓者的趕盡殺絕，沒有哪個比他們更……徹底。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You've seen what I've done for Era, back in the tower. My people were exceptional healers."
msgstr "在塔裡，你見過我是怎麼救艾拉的。我的族人很擅長治癒之術。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Lifebinders focused more on the body than the Soulsmiths, who focus more on the... Well. You can puzzle that one out."
msgstr "生命縛誓者更注重肉體，煉魂師則更注重……唉。這個你自己也猜得到。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But our control of one's spirit was quite impressive as well. These skills made us incredibly sought after allies in the calamity."
msgstr "不過，我們操控靈魂的本事也相當了得。正因如此，災難期間，許多氏族都爭著拉攏我們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Get to the point."
msgstr "說重點。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Better yet. How about you ask my people yourself?"
msgstr "這樣吧。你何不親自問問我的族人？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "After all this time, I'm sure they're quite tired of having me as their sole point of contact with the outside world."
msgstr "這麼多年，他們只能透過我與外界聯絡，想必也早就膩了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...what? "
msgstr "……什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You want to learn, don't you?"
msgstr "你不是想知道嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll tell you whatever you want to know after you speak to the Dreamers."
msgstr "先跟入夢者聊聊。聊完之後，你想知道什麼，我都告訴你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't want to do this, but I doubt you'll listen to me otherwise..."
msgstr "我不想這麼做，可不這樣，你恐怕不會聽我的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sit."
msgstr "坐下。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "All thoughts of resistance vanish as you find yourself dropping to your knees against your will after Talm snaps his fingers, the muscles in your legs giving out completely. Talm slowly cups one of the white flowers in front of him and plucks several petals from it with a mix of reverence and practiced effort, as though he's done it a million times before. He waves you off, telling you to go gather as many as wish. Just as you consider telling him to do it himself, he sighs, saying that it's 'for your own good'."
msgstr "塔爾姆打了個響指，你雙腿的肌肉頓時失了力，不由自主地跪倒在地，反抗的念頭也隨之消散。塔爾姆緩緩托起面前的一朵白花，摘下幾片花瓣。他的動作鄭重而嫻熟，彷彿已經做過無數次。他揮揮手，讓你也去採些，想採多少就採多少。你正想叫他自己去，他卻嘆了口氣，說這是「為你好」。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Dreamers... what can they teach me?"
msgstr "入夢者……他們能教我什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You thought multiple times about ripping the flowers from the ground as you delicately plucked a few petals from each, but felt like you'd look more like a rebelling child than properly offering any form of legitimate resistance. You move throughout the fields efficiently, taking care not to step on any of the flowers, and return once you've gathered a sizeable number of petals."
msgstr "你小心地從每朵花上摘下幾片花瓣，好幾次都想幹脆把花連根拔起。可那樣看起來更像是小孩子鬧脾氣，根本算不上什麼反抗。你利落地穿行在花田間，小心避開腳下的花，採了不少花瓣後才回去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There. What do you want these for?"
msgstr "喏。你要這些做什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I told you. To speak with the Dreamers."
msgstr "我說過了。用來和入夢者交談。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Take my hand, I'll show you."
msgstr "握住我的手，我教你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please?"
msgstr "好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm raises his hand once again, preparing to snap, but you begrudgingly sigh and take the man's hand. He slowly walks you through the process of... bringing Dreamers forth from the petals. Talm does so in seconds, and a pale, wispy silhouette of a young girl dances forth from one of the petals he took from you. She greets Talm warmly, asking how long it's been for him since the last she awoke. The two go back and forth for a time until the girl notices you, and she excitedly runs through more questions than you can possibly keep up with, all before you even get your name out.\n\nTalm calms her, saying that you're there to learn about the Dreamers, and to tell the others within the Dream to prepare themselves. Her silhouette dissipates a second later.\n\nThe man walks you through the process, and you find it very similar to summoning creatures, but a lot harder than anything you've done before. Talm's effortless display earlier clearly came from an untold amount of practice."
msgstr "塔爾姆再次抬手，作勢要打響指。你不情願地嘆了口氣，握住他的手。他一步步教你如何……從花瓣中喚出入夢者。塔爾姆只花了幾秒。從你採來的其中一片花瓣裡，一個小女孩的身影輕盈地飄了出來，蒼白而縹緲。她親熱地向塔爾姆打招呼，問他距離自己上次醒來，他那邊已經過了多久。兩人聊了一陣，小女孩才注意到你。你連名字都還沒來得及報上，她就興奮地問了一連串問題，讓你根本招架不住。\n\n塔爾姆安撫住她，說你是來了解入夢者的，讓她回去通知夢境中的其他人，好做些準備。片刻後，她的身影消散了。\n\n塔爾姆帶著你一步步嘗試。你目擊這與召喚生物十分相似，卻比你以往做過的任何召喚都難得多。他剛才做得那麼輕鬆，顯然是不知練習了多少次的結果。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The last petal withers away in your hand, the last Dreamer you spoke with having left to go check on her child somewhere deep within the Dream. You feel... exhausted. You're unsure of just how long passed, as time within Respite doesn't seem to move like it does in the real world. You feel no hunger, no fatigue, but time does seem to pass. At the very least, the sky changes colors, though not in any pattern you were able to notice. It could have been hours, or it could have been months since you started talking to the Dreamers, you simply don't know or have any way of telling.\n\nThe Dreamers you spoke with all shared the same initial excitement the first girl had at seeing a stranger, and countless questions about what the world was like. Like Talm had said, it'd seem that he's the only one they've talked to outside of the dream since they first entered. [Companion Name] eventually came out to join some of the conversations, and then once she was shown the process, have her own. Not everyone was from the Lifebinders... dozens of names were given, all in-line with some different discipline or school of thought, all joined the Lifebinders here in Respite to escape.\n\nThey told you what Era and Talm couldn't. What they lived through.\n\nThe Titan Wars.\n\nThat was the calamity they spoke of.\n\nTitans were beasts that dwarved even the Ivory Athenaeum by several magnitudes of size. What the Dreamers described sounded more like forces of nature or vengeful Gods rather than anything a group of people could bring forth. When the Titans of two rival summoning clans fought, it was heard across the continent. Mountains were crushed to dust, a quarter of the mainland was buried under water, lakes of fire rose from the ground and killed thousands... \n\nClans that did not raise their own Titan for protection were quickly destroyed by those that did. Each clan saw one another as a threat that could generate a world-changing force, and the only way to stay alive was to have your own and use it against the others, or create a plane of existence like Respite and lose the metaphorical key.\n\nTalm approaches quietly as the last Dreamer fades away."
msgstr "最後一片花瓣在你手中凋零。最後那位與你交談的入夢者已返回夢境深處，去看望她的孩子。你感到……心力交瘁。你不知道究竟過了多久。安歇之境裡的時間，似乎與現實世界不同。你既不餓，身體也不覺得疲倦，可時間顯然仍在流逝。至少天空一直在變換顏色，只是你看不出其中有什麼規律。從你開始與入夢者交談到現在，也許過了幾小時，也許過了幾個月。你無從得知，也無從判斷。\n\n與你交談的每一位入夢者，見到陌生人時都和最初那個小女孩一樣興奮。他們有無數個問題，想知道外面的世界如今是什麼模樣。正如塔爾姆所說，自從進入夢境，他們似乎就只與他這個外界來客說過話。[Companion Name]後來也出來加入了交談。學會方法後，她也開始自己喚出入夢者。他們並不全是生命縛誓者。你聽到了幾十個不同氏族的名字，各自有不同的專長或理念，卻都為了逃難，隨生命縛誓者一同來到了安歇之境。\n\n他們告訴了你艾拉和塔爾姆無法說出口的事，那些他們親身經歷過的往事。\n\n泰坦戰爭。\n\n那就是兩人口中的災難。\n\n泰坦是龐大無比的牛羚，即使象牙藏書院，在它們面前也渺小得不值一提。聽著入夢者的說明，你覺得那些更像是天災，或是降下怒火的神明，根本不像人力所能召出的東西。兩個敵對召喚師氏族的泰坦一旦交戰，整片大陸都能聽見。山嶽被碾成齏粉，四分之一的大陸沉入水下，烈焰從地底湧出，匯成火湖，吞噬了成千上萬人的性命……\n\n沒有召出自己的泰坦來保護族人的氏族，很快便被那些擁有泰坦的氏族消滅了。在每個氏族眼中，其他氏族都是潛在的威脅，隨時可能召出足以改變世界的力量。想活下去，就只能掌握同樣的力量，用它對付其他氏族。或者，另闢一個像安歇之境這樣的世界，進去後再把「鑰匙」扔掉。\n\n最後一位入夢者消散時，塔爾姆悄悄走了過來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... I don't know what to say."
msgstr "我……我不知道該說什麼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Assuming this isn't all one horrid trick... that each of these people truly are... somewhere... in this Dream."
msgstr "如果這不是一場可怕的騙局……如果剛才那些人真的都在……夢境裡的某個地方……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know."
msgstr "我明白。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The calamity was so horrid, and the dangers of the outside world so prevalent, my people decided to never face it again."
msgstr "那場災難太可怕，外面的世界又處處是危險。我的族人決定，再也不去面對這一切。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No living summoner from my time can speak of it, but you know what we faced. We couldn't compete. We wouldn't have wanted to even if we could."
msgstr "與我同時代、如今仍活著的召喚師，都無法談論那段往事。但現在，你知道我們當年面對的是什麼了。我們無力與他們抗衡。就算有那個能力，我們也不願變成那樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And so, the Dream was born."
msgstr "於是，夢境誕生了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The book from the Archive is a history book. How Respite came to be and... the Dream we were building towards."
msgstr "你們從藏書院拿到的那本書，是一本史書。它記載了安歇之境的由來，還有……我們想要創造的夢境。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A world without war. Without death. Without wondering if we'd make it through the next year. That book let kids hold onto hope for a better future."
msgstr "一個沒有戰爭的世界。沒有死亡。也不必擔心自己能否活到下一年。那本書讓孩子們還能盼著一個更好的未來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The city you attacked... they had people that wished for the same, I'm sure."
msgstr "你襲擊的那座城裡……肯定也有人盼著同樣的未來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know that. Do you think for a moment that I don't know that?"
msgstr "我知道。你真以為我不知道嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There's never a night where my actions don't haunt me."
msgstr "沒有一個夜晚，我能擺脫那些往事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Then how could you do it?"
msgstr "那你怎麼還下得了手？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Their souls."
msgstr "他們的靈魂。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I needed a source of power to enact the ritual that let my people enter the Dream."
msgstr "讓族人進入夢境的儀式，需要力量來支撐。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Other clans got their power in other ways, but it always came from somewhere."
msgstr "其他氏族有別的辦法獲取力量，但力量總得有個來源。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A forest clan, the Vieshar, when they brought forth their... you know."
msgstr "有個生活在森林裡的氏族，叫維沙爾。他們召出自己的……你知道我說的是什麼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The energy it required caused all of the plant-life across half the continent to wither and die. Millions starved when their plants couldn't grow as the ground was fallow for a decade."
msgstr "那需要的力量，讓一半大陸上的植物全部凋零、死去。土地整整十年寸草不生，莊稼種不出來，數百萬人活活餓死。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That doesn't mean-"
msgstr "可這也不代表……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My people gave so much to create Respite, but it wasn't enough. There's a reason we have that beast at the front. We were still pursued by those who sought our power."
msgstr "為了建成安歇之境，我的族人已經付出了太多，可還是不夠。我們把那頭牛羚放在入口，是有原因的。覬覦我們力量的人，仍在窮追不捨。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We tried so hard to be left in peace. My people needed a place where they could never be hurt again."
msgstr "我們費盡心力，只想求個安寧。我的族人需要一個永遠不會再受到傷害的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I killed thousands all those years ago. I will never not feel the weight of what I did."
msgstr "……多年前，我殺了上千人。這份罪孽，我永遠也卸不下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But now, my people, my kids, are safe. So are thousands of others. Each and every single one of these flowers was a person saved through what I did that day."
msgstr "可如今，我的族人，我的孩子，都安全了。還有成千上萬的其他人。這裡的每一朵花，都是因為我那天所做的事，才得以保全的一條生命。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I don't expect you to understand. But I do want you to know that what I did was hardly even a footnote in history."
msgstr "……我不指望你能理解。但我想讓你知道，我所做的那些事，在那段歷史裡，甚至都算不上值得一提。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why did you and Era bring us here, Talm?"
msgstr "塔爾姆，你和艾拉為什麼要把我們帶到這裡？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Go ask Era yourselves. She'll be waiting where you entered. There's nothing more for us to show you."
msgstr "你們自己去問艾拉吧。她會在你們進來的地方等著。我們已經沒有別的東西能給你們看了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I mean this sincerely, good luck."
msgstr "祝你們好運。這句話，我是真心的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm takes a shaky breath and waves you and [Companion Name] off, looking back down at the two flowers you first saw him tending to. The two of you look to each other, not even knowing where to begin with everything dropped on you. [Companion Name] brings you to a tower that stretches endlessly into the sky, and once you enter, you realize the circular platform was the one you fought Era and Talm on.\n\nAfter a ride to the top, the horrid, fleshy hallway you were chased in stretches out in front of you. Only one way out, it'd seem."
msgstr "塔爾姆顫抖著吸了口氣，揮手示意你和[Companion Name]離開，又低下頭，望著你最初見他照料的那兩朵花。你們面面相覷。一下子知道了這麼多事，誰也不知道該從何說起。[Companion Name]帶你來到一座直入天際的高塔前。走進去後，你才目擊，裡面那座圓形平臺，正是你們與艾拉、塔爾姆交戰的地方。\n\n平臺載著你們升到頂端。先前被牛羚追趕時跑過的那條血肉通道，再次出現在眼前。看來只有這一條出路了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This 'ought to be good!"
msgstr "這下可有得受了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's the best I've felt in a while."
msgstr "好久沒這麼舒坦過了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The fetid hallway offers more resistance than it did before. Arms of twisted, mottled flesh grasp at the pair of you as you run by, narrow passages threaten to crush you as you pass. No beast chases you this time, but the urgency you feel to leave is no lesser for it.\n\nTrue to Talm's word, Era waits for you by the exit with a sad smile."
msgstr "惡臭的通道比先前更加難以透過。你們奔跑時，一條條由斑駁血肉扭成的手臂伸來抓撓。狹窄的通路不斷擠壓，彷彿要把你們碾碎。這次沒有牛羚追在身後，可你們想逃出去的心情絲毫不減。\n\n塔爾姆沒有騙你們。艾拉正等在出口，臉上帶著一絲傷感的笑。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I saw that you two and Talm talked..."
msgstr "我看見你們和塔爾姆談過了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I trust that you're ready to leave?"
msgstr "想必已經準備好離開了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes. We learned of... The Titan Wars, and bringing forth the Dreamers was... enlightening when it came to practicing Summoning."
msgstr "是。我們知道了……泰坦戰爭的事。喚出入夢者，也讓我們對召喚術……有了不少領悟。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Though I don't know if I want anything to do with it after... all of this."
msgstr "不過，經歷了……這一切，我不知道自己還想不想碰它。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Running from your pet was great for cardio, and when you ran me through with your claws, I learned an important lesson about never trusting summoners again."
msgstr "被你們的寵物追著跑，倒是挺練體力的。至於你那一爪穿胸，也給我上了重要的一課：再也別相信召喚師。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What we don't get is... why. Why all of this? If you fought so hard to bring us here, why are you just... letting us go?"
msgstr "可我們還是不明白……為什麼？為什麼要做這些？你們費這麼大力氣把我們弄到這裡，現在卻又……放我們走？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "To prepare you."
msgstr "為了讓你們做好準備。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've seen what you two must face as you continue to face off against the Soulsmiths."
msgstr "我已經看見了，你們繼續與煉魂師對抗，將會面對什麼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What was... described to you by the Dreamers is nothing compared to what the Fateseekers saw all those years ago, at the end of the calamity."
msgstr "多年前，尋命者曾預見那場災難最終的結局。與那個結局相比，入夢者向你們……講述的那些，根本不算什麼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Going off of what Talm was saying..."
msgstr "照塔爾姆的說法……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bringing forth a Titan comes at an enormous cost to the world, but it wouldn't outright end it. "
msgstr "召出一頭泰坦，會讓世界付出極其慘重的代價，卻不會直接毀掉整個世界。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is true... if the Soulsmiths intended to stop there."
msgstr "沒錯……前提是煉魂師願意就此收手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They will go further than any clan of my time ever could, as there are none who can keep them in check."
msgstr "他們會比我那個時代的任何氏族都走得更遠，因為已經沒有人能制衡他們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The calamity my people lived through shaped the world into what it is today. Despite the devastation, there was a delicate balance between the clans."
msgstr "我的族人經歷的那場災難，將世界變成了如今的模樣。儘管破壞如此慘烈，當時的氏族之間仍維持著微妙的平衡。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Each had clan a... the same level of power. After decades of war, the world was nearly uninhabitable."
msgstr "每個氏族都有……相當的力量。幾十年戰亂之後，世界已幾乎無法生存。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "To prevent their own extinction, those that remained released their..."
msgstr "為了不讓自己也走向滅亡，倖存的氏族將各自的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Titans..."
msgstr "泰坦……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes. Back to the world. Plants grew again. The winds blew through the trees. Rain fell anew. The world began to heal with its natural power restored."
msgstr "是。將它們釋放，讓力量回歸天地。於是草木重新生長。風再次吹過林間。雨水重新落下。自然的力量得以歸還，世界也開始慢慢回春。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...But what does this have to do with us?"
msgstr "……可這跟我們有什麼關係？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] and I... We came to the capitol chasing after ghosts, wanting to know why our home was burnt to the ground by the Soulsmiths. To make them pay, and return our people if they still lived."
msgstr "我和[Companion Name]……我們來到都城，追查那些渺茫的線索，只想知道煉魂師為什麼要把我們的家燒成廢墟。讓他們付出代價。如果我們的鄉親還活著，就把他們帶回來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why did you and Talm test us? To what end?"
msgstr "你和塔爾姆為什麼要考驗我們？目的是什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your people will be used as fuel for the Soulsmith's beast. Like thousands... no... millions, of others will be."
msgstr "你們的鄉親，會成為煉魂師孕育那頭牛羚的養料。還有成千上萬……不，數以百萬計的人，也會遭遇同樣的命運。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you are the first new summoners to learn the art within centuries, outside of the Soulsmiths themselves."
msgstr "幾百年來，除煉魂師之外，你們是最早學會召喚術的兩個新人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How and why could we ever hope to stop them? Why does this fall on us, and not you and Talm?"
msgstr "可就憑我們，怎麼可能阻止他們？為什麼這事要落在我們頭上，而不是你和塔爾姆？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm and I have been around for centuries, child."
msgstr "孩子，我和塔爾姆已經活了幾百年。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "In the few years the two of you have existed on this world in comparison, you've already long-since exceeded our potential."
msgstr "相比之下，你們來到這世上才短短几年，卻早已展現出遠超我們的潛力。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I will never expect you to understand or forgive our appearent betrayal, but I promise you..."
msgstr "我不指望你們理解或原諒我們這番近乎背叛的所作所為。但我向你們保證……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This was the fastest, most effective way we could see to help you continue to surpass us."
msgstr "這是我們能想到的最快、最有效的辦法，能讓你們繼續成長，超越我們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...We didn't ask for this."
msgstr "……可我們根本沒想過要承擔這些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wish with all my heart that this was not your burden to bare."
msgstr "我也打心底裡希望，這副重擔不必落在你們肩上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But the world is unkind to us all, some more than others."
msgstr "可這世道不肯善待任何人，有些人受的苦還要更多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...What if we just... stopped? What then? Went back to Azamire, settled down, and never thought about any of this ever again?"
msgstr "……如果我們就此……收手呢？然後呢？回阿扎米爾，安安穩穩地過日子，再也不去想這些事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Could you, knowing that there's even a sliver of a chance I'm correct?"
msgstr "只要我說的還有一絲可能是真的，你們真能放得下嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Where would we even begin, without you and Talm?"
msgstr "……可沒有你和塔爾姆幫忙，我們又該從哪兒著手？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Far to the west are the Perilous Peaks, as I'm sure you know. Deep within, the Nalidasi Dwarves maintain archives that far predate even the oldest human civilizations."
msgstr "你們應該知道，遙遠的西方有一片險惡山脈。山脈深處，納裡達西矮人存檔著古老的文獻。最早的人類文明出現時，那些文獻就已存在。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...That's where I would start."
msgstr "……換作是我，就先去那裡找線索。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "For what it's worth, I'm sorry that this what Talm and I could offer you. I wish we had more time to do this the right way."
msgstr "不管這聲道歉還有沒有用，我都很抱歉。我和塔爾姆只能用這樣的方式幫你們。要是時間再充裕些，我們就能用更妥當的辦法了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] seems like she may have more to say, but turns a second later and reaches upward. The moment her hand touches the still, reflected pool of water that brought you into Respite, she bolts upward and out of the plane. You look to Era for only a moment before following after her.\n\nThe trek back to the mainland is much calmer than the one here, especially now with experience. You and [Companion Name] hardly share a word the entire trip back.\n\nYou sail further south than Tidebreak, heading back towards the capitol, unsure of what to do or where to go. Both of you go through the motions as you arrive at port, register your vessel, and pay for it to remain docked for some time. Checking with locals and accounting for travel to and from Gloomstone, it'd seem you were only in Respite for an hour, but you know it was much longer than that, and you guess that time moves differently there.\n\nYou wander the streets for a while before [Companion Name] suggests a nearby tavern. The two of you share a room, feeling a bit too unsteady to be apart for now. You don't even know where to begin, and your best friend seems to feel similarly, until she tosses your weapon to you. She's determined not to let anyone get the best of her again, and wants to spar. You smile for the first time in a while."
msgstr "[Companion Name]似乎還想說什麼，但片刻後，她轉過身，向上伸出手。她的手剛碰到那片帶你們進入安歇之境、如倒影般懸在上方的平靜池水，整個人便倏地向上衝去，離開了這片天地。你只看了艾拉一眼，便跟了上去。\n\n返回大陸的航程比來時平靜得多，有了先前的經驗，這一路也順利了不少。整個返程途中，你和[Companion Name]幾乎一句話也沒說。\n\n你們沒有停在破浪鎮，而是繼續向南，朝都城駛去。至於接下來該做什麼、該去哪裡，你們心裡都沒有答案。抵港、登記船隻、交錢讓船停泊一陣子，你們心不在焉地辦完了這些事。向當地人打聽過時間，再扣除往返幽暗之石的航程，你們算出自己似乎只在安歇之境待了一個小時。可你知道，自己在那裡度過的時間遠不止這些。想來，那裡的時間與外界流逝得並不一樣。\n\n你們在街上漫無目的地走了一陣，[Companion Name]提議去附近一家酒館。你們要了一間房。這會兒兩人都還有些心神不定，不願分開。你滿腹心事，卻不知從何說起。你最好的朋友似乎也一樣，直到她把你的武器拋給了你。她不願再輸給任何人，想和你切磋切磋。你終於露出了久違的笑容。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your time in Respite left you shaken and unsure of yourself. You definitely grew in the untold amount of time you stayed there, but if you were to follow the path laid out for you, is there any amount of growth that'd prepare you for what's to come? These thoughts come and go as you clash with [Companion Name]. As the two of you duel into the night, doubtlessly disturbing the other guests, you slowly let your time in Respite wash away from your mind.\n\nWhatever tomorrow brings will be tomorrow's problem. For now, [Companion Name] is safe, alive, and so are you.\n\nAnd for now, that's enough."
msgstr "安歇之境的經歷讓你心有餘悸，也讓你對自己生出了懷疑。你不知道在那裡究竟待了多久，但自己的確長進了不少。可若真要沿著他們指明的路走下去，無論變得多強，就真能應付接下來的一切嗎？你一邊與[Companion Name]過招，一邊胡思亂想。你們一直切磋到深夜，想必沒少打擾其他住客。而安歇之境的那些經歷，也漸漸被你拋到了腦後。\n\n明天會怎樣，就留到明天再操心吧。至少此刻，[Companion Name]還好好地活著，平安無事。你也一樣。\n\n這就夠了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Path to the Peaks - The next leg of your journey has been laid out before you. The Perilous Peaks lay far to the north, the surrounding lands mostly untouched by civilization, but with no better leads, it remains your best path forward."
msgstr "通往群峰之路——下一段旅程的方向已經明確。險惡山脈遠在北方，周圍大多是人跡罕至的荒野。不過，既然沒有更好的線索，眼下還是去那裡最有希望。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've got first watch, I suppose."
msgstr "看來今晚得我先守夜了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Something's out there!"
msgstr "外面有東西！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Stocked up on provisions and as mentally prepared as you can be, you and [Companion Name], set off, leaving the capitol far behind. Things remain in this strange state of... flux, where the both of you try your best to pretend the weight of everything that happened in Respite hasn't been weighing on your shoulders.\n\nAs you sit by this night's campfire, several days into your journey now, [Companion Name] drives her hatchet into a log she was splitting for kindling and turns to face you."
msgstr "備足補給，也儘可能做好心理準備後，你和[Companion Name]踏上旅途，將都城遠遠甩在身後。你們之間始終有種說不清的……彆扭。兩人都竭力裝作若無其事，彷彿安歇之境裡發生的一切，並沒有一直壓在心頭。\n\n出發幾天後的一晚，你坐在篝火旁。[Companion Name]正在劈柴，準備引火。她忽然把手斧往木頭上一嵌，轉過身來看著你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I loathe this, [Player Name]."
msgstr "我受夠了，[Player Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't mind splitting the wood tonight, just give me a sec-"
msgstr "今晚我來劈也行，等我一下……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You know that's not what I mean."
msgstr "你知道我說的不是這個。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This whole... funk. It's like we both died a little in Respite and have been little walking corpses ever since."
msgstr "我是說……咱們現在這副樣子。就像在安歇之境丟了半條魂，出來以後，一直活得像行屍走肉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I haven't been me, and you... haven't been you."
msgstr "我不像我，你也……不像你了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I know."
msgstr "……我知道。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't know... how we're meant to act, now."
msgstr "我不知道……現在該怎麼辦才好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I feel so deep in over my head. We came out here to find a couple people from Azamire and now we're..."
msgstr "這些事，已經遠遠超出我能應付的範圍了。咱們出來，只是想找到幾個阿扎米爾的鄉親，結果現在卻……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What, heading to the home of the Dwarves to learn about Summoning? To what end?"
msgstr "怎麼就要去矮人的地盤，打聽召喚術的事了？目的是什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I always knew that you'd leave Azamire and do something great, but me?"
msgstr "我一直知道，你遲早會離開阿扎米爾，幹出一番大事。可我呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You've gone through everything I have, and I'd argue more. "
msgstr "我經歷過的事，你一樣都沒落下。真要說起來，你經歷的還更多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I have no idea if what Era says is true. I truly hope it isn't."
msgstr "我不知道艾拉說的是不是真的。說實話，我希望不是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But... Despite how stupid their little test was, and how much I wish they would have just been honest from the get go..."
msgstr "但……他們那場考驗再怎麼荒唐，我再怎麼希望他們一開始就把話說清楚……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Era is right, at least about needing to help. I've seen too much to just... go back home."
msgstr "至少有一點艾拉沒說錯，我們得幫忙。見過這麼多事，我沒法就這樣……回家。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I mean, how could we? I feel that our days back in Azamire, even before the attack, are so far behind us."
msgstr "咱們怎麼可能做得到呢？我總覺得，在阿扎米爾的日子，連同遇襲前的一切，都已經離咱們很遠了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just... don't know where we belong anymore."
msgstr "我只是……不知道哪裡才是咱們的歸處了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Believe me, I'm in the same boat..."
msgstr "相信我，我也一樣……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't want to lose ourselves while we figure out where that is."
msgstr "可在找到那個地方之前，我不想咱們先把自己弄丟了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You leave it there as [Companion Name] sits beside you on your log-turned-seat and rests her head on your shoulder. You feel... lighter, and only hope that you find your place in all this mess. You shift a bit, getting ready to stand before you hear [Companion Name] start to snore."
msgstr "你們沒再說下去。[Companion Name]在你身旁的木頭上坐下，把頭靠在你肩上。你心裡……輕鬆了些。只盼在這一團亂麻之中，終究能找到屬於自己的位置。你挪了挪身子，正準備站起來，卻聽見[Companion Name]打起了呼嚕。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It looks like a whole pack has come out to greet us."
msgstr "看來是一整群來迎接咱們了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're gonna have to move camp."
msgstr "這營地是待不下去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your mind wasn't playing tricks on you. The small snap of a branch here, something disturbing the underbrush there. It's always difficult to differentiate between the general comings and goings of creatures in the night, and when something is actively stalking you.\n\nUnfortunately, this is the later. You bolt upright and draw your weapon, waking [Companion Name] in the process as a particularly large Rockwolf charges right for you."
msgstr "先前那些動靜，並不是你的錯覺。一會兒是樹枝輕輕折斷的脆響，一會兒又是灌木林裡的窸窣聲。夜裡的牛羚四處走動，和有什麼東西正在悄悄跟蹤你，往往很難分清。\n\n不幸的是，這次是後者。一頭格外龐大的石狼徑直撲來。你猛地起身，拔出武器，也驚醒了[Companion Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ughhh, what... are you doing?"
msgstr "唔……你……幹什麼呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] wake up!"
msgstr "[Companion Name]，快醒醒！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dinner came to us tonight, it looks like."
msgstr "看來今晚的晚飯自己送上門了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seeing you prepared for it, the beast diverts its charge and instead runs past you, and darting back into the woods, outside of the light of your campfire.\n\nJust outside of the clearing you can see the firelight reflect off of eyes. Lots of eyes."
msgstr "見你已有防備，那牛羚猛地轉向，從你身邊掠過，又竄回篝火照不到的樹林裡。空地邊緣，一雙雙眼睛映著火光。多得驚人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This is some of the toughest meat I've worked with..."
msgstr "這肉可真夠韌的，我還沒處理過幾次這麼難下刀的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This smells and looks way better than expected."
msgstr "這賣相，這香味，可比想象中好多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Huffing and puffing the cool night air, you hold your weapon aloft, challenging more of the beasts to come out. Far fewer of the pack remain, and those that do decide that they've bitten off more than they can chew once the biggest of them lies dead at your feet and dart off into the trees, but not before one grabs your pack of provisions out of the tree it was hung up in. No one had said anything about wolves about the size of horses, so you didn't think to hang your food that high."
msgstr "你大口喘著氣，吸入夜間的涼意，同時高舉武器，等著還有哪頭牛羚敢上前。狼群已所剩無幾。見最大的那頭倒在你腳下，剩下的終於知道惹錯了對手，紛紛逃進樹林。可臨走前，還是有一頭叼走了你掛在樹上的補給袋。又沒人告訴過你，這裡的狼能長得跟馬一樣大，你自然沒想到要把食物掛得那麼高。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... good morning, [Companion Name]."
msgstr "呃……早啊，[Companion Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You know how I always told you I wanted a dog?"
msgstr "還記得我總說想養條狗嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I might get a cat instead."
msgstr "我看還是養貓吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't bring that evil on us, I know there's some scary kitties up in the Peaks."
msgstr "可別招這種禍，我聽說山裡有些貓也嚇人得很。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Knowing our luck, we'd wake up with one nibbling one of our arms."
msgstr "就咱們這運氣，說不定一覺醒來，它正抱著咱們的胳膊啃呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A girl can dream."
msgstr "想想總行吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wolves took our food, didn't they?"
msgstr "那些狼把咱們的吃的叼走了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If they just wanted that, they could have grabbed it and been gone without trying to go for our throats."
msgstr "要是隻衝著吃的來，拿了就走不就行了，何必非咬斷咱們的脖子？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think they just took it as a consolation prize."
msgstr "我看是沒吃著咱們，順手拿點東西安慰一下自己。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They'll need some consoling after eating it. Hardtack and some... absolutely foul pemmican isn't exactly the height of camping food."
msgstr "等吃過袋子裡的東西，它們才真需要安慰。硬餅乾，還有那股味兒……難以下嚥的油脂肉乾，實在算不上什麼野餐美味。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, we do still have to eat something. Nothing stopping us from having them, right?"
msgstr "不過，咱們總得吃點東西。吃它們也沒什麼不行吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gotta do something with the bodies."
msgstr "這些屍體總得處理。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've never had wolf before, but they have to be stringy right?"
msgstr "我還沒吃過狼肉，不過肯定又老又柴吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And I don't know how keen I am on eating something that has maybe eaten a person before."
msgstr "而且，萬一它們吃過人，我可有點下不去嘴。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's a rare day someone comes this far north, I'd say the odds they've eaten someone are low."
msgstr "平時哪有人跑到這麼北邊來。要我說，它們吃過人的可能性不大。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That doesn't sound like zero."
msgstr "可也不是完全沒有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But well, when in Emor."
msgstr "不過嘛，入鄉隨俗唄。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Where's that?"
msgstr "……隨哪門子的俗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Dunno. Something I heard people in the capitol saying."
msgstr "……不知道。聽都城的人這麼說的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You get some rest, I'll work on getting all these bodies prepared."
msgstr "你歇會兒吧，我來處理這些屍體。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Surely nothing will get attracted by all the corpses."
msgstr "這麼多屍體堆著，肯定不會招來什麼東西吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Surely."
msgstr "肯定不會。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll feed you to them first, if you just jinxed us."
msgstr "你要是真把什麼招來了，我就先把你餵給它們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I will never expect you to understand or forgive our apparent betrayal, but I promise you..."
msgstr "我不指望你們理解或原諒我們這番近乎背叛的所作所為。但我向你們保證……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's almost like they don't want people coming up here!"
msgstr "他們這是壓根不想讓人上來吧！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Surely they'll be glad to see us."
msgstr "見到咱們，他們肯定高興。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The magic-enhanced tools you picked up back in the capitol help you make quick work of the pile, at least compared to what it'd usually take you. [Companion Name] takes the freshly cooked steaks as you finish with them and gives them a bit of extra love and seasoning once you're done. With fresh food and better spirits, you pack up camp and head further towards the peaks.\n\nThe two of you nibble smoked strips of rockwolf as you walk. It's very crunchy."
msgstr "你在都城買的那些附魔工具派上了用場，處理起這堆狼屍，比平時快了不少。你每煎好一塊肉，[Companion Name]便接過去，再添些調料，細細料理一番。有了新鮮食物，心情也好了些。你們收拾營地，繼續朝山脈進發。\n\n你們邊走邊嚼著燻好的石狼肉條。咬起來嘎嘣脆。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wow, this is... really good!"
msgstr "哇，這……還真好吃！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think every meal is made a little better if it tried to eat you first."
msgstr "我覺得，想吃你的東西，吃起來就是格外香。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I mean, really, it's only fair when you think about it. Spite tastes good."
msgstr "你想啊，它想吃咱們，咱們吃它，誰也不虧。解氣，還解饞。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Though, these herbs you found definitely help. "
msgstr "不過，你找到的這些香草也功不可沒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The forest provides. Makes me wonder what other kinds of creatures taste like."
msgstr "林子裡好東西可不少。說得我都想嚐嚐別的怪物是什麼味兒了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I really liked that Stonehopper back in the Broken Pass, too."
msgstr "之前在粉碎關口吃的石跳獸，我也挺喜歡的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, both these and the wolves are pretty much just bigger, scarier versions of creatures we already know."
msgstr "嗯，石跳獸也好，石狼也好，其實都是咱們熟悉的動物長大、變兇了些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I didn't expect to like the wolf this much, but what about some weird stuff?"
msgstr "我倒沒想到狼肉這麼好吃。那要是再古怪一點的呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Like... Slimes?"
msgstr "比如……史萊姆？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ooo, that's interesting. Maybe they'd be like some kind of... gelatin?"
msgstr "哦，這倒有意思。說不定吃起來像……某種果凍？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I hope so."
msgstr "……但願吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If we run out of food, maybe we go check out a dungeon and see what kind of creatures we can find?"
msgstr "等食物吃完了，要不要找個地牢逛逛，看看裡面有什麼怪物？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Might be delicious, might poison us and we die horribly."
msgstr "沒準是美味，也沒準有毒，吃完就死得慘兮兮的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm down."
msgstr "我看行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you travel onward, the dense forest gives way to rocky slopes. Little by little you find yourselves walking less and scrambling more, until the journey has turned into an outright climb. The entrance to the Dwarves' home is not one they wanted visitors to get to easily, it'd seem."
msgstr "繼續前行，茂密的森林漸漸被岩石遍佈的山坡取代。腳下的路越來越難走，你們不得不手腳並用，到後來，乾脆一路都在往上爬。看來，矮人並不想讓訪客輕輕鬆鬆就找到家門。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You and [Companion Name] take turns lugging your gear up the mountainside. You're sure you were told the entrance to the dwarven capitol was somewhere around here, but \"lower eastern side of those mountains over there\" weren't exactly prime directions from a group of what seemed to be well-meaning schoolkids. They said the entrance was hidden, and that those seeking the dwarves would likely have to climb for days or weeks, to find the entrance. Nevertheless, blissfully far from the peak but still not easy to access, a large gate carved into the stone stands before you, presumably leading deeper into the mountain. On a low wall flanking either side of the gate, a squat dwarf with a short-trimmed blond beard naps soundly, resting his chin on the pommel of his large maul in what appears to be a heavily practiced position.\n\nYou clear your throat a couple of times, trying to get his attention, but to no avail. So, you walk up and his helmet with your knuckle, just barely able to reach him atop the wall. He wakes with a shout, wide-eyed and startled by your presence, so much so that he careens backward off the wall. You quickly scramble after him and find the dwarf unconscious - but breathing - on the other side.\n\nYou don't know how you're going to explain this to the rest of the dwarves."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]輪流揹著裝備，沿山坡往上攀爬。你記得有人說過，矮人都城的入口就在這附近。給你們指路的是一群學生，看著倒是熱心，可一句「就在那邊幾座山的東側，靠山腳的地方」，實在讓人摸不著頭腦。他們說入口藏得很隱蔽，想找到矮人，多半得在山裡爬上幾天，甚至幾個星期。好在，雖然這地方也不好找，卻遠不用爬到山頂。一扇鑿在巖壁上的大門終於出現在你們面前，門後想必通往山體深處。大門兩旁各有一段矮牆。其中一段牆上，一個矮墩墩的矮人正睡得香甜。他留著修剪整齊的黃金短鬍鬚，下巴擱在大槌的柄端上。這姿勢，看著就知道不是頭一回了。\n\n你清了幾次嗓子，想引起他的注意，可他毫無反應。於是，你走近矮牆，勉強伸手夠到他的頭盔，用指節敲了敲。他驚叫著醒來，瞪大眼睛看著你，嚇得往後一仰，直接從牆上翻了下去。你趕緊翻過去檢視，目擊矮人已經昏了，好在還有呼吸。\n\n這下，你可不知道該怎麼向其他矮人解釋了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dwarf Blood - With the sole Nalidasi guard unconscious at your feet and a gate blocking your path, you're going to have some explaining to do."
msgstr "矮人之血——唯一的納裡達西守護昏倒在你腳邊，大門又擋住了去路。這下，你可得好好解釋一番了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It it a pull door..?"
msgstr "這門是往外拉的……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ah! A push door! Oh... wait, no."
msgstr "啊！原來是往裡推！哦……等等，也不對。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You quickly look around as [Companion Name] scrambles up the low wall after you. She lightly thumps your back once she stands beside you, then bends down to check the dwarf."
msgstr "你趕緊環顧四周，[Companion Name]也跟著你翻過矮牆。她在你身旁站穩，輕輕拍了一下你的背，隨後俯身檢視矮人的情況。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They should consider making you an ambassador, truly remarkable work [Player Name]."
msgstr "真該派你來當大使。幹得漂亮啊，[Player Name]。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "He was sleeping, I just wanted to wake him up!"
msgstr "他睡著了，我只是想叫醒他！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just giving you a hard time."
msgstr "逗你呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Unfortunately - intentions aside - it looks like you've had a bit of the opposite effect."
msgstr "不過，不管你本來想幹什麼……現在看來，好像適得其反了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I guess we'll have to let ourselves in, and then find some way of explaining... this."
msgstr "看來咱們只能自己進去了，再想辦法解釋……這件事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You look over the gate and wall and just barely spot it. A small stone hatch, likely more typically used as an entrance so they don't have to open and close the main gate all the time. Though, with a path like the one you travelled, it's a wonder they made such a gate in the first place.\n\nAs expected the hatch is shut and locked, with no apparent keyhole or method of opening. You get to work trying to open it regardless while [Companion Name] wraps the dwarf's head."
msgstr "你仔細打量大門和圍牆，好不容易才目擊一處不起眼的地方。那裡有一扇小石門，平日裡大概都從這裡進出，省得總要開關大門。不過，來時的路難走成那樣，你倒很好奇，他們當初為什麼還要造這麼大一扇門。\n\n不出所料，小石門關得嚴嚴實實，已經鎖上了。門上既看不到鑰匙孔，也找不到開門的機關。你還是動手試著開門，[Companion Name]替矮人包紮頭部。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's see what this dwarf has got!"
msgstr "來，讓我見識見識這位矮人的本事！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not bad, not bad."
msgstr "不錯，不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You try half a dozen methods of opening the hatch until you realize that it's magically imbued. While there are methods for figuring out the words for opening magic locks, you hardly feel you have the time to do so. Eventually you give up on any gentle method of opening and just jam your tools through the side and start to pry while saying every version of 'open' you can think of.\n\nEventually, it gives way, and you're not sure about what worked specifically, but it hardly matters. You peer down the hatch to find a squat tunnel. You grab the unconscious dwarf and throw him over your shoulder, then head down the tunnel with [Companion] just behind you.\n\nEventually the tunnel opens up into a small chamber with two dwarves cheerfully playing some form of dice game. The two look at you with shock, the shorter of the two runs for the door leading out and latches it - keeping you from progressing further - while the one who is more stout hefts a large blade in your direction and frowns."
msgstr "你試了五六種辦法，才意識到這扇小門施過魔法。雖說有辦法找出開啟魔法鎖的口令，可眼下實在沒那個工夫。最後，你放棄了溫柔的辦法，直接把工具塞進門縫，動手硬撬，嘴裡還把能想到的各種「開門」口令唸了個遍。\n\n門總算開了。究竟是哪一招起了作用，你也說不清，不過這會兒已經不重要了。你朝門內探頭望去，下面是一條低矮的通道。你把昏迷的矮人扛上肩，沿通道往下走，[Companion]緊隨其後。\n\n走了一段，通道通向一間小屋。裡面有兩個矮人，正興高采烈地玩著某種骰子游戲。兩人驚愕地看著你。個子較矮的那個衝到另一扇門前，插上門閂，堵住了去路；更壯實的那個則皺起眉，舉起大刀對準你。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oi! What are you doin' with Humphrey?"
msgstr "喂！你們把漢弗萊怎麼了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Attackers! Thought you'd pull a fast one on us, eh?"
msgstr "有入侵者！想打我們個措手不及，是吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, no! Easy now, I'm not here to hurt anyone."
msgstr "不，不是！別衝動，我不想傷害任何人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Little late for that, don't ya think?"
msgstr "這話說得有點晚了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I-"
msgstr "我……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your friend was so startled by seeing two humans pop up over the cliff that he fell off the wall he was sitting on."
msgstr "你們的朋友看見兩個大活人突然從崖邊冒出來，嚇了一跳，從坐著的牆上摔下去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Ah."
msgstr "……哦。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yeah, that sounds like our Humphrey. Thanks for haulin' him down here"
msgstr "嗯，這確實像漢弗萊幹得出來的事。多謝你們把他背下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So, are we okay?"
msgstr "那……沒事了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Suppose so. I'm Tee, human. Short one over there is Pout."
msgstr "應該沒事了。人類，我叫提。那邊那個矮點的叫波特。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What're your names?"
msgstr "你們叫什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's a pleasure, sorry we gave you and your friend quite the start."
msgstr "很高興認識你們。抱歉，把你們和你們的朋友都嚇了一跳。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Meh, it's good to get the heart racing every once in a while."
msgstr "嗐，偶爾受點驚嚇，心跳快些也挺好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Gotta ask ya though, why'd you come up through our expedition entrance?"
msgstr "不過得問一句，你們怎麼從我們的探險通道進來了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...is there a different entrance?"
msgstr "……還有別的入口？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh yeah, just another stone's throw north. Got it all freshly paved n' everything."
msgstr "當然有，再往北一點就是。路都剛鋪好，別提多平整了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's real nice, you shoulda gone there. We don't get visitors often, especially not humans."
msgstr "那邊可好走了，你們該從那兒來的。我們這兒不常有訪客，人類就更少了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This one is for our... well, don't know if we can share that. But suffice to say, it's mainly an exit. "
msgstr "這條通道是給我們的……嗯，這個好像不能隨便說。總之，主要是用來出去的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Honestly surprised you even found it, let alone climbed up here!"
msgstr "你們居然找到了這裡，還一路爬上來了，真夠厲害的！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll buy ya a drink later if we see ya, wanna hear about that climb!"
msgstr "回頭碰上了，請你們喝一杯，好好講講是怎麼爬上來的！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm going to find those kids when we get back to the capitol."
msgstr "等回了都城，我非找那幾個孩子算賬不可。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well! It's a pleasure to meet you both. Shall we leave Humphry with you, then?"
msgstr "好了！很高興認識二位。那漢弗萊就交給你們了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Well, we'll bring ya to the capitol, but we need to go ask around first. I think the two of you are the first human visitors we've had in a few years at least!"
msgstr "……嗯，我們會帶你們去都城，不過得先去問問。你們恐怕是這幾年頭一回來的人類訪客了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tee nods at the statement and unlatches the door and heads out to whether it may lead. Pout fishes around in a pouch on his waist and withdraws a flask and wafts it under Humphrey's nose, who groggily comes to. He takes the flask and takes a sip, instantly regaining his ruddy complexion. As he looks around in a daze, he blushes, embarrassed by the whole endeavor.\n\nAs the four of you wait, Humphrey asks if you'd give him a chance to regain a bit of his pride with a little bout."
msgstr "提點點頭，拔開門閂走了出去，也不知道是去哪裡。波特在腰間的小袋裡摸索一番，掏出一個酒壺，放到漢弗萊鼻子下面晃了晃。漢弗萊迷迷糊糊地醒了過來。他接過酒壺喝了一口，臉上立刻回春了紅潤。他茫然地看看四周，隨即想起剛才的窘事，立刻漲紅了臉。\n\n你們四個等候時，漢弗萊問你願不願意陪他過兩招，讓他挽回點面子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't have much of a choice now, do we?"
msgstr "看來也由不得咱們了，是吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Even the king?!"
msgstr "……連國王也來？！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Every time you knock the dwarf down, he sips a bit from the flask again and gets right back up, ready to go again. He's a good fighter, and though you are better, it feels like you are fighting a small platoon one-by-one. [Companion Name] steps in a few times as well, either looking to give you a break or flex her own skills.\n\nDespite the fact that the chamber is well-lit and Pout dragged all the furniture out of the way, the low ceilings make for a cramped fighting place for the two of you, and you have to spend a lot of mental energy to not bash your head or weapons on the ceiling while dodging the dwarf's blows.\n\nEventually Tee re-enters the room with another dwarf alongside him. The newcomer has a bushy white beard that nearly trails down to the floor, and sits atop a floating disk of metal, lit by intricate patterns of runes and glowing engravings all throughout its surface. You hardly have the time to inspect it before the newcomer clears his throat."
msgstr "每次被你打倒，矮人便喝一小口酒，立刻又爬起來，準備再戰。他身手不錯，雖然還不是你的對手，可一場接一場打下來，你簡直像是輪番打了一小隊人。[Companion Name]也上場接了幾回，或許是想讓你歇口氣，或許只是想活動活動筋骨。\n\n屋裡光線充足，波特也把傢俱全拖到了一邊，可對你們來說，屋頂還是太低，打起來束手束腳。你既得躲開矮人的攻擊，又得時段留神，別讓腦袋或武器撞上天花板。\n\n過了一陣，提帶著另一個矮人回來了。來者蓄著濃密的白鬍子，幾乎垂到地上。他坐在一塊懸空的金屬圓盤上，圓盤表面佈滿繁複的符文和雕紋，流光閃爍。你還沒來得及細看，他便清了清嗓子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "*Ahem*. Greetings, tall-folk. I am the grand Archivist and royal advisor to the king."
msgstr "*呃哼*。你們好，高個子們。我是首席檔案管理員，也是國王的御前顧問。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I bring tidings from our 37th ruler, Oyadazminis, who welcomes you into our home to look upon our works, cherish our history, and hopefully... and I quote, \"drink until you hit the floor.\""
msgstr "我奉我國第三十七任君主奧亞達茲米尼斯之命，歡迎二位來到我們的國度，欣賞我們的造物，領略我們的歷史，並希望你們……以下是國王的原話：「喝到趴下為止。」"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If you have any other desires or aspirations while visiting Koganusan, they may be granted, should we deem you worthy of such requests."
msgstr "二位在科加努桑若還有其他願望或訴求，只要我們認為你們有此資格，也可酌情滿足。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This may be too lofty of an ask - please forgive our trespasses if so - but we hear the Nalidasi Archives are quite the sight to behold."
msgstr "接下來的請求或許有些冒昧，還請見諒。我們聽說，納裡達西典藏館非常值得一看。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...is that so? I can count the number of times a human has been allowed into our archives on one hand since Koganusan was just a hole in the dirt."
msgstr "……是嗎？從科加努桑還只是地上一個洞的時候算起，允許進入典藏館的人類，一隻手就數得過來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "So, forgive me if I think you're full of silt."
msgstr "所以，恕我直言，我覺得你們在胡扯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...They've almost doubtlessly changed their names through the years, but do Era and Talm ring a bell?"
msgstr "……過了這麼多年，他們多半換過名字。不過，艾拉和塔爾姆，這兩個名字您聽過嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not even remotely."
msgstr "從來沒有。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What about two ageless Sum-"
msgstr "那，兩個長生不老的召……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As the word starts to leave your mouth, the Archivist's eyes go wide and he snaps his fingers, and you find the words silent as they leave your mouth. He chuckles and bids the guards farewell, then snaps again. You find yourselves in front of a grand throne that's equal parts imposing and gaudy. In it sits a dwarf you'd guess is middle aged, with a dark beard studded with gemstones and clasps of metal, similar to the crown atop his head.\n\nYou've been brought into what would seem to be a lavish banquet as table after table of divine looking food and immaculately dressed dwarves fill the throne room.\n\nThe guests look at your studden entrance with curiosity and excitement, which you consider to be better than suspicion and fear. The Archivist floats up to the king and whispers in his ear, and his eyes go from interest, to shock, and then... excitement. He claps his hands once and hands before the room, then announces to everyone that the entertainment has arrived.\n\nThe two of you are ushered into the center of the room, then, one by one, several of the more rugged nobles in the room, along with their guards, encircle you.\n\nThe king announces that you're not to be killed, only to be given a proper welcome to the kingdom, whatever that may mean. You don't know if it particularly matters based on how quickly you're swarmed by the nobles and their guards."
msgstr "你剛要說出那個詞，檔案管理員便瞪大雙眼，打了個響指。你嘴唇還在動，卻發不出任何聲音。他輕笑一聲，向守護告辭，又打了個響指。轉眼間，你們已站在一座宏偉的王座前。那王座氣勢十足，也浮誇得毫不含糊。王座上坐著一名看起來正值中年的矮人。他深色的鬍鬚間綴滿寶石與金屬飾釦，與頭上的王冠頗為相配。\n\n你們似乎被直接帶進了一場盛大的宴會。王座大廳裡，一桌桌珍饈美食令人垂涎，衣著考究的矮人賓客滿堂皆是。對於你們的突然出現，賓客們顯得既好奇又興奮。你覺得，這總比猜疑和恐懼要好。檔案管理員飄到國王身旁，在他耳邊低語了幾句。國王的眼神由好奇轉為震驚，接著又變成了……興奮。他拍了一下手，站起身，向滿廳賓客宣佈：助興的節目來了。\n\n你們被領到大廳中央。隨後，幾位長相粗獷的貴族帶著各自的護衛，陸續圍了上來。\n\n國王宣佈，不許傷及你們的性命，只須好好歡迎二位來到王國。至於這「歡迎」究竟是什麼意思，你也不清楚。不過，貴族和守護一擁而上，你已經沒工夫琢磨這話管不管用了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Nothing too scary, then?"
msgstr "那應該沒什麼嚇人的吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "She seems pleased."
msgstr "她看起來挺滿意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you beat down the guards and nobles who look at you expectantly, you wouldn't have guessed the king himself would have risen to join in on the fun, but through no small deal of effort, he fell like the rest of his people. You tried your best to not kill the man, but with how hard he hit the ground, you wonder if you overdid it.\n\nYou clutch your weapon, covered in more blood than you ever would have expected for a 'friendly' bout. With the Nalidaian king at your feet, you eye the Archivist, worried that despite the promise of this just being for 'entertainment,' you'd find yourself at the hands of a much more upset populace. Instead, he shrugs towards you and gives a small nod.\n\nOyadazminis groans and pushes himself up, he beams with a giant smile, several of his missing teeth having been replaced by intricately carved gemstones. If this is 'entertainment' to these dwarves, you're surprised he's not missing more.\n\nHe waves to the nobles and grabs you and [Companion Name] by your shoulders, dragging you off behind the throne room to an lavishly decorated room, with the Archivist following closely behind. The floating man waves his hand over the door, causing the entrance to vanish entirely under a waterfall of blue sparks."
msgstr "你接連打倒那些躍躍欲試的守護和貴族，卻沒想到國王本人也會起身加入這場熱鬧。費了好一番力氣後，他也和自己的臣民一樣倒下了。你已經儘量留手，可見他摔得那麼重，還是不免擔心自己是不是打過了頭。\n\n你緊握武器，身上沾滿鮮血，遠遠超出了你對一場「友好切磋」的預期。納裡達西的國王就倒在你腳邊。你看向檔案管理員，心裡有些發虛：雖說事先講好了只是「助興」，可這些矮人真不會翻臉嗎？他卻只是朝你聳聳肩，微微點了點頭。\n\n奧亞達茲米尼斯呻吟著撐起身，咧嘴大笑。他缺了幾顆牙，鑲著雕工精細的寶石。要是這些矮人平時就靠這個「助興」，你倒奇怪他怎麼還有這麼多牙。\n\n他朝貴族們揮揮手，一手攬住你，一手攬住[Companion Name]，把你們帶進王座大廳後方一間裝飾華麗的房間。檔案管理員緊隨其後。懸在空中的檔案管理員抬手一揮，藍色火花如瀑布般傾瀉而下，整扇門隨即消失得無影無蹤。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Haven't had a proper bout like that in half a dozen years!"
msgstr "足足六年沒打得這麼痛快了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Don't get visitors with as much fire n' 'em as the both of you everyday. Thanks for indulging my people, they'll like you a lot more for that."
msgstr "像你們倆這麼有勁頭的客人，可不是天天都能碰上。多謝你們陪大家盡興。這一場打完，他們肯定更喜歡你們了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It didn't seem that any of you were particularly keen on letting us not participate."
msgstr "可我看，你們也沒打算讓我們拒絕吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You could have gone crying to your mothers at any moment, but you would have been laughed out of the courtroom."
msgstr "你們隨時都能哭著回去找媽媽，不過那樣的話，就得一路被笑出大廳了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Archivist told me what you seek. At least, part of it."
msgstr "檔案管理員把你們的來意告訴我了。至少說了一部分。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If I were to let anyone into the Archives, they'd have to work their stones off for half a human lifetime to even glimpse the outermost door."
msgstr "換了別人，想進典藏館，非得賣命幹上半個人類的壽命，才有資格看一眼最外面那扇門。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't imagine the two of you have the time for such things, if you're telling the truth about our... mutual acquaintances."
msgstr "不過，關於我們那兩位……共同的熟人，你們要是沒撒謊，想必也沒工夫等那麼久。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't know if I'd call them that at this point..."
msgstr "事到如今，我可不知道還該不該把他們當熟人……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But the two of you are familiar with Talm and Era, then?"
msgstr "這麼說，你們二位認識塔爾姆和艾拉？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aye. They translated half the... special materials we've got in the Archives long ago."
msgstr "對。很久以前，他們替我們翻譯過典藏館裡一半的……特殊統計。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Decided that as payment, they'd take the other half. So many years of history lost..."
msgstr "然後決定拿走另一半，作為報酬。那麼多古老的史料，就這麼沒了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Under normal circumstances I'd agree, but if those books had anything to do with the nastiness that tall fella could do..."
msgstr "換作別的東西，我也會心疼。可那些書要是跟那個高個子使的邪門手段有關……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good riddance, I say."
msgstr "依我看，拿走了才好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We got rather well acquainted with it ourselves. "
msgstr "那些手段，我們也算親自領教過了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why we need to get into the Archives is a long story, but... it was under their recommendation."
msgstr "我們為什麼要進典藏館，說來話長。不過……確實是他們指點我們來的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I believe that, which is the only reason I didn't toss you out the second it was mentioned."
msgstr "這我信。不然，你們一提這件事，就已經被我趕出去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That whole art... It's dangerous. Most everyone at my level of station across the continent is at least loosely aware of Summoning."
msgstr "那門法術……極其危險。整個大陸上，地位與我相當的人，大多多少少都知道些召喚術的事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Mostly because each nation has their own collection of histories and magic under lock and key. Too treacherous to share. Using it is out of the question."
msgstr "主要是因為，各國都把與之有關的史料和魔法典籍嚴密封存著。公開太危險。使用就更不必說了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "To be honest, your arrival and need for said materials has us more... concerned more than anything."
msgstr "說實話，你們突然到訪，還要查閱那些統計，我們更多的是……擔憂。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Talm and Era are two of the most trusted individuals to the kingdom, but we cannot simply give the materials to you."
msgstr "塔爾姆和艾拉深受王國信任，但我們也不能就這麼把統計交給你們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Aye. We trust their judgement, but both protocol and public perception hold a lot of sway here."
msgstr "對。我們信得過他們。不過，該守的規矩得守，也得讓大家心服口服。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can we do anything else that doesn't involve public beatdowns or ballroom brawls to earn our way in, then?"
msgstr "那除了當眾打一架、把宴會廳鬧個底朝天，我們還能做點什麼，換個進去的資格？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes, and it'll be your great pleasure to do so. My lovely daughter will be your ward. You couldn't find yourself in better hands if you tried."
msgstr "當然有，而且是件美差。我的寶貝女兒就託付給你們了。有她幫忙，你們儘管放心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As Oyadazminis finishes, there's a shimmer in the corner of the room. A young red haired dwarf steps out from seemingly thin air, a cloak of woven blue metal thread billowing out around her. She introduces herself as Redilok and gives a small curtsy and mentions she enjoyed watching you give her father quite the wallop out in the ballroom. The king turns about as red as his daughter's hair and shakes his head before motioning for the Archivist to rematerialize the door, then the two of them depart.\n\nThe princess opens a new door in a different section of wall and motions for the two of you to follow. You pass through the doorway and find yourselves on the balcony of a large tower connected to - what you presume is - the castle you were just in. The balcony overlooks the whole of Koganusan, the whole of the capitol fitting within an unbelievable hollow under the Perilous Peaks. You hardly have the time to take it in before the princess starts running through its extensive history, and that of their western neighbors, a smaller kingdom of dwarves who live under a large volcanic mountain range.\n\nWhat she wants your assistance with is no small task. Connecting the two kingdoms via a magical transport line that allows a stone platform to accelerate to incredible speeds. The 'Stoneway' as she calls it is already well underway, but still needs an extraordinary amount of work. Before you're allowed to begin though, you must show her how you go about summoning creatures, purely to satisfy her curiosity. If she's to vouch for you, she wants to know just what secrets her father intends to give away to humans."
msgstr "奧亞達茲米尼斯剛說完，房間角落便閃過一陣微光。一個年輕的紅髮矮人女孩憑空走了出來，身上那件用藍色金屬絲織成的披風隨之飄動。她微微屈膝行禮，介紹自己叫雷迪洛克，又說剛才看你們在宴會廳把她父親狠狠揍了一頓，實在過癮。國王的臉漲得幾乎和女兒的頭髮一樣紅。他搖搖頭，示意檔案管理員把門變回來，隨後兩人一同離開了。\n\n公主在另一面牆上開啟一扇門，招呼你們跟上。你們穿過門，來到一座高塔的陽臺上。這座塔連著一座城堡，想必就是你們剛才待的地方。站在陽臺上，整座科加努桑盡收眼底。險惡山脈下的洞窟大得不可思議，竟容納了整座都城。你還沒看上幾眼，公主便開始講述這座城市漫長的歷史，接著又說起西邊的鄰國。那是一個較小的矮人王國，建在一大片火山山脈之下。\n\n她想請你們幫忙的事，著實不小。她打算修建一條連線兩國的魔法運輸線，讓石臺沿著線路飛速行駛。這條被她稱作「石道」的線路已經修了一大段，可要做的事仍然堆積如山。不過，動工之前，她想先看看你們是怎麼召喚生物的。沒別的，就是好奇。既然要為你們擔保，她總得弄清楚，父親究竟準備把什麼秘密交給人類。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Since she was in the room when her father mentioned the closely guarded art of Summoning, you don't find any harm in indulging the princess's request. You and [Companion Name] show princess Redilok several of the creatures you've learned to create over your journey here, much to her pleasure. She takes several sketches of the beasts, and asks for you to make them perform... all manner of things, some practical, some a bit silly. She questions you on your journey here throughout the 'tests' as she calls them. You fill her in. The Soulsmiths, your travels. Talm and Era's trials. She listens without a single comment, enraptured by your tales.\n\nAfter a long while and the summoning of several more creatures, Redilok closes her notepad and makes it vanish, much like the Archivist did with the door, earlier. She thanks you for your time and asks you to make yourself at home, and that she'll be in touch very soon regarding the Stoneway, then promptly slips off the balcony backward and disappears.\n\nAfter confirming you didn't just witness the princess fall to her untimely death, you enter what seems to be 'your' room from the balcony and find a room that likely cost several thousand gold just to furnish, let alone build. A two plush four poster beds, a pool of steaming water kept warm by some arcane source you're unfamiliar with. Thick carpet, beautiful silken drapes, and various pieces of artwork depicting lands you've never seen nor heard of.\n\nThe sight is made a bit warmer by the fact that [Companion Name] has already launched herself at the nearest bed and started to snore before even making contact with the pillow, a sentiment you cannot help but share moments later."
msgstr "先前她父親談起召喚術這門嚴守的秘術時，她就在房間裡。既然如此，你覺得給她看看也無妨。你和[Companion Name]召出幾種一路上學會創造的生物，讓雷迪洛克公主看了個夠。她興致勃勃地給這些牛羚畫了幾張速寫，又讓你們指揮它們做這做那。有些需求還算實用，有些就純粹是在逗著玩了。她把這些叫作「測試」，還一邊看，一邊問起你們來這裡之前的經歷。你將一路上的事告訴了她。煉魂師，還有你們四處奔波的經歷。還有塔爾姆和艾拉設下的考驗。她聽得入神，一句也沒有插嘴。\n\n又過了好一陣，你們還多召了幾種生物給她看。雷迪洛克這才合上筆記本，讓它憑空消失，就像檔案管理員先前變走那扇門一樣。她謝過你們花時間演示，讓你們把這裡當自己家，又說很快會來找你們商量石道的事。說完，她便向後一仰，翻下陽臺，沒了蹤影。\n\n確認公主並沒有就這麼摔死，你們才從陽臺走進似乎是為你們安排的客房。單看裡面的陳設，恐怕就花了幾千金幣，還不算建築房間的費用。兩張柔軟的四柱床，一池冒著熱氣的水。池水靠某種你不熟悉的魔法保持著溫熱。腳下鋪著厚地毯，窗邊垂著精美的絲綢帷幔，四周擺著各式藝術品，描繪的都是你從未見過、甚至從未聽說過的地方。\n\n[Companion Name]早已撲向最近的那張床，頭還沒捱上枕頭就打起了呼嚕。看她這副模樣，你也覺得這裡親切了幾分。沒過多久，你便和她一樣，倒頭睡著了"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Stoneway Yourway - After a warm welcome to the kingdom of the Nalidasi Dwarves, Princess Redilok is primed to accept your help in finishing the last of the Stoneway, which will earn your entry into the Royal Archives."
msgstr "石道通途——在納裡達西矮人王國受到一番熱情款待後，你們即將協助雷迪洛克公主完成石道的最後一段工程。作為回報，你們將被允許進入皇族典藏館。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've been working on the Stoneeeeway~"
msgstr "我在石道上幹活喲～"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "All the live long... is it daytime down here?"
msgstr "從早一直忙到……這底下現在算白天嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You wake to find breakfast floating towards you, with Princess Redilok floating just behind it. She pours over a large scroll, as your meal assembles itself on a silver tray inches above your lap. You feel horrendously underdressed and disheveled to be in the presence of royalty, but she hardly seems to notice. Her fault for coming unannounced. You still do your best to make yourself marginally more presentable, then lightly pick at the meal in front of you. You glance towards [Companion Name] who seems even more flustered by the princess's sudden arrival. You catch her eye and lightly wipe at the corner of your mouth, trying to get her to wipe the drool away. She hardly contains a groan before doing so as subtly as she can.\n\nOnce satisfied with whatever she was looking through, Redilok looks up to address you both, her smile as sweet as the flaky pastry you bite into."
msgstr "你一覺醒來，目擊早餐正朝你飄來，雷迪洛克公主就飄在後面。她埋頭研究著一卷大卷軸，早餐則自行擺上銀托盤，懸在你腿上方。在公主面前，你這副衣衫不整、睡眼惺忪的模樣實在有失體面，可她似乎毫不在意。誰讓她來之前也不打聲招呼呢。你還是儘量收拾了一下，讓自己看起來像點樣子，才慢慢吃起面前的早餐。你朝[Companion Name]瞥了一眼。公主突然到訪，她看起來比你還窘迫。等她看向你，你輕輕擦了擦嘴角，示意她把口水擦掉。她差點呻吟出聲，趕緊儘可能不動聲色地擦了擦嘴。\n\n雷迪洛克終於看完卷軸，滿意地抬起頭。她朝你們一笑，笑容甜得就像你剛咬下的那口酥點。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please, you two. If you couldn't tell by the way my father welcomed you to our home with a kerfuffle by all the top-brass in the kingdom, we do things a bit differently here."
msgstr "哎呀，你們兩個。我父親拉上王國裡一眾大人物，跟你們打了一架當作歡迎。你們還沒看出來嗎？我們這兒的規矩跟外面不太一樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your human modesty and decorum will only get you funny looks here. Dig in!"
msgstr "你們人類那套拘謹的禮數，在這裡反倒讓人覺得奇怪。放開吃！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...We're honored, princess."
msgstr "……多謝公主款待。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tsk tsk. What'd I just say?"
msgstr "嘖嘖。我剛才說什麼來著？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "None of that stuffy business. You need to eat up if you're going to help our Stoneway workers."
msgstr "別這麼拘束。待會兒還要幫忙修石道呢，不吃飽怎麼行？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd like to ask... if you already have people working on this project, why would our aid be needed, exactly?"
msgstr "我想問問……既然已經有人在修了，為什麼還需要我們幫忙？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And not that we mind, but that's all it'll take to get us into the archives?"
msgstr "倒不是不願意，不過，只要幫著修完，我們就能進典藏館了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Good questions!"
msgstr "問得好！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The tunnel to excavate the Stoneway met with a bit of a... snag. There was a cavern right near the middle of our kingdoms that seemed man or dwarfmade."
msgstr "開鑿石道隧道的時候，我們碰上了點……麻煩。就在兩國之間，差不多正中間的位置，有一座洞窟，看著像是人類或矮人開鑿的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not too uncommon considering the distance, but the cavern was guarded by beasts made of the same magic I had you show me earlier."
msgstr "這一路這麼長，碰到這種地方倒不稀奇。可洞裡有牛羚守著，用的正是你們之前給我演示過的那種魔法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "For such scary beasties, they didn't put up much of a fight and we finished excavating the route for the Stoneway. Not without some losses, though."
msgstr "那些牛羚長得嚇人，倒沒費多少工夫就解決了。石道的路線也順利挖通了。不過，我們還是折了些人手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seems a bit miraculous to stumble across a cavern filled with ancient beasts."
msgstr "偏偏就碰上一座藏著古老牛羚的洞窟，未免太巧了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're on the same page, then."
msgstr "看來咱們想到一塊兒去了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My father - bless the foolhardy man - is sure it was a trap set by the Flamberian Dwarves, despite the fact the Stoneway is meant to connect us."
msgstr "我父親那個莽撞性子啊……一口咬定是弗拉姆貝里矮人設的陷阱。可這條石道，本來就是為了連線兩國才修的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...And help bury old grudges..."
msgstr "……也好讓大家放下過去的仇怨……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You don't seem to share the sentiment though. You think it was someone else?"
msgstr "不過，你好像不這麼想。你覺得另有其人？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I do. There was a war between our kingdoms long before my father was even a pebble in his father's eye, but Dwarven grudges run deep."
msgstr "沒錯。兩國確實打過仗，那時候連我祖父都還沒想著要我父親這個孩子呢。可矮人記起仇來，哪有那麼容易忘。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Despite the years, our elders are worried something will go awry and are jumping at the chance to reignite the old war."
msgstr "這麼多年過去，長輩們還是總擔心出岔子，一有風吹草動，就恨不得重燃戰火。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The tunnel to excavate the Stoneway met with a bit of a... snag. There was a cavern right near the middle of our kingdoms that seemed man or dwarf-made."
msgstr "開鑿石道隧道的時候，我們碰上了點……麻煩。就在兩國之間，差不多正中間的位置，有一座洞窟，看著像是人類或矮人開鑿的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I've been working with their prince for half a decade on the Stoneway now, and he's an honest man. This wasn't them."
msgstr "為了修這條石道，我和他們的王子已經共事五年了。他為人正直。這事不是他們乾的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe something else, then? You remember the Soulsmiths from our stories earlier?"
msgstr "那，會不會是別的勢力？還記得我們之前提過的煉魂師嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd be surprised, but it's not as though there's other Summoning clans running amok nowadays, are there?"
msgstr "真是他們，我會有些意外。不過，如今四處作亂的召喚師氏族，應該也沒有別家了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If there are, we haven't had the misfortune of meeting them. Can you think of any reason why they'd target your people?"
msgstr "就算有，我們也還沒倒黴到碰上。你想得到他們為什麼要對付你們嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, I can't, and that's what worries me, and why I want the two of you there as we complete the Stoneway."
msgstr "想不到，這才讓我擔心。所以石道竣工的時候，我希望你們也在場。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The rulers won't be there in person, but several high-ranking nobles - along with the Flamberian Prince and myself - will hold a small celebration in the center of the Stoneway as it's finished."
msgstr "兩國君主都不會親自來，不過會有幾位地位顯赫的貴族出席。我和弗拉姆貝里王子也會到場，在石道中段辦個小型慶典，慶祝竣工。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And we're to be there incase something happens with the Soulsmiths."
msgstr "我們負責留意煉魂師，防著他們來搗亂。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Redilok nods, then leaves to let the two of you eat and get prepared. When she returns, another magical doorway that she creates takes you to what she calls the Stoneway Station. Several deep set rails of metal stretch along the ground, far, far into a tunnel that stretches into the distance. The underground pathway is lit by blue-green balls of floating light spaced evenly apart, giving as much light as if the Stoneway was above ground instead of thousands of meters below it. \n\nDozens of dwarves carry lengths of rails etched with glowing runes onto the stone platform hovering above the metal path. Making sure you're not in the way, you step upon the rectangular 'Slabglider' at Redilok's request. The Slabglider is the length of several carts stacked end-to-end, with comfy seating along its outer edge, with plenty of space for the rails and cargo between.\n\nOnce fully loaded, Redilok smiles and snaps her fingers, sending the platform cruising through the tunnel at dizzying speed. Despite how fast the three of you hurtle down the path, the ride seems remarkably calm. Your body feels still, but the lights whizzing by faster than your eyes can track show you're definitely moving.\n\nIt's not long before the Slabglider begins to slow and then stop. You worry something is wrong before Redilok confirms that you're near the center of the Stoneway, meaning that you crossed nearly a fourth of the continent in minutes. It's hard to even wrap your head around.\n\nOnce you disembark, several dwarves - some Nalidasi, some Flamberian - jump aboard and start unloading metal rails. You figure you 'ought to help instead of just standing around waiting."
msgstr "雷迪洛克點點頭，隨後離開，讓你們安心吃飯，收拾妥當。等她回來，又開出一扇魔法門，帶你們來到她所說的石道車站。幾條金屬軌道深嵌在地面上，順著隧道一直延伸到遠處。藍綠色的光球等距懸在空中，將整條地下通道照得亮如白晝，幾乎讓人忘了這裡是數千米深的地底。\n\n幾十個矮人正把一段段刻著發光符文的軌道，搬上懸在金屬軌道上方的石臺。你避開忙碌的工人，按照雷迪洛克的指示，登上那座長方形的「石板滑行者」。石板滑行者足有幾輛車首尾相接那麼長，四周設著舒適的座位，中間則留出大片空間，裝載軌道和其他貨物。\n\n貨物裝齊，雷迪洛克笑著打了個響指，石臺立刻沿隧道飛馳起來，快得令人目眩。雖然你們三人在通道里迅捷前進，坐起來卻出奇平穩。身體感覺不到絲毫晃動，只有兩旁飛掠而過、快得看不清的燈光，提醒你們確實正在移動。\n\n沒過多久，石板滑行者便開始緩速，停了下來。你還以為出了什麼問題，雷迪洛克卻告訴你，這裡已接近石道中段。也就是說，你們只花了幾分鐘，就穿過了將近四分之一片大陸。你一時簡直無法想象。\n\n你們下了石臺，幾個矮人便跳了上去，開始卸下金屬軌道。他們中既有納裡達西人，也有弗拉姆貝里人。你覺得與其站著乾等，不如搭把手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Come on... Someone has to be out of place..."
msgstr "快找找……總有人不對勁……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "There!"
msgstr "看那兒！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're able to follow along with the dwarves quite well, and they're a bit impressed as you and [Companion Name] keep up with laying the railings and locking them into place. The Flamberians get to work as you set each in place and you finally take a good look at them. Each appears almost molten lacking any traditional skin and instead seeming to be made out of a stone-like material with bright red magma heating the rock as some sort of vein system, serving a purpose you can't even begin to guess at. Among them is their own royal, Prince Cintak.\n\nThey grip the newly connected rails at heat it until it's red-hot, binding individual sections together into one fully linked pathway. Once that's done, the Nalidasi etch in a last set of runes, activating the section of rail. Both Redilok and Cintak are active participants in the Stoneway creation, though you do note they do disappear alone together more than a few times throughout your time working on the path.\n\nConstruction goes on for a long time, and you end up returning to Koganusan several times, eating, sleeping, and enjoying the luxuries of staying within the royal palace, getting more acquainted with Redilok and several nobles within the kingdom's upper-ranks.\n\nFinally, days after you began, the blue lights that light the corridor give way to red, and the rail you lay connects to that of the Flamberian's side of the Stoneway. It isn't sealed into place just yet, as this will be done at the ceremony Redilok informs you is called the 'Linking'."
msgstr "你們很快跟上了矮人的節奏，一段段鋪好軌道，再固定到位。見你和[Companion Name]幹得有模有樣，他們也有些佩服。你們每放好一段，弗拉姆貝里矮人便接手處理。這時，你才有機會仔細打量他們。他們個個都像是半熔化的岩石，身上沒有尋常的皮膚，取而代之的是石頭般的外殼。鮮紅的岩漿沿著血管似的脈絡流動，將岩石烘得灼熱。至於這副身體究竟如何運轉，你完全想不明白。他們的王族，辛塔克王子，也在其中。\n\n他們握住剛剛接好的軌道，將其加熱至通紅，把一段段接縫融合，連成完整的線路。隨後，納裡達西矮人再刻上最後一組符文，啟動這一段軌道。雷迪洛克和辛塔克都親自參與修建。不過，你也注意到，幹活期間，兩人好幾次單獨溜走，不見了蹤影。\n\n工程持續了很久，你們也幾次返回科加努桑，吃飯、休息，享受住在王宮裡的種種便利。其間，你們漸漸熟悉了雷迪洛克，也結識了幾位王國的大貴族。\n\n終於，開工數日後，通道里的藍光變成了紅光。你們鋪下的軌道，與弗拉姆貝里一側的石道接上了。不過，最後的接縫還沒有融合。雷迪洛克告訴你，這一步要留到「接軌儀式」上完成。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Several years in the making... I can hardly believe we're done."
msgstr "修了好幾年……真不敢相信，總算完工了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully the first step among many in soothing the wounds of the past."
msgstr "但願這是彌合舊日傷痕的第一步，往後還能有更多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Though I'm surprised Redilok sought it fit to bring along two humans, I trust her judgement."
msgstr "雷迪洛克竟會請兩位人類來幫忙，確實讓我有些意外。不過，我相信她的眼光。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...thanks, I think?"
msgstr "……那就，多謝了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're just happy we could help out."
msgstr "能幫上忙，我們也很高興。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sure... Though, I know you're here to ensure the Linking goes well. The royal princess has informed me of such."
msgstr "那是自然……不過，我知道二位來這裡，是為了確保接軌儀式順利舉行。公主殿下已經告訴我了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You have my gratitude. Please ensure her safety over mine. I couldn't bare it to-"
msgstr "多謝二位。如果有危險，請優先保護她。我實在無法承受她……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Cinny, please! All this propriety is going to put them off."
msgstr "小辛，拜託！你這麼一本正經的，會把他們嚇跑的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Cinny?"
msgstr "……小辛？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's just a nickname of sorts the royal princess is fond of. It really doesn't mean much, pay it no mind."
msgstr "只是公主殿下喜歡用的一個暱稱。沒什麼特別的，不必在意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Doesn't mean much, hm? You told me you loved it."
msgstr "沒什麼特別的，嗯？你明明說過很喜歡。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course I do my precious little cabochon! I-"
msgstr "當然喜歡，我的寶石小心肝！我……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...*ahem*."
msgstr "……*呃哼*。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you are observant, I'm sure you've noticed the princess and I's..."
msgstr "二位這麼細心，想必也注意到了，我和公主……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Disappearances off into the dark of the tunnels?"
msgstr "經常溜進隧道暗處？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Alone?"
msgstr "就你們兩個？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I am in no position to ask this of you, but I must do so anyway."
msgstr "我本不該向二位提出這樣的需求，可還是得厚著臉皮開口。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please keep this between yourselves for now. After the Linking the two of us intend to announce..."
msgstr "請暫時替我們保密。接軌儀式結束後，我們打算宣佈……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The royal princess and I-"
msgstr "公主殿下與我——"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh Cinny. I'm sure they figured it out on day one."
msgstr "哎呀，小辛。我看他們第一天就猜出來了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're in loveeeeee~"
msgstr "我們相愛啦～"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Neither of us have any reason to mind, but isn't that a bit..."
msgstr "我們當然沒什麼意見，不過，這是不是有點……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Scandalous? Daring? Risqué, maybe?"
msgstr "有傷體面？膽大包天？不太合規矩？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh it is. "
msgstr "可不是嘛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tell. Us. Everything."
msgstr "快。給我們講講。怎麼回事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...but the Linking."
msgstr "……可接軌儀式……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Cinny darling, it's a party! Drop a couple stones and lighten up, I've never gotten to tell anyone about this~"
msgstr "親愛的小辛，這可是慶典！別端著啦，放鬆點。我還從沒跟別人說起過這件事呢～"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Prince Cintak simply holds his stony face in his hands as the princess starts to divulge far more detail than you would have thought she'd offer up. The Slabglider departs back towards Koganusan and comes back with half a village of dwarves, tables, decor, and liquor. Then it speeds off towards the Flamberian capitol and brings back even more. Just like that, the Linking is underway.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] stroll about the thrown together party. The Stoneglider comes and goes multiple times, bringing more people, food, and furnishings, all of which are tucked into the carved out alcove you all reside in. The atmosphere is lively, sometimes too much so. It'd seem the king isn't the only one with longstanding grudges, and several scuffles break out through the celebration, but they're quickly quelled.\n\nYou're on edge, waiting for any sign of the Soulsmiths. You scan every new arrival, take stock of each good brought in, and... the small hint of blood left on one of the chairs.\n\nWith the small fights, rowdy dwarves, and free flowing alcohol, it's no wonder someone could have gotten hurt, but the chair hadn't been unloaded from the Slabglider yet.\n\nSomething is awry, you just don't know what yet."
msgstr "辛塔克王子只能雙手捂住自己那張石頭臉。公主則興致勃勃地講了起來，細得遠遠超出了你的預料。石板滑行者返回科加努桑，再回來時，帶來了足有半個村子那麼多的矮人，還有桌椅、裝飾和酒。隨後，它又飛馳前往弗拉姆貝里都城，運回了更多賓客和物資。就這樣，接軌慶典開始了。\n\n你和[Companion Name]在臨時佈置的會場裡四處走動。石板滑行者來來回回，又帶來更多賓客、食物和桌椅，把你們所在的這處開鑿出來的洞廳塞得滿滿當當。氣氛熱鬧得很，有時甚至熱鬧過了頭。看來，放不下舊怨的不止國王。慶典上接連起了幾場衝突，不過很快都被制止了。\n\n你始終繃著神經，留意著煉魂師的蹤跡。每個新到的賓客，每批運來的物資，你都仔細看過。然後……你目擊一把椅子上沾著一點血。\n\n會場裡有人打架，有人鬧騰，酒更是一杯接一杯，磕破點皮本不奇怪。可這把椅子還沒從石板滑行者上卸下來。\n\n一定有哪裡出了問題，只是你還沒弄清楚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh no..."
msgstr "糟了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Where is the princess?!"
msgstr "公主在哪兒？！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You move through the crowds and finally spot who you were looking for. The Nalidasi dwarf is almost indistinguishable from everyone else, except the fact that she's a bit more pale, and seems far less into the festivities than anyone else. She carries a large barrel draped in cloth and tucks it amongst many others at the back of the alcove.\n\nYou stop her by grabbing her arm, and the pale dwarf doesn't even react to your presence. [Companion Name] pulls up the dwarf's sleeve and you see her arm coated by a thick stream of blood. The woman drops the barrel, but stands motionless in your grip, lifeless eyes staring up at you. Quickly checking the woman over, you peel back her collar, you see that the blood on her arm must have come from her slit neck, which was intentionally hidden under her bulky garb. The dwarf's blank look reminds you of Talm controlling the Soulsmith back in the capitol, and judging by her state, you know she's being controlled by someone. \n\nBut it's too late. Volatile runes spill out from the dropped barrel, similar to those you made with Gloob, though these look substantially better crafted.\n\nAnother dwarf - this one Flamberian - breaks the top of a barrel at the back of the room and sinks his hands inside of it before heating himself red hot.\n\n[Companion Name] draws her bow and shoots at the dwarf, but the damage is done. You hear the sizzling of the volatile runes and cry out to anyone nearby."
msgstr "你穿過人群，終於找到了那個可疑的身影。那是個納裡達西女矮人，和其他人幾乎沒有區別，只是臉色蒼白了些，對周圍的慶祝活動也遠沒有旁人那麼熱衷。她搬著一隻蒙了布的大桶，將它放進洞廳後方的一堆桶裡。\n\n你一把抓住她的胳膊，將她攔下。這個臉色蒼白的矮人卻對你的出現毫無反應。[Companion Name]拉起她的袖子，你看見一大股鮮血順著她的手臂流了下來。女矮人鬆開手，桶掉在地上。她卻仍一動不動地任你抓著，用毫無生氣的雙眼仰望著你。你迅速檢查她的身體，掀開衣領才目擊，她的喉嚨已被割開。胳膊上的血顯然是從那裡流下來的，而厚重的衣服正好遮住了傷口。那副空洞的神情，讓你想起塔爾姆在都城操控的那個煉魂師。看她這模樣，你知道，她也正受人操縱。\n\n但一切都太晚了。不穩定的符文從落地的桶中滾了出來，跟你和格魯布製作過的相似，只是這些的做工明顯精良得多。\n\n另一個矮人，這次是弗拉姆貝里人，砸開洞廳後方的一隻桶，把雙手探了進去，隨即渾身燒得通紅。\n\n[Companion Name]拉弓射他，可已經來不及了。符文發出嘶嘶聲，你扯開嗓子，朝周圍的人大喊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Everyone! Get down!"
msgstr "所有人！趴下！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're under attack!"
msgstr "有人襲擊！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You see several dwarves by the wall turn towards you, startled by the arrow whizzing in their direction and your shout. They disappear as the runes in the barrel and several others nearby explode with a burst of magical energy, swallowing them entirely in a flash of white light.\n\nThe whole world heaves upward. [Companion Name] grabs you as you're sent careening out of the alcove and down the tunnel, crashing to the ground with a sickening series of cracks then rolling several meters.\n\nThe two of you stagger towards your feet and rush back inside to see that half the cavity has been reduced to rubble, and many of those attending were killed instantly by the blast. The cleared out section is... far larger than it should be, as a large cavern is revealed by the blast. Soulsmiths adorned with gold trimmed robes and long, black metal weapons begin to flood out from the hole and descend on the Dwarves alongside their dark summoned monsters. \n\nThe sight is horrifyingly similar to that dark night in Azamire.\n\nBehind the cultists is a slug-like monster that pulls itself along the ground on countless sets of arms, pulling itself into the opening with sickening, twitchy movements. The creature is nearly as long as the Stoneglider, and twice as tall. A large black metal vessel protrudes from the beast's back, seemingly fused to it. You watch the device on its back begins to glow as it pulls itself towards the dead dwarves on the ground.\n\nA pulse of dark green light washes over the bombed-out alcove.\n\nThen the dead begin to move again. "
msgstr "牆邊的幾個矮人被飛來的箭和你的喊聲驚動，轉頭望向你。下一刻，那隻桶和附近幾隻桶裡的符文同時炸開，魔力噴湧而出。白光一閃，他們便被徹底吞沒了。\n\n整個世界猛地向上一掀。[Companion Name]一把抓住你，你們一起被丟擲洞廳，飛進隧道，重重砸在地上。接連幾聲脆響令人心驚，你們又滾出了好幾米。\n\n你們掙扎著站起來，趕緊衝回洞廳。裡面已有一半被炸成廢墟，不少賓客當場喪命。爆炸後露出的空間……大得不對勁。原來，巖壁後還藏著一座巨大的洞窟。身穿金邊長袍、手持黑色金屬長兵器的煉魂師從洞口蜂擁而出，帶著他們召喚的黑暗怪物，一同撲向矮人。\n\n這一幕，與阿扎米爾遇襲的那個黑夜像得令人膽寒。\n\n那些邪教徒身後，一頭蛞蝓般的怪物正用無數條手臂拖著身體前進，一抽一抽地擠進洞口，看得人直犯惡心。它幾乎與石板滑行者一樣長，高度卻足有兩倍。一個巨大的黑色金屬容器從它背上凸出，看起來已經與它的身體長在了一起。它朝地上的矮人屍體爬去，背上的裝置隨之亮起。\n\n一道暗綠色光芒掃過被炸燬的洞廳。\n\n一道暗綠色光芒掃過被炸燬的洞廳。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "When the dwarves that remain see you crash against the Soulsmiths, any who are able follow close behind you, burning with unbridled rage. You do your best to defend those too dazed or injured to help or run, but many are cut down by the Soulsmiths who weave through the crowd of undead.\n\nThis entire attack was planned out meticulously, maybe even your presence was accounted for. You try to intercept a group that head towards the Stoneglider, but the horde of undead stop you each time. Several Soulsmiths board the Stoneglider, load barrels of volatile runes onto the platform, then send it hurtling towards Koganusan. There's nothing you can do, there's too many things to deal with at once.\n\nIn the heat of battle you catch a glimpse of Prince Cintak standing over Princess Redilok, who clutches the new stump of her arm and tries to stem the bleeding. You try to reach them, but there's simply too many undead between you. It's not long before the prince is run through by one of the Soulsmith's black metal blades. He's then hefted into the air and unceremoniously pinned onto the back of the horrific slug creature who cries out as it's blubbery flesh is pierced. \n\n[Companion Name] is much closer, she reaches the princess just in time to spare her from the same fate as the prince. Moments after she cuts down the Soulsmith, those that remain call out to one another, escaping with the body of the prince, following after their beast who now scampers deeper into the cavern.\n\nThe undead remain, but without the threat of the gold-robed Soulsmiths probing for weaknesses or distractions, you're able to cut down the rest of them in short order. You rush to the princess's side. Undeterred by her missing arm, she stands, eyes piercing the dark of the cavern and staring towards those who took the prince. She claims that it'd take more than that to kill him, and that the Soulsmiths wanted him alive. [Companion Name] tries to stop the princess from following into the cavern, but she's undeterred.\n\nOnly thing you can do is follow after."
msgstr "倖存的矮人見你衝向煉魂師，凡是還能戰鬥的，都滿腔怒火地緊隨其後。你竭力護住那些受傷太重，或仍未回過神來、無法戰鬥也來不及閃避的人。可煉魂師穿梭在亡者之間，還是殺死了不少人。\n\n整場襲擊顯然經過周密策劃，或許連你們在場，都早已被算在其中。一隊煉魂師朝石板滑行者奔去。你幾次想攔住他們，卻都被成群的亡者擋了回來。幾個煉魂師登上石板滑行者，把一桶桶不穩定的符文搬上石臺，隨後讓它朝科加努桑疾馳而去。你根本無力阻止。眼前要應付的敵人，已經太多了。\n\n混戰中，你瞥見辛塔克王子正護在雷迪洛克公主身前。她一隻手臂已被斬斷，正緊緊按著斷口，試圖止血。你想趕到他們身邊，可中間隔著太多亡者。沒過多久，一名煉魂師便用黑色金屬利刃刺穿了王子的身體。他將王子挑到半空，狠狠釘在那頭恐怖的蛞蝓怪物背上。怪物肥厚的血肉被刺穿，發出一聲慘叫。\n\n[Companion Name]離他們近得多。她及時趕到公主身邊，才沒讓公主也遭受同樣的厄運。她剛斬倒那名煉魂師，剩下的敵人便互相呼喊著撤退。牛羚馱著王子的身體，飛快爬向洞窟深處，他們緊隨其後。\n\n亡者仍在攻擊，但沒了那些金袍煉魂師伺機偷襲，你們很快便將它們全部解決。你衝到公主身旁。即使失去一條手臂，她還是站了起來，目光直直望向黑暗深處，盯著擄走王子的那群人。她堅稱，辛塔克沒那麼容易死，煉魂師要的是活口。[Companion Name]試圖攔住她，不讓她追進洞窟，可她心意已決。\n\n你們能做的，只有跟上去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Prince Procurement - After the Soulsmith attack on the Linking, you and [Companion Name] follow after Princess Redilok who is out for blood. Will you find the prince at the end of the path, or lose another royal in the process?"
msgstr "營救王子——接軌慶典遭到煉魂師襲擊後，你和[Companion Name]追著一心復仇的雷迪洛克公主，深入洞窟。此行能否救回王子，還是連公主也會搭上性命？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll focus on breaking up the bigger rocks."
msgstr "大塊的石頭交給我來敲碎。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Light? We're close to the surface?"
msgstr "有光？快到地面了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You hold a lantern aloft as the three of you jog through the cavern, barely illuminating the ancient tunnels. [Companion Name] continually tries to stop the princess - at least long enough to properly tend to her missing arm - but Redilok forces herself onward.\n\nAnother blast echoes down the winding passage in front of you, the sudden rush of wind nearly knocking you off your feet. You find the source not long after. The Soulsmiths collapsed the cave behind them, the rubble still settling as rocks shift into place."
msgstr "你高舉燈籠，勉強照亮古老的通道，三人一路小跑著穿過洞窟。[Companion Name]不斷勸公主停下，至少先把斷臂的傷口好好處理一下，可雷迪洛克仍咬牙往前趕。\n\n前方又傳來一聲爆炸，轟鳴沿著蜿蜒的通道迴盪。緊接著，一股氣浪迎面撲來，險些把你掀翻。沒走多遠，你們便找到了爆炸的位置。煉魂師炸塌了身後的通道。碎石堵住去路，還在不斷滑落、堆積。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Those damn cowards!"
msgstr "這群該死的懦夫！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Both of you, give me a hand, will you?"
msgstr "你們兩個，搭把手行不行？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I seem to have just lost one. And then some."
msgstr "我剛好缺隻手。還缺了大半條胳膊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We want to, princess, but we can't."
msgstr "公主，我們也想幫忙，可不能再追了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're injured, and by the time we cut through this, they'll be long gone."
msgstr "你還傷著，等我們挖通這裡，他們早就跑遠了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We should go back to Koganusan, regroup, and come back."
msgstr "先回科加努桑，召集人手再來吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If they took [Companion Name] would you say the same?"
msgstr "要是被抓走的是[Companion Name]，你也會這麼說嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I see your point."
msgstr "……我明白了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can you do one of those doorway thinggies you did before to get us to the other side of these rocks?"
msgstr "你能不能像之前那樣開扇門，讓我們直接到這些石頭後面去？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can only set the destination to somewhere I've been before, it won't help here."
msgstr "門只能通往我去過的地方。這裡不行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Then we'll have to go through. When we rescue the prince, can you get us back to the capitol?"
msgstr "那就只能挖過去了。等救出王子，你能帶我們回都城嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't think so. The further the destination, the more magic it takes out of me. We're quite a ways from home."
msgstr "恐怕不行。目的地越遠，耗費的魔力就越多。這裡離家太遠了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If we're lucky, some of the survivors will realize I'm a bit limited and will wait for us."
msgstr "運氣好的話，倖存者裡會有人想到，我的本事也有個限度，留下來等我們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Or... they'd be sensible and get themselves home, leaving us out here to this foolish mission alone."
msgstr "也可能……他們都夠理智，已經自己回家了，只剩咱們三個還在這裡犯傻。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do you want to rest while we get this stone moved, then?"
msgstr "那你要不要先歇會兒？我們來搬石頭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hey now. I said I can't make a doorway through it, I didn't say I was gonna sit around and let you do all the work."
msgstr "喂，等等。我只是說沒法開門過去，可沒說要坐著看你們幹活。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You set your jaw and take out your tools. The rock is dense and you're worried about a cave-in, but Redilok extends her hand and begins moving stone with her magic. Smaller boulders lift into the air and are thrown backward, crashing into the cavern walls far behind you."
msgstr "你咬緊牙關，提領工具。岩石堅硬密實，你又擔心會再次坍塌。這時，雷迪洛克伸出手，開始用魔法搬動石塊。小一些的石塊浮到空中，被拋向後方，重重撞在遠處的洞壁上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please don't blow up, please don't blow up, please don't blo-"
msgstr "千萬別炸，千萬別炸，千萬別……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Whew..."
msgstr "呼……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The three of you make short work of the blockage and climb out of the caverns through what appears to have been a natural entrance to the cave system. The sun is just beginning to set over the western horizon, which initially gives you pause. It'd taken a while to get out of the caves, but the Soulsmiths are on foot as well, many of which are injured. There's a good chance they'd have to stop nearby.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] see it at the same time. A thin trail of smoke in this distance, not too far from you. A camp, it has to be."
msgstr "三人合力，很快清開了堵路的碎石，隨後沿著一處似乎是天然形成的洞口，爬出了地下洞窟。西邊的太陽剛開始落下。你望著天色，心裡一沉。從洞裡出來確實耽擱了一陣，可煉魂師也只能靠雙腳趕路，其中不少人還受了傷。他們很可能得在附近停下來。\n\n你和[Companion Name]幾乎同時看見了。不遠處，一縷細煙正嫋嫋升起。營地。一定是他們的營地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Either of you any good at trackin'?"
msgstr "你們誰會追蹤？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... ugh. This is all a bit overwhelmin' for me."
msgstr "我……唉。這外頭真讓我有點吃不消。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The sun's so bright... grass is too smelly. Dwarves belong in the ground, not out in all this mess."
msgstr "太陽太晃眼……草味兒也太沖。矮人就該待在地下，不該跑來這種亂七八糟的地方。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Yes, but we don't need to be. They clearly didn't think they'd be followed, because they've set up camp just over the hill."
msgstr "會，不過眼下用不著。他們顯然沒想到有人會追來，就在山坡那頭紮了營。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well then, let's get after 'em!"
msgstr "那還等什麼，追上去！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We will. You're going to stay put. I promise you we'll get him back."
msgstr "我們去。你留在這裡。我保證，一定把他帶回來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're giving me an order?"
msgstr "你在教我做事？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm fine. Don't need any babyin'."
msgstr "我沒事。用不著把我當小孩子照顧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm not asking. It seems like you'll hardly make the trek to their camp, let alone be ready for another fight."
msgstr "這事沒得商量。你連走到他們營地都夠嗆，怎麼再打一場？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, course I'm a little tired. I got my arm blown off and half the royal court got butchered in front of me, then they stood back up and tried to gnaw on me."
msgstr "是，我當然累了。胳膊被炸沒了，半個皇室的人死在我眼前，接著又爬起來，想撲過來啃我。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Speaking of you arm... you should tend to that wound, because your wrappings are already coming undone."
msgstr "說到胳膊……你該重新包紮了，布條都快散了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We've got this, alright?"
msgstr "交給我們，好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Redilok jabs her stump towards [Companion Name] and looks like she's about to say something protest before she realizes she's dripping blood on her boot. She sits with a grumble and waves you off. That's about as good of a blessing as you figure you're going to get.\n\nAs you get closer to camp, the two of you start to move more carefully, crawling on your stomachs through the plain's waist-high grass. The Soulsmiths may not have expected you to make it through the cave-in, but that didn't stop them from protecting themselves by littering the ground with volatile runes. [Companion Name] crawls towards one, trying to slowly pry it out of the ground with her knife.\n\nSlowly but surely, she wiggles it out of the ground, then passes it back to you, then moves onto the next one. As tempting as it may be to keep it for later, keeping a small pile of bombs in your backpack it bound to lead to an untimely end. You'll have to carefully destroy them.\n\nYou roughly know how the magic works from your time creating similar charges with Gloob way back in Azamire, but these are far more complex."
msgstr "雷迪洛克朝[Companion Name]一揮斷臂，正要反駁，卻目擊血正滴在自己的靴子上。她嘟囔著坐下來，揮手讓你們走。能讓她這樣點頭，已經算不錯了。\n\n靠近營地後，你們放輕動作，伏在地上，穿過平原上齊腰高的草叢。煉魂師或許沒想到你們能穿過坍塌的通道，卻也沒有疏於防備，沿途埋了不少不穩定的符文。[Companion Name]爬到其中一枚旁邊，試著用小刀將它慢慢撬出來。\n\n她一點點鬆動符文，小心提領，遞到你手裡，又爬向下一枚。留著以後用確實不錯，可揹著一包炸彈到處跑，遲早要把自己送上天。你得小心地毀掉它們。\n\n當初在阿扎米爾，你和格魯布做過類似的爆炸符文，大致知道其中的魔法原理。可眼前這些，複雜得多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They have to pay."
msgstr "他們必須付出代價。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Who... was that?"
msgstr "那……是誰？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As [Companion Name] very delicately extracts the volatile runes and passed them off, you slowly wither away their power. It's a nerve-wrecking process, and you feel time moving by glacially slow as you crawl closer and closer towards the Soulsmith's camp.\n\nEventually, you find yourself just outside the camp. You look over the wretched summoners, and one stands out among the elites: An elderly woman whose robes are instead lined with light strips of blue and green instead of gold. Someone important, doubtlessly, though you don't remember seeing her during the attack on the Linking. Dozing by the fire, patrolling around the slug monster, and even cozying up with a few resting cultists are a dozen or so large wolf-like creatures the Soulsmiths seem fond of. These ones are a lot larger than those they attacked Azamire with, though. Watching one of them nuzzle one of the murderers and seemingly beg for a scrap of food... makes you feel strange. These creatures may be summoned beasts, but they are alive and maybe even close with those who brought them to life. \n\nBack in the tunnels, the monsters ended the lives of dozens of dwarves, but it's not like they had a choice. You know as much from the creatures you've summoned yourself. You will them to do something, and they obey. \n\nYou'll try to end them quickly.\n\nYou pry your eyes away and find Prince Cintak's corpse, still pinned to the slug creature by the black metal blade he was stabbed with. [Companion Name] scoots close and whispers to you."
msgstr "[Companion Name]小心翼翼地挖出符文，遞給你，你則一點點消去其中的魔力。每一步都讓人提心吊膽。你們緩緩爬向煉魂師的營地，只覺得時間慢得難熬。\n\n終於，你們來到了營地外圍。你掃視著那些可憎的召喚師，目擊精銳之中有個人格外顯眼。那是個年老婦人，長袍上鑲著淺藍與淺綠色飾邊，而非其他人的金邊。她無疑是個重要人物，可你不記得在接軌慶典遇襲時見過她。營地裡還有十幾頭碩大的狼形生物，看來煉魂師對它們頗為偏愛。有的在火堆旁打盹，有的繞著蛞蝓怪物巡行，還有幾頭親暱地依偎在休息的教徒身邊。不過，這些比當初襲擊阿扎米爾的那些大得多。你看著其中一頭蹭著一個殺人兇手，像是在討食，心裡……有種說不出的滋味。\n\n在隧道里，這些怪物殺死了幾十個矮人，可它們也沒有選擇。你自己召喚過生物，清楚這一點。你要它們做什麼，它們就會照辦。\n\n你會盡量給它們一個痛快。你移開視線，找到了辛塔克王子的軀體。他仍被那把黑色金屬利刃釘在蛞蝓怪物身上。[Companion Name]挪近了些，在你耳邊低聲問道。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Why'd they take him, and only him?"
msgstr "他們為什麼抓他，而且只抓他一個？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't know. The Soulsmiths were able to control those dead Dwarves during the Linking, maybe it has something to do with that?"
msgstr "我不知道。接軌慶典上，煉魂師能操控那些死去的矮人，也許跟這個有關？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Figure they'll tell us if we ask?"
msgstr "你說，問他們會說嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'd have to leave one alive for that."
msgstr "那就得留個活口了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Guess not then."
msgstr "那還是算了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hey, [Player Name]?"
msgstr "喂，[Player Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I didn't want to ask in front of the princess..."
msgstr "剛才當著公主的面，我沒好意思問……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do you think the prince is still alive?"
msgstr "你覺得王子還活著嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Well, we lived through the explosion and we're made of flesh. He's made of stone and magma..."
msgstr "……咱們是血肉之軀，爆炸都沒把咱們炸死。他可是岩石和岩漿做的……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Guess it's a good thing we didn't save some of those explosive runes then, huh? Wouldn't have minded putting them to good use."
msgstr "這麼說，剛才沒留下幾枚爆炸符文，倒是好事了？我還真想拿那些東西好好招呼他們一下。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If he is alive, and then we blew him up..."
msgstr "萬一他還活著，卻被咱們炸死了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well... we'd be lucky if we were only banished from both Dwarven kingdoms."
msgstr "那……兩國要是隻把咱們驅逐出境，都算走運了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] grimaces at the thought. After a moment, she turns her attention towards the camp. She nods towards the Soulsmiths, and you nod back. No point in waiting."
msgstr "[Companion Name]一想到那場面，便齜了齜牙。片刻後，她重新望向營地。她朝煉魂師的方向點點頭，你也點頭回應。沒必要再等了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You clash against the Soulsmith Elites, knowing that they're going to use their summoned creatures to frontline for them like they did with the undead back during the Linking. As the elites fall, the vessel attached to the slug monster whirrs to life and bathes the area in flashes of green light, and the elites rise again. It doesn't stop you.\n\nEventually, the monster runs out of bodies to throw at you, and the leader of this band of Soulsmiths throws herself at you directly, but even she falls. As you strike the killing blow, she commands the slug beast to escape, then falls silent in the tall grass of the plains. Following the orders of its master, the beast tears through the field, slimy arms tearing chunks out of the ground as it scuttles north. You keep pace with it, barely, but when you or [Companion] strike it, your weapons bounce off it, it's thick flesh seemingly resistant to conventional weaponry.\n\nSuddenly, Prince Cintak stirs. It's hard to tell if the man is trying to free himself, or if his corpse is just being flung about, but sure enough, he is able to sink his feet into the monster's meat and push. The black metal sword that pinned him to the beast slides out from it's body with a nauseating squelch and the prince tumbles to the ground. Both you and [Companion Name] let the monster run, quickly attending to the prince instead. He lives, though the weapon that bound him to the slug is still firmly stuck within his stone body. For now, you're just happy he's in one piece. You watch as the Soulsmith's Shambling Beast drags itself far to the north and wish you could give chase, but it's a problem for another day.\n\nBoth of the royals support one another as the four of you head back down into the tunnels to reunite with the rest of the survivors. The molten Flamberians cheer with relief at the sight of their prince and surround him, offering to help tend his wounds or swear revenge on those who attacked the Linking. The Nalidasi greet the princess much the same. The wounded have been tended to through a mix of cauterization and sterilization from the party's booze, and many of the decorative tapestries have been torn to fashion bandages.\n\nOnce everyone is settled, the magically inclined amongst the Nalidasi join together and open a large doorway in the wall of the Stoneway tunnel, bringing you right to the smoking crater that was once the station you left from. Stone buildings all around you have been leveled by a blast that far outweighs the Soulsmith's attack on the Linking. Now you know what they did with the Stoneglide.\n\nBoth the Archivist and king Oyadazminis look upon the blast sight with anger and pain, but then relief upon seeing your group step out from the ashes. The man's eyes are wet with tears as he embraces his daughter, originally having feared the worst. He pulls you aside after breaking apart from the princess, and begs for your aid. He promises access to the Archive, the treasury, and whatever else you may desire in exchange for purging the Soulsmith blight from the land. Despite the Archivist trying in vain to slightly temper the king's impassioned promises of remuneration, his resolve is similarly hardened.\n\nKoganusan is going to war, and you will help guide them to victory."
msgstr "你衝向煉魂師精銳，知道他們一定會像接軌慶典上驅使亡者那樣，讓召喚獸擋在前面。精銳們接連倒下，蛞蝓怪物背上的容器卻嗡嗡啟動，綠光不斷掃過營地，讓他們再次站了起來。可你沒有停手。\n\n終於，怪物再也找不到能驅使的屍體。這隊煉魂師的首領親自撲了上來，卻也沒能撐住。你給出致命一擊時，她命令蛞蝓牛羚逃走，隨後倒在平原的高草中，再無聲息。牛羚遵從主人的命令，飛快地向北逃竄。黏滑的手臂不斷扒扯地面，掀起一塊塊泥土。你們勉強追得上它，可無論你還是[Companion]，武器砍上去都會被彈開。那身厚實的血肉，似乎根本不怕尋常兵刃。\n\n忽然，辛塔克王子動了。起初，你分不清他是在掙扎，還是身體被怪物顛得亂晃。可很快，他便將雙腳蹬進怪物的血肉裡，用力一撐。釘住他的黑色金屬劍從牛羚體內拔了出來，發出一聲令人作嘔的黏響。王子隨即摔落在地。你和[Companion Name]顧不上再追怪物，趕緊去檢視王子的情況。他還活著，只是先前將他釘在蛞蝓身上的武器，仍牢牢插在他的岩石身軀裡。眼下，能把他完整地救回來，你已經很慶幸了。你望著煉魂師那頭跛行獸一路向北逃遠，恨不得追上去。可它的賬，只能留到以後再算。\n\n王子和公主互相攙扶著，你們四個重返地下通道，與其他倖存者會合。見王子平安歸來，岩漿流動的弗拉姆貝里矮人終於鬆了口氣，歡呼著圍上前。有的要替他處理傷口，有的發誓要向襲擊慶典的兇手討回血債。納裡達西矮人也同樣圍住了公主。傷員已經得到了救治：傷口用灼燒止血，再拿慶典上的酒消毒，許多裝飾用的掛毯也被撕成了繃帶。\n\n等眾人安頓妥當，納裡達西人中擅長魔法的幾位合力施法，在石道隧道的牆上開啟一扇大門，將你們直接帶回出發的車站。可那裡如今只剩下一個冒煙的大坑。周圍的石砌建築全被夷為平地。這場爆炸，比煉魂師在接軌慶典上工藝的那場猛烈得多。現在你知道，他們把石板滑行者開回來做什麼了。\n\n檔案管理員和奧亞達茲米尼斯國王望著廢墟，滿臉憤怒與悲痛。見你們一行從灰燼中走出來，兩人才終於露出釋然的神情。國王原本已做好了最壞的打算，此刻一把抱住女兒，眼裡滿是淚水。鬆開公主後，他把你拉到一旁，懇求你出手相助。只要能將煉魂師這禍害從世上剷除，他願意向你開放典藏館、國庫，答應你想要的一切。檔案管理員試圖勸國王冷靜些，別一時激動許下太多報酬，卻沒能勸住。不過，論起對付煉魂師的決心，他也絲毫不遜。\n\n科加努桑即將開戰，而你將協助他們贏得這場戰爭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Repairing What Remains - The Soulsmiths successfully hijacked the Stoneglide and loaded it with explosives while those attending the Linking were preoccupied on all sides by assailants. Their efforts resulted in a massive swathe of Koganusan being reduced to rubble. Any amount of relief will go a long way towards caring for the populace."
msgstr "重建家園——接軌慶典遭到圍攻時，煉魂師趁眾人無暇分身，劫走石板滑行者，在上面裝滿了爆炸物。科加努桑大片城區因此被炸成廢墟。如今，能多幫上一點，就能讓受災的民眾少吃一點苦。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Her house simply isn't enough. How about a proper cookhouse? Maybe she'll be able to get some help then, too?"
msgstr "光靠她家那間廚房，實在忙不過來。不如建個像樣的食堂？這樣也方便別人來搭把手，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully this will work a bit better than her home."
msgstr "希望這裡能比她家更施展得開。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "King Oyadazminis and the Archivist move with purpose through the ruined market district of Koganusan, handing out food to those who lost their homes and businesses, comforting others, and lending a hand where they can. Though it's a small comfort to those figuring out how to go on, it's still more than enough to get some following in their footsteps if they're able. The pair catch your eye and rush over after excusing themselves from a small group of young dwarves."
msgstr "奧亞達茲米尼斯國王和檔案管理員正忙著在受災的集市區奔走。他們給失去住所和店鋪的人分發食物，安慰驚魂未定的民眾，哪裡需要，就去哪裡搭把手。對那些連往後日子該怎麼過都不知道的人來說，這些或許還遠遠不夠。但看見他們忙前忙後，一些尚有餘力的民眾也跟著行動起來。兩人看見你們，便向身旁的幾個矮人孩子告辭，快步走了過來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I never thought there'd be a day where I'm pleased to see two humans waiting for me, but these are trying times. "
msgstr "沒想到啊，我居然也有這麼盼著見到兩個人類的時候。不過，如今確實是難關當頭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I haven't had the chance to properly thank you for returning my daughter to me, and unfortunately I am rather tied down at present."
msgstr "你們把我女兒平安帶了回來，我還沒來得及好好道謝。可眼下，實在脫不開身。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We can see that. It feels rare to see someone of your station handling a crisis hands on."
msgstr "我們看得出來。像您這樣身份的人，出了事還能親自來幫忙，確實少見。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Would you rather I leave it to those beneath me?"
msgstr "難道你更希望我把事情全丟給手下？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "No, not at all. If anything, I find it refreshing, and it's clear your people do too."
msgstr "不，當然不是。恰恰相反，我覺得這樣很好。您的子民顯然也這麼想。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just wish I could have prevented it in the first place..."
msgstr "只可惜，我沒能阻止這一切……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I wish [Companion Name] and I could have done more."
msgstr "……我也希望，當時我和[Companion Name]能多做些什麼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Excuse me for speaking out of turn, but from the reports I've seen, it sounds as though there wouldn't have been a single survivor were it not for your efforts."
msgstr "恕我插一句。根據我看到的報告，要不是二位奮力相救，恐怕一個人都活不下來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We owe you quite the debt, but it'll be some time before we can properly return the favor."
msgstr "這份恩情，我們記著。只是要報答二位，恐怕還得等一陣子。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're not worried about it in the slightest, we're just trying to do what we can to prepare to drive the Soulsmiths out of here for good."
msgstr "不用惦記著報答。我們只想盡力做好準備，把煉魂師徹底趕出去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You have my blessing and what I can spare of my men, though free hands are in short supply."
msgstr "我全力支援。能抽出來的人手，都可以交給你們，不過眼下實在是處處缺人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Speaking of which... If you find yourself in need of a bit more than I can offer..."
msgstr "說到這個……要是我這邊的人手不夠……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sure that the townsfolk would be even more willing to lend a hand with a bit of food in their bellies, or if you're able to help cure what ails them."
msgstr "不妨先幫鎮民們填飽肚子，治好傷病。等緩過勁來，他們一定也願意出份力。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sure we can figure something out, can't we [Player Name]?"
msgstr "咱們總能想出辦法的，對吧，[Player Name]？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not sure where to start, you decide on the easiest of the options you can think of. Food. Easy to make in bulk, and something that everyone needs. You ask around until you hear of a kindly woman named Zotty, who has been taking care of as many of the districts kids as she can. From what you gather, she was a baker, but her business was destroyed in the attack, a story like many others in Koganusan. When you visit her house on the edge of the ruined district, you see a line of several kids line up by the door, each of them getting a small but well-seasoned portion of stew and a bit of bread.\n\nZotty is a bit wary of you at first, but your reputations proceed you both, and she simply says that any help you can offer is more than enough. It's clear she doesn't expect much, but you hope to prove her wrong."
msgstr "你一時不知道從哪兒入手，便決定先做件最容易想到的事。給大家弄些吃的。一次能做上許多，又是人人都缺不了的。打聽了一圈，你們聽說有位叫佐蒂的好心婦人，正在盡力照顧這一帶的孩子。她原本開著一家麵包店，襲擊過後，店沒了。如今的科加努桑，像她這樣的人還有很多。她家就在受災街區邊上。你們找到那裡時，門口正排著幾個孩子。每人都領到一小份香噴噴的燉菜，外加一點麵包。\n\n佐蒂起初還有些提防你們，不過也早就聽說了你們的事。她只說，不管能幫多少，她都領情。她顯然沒指望你們能做太多。你想，這回可得讓她刮目相看。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#. Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Do we just plant these in the ground or..?"
msgstr "這些直接埋進土裡就行，還是……？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The devastation left by the Soulsmith attack has both fortunately and unfortunately left behind no small number of plots free of their original buildings. All it takes is a small chat with the king and one of them is requisitioned from its deceased owner and then attributed to the two of you. You draft up and begin construction on a sizeable cookhouse, capable of feeding a large portion of those displaced by the attack, and giving new purpose to a few as well, should they choose to help Zotty.\n\nBuilding the structure goes much faster than expected. When townsfolk see you working on the structure, many come to help for any number of reasons. Dwarven pride, giving back to their community, or even trying to help the two of you in return for saving as many as you could at the Linking. Before you know it, the dwarven cookhouse stands tall amidst the rubble, ready to feed those in need. Zotty admires the building with her hands on her hips, save for a couple small dabs at her eyes when she thinks you aren't looking."
msgstr "煉魂師毀掉了不少房屋，倒也留下了大片空地。雖然眼下用得上，你卻實在高興不起來。你跟國王簡單說了說打算，他便將一塊主人已經遇難的地皮徵用，交給你們。你們畫好圖紙，動手建起一間大食堂。有了它，許多因襲擊而無家可歸的人便能吃上飯。願意來幫佐蒂的，也能重新找點事情做。\n\n房子蓋得比預想中快得多。鎮民們見你們忙活，紛紛趕來搭手。有的不想讓矮人的本事輸給人類，有的想為街坊做點事，還有的聽說你們在接軌慶典上救了許多人，想借此還一份人情。沒多久，一座食堂便在廢墟間立了起來，只等開火做飯，招呼有需要的人進門。佐蒂叉著腰，望著新食堂看了又看。趁你們不注意，她還偷偷抹了幾下眼角。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "When I said I wanted a spot of help, I was expecting a bag of tubers, or maybe a scrap of meat."
msgstr "我說想請人幫點忙，想著能拿來一袋薯塊，或者拿點肉來，就挺好了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Didn't expect you to drop a whole bleedin' building on my head!"
msgstr "誰知道你們一出手，竟給我蓋了整棟房子！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Hopefully it'll be a good starting point. Lots of folks from around town pitched in, and there's a ton of cookware and raw foods as well."
msgstr "有了這個開頭，往後應該就好辦了。城裡不少人都來幫過忙，廚具和食材也備了不少。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's more than I'll be able to handle alone. You two bring an army to help me keep the place runnin' too?"
msgstr "這麼大的地方，我一個人可顧不過來。怎麼，你們還給我備了一大幫人，等著來幹活？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not quite, but we figure if it's anything like building the place, once you start whipping up meals, others will start leaping over the counter to help you out."
msgstr "那倒沒有。不過蓋房子的時候，大家不都來了？等你這邊一開火，肯定又有人搶著來搭手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You think I'm lettin' just any schmuck make food for the town?"
msgstr "你當我這廚房是誰都能進的？做出來的飯，可是要給大家吃的！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm pleased the Nalidasi have left such an impression on you as to make you think we can do anything."
msgstr "你們覺得納裡達西人無所不能，我聽著是挺高興。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But let me tell you, cooking is not a strongsuit of our kind."
msgstr "可唯獨做飯這事，我們還真不在行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We've seen a few displays of... less proper ettique, but you all seem to take such pride in your craftsdwarfship, I almost find it hard to believe the Nalidasi don't treat food the same."
msgstr "我們是見過你們吃飯時……不怎麼講究。不過，你們那麼看重自己的手藝，我還以為做飯也不會含糊呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Let's just say that there's a reason you've seen our crafts and not our fine dining experiences."
msgstr "這麼說吧，你們聽說過納裡達西的好手藝，可聽說過納裡達西有什麼好菜嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I swear, folks are more inclined to start chewing gravel and wash it down with ale than to enjoy a proper meal half the time."
msgstr "這裡的人啊，有時候寧可嚼把碎石，再灌口麥酒，也懶得好好吃頓飯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I was tryin' to do my best to fix that before my bakery got blown to bits."
msgstr "麵包店還沒被炸掉的時候，我一直想改改他們這毛病。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any ideas on where we could find you some help, then?"
msgstr "那該去哪兒給你找幫手？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We just gotta give folks something they cannot possibly mess up. Cobblestone Soup."
msgstr "得先找道菜，簡單到誰來都做不壞。卵石湯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...doesn't seem all that much better than the gravel you mentioned..."
msgstr "……聽著跟吃碎石也沒好到哪兒去……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Zotty lets out a hearty chuckle before digging in her pocket and handing over a pouch of what looks like small bits of quartz. She assures you that they'll grow into Stonemelons, which are used in a soup that's hearty and filling, and practically impossible to mess up."
msgstr "佐蒂哈哈大笑，從口袋裡掏出一隻小袋子遞給你。袋子裡的東西，看著像一小粒一小粒的石英。她讓你放心，說這些種下去就能長出石瓜。拿石瓜煮湯，味道好，又頂飽，幾乎不可能失手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "This feels a little unorthodox."
msgstr "這做法還真沒見過。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I should probably wash my pickaxe."
msgstr "我是不是該先洗洗鎬頭？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The stonemelons grow strong with little supervision, which doesn't surprise you based on the name. Continuing to live up to their title, these small boulder-like melons look nearly identical to any ordinary rock you'd see out and about, except that they're almost perfectly spherical orbs. They're heavy, but you manage to lug your harvest back to Zotty's new cookhouse."
msgstr "石瓜不用怎麼照料，就長得結結實實。想到它們的名字，你倒也不覺得奇怪。它們長得也確實像石頭。要不是一個個圓得出奇，混在路邊的石塊裡，你大概根本認不出來。這些瓜沉得很，你們還是把收成一趟趟搬回了佐蒂的新食堂。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Proper dwarven farmers, the lot of you! Hardly seen any Stonemelons this size in my days, almost as good as my ol' pappy Xon could grow."
msgstr "行啊，你們都能當矮人農夫了！這麼大的石瓜，我可沒見過幾回。都快趕上我老爹克森種的了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm glad you're impressed, though almost surprised you could tell them apart from any old rock."
msgstr "你滿意就好。不過說真的，你怎麼認得出這些是瓜，不是石頭？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Clear as day to my dwarvern eyes, surprised you don't see it."
msgstr "我們矮人一眼就看得出來，跟大白天看東西一樣清楚。你們看不出來才奇怪呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Clear as day? But we don't get any sunlight down here..."
msgstr "大白天？可這底下也曬不著太陽啊……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's awfully clear though, ain't it?"
msgstr "反正看得清清楚楚，不是嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I guess so..."
msgstr "也是……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, how do we get these open? Should have plenty of knives around."
msgstr "那這些瓜怎麼開啟？這裡總不缺刀吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Our knives are for cuttin' up veggies and carvin' out meat. Step aside."
msgstr "刀是拿來切菜切肉的。讓開點。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Zotty grabs a pickaxe from the wall she seems to have brought out for just this purpose. She brings it down on the melon several times to no avail - to the point you're concerned you brought her an actual rock - until eventually, the melon cracks open like a geode. Inside, the stonemelon is filled with white flesh, which Zotty then extends out to you. You scrape a bit off and are surprised by its rubbery texture, and the fact that it's almost savory, like smoked meat. Zotty waves her hand towards your pile and gets to work cutting open a few more herself."
msgstr "佐蒂從牆上取下一把鎬頭，看樣子早就為這一刻準備好了。她舉鎬連敲了幾下，石瓜卻沒什麼反應。你正擔心自己不會真搬了塊石頭回來，瓜殼終於裂開，像剖開了一塊晶洞石。裡面是白色的瓜肉。佐蒂遞給你，讓你嚐嚐。你刮下一點放進嘴裡。瓜肉彈韌得出奇，竟還帶著一股近似燻肉的鮮香。佐蒂朝剩下的石瓜一指，自己也繼續動手，又敲開了幾個。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "A bit of this, and a bit of that..."
msgstr "這個放一點，那個添一些……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And serve!"
msgstr "上桌！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You do a better job of mashing the stonemelons to bits than splitting them perfectly in half like Zotty does in the beginning until she gives you a few pointers. You slowly but surely make your way through the pile, leaving behind a crime scene that'd inspire fear in all but the bravest of produce."
msgstr "剛開始，你只會把石瓜砸得七零八落，根本做不到像佐蒂那樣整整齊齊地劈成兩半。經她指點幾句後，你才漸漸摸到了門道。你們一點點處理完那堆石瓜，留下一地碎殼殘肉。要是蔬果也會害怕，看到這慘案現場，恐怕早就嚇得四散奔逃了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you done makin' a mess?"
msgstr "你們倆，霍霍完了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Think so! What do ya do with 'em now?"
msgstr "差不多了！接下來呢？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I ain't just gonna tell ya, I'm gonna show ya."
msgstr "光說你們哪會啊，來，我做給你們看。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I know the two of ya' got some proper worldsaving to go do, but if everyone here starves by the time you get back, what's it for?"
msgstr "我知道，你們還趕著去拯救世界。可要是等你們回來，大夥兒都餓死了，救下來又有什麼用？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I won't keep ya long, promise."
msgstr "放心，耽誤不了多久。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Zotty starts the stoves and begins carving out the melon flesh, dicing and seasoning it with a handful of herbs. Once her pot of water begin to boil, she tosses the prepared flesh back in, then combines it with some meat and veggies and stirs. Once done, she pours it into the hollowed out shell of the stonemelon and pushes it towards the two of you.\n\nThe Nalidasi may not value cooking much, but with food like this, it's sure to change."
msgstr "佐蒂點起爐火，挖出瓜肉，切丁，再抓上一把香草調味。鍋裡的水一開，她就把備好的瓜肉倒進去，加上肉和蔬菜，一起攪勻。煮好後，她將湯盛進掏空的瓜殼，推到你們面前。\n\n納裡達西人以前或許不把做飯當回事，可吃過這樣的東西，想來就該改主意了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Before either you or [Companion Name] can finish cooking your first pots, both Nalidasi and many of the Flamberian survivors from the Linking start trickling into the cookhouse, asking how they can help - in exchange for a bit of food of course - and Zotty begins barking out orders like a trained general. Flamberians heat their bodies and are used as stoves, much to the amusement of both races of dwarves. Zotty moves through the kitchen with purpose, correcting well-intentioned helpers and directing them to watch you and [Companion Name] as examples.\n\nIt takes a while, but those in the cookhouse start to produce Cobblestone Soup that Zotty is willing to serve to the long line of hungry survivors of the market district disaster. The two of you do so well Zotty is reluctant to let you go, until King Ozadazminis himself offers himself and the Archivist as replacements during a visit to the building's opening night. Zotty grumbles and mentions that good help is hard to find, but allows to you go after making sure you've both eaten your fill."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]連各自的第一鍋湯都還沒做好，就陸續有人走進食堂。既有納裡達西人，也有不少從接軌慶典上逃過一劫的弗拉姆貝里人，都是來問能不能幫忙換口飯吃的。佐蒂立刻指揮起來，架勢活像個帶慣了兵的將軍。弗拉姆貝里人把身體燒熱，直接充當爐子。這主意把兩邊的矮人都逗樂了。佐蒂在廚房裡來回忙碌，見誰做得不對就上前指點，還不時讓他們看看你和[Companion Name]是怎麼做的。\n\n又忙活了一陣，幫手們終於煮出了讓佐蒂滿意的卵石湯，可以端給門外排著長隊、飢腸轆轆的災民了。你們幹得太好，佐蒂實在捨不得放人。直到開張當晚，奧扎達茲米尼斯國王親自過來，提出由他和檔案管理員接手你們的活兒，她才答應讓你們走。她嘴裡還唸叨著「好幫手不好找」，又非要看著你們吃飽了飯，才肯放行。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Slug Slayer - There's only one thing you've seen that can pierce the Soulsmith slug monster's thick flesh, and it's currently embeded within the chest of the Flamberian Prince. Surely he's willing to part with it... if he can."
msgstr "蛞蝓獵殺——煉魂師那頭蛞蝓怪物皮肉厚實，你只見過一樣東西能刺穿它。偏偏那東西現在還插在弗拉姆貝里王子的胸口。想來王子很樂意把它交給你……只要拔得出來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Should come to a point here, maybe a handle made of..."
msgstr "這頭得打尖。至於柄，用什麼好呢……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Looks sharp enough to me."
msgstr "我看夠鋒利了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You wander outside of the room Prince Cintak has been being kept in, but were blocked by Princess Redilok before you could see the man.You and [Companion Name]'s plan is absurd, but if you intend to take down the Shambling Beast, you see no other path forward. You lay it out in detail to Princess Redilok, who blanches at the thought."
msgstr "你來到辛塔克王子的房門外，還沒見到他，就被雷迪洛克公主攔了下來。你和[Companion Name]想的這個辦法確實離譜，可要殺死那頭跛行獸，你們也實在想不出別的路子。你把打算從頭到尾說了一遍。雷迪洛克越聽，臉色越白。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You want to what?"
msgstr "你們想幹什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll be careful, I promise."
msgstr "我們會小心的，我保證。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, right. You'll carefully rip the spike of unknown material out of Prince Cintak's chest and close him up before he bleeds out."
msgstr "哦，對。你們要「小心」地從辛塔克王子的胸口拔出一根連是什麼做的都不知道的尖刺，再趕在他的血流乾之前把傷口合上。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Which of you is the surgeon, hm? I'm sure my father has an axe or something you could use..."
msgstr "敢問二位，哪位會做手術？我父親那兒肯定有斧子，你們借一把用不就好了……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...I know the concept is scary, but we're going to ask the prince what kind of... wound care his people even use."
msgstr "……我知道這事聽著嚇人。我們打算先問問王子，他們族人受了傷……通常都是怎麼治的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We've banadaged ourselves up countless times, but I'm not really sure where we'd start with someone made of stone and lava."
msgstr "咱們給自己包紮過多少回了，可要給一個渾身都是岩石和熔岩的人治傷，我還真不知道該從哪兒下手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And we're not going to be the ones operating on him, don't worry."
msgstr "你放心，主刀的也不是我們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I remember being introduced to someone at the Linking that seemed to be a big-shot in Flamberian society because they were a doctor."
msgstr "我記得接軌慶典上，有人給我介紹過一位弗拉姆貝里醫生。看得出來，他在族裡很有分量。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If he's still around, he would have come back with the rest of the survivors. He'd be the surgeon."
msgstr "他要是還活著，應該已經跟其他倖存者一起回來了。到時候請他主刀。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...fine."
msgstr "……好吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But if the prince doesn't make it, I'll see you both tried for treason. You won't leave Koganusan alive."
msgstr "但王子要是有個三長兩短，我就以叛國罪把你們兩個送上法庭。你們別想活著走出科加努桑。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Redilok seems to mull on the idea, before stepping aside and opening the door to his room. Prince Cintak is in rough shape. He put on a brave front while trekking back to the Dwarven capital, but the events of the Linking have doubtlessly worn away at the man. His breaths are labored, and the twisted black metal rod peircing his chest seems to have fused more with him. Despite his state, he still manages a smile as the three of you enter the room. After catching him up on current events, you detail your reason for visiting. You want to pry the metal from his chest and fashion it into a weapon to kill the Shambling Beast the Soulsmiths attacking the Linking with.\n\nHe digests the words for only a moment before praising the idea, reiterating that it seems to be the only thing that's pieced the beast's flesh, and that he's more than willing to help and details what he knows. First-aid for Flamberians seems to be more akin to working on a forged good than a living being, but you suppose that that makes sense for a being comprised of stone and magma. His people use emerald-tipped blades that are magically enhanced to cut into thier rocky exteriors. Then, for a wound that'll be as severe as his, a concoction of golden stardust and sporlyle would be able to help his body seal the wound, but he'd need to be hammered closed, like working on a platebody.\n\nPrincess Rodilok nearly faints as the man details beating on his chest with hammers to close the wound.\n\nYou decide to search for your doctor first. He's easy to find, as the man has been helping treat some of the more severely wounded folks in the Nalidasi market district, which has gone a long ways towards lightening some of concern that the Flamberians were behind the attack. When you detail your plan for working on the prince, Doctor Hacksmith is able to draw up a detailed schematic for this emerald blade that Cintak mentioned, but all of the doctor's handwriting is next to indesipherable. At least the diagram is detailed enough for you to work on."
msgstr "雷迪洛克思量片刻，終於讓到一旁，替你們開啟了房門。辛塔克王子的情況很不好。一路走回矮人都城時，他硬撐著沒讓人看出異樣。可接軌慶典上那一番折騰，終究還是耗盡了他的力氣。他每喘一口氣都很吃力。穿透胸膛的那根黑色金屬桿彎曲扭結，似乎比先前更深地長進了他的身體。即便如此，見你們三人進來，他還是擠出了一絲笑容。你先把近來的事告訴了他，隨後才道明來意。你們想提領他胸口的金屬，拿來打造一件武器，殺死煉魂師在接軌慶典上放出的那頭跛行獸。\n\n王子只想了一會兒，便說這是個好主意。畢竟，據他所知，刺穿過牛羚皮肉的也就這麼一樣東西。他很樂意幫忙，當即把自己知道的一一道來。聽他說來，給弗拉姆貝里人治傷，倒更像是在修補一件鍛造好的器物。不過，想到他們的身體本來就是岩石和岩漿，這也說得通。要切開他們堅硬的外層，得用經過魔法強化、刀尖嵌著祖母綠的刀。至於王子這樣的重傷，得把黃金星塵和斯波里爾調成藥水，幫助傷口癒合。光靠藥水還不夠，還得像修補胸甲那樣，用錘子把傷口一點點敲合。\n\n聽辛塔克仔細講到該怎麼往他胸口掄錘子，雷迪洛克公主差點沒暈過去。\n\n你決定先去找那位醫生。人倒是不難找。他一直在納裡達西的集市區救治重傷員。見他這麼忙前忙後，原本懷疑襲擊是弗拉姆貝里人所為的人們，也漸漸打消了疑慮。你把救治王子的打算告訴哈克史密斯博士，他便照辛塔克的說明，畫出了那把祖母綠刀的詳圖。只是博士寫的那些字，你幾乎一個也認不出來。好在圖紙畫得夠細，光看圖也能把刀打出來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wonder how Flamberian bodies handle stardust..."
msgstr "也不知道弗拉姆貝里人的身體碰上星塵，會有什麼反應……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Can't imagine something like this would have a regenerative effect on human flesh... Maybe the opposite."
msgstr "換作人，這東西恐怕沒法讓傷口癒合……沒準還會起反作用。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "When king Oyadazminis said that you'd have the backing of the whole kingdom when it came to getting them ready to go against the Soulsmiths, you didn't expect the level of support he decided to show. When one of his aids found you and [Companion Name] hammering out prototypes of the emerald tool in the palance courtyard, Oyadazminis himself had his people gather your things and walked you through the capitol until you found a lovely, well-stocked workshop built within the stalk of a large plant that you've never seen anywhere outside of the cavern. The workshop itself is outfitted with dozens of tools and workstations you couldn't even begin to guess at the function of. He bought the workshop from the owner, who tried to protest up until the kings' aids draped him in jeweled necklaces and sacks of gold were dropped in front of him until he couldn't see over the pile. In exchange, him and his workers found a perfect balance of handing you tools before you even asked for them, pointers in working with emerald, and giving you space when you needed it.\n\nAfter a few dozen failed attempts, you finally create a blade that was strong enough to chip away at stone with nary a scratch, and that is without the magical enhancements the prince mentioned. The former workshop owner - an older dwarf with gold-blonde hair who introduced himself as Kajc -  takes the blade and plunges it into the wall, before leaning back and stroking his chin."
msgstr "奧亞達茲米尼斯國王說過，只要是為迎戰煉魂師做準備，整個王國都會支援你們。你卻沒料到，他竟肯幫忙幫到這個地步。一名侍從看見你和[Companion Name]在王宮庭院裡試打祖母綠刀，國王便親自趕來，叫人收拾好你們的東西，領著你們穿過都城，來到一間精巧的工坊。工坊就建在一株巨型植物的莖幹裡，材料工具一應俱全。那種植物，你還沒在這座洞窟以外的地方見過。工坊裡足有幾十種工具和工作臺，許多你連用途都猜不出來。國王當場買下了工坊。坊主起初還想推辭，可侍從已經把寶石項鍊一串串掛到他脖子上，又把一袋袋金幣往他面前摞。等他連錢堆後面的東西都看不見了，也就不再推辭了。有坊主和工人們搭把手，你幹起活來順手多了。往往還沒等你開口，要用的工具就遞到了手邊。打磨祖母綠有什麼竅門，他們會順口提點幾句；看你想自己試試，便由著你慢慢琢磨。\n\n試壞幾十把之後，你終於做出一把能削下石屑、刀刃卻幾乎不留劃痕的刀。這還沒算上王子所說的魔法強化。工坊原來的主人是個上了年紀的金髮矮人，自我介紹時說叫凱克。他接過刀，一把扎進牆裡，隨後退開些，摸著下巴端詳起來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Now, that's a fine tool you've got there, folks."
msgstr "好傢伙，你們這把刀打得可真不錯。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What'd you say it was for, again?"
msgstr "剛才你們說，這是拿來做什麼的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Eh... it might be better if you don't know."
msgstr "呃……這個嘛，你可能還是不知道的好。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Fine then, keep your secrets."
msgstr "成，不說就不說。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Make sure you come on back here though if you've got more stuff to work on."
msgstr "下回還有東西要打，可得記著上我這兒來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I suppose my workshop is more the king's workshop, so it's not like I'd be able to stop you even if I wanted to."
msgstr "不過，這工坊如今該算國王的了。你們真要來，我想攔也攔不住。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And how do you feel about that?"
msgstr "工坊就這麼成了別人的，你捨得嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, it's wonderful! Do you know how long its been since I've had to help make something important?"
msgstr "我？高興還來不及呢！你們知道，我有多久沒幫著做過一件真正要緊的東西了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's just been random bits and bobs for years. A ring here, a golden egg that'll sit on a shelf collecting dust for ages there."
msgstr "這幾年，淨做些零零碎碎的小玩意兒。今兒打一枚戒指，明兒做一顆金蛋，往架子上一擺，也就剩下落灰了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "At least this fancy poker you've got is going to be used for something. Makes me feel useful."
msgstr "你們這根漂亮的尖傢伙，好歹是真要派上用場的。我這把老骨頭也算還有點用。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You head back to the palace with your emerald tool and hand it off to the princess, who promises she'll make it capable of withstanding the staggering heat of Cintak's blood. She mentions few things can handle someone as hot as him, and you get the feeling that she stopped talking about his blood a long while ago, but you let her babble, as she's clearly nervous about the whole ordeal of cutting open her not-so-secret love. Eventually she shoos you away, to get you working on the potion that should help seal up the prince once Hacksmith is done cutting the metal out of his body."
msgstr "你把祖母綠刀帶回王宮，交給公主。她答應替刀施法，好讓它經得住辛塔克血液的驚人高溫。她還說，像辛塔克這樣火熱的，能招架得住的可沒幾個。聽到這裡，你覺得她早就不只是在說他的血了。你由著她說下去。她對辛塔克的心意，大家早就看出來了。眼下心上人就要挨這一刀，她緊張得話都停不下來。過了一會兒，她便催你們去配藥水。等哈克史密斯從王子體內切出那塊金屬，還得靠這藥水幫傷口癒合。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just... stay still!"
msgstr "別……別動啊！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Finally."
msgstr "總算好了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You come back with the sparkling concoction and bring it into the bedroom-turned-surgery suite. A few Flamberians have joined Doctor Hacksmith, their purpose seemingly to be there to heat up the Prince's body, and then help hammer him closed afterward. The princess presents your emerald blade, now with glowing runestones etched into its hilt. Hacksmith presses one and the blade glows red, waves of heat scorching the air around it. The doctor tests the blade lightly on his own leg, then takes your potion and dribbles a few drops on the wound. Just as easily as the blade cut stone, your elixir quickly helps his rocky flesh knit back together."
msgstr "你帶著調好的藥水回來，瓶中的藥液閃著微光。王子的臥房如今已經成了手術室。幾名弗拉姆貝里人也來給哈克史密斯博士搭手。看樣子，他們得先讓王子的身體熱起來，等手術結束，再幫忙把傷口敲合。公主拿出你們打造的祖母綠刀。如今，刀柄上已嵌著幾枚刻有符文的石頭，正微微發光。哈克史密斯按下其中一枚，刀刃隨即燒得通紅，撲面而來的熱浪連四周的空氣都烤得灼燙。博士先在自己腿上輕輕劃了一刀，又接過藥水，往傷口上滴了幾滴。刀刃切開岩石毫不費力，藥水也同樣見效。轉眼間，那道石質皮肉上的傷口便重新合攏。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I think we're about ready to begin."
msgstr "我看，可以開始了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Prince, I apologize that we hardly have an ideal room, staff, or tools to treat you."
msgstr "殿下，這間屋子、我們這點人手，還有手邊的器具，都算不上理想，還請您見諒。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Your family is well known to mine, I know I'm in good hands."
msgstr "咱們兩家是老相識了。由你來做這個手術，我放心。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'll do my best."
msgstr "我會盡力的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You'd better be alright, Cinny. "
msgstr "小辛，你可不能有事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You say that when you're worse off than me. You're missing a whole arm."
msgstr "你還說我？你傷得比我重。整條胳膊都沒了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But I'm stable. They're practially cutting your heart out!"
msgstr "可我的傷已經穩住了。他們這都快把你的心挖出來了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Cintak pulls the princess close and whispers something in her ear, which seems to help her settle, and blush. You turn away to let the two of them have their moment, but soon enough, everyone's ferried out of the room.\n\nThe surgery is long. Several times you and [Companion Name] have to settle Princess Redilok from interrupting, but she hardly seems that intent on entering. Just the idea of having to wait outside and feeling like she can't help further drives her up the wall.\n\nAfter multiple hours, you begin to hear loud thuds from the Prince's room. Hammering Cintak's chest back closed sounds lightly terrifying, but you trust the Flamberians know their own anatomy better than you do. Eventually, the door swings open, and Hacksmith declares his work done, before handing you the rock of dark twisted metal. After a quick peek to check in on the Prince, you let Redilok stay with him herself, then head back to the workshop to fashion a weapon out of the weird material."
msgstr "辛塔克把公主拉到身邊，在她耳邊低聲說了幾句。她似乎安心了些，臉也紅了。你轉過身，讓他們單獨待一會兒。沒多久，其餘人就都被請到了門外。\n\n手術一直沒有結束。好幾次，雷迪洛克公主都像是要衝進去，你和[Companion Name]只好勸她冷靜。其實，她也未必真想進去打斷手術。讓她難受的是隻能在門外乾等，再也幫不上忙。\n\n幾個小時後，王子的房間裡終於響起一聲聲沉重的錘擊。一想到他們正用錘子把辛塔克的胸口敲回原樣，你多少有些心驚。不過，弗拉姆貝里人總比你懂得該怎麼醫治自己的族人。門終於開了。哈克史密斯宣佈手術結束，把提領來的那塊黑色金屬交到你手上。它扭作一團，看著倒像塊石頭。你往房裡看了一眼，見王子沒有大礙，便不再打擾，讓雷迪洛克單獨陪著他。你帶著那塊古怪的金屬回到工坊，打算把它鍛成一件武器。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you beat the metal rod into a speartip, something becomes distrubingly clear. The metal that was burried inside the prince is alive. [Companion Name] suggests the name Soulsteel, keeping in line with the Soulsmiths' unoriginal naming conventions, and the name sticks. The dwarves in the workshop are more fascinated than horrified by the material and frequently suggest... unconventional smithing methods to combat the metal's unwillingness to take shape the way you want it to. You try hammering it for hours on end, taking turns with [Companion Name] and Kajc. You try etching it in acid, heating it and cooling it in a way that'd make any other metal crack, all to no avail. The only thing that works is when you... speak with it. The Soulsteel doesn't speak back, but it wavers in all sorts of fashions, communicating in a language you haven't got the slightest clue on how to begin desciphering.\n\nEventually, you manage to learn its version of positive and negative wiggles, you're able to tell it that you intend to kill off the beast it originally came from, to which it seems thrilled. At least, you think that's what it is trying to communicate to you. It stops resisting being shaped and you're able to use it to make the cutting edge of a long, curved blade. You don't like how the metal seems to shiver whenever it is close to something, but you can't think of any other way to cut through the beast it came from. For now, this will have to do."
msgstr "你一錘一錘地敲著那根金屬桿，想把它鍛成矛尖。可錘子每落下一次，你心裡那個不安的猜測就更真切一分。從王子體內提領的這塊金屬，是活的。[Companion Name]說，照煉魂師那套沒什麼新意的取名法，就叫它「魂鋼」好了。這個名字就這麼定了下來。工坊裡的矮人倒沒怎麼害怕，反而對魂鋼著了迷。見它怎麼都不肯成形，大家紛紛出起主意，只是那些鍛造的法子，一個比一個……別出心裁。你、[Companion Name]和凱克輪流揮錘，一連敲了好幾個鐘頭。你試過用酸蝕刻，又試著把它燒熱、驟冷。換了別的金屬，這麼折騰早就裂了，魂鋼卻還是老樣子。唯一管用的辦法，竟然是……跟它說話。魂鋼不會開口，卻能以各種方式扭動回應。它似乎有一套自己的語言，而你壓根不知道該從哪裡學起。\n\n摸索了一陣，你總算分得清，怎樣扭是點頭，怎樣扭是搖頭。你設法讓它明白，你打算殺死它原先寄身的那頭牛羚。聽到這話，它似乎高興極了。至少，你覺得它想表達的是高興。這回它終於肯順著你的錘子成形了。你用它打出一道鋒刃，做成了一把長長的彎刀。只要挨近什麼東西，魂鋼就會微微顫動。這一點你實在喜歡不起來。可要破開那頭牛羚的皮肉，你也想不出除了用它身上取下的東西，還能有什麼別的辦法。眼下，就靠這把刀了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Misty Mystery - The Soulsmith's Shambling Beast was last seen dragging its pitiful form north from the center of the Stoneway. As long as it didn't change directions, that'd place it somewhere within the Misty Thicket... an incredibly dense bog covered in a perpectual blanket of mist. The perfect place to go searching for a monster."
msgstr "迷霧尋蹤——你最後一次見到煉魂師的跛行獸時，它正拖著身子，從石道中段狼狽地向北逃去。要是它一路沒拐彎，現在多半就在迷霧灌木林。那是片草木叢生的沼澤，終年不見霧散。要找怪物，這地方可真是再合適不過了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What's going on up here?"
msgstr "上面出什麼事了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh my."
msgstr "哎喲。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It feels good to be outside the caverns that hold the Nalidasi capital, but unfortunately, it's not like your planned adventure is going to be particularly fun. You take in a deep breath of fresh air and wipe off a layer of dust that you're sure has been perptually stuck to your body during your subterranean stay, despite your adherance to basic hygenie. You and [Companion Name] take the time to map out the area, lining up your current position with where the Linking took place, and then plotting the trajectory of where the Shambling Beast could have shuffled off to, assuming it stayed the same course across an unknown amount of distance. It should be somewhere within the Misty Thicket, though you can't begin to wager where, you'll just have to deal with that once you get there.\n\nA long shot, but the best you've got, considering the current circumstances."
msgstr "走出納裡達西都城所在的洞窟，能到外面透口氣，確實舒服。可惜，接下來要辦的事，恐怕沒這麼讓人愉快。你深吸了一口新鮮空氣，抹掉身上的一層灰。在地底住的那些日子，你明明也沒少洗，可這層灰像是從來就沒洗掉過。你和[Companion Name]畫出附近的地形，在圖上標明你們現在的位置，又找出舉行接軌慶典的地方。牛羚當時是從那裡往北逃的。只要它沒換過方向，你們就能循著這條線，大致推算出它的去向。至於它到底走了多遠，誰也說不準。照這個方向走，牛羚多半進了迷霧灌木林。至於它藏在哪兒，只能等到了林子裡再慢慢找。\n\n指望這點線索找到它，機會不大。可眼下你們也沒有更好的辦法。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's... quite a ways away, isn't it?"
msgstr "這地方……夠遠的啊。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I don't suppose the Nalidasi have a second, smaller, portable Stoneglider, that doesn't need rails, huh?"
msgstr "你說，納裡達西人就沒有另一臺石板滑行者？小一點，能帶著走，最好還不用鋪軌道。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It'd be a mix of amazing and terrifying if they did. If I was moving that fast over land, it'd only be a matter of time before I hit something a little too big."
msgstr "真有那東西，坐起來肯定既過癮又嚇人。要是讓我開著它在野地裡跑，照那個速度，早晚得撞上什麼大傢伙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I imagine it'd look a little like a balloon filled with red paint hitting a wall."
msgstr "想想那場面，跟一隻灌滿紅顏料的氣球拍在牆上差不多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe it is best they keep those on rails, eh?"
msgstr "……那還是讓它在軌道上跑吧。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's so much distance to cover on foot. We'll have to keep ourselves stocked up along the way."
msgstr "可這麼遠，全靠兩條腿走啊。路上還得隨時補給。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Just like travelling to the capitol! Feels like that was so long ago. I won-"
msgstr "跟咱們當初去都城一樣！總覺得那都是好久以前的事了。不知道……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Both of you drop into combat position as you hear a shout from the cliffs up above you. Several loud growls and snarls follow, followed by several swears and exclamations of 'bad doggy'. You look to [Companion Name] who shrugs and starts climbing the cliffside."
msgstr "上方的崖頂突然傳來一聲喊叫，你們倆立刻擺出迎戰的架勢。接著是幾聲低沉的咆哮，夾雜著罵聲，還有人一個勁兒地喊：「壞狗！壞狗！」你看向[Companion Name]。她聳聳肩，動手往崖上爬。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Who's a good monster?"
msgstr "誰是最乖的小怪物呀？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You are! Yes you are!"
msgstr "是你呀！對，就是你！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You weren't too sure what you'd find when you climbed the cliffface, but it wasn't a young Flamberian dwarf being chased by half a dozen Rockwolves. The young man dangles from a twiggy looking tree growing out of the mountainside while Rockwolves jump up to nip at his heels, trying to grab a bite.\n\nThe moment that the two of you pull yourselves up over the side, the Rockwolves turn towards you. They snarl and start angling towards the pair of you instead, until a brief moment of familiarity washes over them. A Rockwolf with an outer shell of a sandy-looking stone carefully approaches you, then flips over at your feet in submission. These wolves must have been from the same pack as the one you fought when you first arrived at the Perilous Peaks, it's the only thing that explains their current behavior. The large rock-covered wolves gaze down at you, seemingly waiting for your next move. Some yawn and lay down, or snarl at the Flamberian as he tries to push his way over to you. The Rockwolves are immense creatures, easily twice your size, which make the Flamberian look even smaller in comparison."
msgstr "往上爬的時候，你也說不準崖頂會有什麼。可一個年輕的弗拉姆貝里矮人被六頭石狼追得四處躲，這你還真沒想到。山壁上斜長著一棵細瘦的小樹，小夥子就吊在上面。石狼在底下躥來躥去，張口去咬他的腳後跟，都想從他身上咬下一塊肉。\n\n你們剛翻上崖邊，石狼便齊齊轉過頭來。它們齜著牙朝你們逼近，卻又慢慢收了聲，像是認出了你們。一頭披著砂岩般外甲的石狼試探著走近，往你腳邊一躺，翻過身露出了肚皮。你們初到險惡山脈時，曾跟一群石狼打過一架。這幾頭準是那一群裡的，不然怎麼解釋它們見了你就這麼老實？這群披著石甲的巨狼低頭望著你，似乎在等你下一步動作。有幾頭打了個哈欠，就地趴下了。那個弗拉姆貝里小夥子想從狼群中擠到你身邊，另外幾頭又衝他齜起牙來。這些石狼個個都有你兩倍大。那小夥子本來就矮，站在它們中間，看著更小了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Um... Good doggies?"
msgstr "嗯……乖狗狗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I figured they'd be out for revenge after we..."
msgstr "我還以為它們會來報仇呢，畢竟咱們……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Took care of the big one."
msgstr "把最大的那頭給收拾了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Seems that we're the big ones, now."
msgstr "看來這回輪到咱們當老大了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We are? You hardly come up to the things' shoulder."
msgstr "咱們？你站直了都夠不著它的肩膀。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Tell that to it. Seems pretty supplicant to me."
msgstr "這話你跟它說去。我看它服氣得很。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "How in the names of the Great Flame did you two do that? "
msgstr "火焰在上，你們倆到底是怎麼做到的？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We had a run in with their leader a while back, and it seems that they aren't too mad that we... turned it into jerky."
msgstr "前陣子，我們碰巧跟它們的頭狼打了一架。看來，就算咱們把頭狼……做成了肉乾，它們也沒怎麼往心裡去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Incredible. Animal Behaviorial Specialist Brunite at your service. Humans are a rarity in these parts..."
msgstr "真不可思議。我叫布魯尼特，專門研究動物習性，很高興為二位效勞。這一帶可難得見到人類……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, normally they are, at least. The last time I saw some was actually..."
msgstr "嗯，至少平時很少見。說起來，我上回見到人類，還是在……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Wait. You were at the Linking! You saved our prince!"
msgstr "等等。接軌慶典那天，你們也在！就是你們救了我們的王子！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, we helped out a bit."
msgstr "我們也就幫了點忙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please, please, you're far too modest. I doubt any of us would have gotten out of there alive were it not for your efforts."
msgstr "哎呀，二位太謙虛了。那天要是沒有你們，我們這些人恐怕一個也逃不出來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And... me doubly so, it'd seem. Thank you for saving me once again."
msgstr "至於我……看來已經是第二次靠你們撿回一條命了。多謝二位，又救了我一次。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We didn't have to do much, we're able to get a better vantage up here anyway."
msgstr "沒費什麼事。再說，爬到這裡也好，能看得遠些。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh? And what are you scouting out, if I may ask?"
msgstr "哦？冒昧問一句，二位在找什麼？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're headed out to the Misty Thicket. It'll be quite the journey."
msgstr "我們打算去迷霧灌木林。一趟挺遠的旅程。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What'd you learn about the behaviors of the Rockwolves? That they're hungry?"
msgstr "倒是你，研究石狼研究出什麼來了？它們餓了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, actually, yes."
msgstr "呃，說起來，你還真說對了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They seem to designate members of their pack to hunt, while others serve other purposes."
msgstr "我目擊狼群裡似乎有分工。有些專門負責捕獵，其他的也各有用處。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "For example, the one at your feet there, its stone hide is closely related to sandstone. Hunters will sharpen their teeth by gnawing on its hide, like you'd sharpen your blade on a whetstone."
msgstr "就拿你腳邊這頭來說，它身上那層石甲，質地跟砂岩很像。負責捕獵的狼就啃它的石甲磨牙，跟你用磨刀石磨刀一個道理。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Sounds... useful, actually."
msgstr "這麼一說……還真挺管用。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They metabolize both meat and stone, with different Rockwolves prioritizing different stone and mineral types to change their hides in accordance with what the pack needs."
msgstr "石狼既吃肉，也能消化石頭。不同的石狼會挑不同的岩石和礦物來吃。狼群需要什麼樣的石甲，它們就能長出什麼樣的石甲來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'd imagine you were acting in self-defense when you fought against the pack earlier. Well, it seems they're missing a handful of crucial roles now."
msgstr "你們之前跟它們動手，想來也是為了自保。不過眼下看來，狼群裡有幾樣要緊的活兒，已經沒狼能幹了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Maybe there's something that can be done for your journey..."
msgstr "說不定……我倒有個辦法，能讓你們這趟少走點路。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Brunite details his plans. He'd originally wanted to use the wolves as mounts to help his people return back to their home once things were sorted with the Soulsmiths, but maybe with your help, he could expidite his plans, in exchange for letting you bring some of the wolves with you. They already seem plenty docile with you around, what's the harm in trying, right? \n\nYou return to the capitol, and run the idea of starting a breeding program for the Rockwolves to the king, who simply laughs and waves his hand, seemingly letting the Archivist write down and deal with aquiring the materials to set up a place to store, raise, and train wolves, assuming they don't break out and eat you."
msgstr "布魯尼特說起了他的打算。他原本想把這些狼馴成坐騎。等煉魂師的事告一段落，族人們就能騎著它們回家了。現在有你們幫忙，說不定能早點把這件事辦成。作為回報，你們可以帶上幾頭石狼趕路。你們一來，它們就這麼聽話。試試又何妨？\n\n你們回到都城，把繁育石狼的打算說給國王聽。國王哈哈一笑，大手一揮，檔案管理員便提筆記下，看來籌集物資的事又落到了他頭上。得先給狼群安個家，往後才好飼養、訓練。當然，這一切的前提是，它們別先跑出來把你們吃了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I feel soggy and miserable."
msgstr "我渾身都溼透了，真難受。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just want to find the beast and get back home."
msgstr "我只想趕緊找到那頭牛羚，早點回家。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The wolves are equal parts stone and organic, and with sufficent meat and sources of minerals, they grow much faster than you'd ever expect. In conjunction with preparing a route to the Misty Thicket, you frequently stop in to help Brunite with the Rockwolf study, creating wolves that didn't seem to appear naturally before. Soon enough, by the time you're ready to head out, you have three wolves with hides made of a material similar to quartz, hoping it'd be light enough for travel but hard enough to protect the beasts from any kind of dangerous monsters you may come across in the countryside."
msgstr "石狼身上一半是血肉，一半是岩石。只要肉和礦物管夠，它們長得比你想象中快得多。籌劃前往迷霧灌木林的路線時，你也常去幫布魯尼特研究石狼。你們甚至培育出了幾種在野外似乎從未見過的石狼。等到準備出發時，你們已經有了三頭披著石英般外甲的狼。但願這層甲夠輕，跑長途時不礙事，又足夠結實，萬一在野外撞上什麼兇險的怪物，也護得住它們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can't believe it! Rockwolves feel like they were made to be domesticated. Most of them are generally of good temperment, and they're so friendly too!"
msgstr "簡直不敢相信！石狼簡直天生就適合馴養。大多脾氣都好，還特別黏人！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Milkbone here hardly stops licking me! I'm shocked at how fast they can grow under controlled conditions, too, it reminds me of growing crystals as a boy."
msgstr "就說奶骨吧，你看，她都舔我半天了！能控制飼養條件以後，它們竟然長得這麼快。倒讓我想起小時候養晶體的事了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you sure that Milkbone isn't just seeing if you'd be a good addition to her hide? Flamberians are mostly stone, right?"
msgstr "你就這麼肯定，奶骨舔你，不是在嚐嚐你這身石頭適不適合拿來長石甲？你們弗拉姆貝里人身上，不是大半都是石頭嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I... hadn't considered that."
msgstr "我……這個我倒沒想過。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "[Companion Name] be nice, I'm sure she's just a friendly, mostly feral wolf."
msgstr "[Companion Name]，別嚇唬人家。奶骨肯定就是喜歡你。雖說野性是還沒怎麼褪。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you sure you want to join us though, Brunite? The Misty Thicket is a long ways away."
msgstr "不過，布魯尼特，你真打算跟我們一起去？迷霧灌木林可遠著呢。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We're just scouting a path and locating that monster that attacked the Linking, but we'll almost definitely get into some trouble at some point."
msgstr "這回雖說只是探路，找找襲擊接軌慶典的那頭怪物，可這一趟十有八九要碰上麻煩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "And miss the opportunity to see how the first wolves we've bred behave in uncontrolled conditions? Not a chance!"
msgstr "這可是咱們養出來的第一批石狼。我還想親眼看看它們在野外都會是什麼表現呢。說什麼我也得去！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Atop the quartz rockwolves, you make extrodinary time. The beasts are fast, incredibly easy to care for, and defend themselves well enough that you feel comfortable sleeping through the night without anyone on watch. Despite his shaky introduction, Brunite proves to be quite capable while travelling to the Misty Wetlands with you, though he does still jump a bit whenever Milkbone licks him, wondering if [Companion Name]'s joke held any truth.\n\nFinding the Shambling Beast will be like finding a needle in a haystack - and that's if it's even here in the first place - but you trudge into the wetlands regardless. The Misty Wetlands have both mist and wetland in abundance, and you frequently have to stop and cut your way through underbrush or use lumber to cross particularly deep stretches of water, especially with your heavy Rockwolves accompanying you."
msgstr "騎上這幾頭披著石英外甲的石狼，你們趕路快了許多。它們跑得快，好照料，也有本事保護自己。到了夜裡，你們連守夜的人都不用留，儘管踏踏實實睡到天亮。別看頭一回見面時布魯尼特那麼狼狽，去迷霧濕地的路上，他可一點兒沒拖後腿。就是奶骨一舔他，他還是會嚇得一縮，忍不住琢磨[Companion Name]那句玩笑裡會不會有幾分真。\n\n要在這裡找到跛行獸，無異於大海撈針。何況這根「針」究竟在不在這裡，都還說不準。你們還是邁開步子，走進了溼地。迷霧濕地倒真是名副其實，霧和水一樣都不少。沒走多遠，你們就得停下來劈開擋路的灌木。遇上水深的地方，還得伐木搭路，尤其是身後跟著這麼幾頭沉甸甸的石狼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They started it."
msgstr "可是他們先動的手。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I wonder what they may have..."
msgstr "也不知道他們身上都帶了些什麼……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you sink your axe into yet another tree to cross another endless stretch of water, a flaming bolt glances your shoulder and sinks into the thick bark. You drop your axe and whip your head around to see the burning shilloette of a Flamberian far behind you, with a hefty crossbow held aloft. You cry out and everyone dives into the water, narrowly avoiding further projectiles. A volley of similar bolts follows soon after, peppering the ground and trees around you, your party, and mounts. You poke your head out of the water and see [Companion Name] fire a bolt of magic that freezes the water in the air, providing a thin shield against the attacks' bolts."
msgstr "前面又是一大片望不到頭的積水。你的斧子剛砍進樹幹，一支燃燒的弩箭便擦過你的肩頭，一頭扎進厚實的樹皮。你扔下斧子，猛地回頭。遠處有個渾身冒著火光的弗拉姆貝里人，手裡高舉著一把重重的十字弓。你大喊一聲，眾人齊齊撲進水裡，險險避開接重新上弦來的弩箭。緊接著又是一陣齊射，一支支弩箭扎進你們和坐騎身旁的泥地與樹幹。你從水裡探出頭，只見[Companion Name]打出一道法術，半空中的水頃刻間凍成了一面薄薄的冰盾，擋住了飛來的弩箭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Those look like Flamberians!"
msgstr "那些好像是弗拉姆貝里人！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I fear you're right. I hope the two of you are... capable of dealing with them?"
msgstr "恐怕你沒看錯。二位……能對付得了他們吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "If we have to. Any clue on why they're out here, and what problem they'd have with us?"
msgstr "真要動手的話，肯定是能。你知道他們為什麼在這兒，又為什麼要襲擊我們嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I mean, you're one of them, no?"
msgstr "你也是弗拉姆貝里人，對吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Not all Flamberians were too interested in peace with the Naladasi."
msgstr "不是所有弗拉姆貝里人都願意跟納裡達西人講和。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sure the defectors have some way of identifying one another, and I'm sure I don't look the part."
msgstr "那群叛逃者肯定有辦法認出自己人。我嘛，一看就跟他們不是一夥的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Any idea on if this will cause any problems for us later on down the line?"
msgstr "那咱們跟他們動手，回頭會不會惹出什麼麻煩？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, I highly doubt it! There's a reason why they're hiding all the way out here."
msgstr "哦，你說這個，我看不會！他們躲到這麼偏遠的地方，可是有原因的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Those that are willing to reject the Naladasi with violence aren't welcome in our kingdom."
msgstr "我們王國不歡迎那些非要跟納裡達西人動武的傢伙。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Plus, they fired first."
msgstr "再說了，也是他們先放的箭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "That's enough for the two of you. Brunite gets your mounts to cover while you and [Companion Name] do your best to move towards the Flamberians as quietly as you can through the wetland bogs. Shrouded by the mist and setting sun, you're upon them before they even know it. You reach up from the water and drag one of the attackers under, silencing them as quickly as you can. The Flamberian next to him cries out, and the group is thrown into chaos."
msgstr "有這句話，你們倆心裡就有數了。布魯尼特帶坐騎去找地方躲避。你和[Companion Name]則儘量放輕動作，蹚過泥沼，朝那些弗拉姆貝里人摸去。暮色漸深，又有霧氣遮掩。直到你們摸到跟前，他們都沒察覺。你從水下伸出手，拽住其中一個襲擊者，將他拖進水裡，沒讓他再出聲。他身旁的弗拉姆貝里人驚叫起來，人群頓時亂了套。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Has to be what we're looking for."
msgstr "準是我們要找的東西。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Here we are."
msgstr "到了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You and [Companion Name] pant in the mist, happy to be done with such messy work. Killing monsters is one thing, but it's always a little bit different to be fighting against human - or human adjacent - opponents, even if they're the aggressors. Brunite brings your rockwolves over once the sounds of fighting die down, trying to avert his eyes from the dead dwarves in the water."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]站在霧裡直喘氣。這場廝殺總算結束了，你也鬆了口氣。殺怪物是一回事。可當對手是人，或是跟人相差無幾的矮人，動起手來，心裡總歸不一樣。哪怕先動手的是他們。打鬥聲一停，布魯尼特便帶著石狼走了過來。他轉開視線，儘量不去看水裡的矮人屍體。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You two are... efficient."
msgstr "你們兩個……下手可真利落。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm sorry. They didn't seem to be too interested in talking through things."
msgstr "抱歉。看他們的樣子，根本沒打算跟我們談。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We didn't have much choice in the matter."
msgstr "我們也沒得選。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh, don't get me wrong, I won't shed any tears for them."
msgstr "別誤會，我可不會為他們掉眼淚。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "They probably feared we'd give them up to Flamberian authorities if we found them out here, and thought it'd be better to silence us."
msgstr "多半是咱們撞見了他們，他們怕咱們回去報信，就想幹脆殺人滅口。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The two of you are just... "
msgstr "只是你們倆……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can't think of many people who could move that quickly and leave that much death in their wake. Regardless of the reason."
msgstr "這麼一會兒工夫，竟然就能殺這麼多人。我還真想不出有幾個人辦得到。不管是為了什麼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Brunite grimaces as Milkbone starts to sniff the corpse of one of the attackers, and pulls her away from the body. You and [Companion Name] start to go through the defectors' posessions and find a map and various plans they'd made. Several drafts of ransom notes which lead you to believe they intended to kidnap Prince Cintak at some point... they were ambitious if nothing else. They seemed to have a nearby camp, but what interests you far more is an old ruined castle, the Flamberians had marked, circled, and drawn several warnings of \"Death\" and \"Stay away\" around. Seems like a good place to start your search. As you get closer to the old ruined castle, you find tracks that stick out in the murk. Tracks made by hundreds of pairs of arms."
msgstr "奶骨湊到一名襲擊者的屍體旁嗅了嗅。布魯尼特皺起臉，把她拉開。你和[Companion Name]翻了翻叛逃者的東西，找到一張地圖，還有幾份行動計劃。光是勒索信就打了好幾份草稿。看來，他們還打過綁架辛塔克王子的主意……別的不說，膽子倒是不小。地圖上標著一處營地，看來那些叛逃者就駐紮在附近。可真正讓你在意的，是一座廢棄的古堡。他們特意把古堡圈了出來，還在旁邊反覆寫著「致命危險」「別靠近」。看來，要找那頭牛羚，就該先去這座古堡看看。離古堡越近，泥地裡的痕跡就越顯眼。那是幾百雙手臂爬過時留下的。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The Shambling Beast made a mess of a trail through the Misty Thicket, and you wager you'd be able to follow it all the way out pretty easily, now that you've found its trail. Downed trees, a huge gouge through the ground thats already filled with water, and occasional lumps of flesh are pretty telling that you're on the right track. As you get closer and closer to what you presume would be the castle, the stench of death seems to hang in the air, which is impressive for such a horrid bog that already doesn't smell like a bundle of roses.\n\nThe two of you leave Brunite and the Rockwolves behind, trusting in your ability to move more quietly and take up less space than huge beasts with stone for fur. You follow the trail until you find what the Flamberians detailed on their map. Row upon row of corpses are pinned to the outer walls of a ancient castle. All of the bodies are seemingly frozen in space, but doubtlessly alive, since the wall adornments seem to moan and twitch from time to time. The mist-shrouded moat surrounding the castle does little to brighten the image in your mind. You let out an involentary shiver as you gaze up at the macbre sight.\n\n[Companion Name] pulls you away, sure that the monster you're looking for is within the walls. This is definitely not something you can take on alone. It's time to see just how serious King Oyadazminis is about going to war, because it'll take quite the siege to bring down these walls. The journey back is much faster than your journey in, perhaps in part due to the back you know you'll have dry feet for the first time in a while. It's still quite the trek to return to the capitol, but it's comparatively smooth sailing than your trip to the Misty Thicket."
msgstr "跛行獸一路穿過迷霧灌木林，把沿途攪得一片狼藉。如今找著了它的蹤跡，哪怕一路追出林子，想來也不會跟丟。沿途的樹倒了一片，地上被拖出一道深溝，溝裡已經積滿了水。偶爾還能看見幾塊掉落的血肉。你們走對了。你估摸著，古堡就在前面了。越往前走，空氣裡的腐屍味就越濃。這片沼澤本來就夠臭的了，那股味道居然還能蓋過去。\n\n你們讓布魯尼特和石狼留在後面。兩個人悄悄摸過去，總比帶著幾頭渾身披著石甲的龐然大物容易藏身。你們沿著痕跡繼續前行，終於看見了弗拉姆貝里人在地圖上標出的那座古堡。古堡的外牆上，密密麻麻釘著一排又一排屍體。那些身體彷彿被定在了牆上，可分明還活著。隔一會兒，牆上的這些「裝飾」就會抽動幾下，發出呻吟。城堡四周還有一道護城河，霧氣沉沉地壓在水面上，更添了幾分陰森。你仰頭望著這一幕，不由得打了個寒戰。\n\n[Companion Name]把你拉開。她確信，你們要找的怪物就在城牆裡面。光憑你們倆，這回肯定應付不來。要打下這座城堡，少不了一場硬仗。奧亞達茲米尼斯國王說過要出兵，是時候看看他究竟有多大決心了。回去時，你們的腳程比來時快多了。說不定是因為一想到總算能離開這片沼澤，讓溼透的雙腳幹一幹，你們就不由得加快了腳步。回都城還有很長一段路要走。好在比起來迷霧灌木林時的跋涉，這一路順當多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Bring Down The House - The weapon to defeat the Shambling Beast is ready, and a path to the Soulsmith's Ruin is cleared. Prince Cintak and Princess Redilok will lead their people into battle, with you and [Companion Name] at the head. "
msgstr "攻破迷霧要塞——斬殺跛行獸的武器已經備好，通往那座被煉魂師佔據的古堡的路也已打通。辛塔克王子和雷迪洛克公主將率領族人出征，由你和[Companion Name]打頭陣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I can't wait to see them in action."
msgstr "真想早點看看它們上陣是什麼樣。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We should get some rest."
msgstr "咱們該歇會兒了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The path to the Misty Keep is plotted, a weapon to slay the Shambling Beast is strapped to your back, and things are slowly returning to normal in Koganusan. As you walk through the outer courtyard of the palace, you notice a large number of guards out and training against one another, with the occasional Flamberian even dotting their ranks - holdovers from the Linking that haven't been able to start the trek back to their homeland yet, and have decided to accompany the prince until he sees it fit to return.\n\nWhen you enter the throne room, King Oyadazminis looks down from his seat with a knowing expression."
msgstr "前往迷霧要塞的路線已經摸清，能殺死跛行獸的武器就背在你身上。科加努桑也在一點點回春往日的模樣。你穿過王宮外院，看見大批守護正在兩兩對練，隊伍裡偶爾還能瞧見幾個弗拉姆貝里人的身影。他們都是接軌慶典後留下來的，一時沒能啟程返鄉，索性決定跟著王子，等他認為時機合適了，再一道回去。\n\n走進王座大廳，奧亞達茲米尼斯國王從座上低頭看向你，像是已經猜到了你的來意。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're ready, aren't you?"
msgstr "都準備好了，是吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I believe we are."
msgstr "應該差不多了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's been many long years since we actively sought dealings with your kind, but what transpired at the Linking has given me much to think about."
msgstr "我們已經很多年沒主動跟人類打過交道了。不過，接軌慶典上發生的事，讓我想了很多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Though I doubt most humans would be willing to help even a fraction as much as the two of you have, perhaps we've been... avoidant, for far too long."
msgstr "我不指望大多數人類都能像你們一樣幫我們這麼多，哪怕幫上十分之一也好。不過，也許是我們……關起門來太久了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Once those who attacked my people are burried in thier marsh, we'll send an envoy or two around. Let your people know that we'd be willing to entertain more than a few tourists, from time to time."
msgstr "等把那些襲擊我族人的傢伙埋進他們自己的沼澤裡，我打算派一兩位使節出去走走。也讓你們的人知道，我們願意跟你們多些來往，不必總是偶爾來幾個遊客就算了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The world would be much better off for it."
msgstr "那樣一來，對大家都有好處。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You know they would be. We'll see if your fancy nobles can stay standing after a single glass of fine Naladasi liqour."
msgstr "那當然了。到時候倒要看看，你們那些貴族老爺喝上一杯上好的納裡達西烈酒，還能不能站得穩。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "But, as much as I'd like to, I can't entertain the thought of festivities yet."
msgstr "不過，雖然我也想熱熱鬧鬧地辦一場，但眼下還不是慶祝的時候。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We've read over your reports and path to the Soulsmiths' keep."
msgstr "你們送來的報告，還有通往煉魂師要塞的路線，我們都看過了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As the king has so kindly promised, our people are at your disposal, though we'll be joining you as well."
msgstr "國王既已應允，我們的人手就聽二位調遣。我們也會隨你們一道出徵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As will my daughter... Try as I might, she refuses to stay off the battlefield, despite her injuries. The..."
msgstr "還有我女兒……我怎麼勸都不管用。傷成這樣，她還是非上戰場不可。那位……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "...Prince, seems to have taken a liking to my daughter, and is joining her. "
msgstr "……王子，看來是喜歡上我女兒了，也要陪她去。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'd be fortunate to have the four of you alongside us, but wouldn't that be... dangerous for you all?"
msgstr "有四位跟我們並肩作戰，是我們的榮幸。可這對各位來說……會不會太危險了？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "What kind of father would I be if I let my daughter fight my battles for me?"
msgstr "要我躲在後面，讓女兒替我上陣？那我還算什麼父親？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The king has also expressed interest in making sure nothing... untoward occ-"
msgstr "國王還說，他得親自看著，免得有些事……不太合乎分……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ahem. We've prepared several wagons. I hear that your little breeding program with the Rockwolves has gone well?"
msgstr "咳。我們已經備好了幾輛大車。聽說，你們養石狼的事進展不錯？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We feel they'd be far better for handling any outdoor excursions than our current beasts of burden. Brunite was more than happy to help create some wolves that could help."
msgstr "要在野外拉車，它們應該比我們現在用的馱獸更合適。布魯尼特一聽說能幫上忙，高高興興地就去培育適合拉車的石狼了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It sounds like we're just about ready then, yes?"
msgstr "這麼說，咱們也算萬事俱備了吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We'll head out to prepare."
msgstr "那我們這就去準備出發。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As you leave the palace, the most of training guards have already mobilized, with the remainer saluting the two of you as you pass by. You meet Brunite at the caverns set aside for the Rockwolf breeding program, and even he dawns an axe and simple armor. He brings the two of you your wolves, then takes a seat upon Milkbone and takes off down a long line of pens, cutting open the fences as he runs along, a growing pack of Stonewolves following behind him as he charges through the caverns and out of the caverns.\n\nIt's a little startling to see just how many wolves can be made in the right conditions, and hope that Brunite hasn't made too much of a fuss in the capitol. Despite the sight, many citizens cheer after you as you race through the city and out into the fresh air above. The pack slows as you step outside to see a large procession of Naladasi with armed wagons, some topped with braziers you imagine are to ward off the mists of the thicket.\n\nThere are numerous shouts as you arrive, but not because of you, it's because of the similarly sized horde growing in the distance. A large, orderly rank of Flamberians march towards the Naladasi, carrying large waving banners that make the whole army appear as if they're on fire. You spot Prince Cintak flag down king Oyadazminis, and the two of them march out to meet the army. An hour passes before the army continues its advance, banners now down. Hopefully that's a good thing?\n\nThe Prince announces that due to the silence that followed after the Linking, the Flamberians had reason to suspect the Naladasi had attacked the procession and kidnapped him, but he's informed his mother - the queen - of the full situation, and the army that was sent to attack the Naladasi are instead joining them to attack Soulsmiths. Apperently.\n\nThe journey back out to the Misty Thicket starts tense, but as more and more stories are traded between the rank and file, the dwarves stoke one another's passion towards their shared enemy, and find themselves growing closer in the process.\n\nThe wagons are pulled around to create a wall of sorts a few hours out from the Misty Keep, and you and [Companion Name] keep yourselves busy by helping to prepare the massive bolts that'll be loaded into the ballista-carrying wagons."
msgstr "你們離開王宮時，方才還在操練的守護大多已經動身。餘下的人見你們經過，紛紛抬手致意。你們去飼養石狼的洞窟找布魯尼特。連他也披上了簡易的護甲，帶上了一把斧頭。他把你們的坐騎牽來，自己翻身騎上奶骨，沿著一長排獸欄疾馳而過，邊跑邊劈開柵欄。石狼一頭接一頭地跟上他，狼群越聚越大，跟著他一路穿過洞穴，衝向洞外。\n\n你知道條件合適，石狼就長得快，卻沒想到布魯尼特已經養出了這麼一大群。只盼他帶著狼群穿過都城時，別鬧出太大的動靜。不過，看見這麼一群石狼奔過街頭，倒有不少市民沿途為你們歡呼。你們一路衝出城，迎面吹來了地上清新的風。狼群出了洞口，漸漸放慢腳步。前方是納裡達西人的大隊人馬，隨行的戰車都裝著武器，有些車頂上還架著火盆，想來是為了驅散林中的濃霧。\n\n你們剛到，隊伍裡便響起一陣呼喊。眾人看的卻不是你們。遠處正有另一支人馬逼近，看那陣勢，人數恐怕和這邊不相上下。那是一支弗拉姆貝里大軍。他們列著整齊的隊伍，朝納裡達西人開來。大旗迎風招展，遠遠望去，整支軍隊像是一片移動的火海。你看見辛塔克王子朝奧亞達茲米尼斯國王招了招手，兩人一同上前，迎向那支大軍。一個小時後，弗拉姆貝里大軍才重新開拔。方才還高高飄揚的旗幟，這會兒都降下來了。這算是好兆頭吧？\n\n辛塔克王子告訴大家，接軌慶典過後一直沒有訊息傳回去，弗拉姆貝里人有理由懷疑，是納裡達西人襲擊了赴會的隊伍，又擄走了王子。他剛剛已將來龍去脈告訴母親，也就是弗拉姆貝里女王。原本奉命前來攻打納裡達西的大軍，如今要和他們並肩作戰，一同討伐煉魂師。至少，按王子的說法是這樣。\n\n重返迷霧灌木林的路上，兩軍起初還互相提防著。可走著走著，士兵們聊起各自的遭遇，你一言我一語，對煉魂師的怒火越燒越旺，有了共同的敵人，兩支隊伍不知不覺熟絡了不少。\n\n離迷霧要塞還有幾個小時路程時，大軍停下來，將車輛圍成一道屏障。你和[Companion Name]也跟著忙活起來，幫弩手備好戰車上的重弩要用的大箭。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just have to reel them in before the shadows do."
msgstr "得搶在那些黑影前頭，把人拉上來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We did what we could."
msgstr "我們盡力了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You're pleased to take a bit of time to yourself, even if it is to do more work. The journey over had been long and tiring, constantly riding between the ranks and guiding troops. The Flamberian queen has repeatedly called for your attention, but with as many moving parts as this war procession has had, you simply haven't had the time. Thankfully, Prince Cintak has reassured you that his mother is aware of the stakes and your part in keeping everything moving, and is more than happy to wait. You lay down after having earned your rest, and try to calm your nerves before finally falling to sleep.\n\nAfter nowhere near enough time, you open your eyes to the daylight, you realize... there shouldn't be daylight. You were in a covered wagon. You look around and notice that four Flamberians have lifted your cot and carried you out in front of the queen. [Companion Name] is in a similarly dazzed, groggy state as yourself, both of you seemingly having been tired and secure enough to sleep through the... basically kidnapping. Prince Cintak stands beside his mother, mortified, and shoots you an apologetic look."
msgstr "雖說手上還有活兒，你倒很高興，終於能有片刻清靜。這一路實在夠累的。你騎著石狼在隊伍之間來回奔走，不斷給部隊指路。弗拉姆貝里女王已經幾次派人來找你，可這麼大一支隊伍要協調，你實在抽不開身。好在辛塔克王子讓你放心。母親明白這一仗關係重大，也知道你一路忙著給大軍帶路。等你得空了再見面，她不介意。忙完這一切，你總算能躺下了。你努力讓緊繃的神經放鬆下來，好一會兒才睡著。\n\n感覺才睡了沒多久，你一睜眼，便看見了天光。等等……這裡怎麼會有天光？你明明睡在一輛帶篷的大車裡。你四下一看，這才目擊，四個弗拉姆貝里人把你連人帶床抬了出來，一路抬到了女王面前。[Companion Name]也是一臉茫然，睡眼惺忪。看來你們倆都累壞了，又睡得實在安心，竟然連這麼一場……幾乎算得上綁架的事都沒察覺。辛塔克王子站在母親身旁，窘得不知如何是好，只能遞給你一個歉意的眼神。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It is a pleasure to finally see the faces of my son's saviors. "
msgstr "總算見到救我兒子的兩位恩人了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I apologize for disrupting your sleep, but I wished to make myself known to you before we are to head into battle alongside one another."
msgstr "擾了二位清夢，還請見諒。只是馬上就要並肩上陣，我想在那之前，先跟二位打聲招呼。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I- I- Good morning, your excellency, queen..."
msgstr "我……呃，早安，女王陛下……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Rest, child. I've done away with my name long ago, like all those who ascend to my rank. You may refer to me as the Flame. "
msgstr "別拘束，孩子。和歷代登上王位的人一樣，我早已捨棄了從前的名字。你們可以稱我為「火焰」。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I tried to get her to hold off a while longer, but she was insistant."
msgstr "我勸過母親，讓你們再睡一會兒，可她執意要見你們。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Pleased to meet you, your grace, but... may I ask why you've brought us here?"
msgstr "很榮幸見到您，陛下。不過……您特意把我們帶到這裡，是有什麼事嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "From what I've heard, the two of you are the reason my son still breathes. "
msgstr "我聽說，我兒子如今還活著，全是多虧了你們兩個。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My nation is in your debt, as am I. Were it not for your efforts, my people would have surely clashed against the Naladasi, and we'd be all the worse for it."
msgstr "我和我的國家，都欠二位一份恩情。要不是你們，我的族人早就和納裡達西人打起來了，那樣只會兩敗俱傷。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "We were just doing what is right. The Soulsmiths... they've torn apart so many homes, our own included."
msgstr "我們只是做了該做的事。煉魂師……他們毀了太多人的家，我們自己的家也在其中。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I'm just glad we were able to get to him in time."
msgstr "能及時趕到，把王子救下來，我已經很慶幸了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "As am I."
msgstr "我也是。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "I just wanted to bring it to your attention that I'm endlessly thankful for your assistance, and for your efforts, I wish to reward you once we return to our homeland. I'd like to-"
msgstr "把二位請來，就是想讓你們知道，我有多感激你們的幫助。等回了弗拉姆貝里，我要好好答謝二位。我打算……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "She wants to show off that she can give you more than the Naladasi and keep you around as my personal bodyguards."
msgstr "母親是想讓你們看看，她出手比納裡達西人闊綽，好把你們留在我身邊，當我的貼身護衛。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Well, we're flattered, but..."
msgstr "這……我們很榮幸，不過……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "My darling little lava rock is right! You're heroes and should be treated as such! AND I find it outrageous that that cheapskate king has you sleeping in a cart!"
msgstr "我的小熔岩寶貝說得沒錯！你們是英雄，就該有英雄的待遇！那個摳門的國王竟讓你們睡大車？簡直不像話！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Are you sure the two of you want to be on the front lines?"
msgstr "二位當真要上前線嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Perhaps the three of you, or four since my precious son seems to have a thing for that cute little Naladasi princess, can wait back here while we level the castle of those rotten Soulsmiths for ever daring to-"
msgstr "不如你們三個留在後面等著？哦，該是四個，我的寶貝兒子好像看上了那個可愛的納裡達西小公主。你們就在這兒等著，看我們把那幫混賬煉魂師的城堡夷為平地。竟敢對我兒子……"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Oh Flames, mother!"
msgstr "火焰在上，母親！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Shush dear, you can't fault a mother for trying to keep her baby safe."
msgstr "好啦，親愛的。當媽的想護著自己的孩子，總沒錯吧？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Since you're all so determined to join us on the battlefield, see to it that he's safe, will you?"
msgstr "既然你們一個個都鐵了心要上戰場，就替我保護好他，好嗎？"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Of course, we'll do our best to make sure as many people make it back alive as we can."
msgstr "當然。我們會盡全力，讓儘可能多的人活著回來。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Please do... I can't lose my son a second time."
msgstr "拜託了……我不能再失去他了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "The queen seems to be at least partially assuaged by this and nods her head. The Flamberians that carried you out now pick your cots up and carry you back to the wagon, and you try to digest what just happened.\n\nAfter a couple more hours, the camp begins to shuffle once more. The dwarves break down camp and begin to move out once more. You and [Companion Name] mount your Rockwolves and lead the way, guiding the group across the more percarious bits of terrain and waiting for them to create paths to get wagons across large stretches of water when required. The castle looms in the distance, almost seemingly a source of the Misty Thicket's fog itself. The walls covered in corpses only shake the resolve of the dwarves for a moment, though you hear several utterances of how sick the people inside must be.\n\nSoulsmiths line the walls, along with summoned beasts that remind you of bats, with mouths that are far too large.\n\nWagons are pulled up to form an armored wall, and then, everyone bursts into motion. Several large balls of energy soar over the walls of Misty Keep, but are burned away by Flamberian mages, or sent far off course by Naladasi mages interferring with their course. Four of the wagons' walls fall away to reveal giant ballista, which are loaded with bolts created just last night. You and [Companion Name] move through the ranks and direct their fire, and the balista shots land true. When they sink into the wall, glowing runestones across their surface glow bright, then explode, ripping large sections of the ancient castle apart. You hear and see King Oyadazminis let out a battlecry as he hefts a large javilen towards the ramparts and snaps his fingers just before contact, causing the bolt to explode in a dazzling ball of light that blows twenty Soulsmiths apart. The Archivist twists his staff in the air and halts another ball of green energy above the army before sending it back over the wall towards whatever sent it in the first place, causing the entire castle to shake with the impact.\n\nSoulsmiths fire all manner of bolt, arrow, and magic towards the dwarves, and they return fire, but the evergrowing swarm of bat-like creatures harass the them. You watch as several dwarves are picked up by the beasts and are dropped into the moat around the castle, where large, dark shadows quickly pull the soliders under the water. Bats are burned away, and more balista shots are loosed at the walls, but with the force you're now taking, one of the balls of green energy makes it through your defenses and crashes into one of the wagons, leaving it a smoldering pile of scrap. The bats grow further in number, and your find a startling number of dwarves being carried away, while the Flamberian Queen seems to be frozen in shock. You grab a length of rope with a hook on the end, meant to scale the walls, and instead use it to fish out a dwarf from the water. Many others around you follow suit, while the back ranks cover you."
msgstr "女王聽了這話，似乎總算安心了些，輕輕點了點頭。剛才抬你們來的幾個弗拉姆貝里人又抬起行軍床，把你們原樣送回車裡。你躺在床上，還有些回不過神來。\n\n又過了幾個小時，營地裡重新有了動靜。矮人們拔營，再次出發。你和[Companion Name]騎上石狼，在前頭帶路，領著隊伍穿過幾處難走的地段。碰上大片積水，你們便停下來，等後面的人搭好路，讓車輛透過。遠處，城堡的輪廓隱約浮現。迷霧灌木林裡的濃霧彷彿都是從那座城堡裡湧出來的。望見掛滿屍體的城牆，矮人們也只遲疑了片刻。你聽見好幾個人低聲咒罵，幹得出這種事，城裡那幫傢伙得有多喪心病狂。\n\n煉魂師沿著城頭一字排開。它們身旁的召喚獸形似蝙蝠，一張張嘴卻大得出奇。\n\n戰車向前靠攏，連成一道鐵壁。下一刻，所有人都動了起來。幾個巨大的魔法光球從迷霧要塞的城頭飛來。弗拉姆貝里法師用火將它們燒盡，納裡達西法師則施法改變它們的方向，讓它們遠遠偏離了目標。四輛大車的側板落下，露出裡面的巨弩。昨晚剛做好的弩箭，此刻已架在弩上。你和[Companion Name]穿行在隊伍間，指揮弩手瞄準。射出的弩箭支支命中城牆。箭身深深射入牆體，嵌在上面的符文石驟然亮起，隨即炸開。古堡的城牆一下就被炸塌了好幾段。一聲戰吼傳來。你轉頭看去，只見奧亞達茲米尼斯國王舉起一支大標槍，朝城垛擲去。標槍即將擊中城頭時，他打了個響指。一團耀眼的強光炸開，當場將二十名煉魂師炸得粉碎。檔案管理員凌空一轉法杖，將又一顆綠色光球定在大軍頭頂，隨即原路送了回去。光球越過城牆，正中發出攻擊的地方，震得整座城堡都在搖晃。\n\n煉魂師朝矮人射來弩箭、羽箭和各式法術。矮人立即還擊，可那群蝙蝠般的怪物越聚越多，不斷俯衝下來，攪得他們難以招架。你眼看著幾名矮人被牛羚抓到半空，丟進城堡周圍的護城河。幾個碩大的黑影迅速游來，把落水計程車兵拖進了水底。一群蝙蝠被烈火燒盡，又一輪重弩射向城牆。可敵人的攻勢越發猛烈，一顆綠色光球穿過防線，正中一輛戰車。轉眼間，那輛車就只剩一堆冒煙的殘骸。蝙蝠還在增加，被抓走的矮人越來越多，多得叫你心驚。弗拉姆貝里女王卻站在原地一動不動，像是被眼前的慘狀驚呆了。你抓起一條原本用來攀上城牆的鉤索，甩進河裡，把一名矮人拉了上來。周圍許多人見狀，也紛紛效仿。後排計程車兵則掩護你們救人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Today, the beast dies."
msgstr "今天，那牛羚非死不可。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.CompletedDescription
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's over."
msgstr "結束了。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "You do what you can, hauling as many dwarves out of the water as you have time for. Tons of hooks fly into the water once the others catch wind of your idea. You haul up more dwarves than you can count, but as you reel in another, your rope goes taught and is ripped from your hands, then goes slack. Whatever is in the water is very, very, big.\n\nThe Flame is ripped from her trance-like state. It wasn't shock, the woman was preparing. The thicket behind the dwarves cracks and screams as a wave of golden fire washes overhead like a wave crashing on the beach. The sky is blotted out by golden flame that sweeps through the air and rips through the majority of the Soulsmiths' bats and crashes against the wall, lighting the corpses ablaze. Where they were still before, the living wall now screams at your forces, with many of them tearing away bits of their body and turning it into balls of black magic which they then pelt you with.\n\nEach one explodes in black flashes with concussive force, sending those they hit to the ground. Another wagon is destroyed as a volley of green magic comes over the wall once more. Soulsmiths atop the wall fire at the undefended dwarves, but both races return with their own bolts in turn. Princess Redilok stands atop one of the balista wagons and charges the bolt that is fired from it. It connects with the south-western tower, and explodes with startling force. The tower groans and collapses due to the damage, Soulsmiths try in vain to jump from its collapsing weight, but land in the water amongst whatever monster they have patrolling the depths."
msgstr "你抓緊時間往上拉人，能救一個是一個。眾人見你用鉤索救人，也紛紛效仿，轉眼間，無數鐵鉤從岸上飛進了河裡。你已經記不清拉上來多少人了。正要再拉一個，手裡的繩索突然繃緊，一股巨力猛地將它從你手中扯走，緊接著，繩子又鬆了下來。水底下那東西，大得嚇人。\n\n火焰終於動了。她不是嚇呆了。她一直在蓄勢。矮人身後的密林發出一陣刺耳的爆裂聲。黃金烈焰掠過眾人頭頂，如同巨浪轟然拍岸。金焰遮天蔽日，橫掃半空，將煉魂師召出的蝙蝠燒去了大半，隨後猛撞上城牆，點燃了釘在牆上的屍體。剛才還一動不動的屍體，此刻齊齊朝你們尖叫。許多屍體從自己身上撕下血肉，揉成漆黑的魔法光球，劈頭蓋臉地砸來。\n\n每顆光球都在一閃而過的黑光中炸開，被擊中的人當場便被震倒在地。又一輪綠色魔法越過城牆，再次摧毀了一輛戰車。城頭的煉魂師瞄準失去掩護的矮人開火，兩族矮人各自舉弩還擊。雷迪洛克公主站上一輛弩車，將魔力注入弩箭。巨弩應聲而發。那支箭正中西南角的塔樓，轟然炸開，威力驚人。塔樓發出不堪重負的呻吟，隨即轟然倒塌。煉魂師們縱身跳開，想躲過墜落的巨石，卻落入護城河裡，掉進了那些在深水中來回遊弋的怪物之間。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "It's time! Their forces are scattered!"
msgstr "就是現在！他們的陣形散了！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Ready the rope bolts!"
msgstr "準備繩索弩箭！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "For those who died at the Linking!"
msgstr "為接軌慶典上的死難者報仇！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "For all the lives the Soulsmiths have claimed!"
msgstr "為所有慘遭煉魂師毒手的人報仇！"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.Steps.Dialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Only two of the four balista carts still stand, but it's enough. Ropes are already tied to the large bolts which are launched and burried into the top of the drawbridge. Brunite sees to the Rockwolves and orders them to charge away from the keep, pulling the ropes taught. Another pair of bolts are launched. Then another. Then another. You lose another of the carts to a group of Soulsmiths that has flown over the wall atop giant versions of the bats that swarmed you before the golden flames burned the from the sky, but they're eventually cut down.\n\nFinally, the drawbridge gives and comes crashing down. The path into the Misty Keep is open.  Wolves are unteathered and then sent back towards the keep, their stony bodies deflecting some of the smaller projectiles as they crash into the ranks of Soulsmiths on the other side of the gate. Flamberian and Naladasi charge side-by-side across the bridge, some stopping to pull up comrades from the water. As dwarf and Soulsmith fall, an all too familiar sight that brings back memories of the Linking washes over you. A pulse of green light, then the dead begin to move once more. The Shambling Beast is here.\n\nYou charge amongst the dwarves with [Companion Name] at your side, and you find yourself face-to-face with a Soulsmith. A butcher. A monster. She raises her staff towards you, but is carved down by Prince Cintak, who leads the charge. The man yells to those around him to clear a path.\n\nThe Shambling Beast crawls towards you, endless rows of arms churning the earth beneath it. You lift your Soulmetal-lined Blade and charge through the crowd."
msgstr "四輛弩車如今只剩兩輛，不過，兩輛也夠了。繩索早已係在巨型弩箭上。弩箭接重新上弦出，深深扎進吊橋頂端。布魯尼特指揮石狼掉頭，向遠離要塞的方向猛衝，繩索頓時繃得筆直。又有兩支弩箭飛向吊橋。弩弦再響，兩箭齊發。緊跟著，又是一輪。一群煉魂師騎著巨蝠越過城頭。那些巨蝠與先前被金焰燒死的怪物一模一樣，個頭卻大得多。你們最終將這一隊煉魂師斬落，卻也又損失了一輛弩車。\n\n終於，吊橋再也撐不住，轟然砸落。通往迷霧要塞的路開啟了。石狼身上的繩索一解開，便被驅向要塞。小些的箭矢打在它們的石甲上，紛紛彈開。它們一頭撞進了城門另一側的煉魂師陣中。弗拉姆貝里矮人和納裡達西矮人並肩衝過吊橋，不時有人停下，伸手把落水的戰友拉上來。矮人和煉魂師相繼倒下。眼前忽然出現了再熟悉不過的一幕，你一下子想起了接軌慶典。一道綠光掃過，死者又動了起來。跛行獸就在這裡。\n\n你隨矮人們一同衝鋒，[Companion Name]緊跟在側。混戰中，一名煉魂師迎面擋住了你。一個劊子手。一個怪物。她舉起法杖對準你，卻被一馬當先率軍衝鋒的辛塔克王子揮刃斬倒。王子向四周高喊，讓眾人為你清出一條路。\n\n跛行獸向你爬來。它身下那一排排望不到頭的手臂翻攪著泥土，一寸寸逼近。你高舉鑲著魂鋼刃的長刀，衝過人群。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Quest.CompletionDialogue.DialogueText
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "With each stroke of your blade, its Soulsteel edge seems to quiver with delight. You find the blade actively pulling towards its source and relishing in the pain it inflicts upon the Shambling Beast. You carve through the beast, the blade pulls you further, and you climb atop the spongey flesh of the creature. \n\nHundreds of arms grasp at you as it tries in vain to pull you off, but [Companion Name] batters them away, ripping a spike of Soulsteel from the monster and weilding it like a mallet, repeatedly crashing down upon the beast. Your sword continues to delight in cleaving through flesh, but you wrest control of it long enough to drive the sword into cage fused with the back of the Shambling Beast.\n\nWith that, another pulse of green light is unleashed and you're thrown from the creature, leaving your sword wedged in the metal of the cage. As you sail through the air, you see the undead begin to drop, but the Soulsmiths fight on. However, without support from the undead, they're far outnumbered by the dwarves. \n\nThe Shambling Beast is dead. You've won.\n\nYou feel nothing but relief as you crash into the ground, and everything goes dark."
msgstr "每一刀劈下去，魂鋼刀刃都在顫動，彷彿在歡喜。刀竟主動往跛行獸身上拽。它原本就是從那頭牛羚身上取下來的，如今每讓牛羚多受一分痛苦，它就越發歡欣。你一刀劈開牛羚的皮肉，刀還在牽著你往前。你順勢攀上了它綿軟如海綿的身軀。\n\n上百條手臂伸來抓你，想把你拖下去。[Companion Name]揮開那些手臂，又從怪物身上硬生生拔出一根魂鋼尖刺，當作木槌，一下接一下地往牛羚身上砸。你的刀還貪戀著劈開血肉的滋味。你跟它較著勁，總算暫時奪回了控制，將刀狠狠刺進跟跛行獸脊背長在一起的金屬籠中。\n\n又一道綠光猛然迸發，將你從牛羚背上震飛。你的刀還牢牢嵌在金屬籠上。你還沒落地，就看見那些死而復起的亡者紛紛倒下。煉魂師卻還在戰鬥。可沒了亡者助陣，煉魂師的人數就遠不及矮人了。\n\n跛行獸死了。你們贏了。\n\n你重重地摔在地上，心裡只覺得如釋重負。隨即，你眼前一黑，什麼也不知道了。"

