#: MainMenu/steam_next_fest_popup.tscn
msgid "[color=#E9DFC1]Thank you for trying our Demo!\n\nMelvor Idle 2 is still in active development, and the version you're about to play is an [color=FFD16D]early limited look at the game[/color]. Many systems, features, visuals, and balance are still being developed and refined as we work towards an Early Access release.\n\nFor this demo, progression is limited to [color=FFD16D]Level 60[/color], with only a limited selection of Skills and content available to test out. The Early Access release will have far more content available!\n\nAs this is an early build, you may encounter unfinished content, balance that isn't quite right, missing features, or bugs.\n\nYour feedback during this Demo period is incredibly valuable to us. We'd love to hear about your experience, any bugs you may have encountered, or general discussions around the game.\n\nMost importantly, have fun, explore, experiment, and enjoy your first steps into Melvor Idle 2!\n\nAnd remember - [color=FFD16D]Melvor Idle 2 is an idle game![/color] You can set your character on a task, let them make progress in the background, and check out some of the other great games that have a Demo for you to try. Melvor will be here when you get back!\n\nThank you for being part of the journey![/color]\n\n- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs, Coolrox, Prat, Tapi & Ash[/color][/i]"
msgstr "[color=#E9DFC1]感謝你體驗我們的試玩版！《梅爾沃放置2》仍在開發中，你即將體驗的版本僅展示了[color=FFD16D]遊戲早期的一部分內容[/color]。為了迎接搶先體驗版的推出，我們還在持續開發和完善各項系統、功能、畫面及平衡性。\n\n本試玩版的等級上限為[color=FFD16D]60級[/color]，僅開放部分技能和內容供你體驗。搶先體驗版將帶來豐富得多的內容！\n\n由於這還是早期版本，你可能會遇到尚未完成的內容、不夠合理的平衡性、缺失的功能或程式錯誤。\n\n試玩期間，你的反饋對我們非常寶貴。歡迎分享遊玩感受、反饋遇到的錯誤，也歡迎聊聊你對遊戲的看法。\n\n最重要的是玩得開心！盡情探索，大膽嘗試，好好享受你在《梅爾沃放置2》中邁出的第一步吧！\n\n別忘了，[color=FFD16D]《梅爾沃放置2》是一款放置遊戲！[/color]你可以給角色安排一項任務項目，讓角色在後臺繼續忙碌，自己去體驗其他精彩遊戲的試玩版。等你回來，梅爾沃還在這裡等著你！\n\n感謝你一路相伴！[/color]\n\n- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs、Coolrox、Prat、Tapi 和Ash[/color][/i]"

