msgid "Skill Difficulty: "
msgstr "技能難度："

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Specialised Equipment"
msgstr "製作特殊裝備"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use materials obtained from Hunting and Combat to create various types of specialised equipment."
msgstr "使用從狩獵與戰鬥取得的材料，製作各種特殊裝備。"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Slayer Equipment"
msgstr "獵殺裝備"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft powerful Slayer weapons and armour to improve your effectiveness during Slayer training for all Melee, Ranged and Magic"
msgstr "製作強大的獵殺武器與護甲，提升你在近戰、遠程與魔法獵殺訓練中的效率"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Consumables & Accessories"
msgstr "消耗品與飾品"

#: Tutorials/beastcrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Consumables and Accessories that provide useful bonuses to various skills."
msgstr "製作能為各項技能提供實用加成的消耗品與飾品。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Difficulty: "
msgstr "難度："

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "to"
msgstr "至"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "General Info"
msgstr "一般資訊"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Fight Enemies"
msgstr "擊敗敵人"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Battle enemies to gain [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] and collect valuable rewards as loot. [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] is granted based on the [color=#FFD16D]weapon damage[/color] you deal."
msgstr "與敵人戰鬥以獲得[color=#FFD16D]戰鬥技能經驗[/color]，並收集珍貴的戰利品。[color=#FFD16D]戰鬥技能經驗[/color]依你造成的[color=#FFD16D]武器傷害[/color]給予。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Choose a Combat Area"
msgstr "選擇戰鬥區域"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Select from [color=#FFD16D]Combat Areas, Slayer Zones[/color] or [color=#FFD16D]Dungeons[/color] to find different enemies to battle."
msgstr "從[color=#FFD16D]戰鬥區域、獵殺區域[/color]或[color=#FFD16D]地城[/color]中選擇，以找到不同的敵人戰鬥。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Automatic Healing via Auto Eat"
msgstr "透過自動進食自動治療"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Equip [u]Food[/u][/color] to automatically restore Health when it falls below a set threshold, helping you survive longer battles.\n\nMore information is contained by hovering over the [color=#FFD16D]Auto Eat icon on your Health Bar[/color]."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]裝備[u]食物[/u][/color]後，生命值低於設定門檻時會自動回復，幫助你撐過更長的戰鬥。\n\n將滑鼠移到[color=#FFD16D]生命條上的自動進食圖示[/color]可查看更多資訊。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Combat Styles"
msgstr "戰鬥風格"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "There are three Combat Styles: [color=#FFD16D]Melee, Ranged[/color] and [color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]. Your equipped [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] determines which style you use.\n\n[color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color]\n\nBeating a Combat Style [color=green]increases your Max Hit by 10%[/color], while losing [color=orange_red]decreases it by 10%[/color]. This is only applied to you, and never the Enemy."
msgstr "戰鬥風格共有三種：[color=#FFD16D]近戰、遠程[/color]與[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]。你裝備的[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]決定你使用的風格。\n\n[color=#FFD16D]近戰[/color]剋[color=#FFD16D]遠程[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]遠程[/color]剋[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]剋[color=#FFD16D]近戰[/color]\n\n克制對方的戰鬥風格會[color=green]使最大傷害提高 10%[/color]，被克制則[color=orange_red]降低 10%[/color]。此效果僅套用於你，不會套用於敵人。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Ranged required Ammunition"
msgstr "遠程需要彈藥"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Using the [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Combat Style[/color] requires a [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Weapon[/color] plus its [color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color]. For example, using a [u]Bow[/u] requires [u]Arrows[/u] as ammunition primarily obtained from Fletching.\n\nSome [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Weapons[/color] like [u]Javelins[/u] can be their own [color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color]."
msgstr "使用[color=#FFD16D]遠程戰鬥風格[/color]需要[color=#FFD16D]遠程武器[/color]及其[color=#FFD16D]彈藥[/color]。例如使用[u]弓[/u]需要[u]箭矢[/u]作為彈藥，主要透過製箭取得。\n\n部分[color=#FFD16D]遠程武器[/color]，例如[u]標槍[/u]，本身即可作為[color=#FFD16D]彈藥[/color]。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Magic requires Runes"
msgstr "魔法需要符文"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "The [color=#FFD16D]Magic Combat Style[/color] requires a [color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapon[/color] in combination with the the use of [color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color]. These cost [u]Runes[/u] primarily obtained from Runecrafting."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]魔法戰鬥風格[/color]需要[color=#FFD16D]魔法武器[/color]搭配[color=aqua]魔法法術[/color]使用。法術會消耗[u]符文[/u]，主要透過符文製作取得。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Stances"
msgstr "架式"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Combat Stances"
msgstr "戰鬥架式"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Each weapon has different [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] to choose from. Your selected [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color] determines which Combat Skills gain XP."
msgstr "每種武器都有不同的[color=#FFD16D]架式[/color]可選。你選擇的[color=#FFD16D]架式[/color]決定哪些戰鬥技能獲得經驗。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Weapon choice matters"
msgstr "武器選擇很重要"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "The [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] you use determines the [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] available to choose from. Not all [color=#FFD16D]weapons[/color] have access to all [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color]."
msgstr "你使用的[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]決定可選擇的[color=#FFD16D]架式[/color]。並非所有[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]都能使用所有[color=#FFD16D]架式[/color]。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
#: Entities/Combat/offensive_stats_container.tscn
msgid "Chance to Hit"
msgstr "命中機率"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Take a look at the [color=#FFD16D]Equipment Stats[/color] tab to see how this is calculated in relation to your [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color]."
msgstr "查看[color=#FFD16D]裝備屬性[/color]分頁，了解這與你的[color=#FFD16D]架式[/color]之間的計算方式。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn Entities/Combat/view_player_stats_panel.tscn
msgid "Equipment Stats"
msgstr "裝備屬性"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Accuracy & Evasion"
msgstr "命中與閃避"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Your [color=#FFD16D]chance to hit[/color] depends on your [color=#FFD16D]Stance's Accuracy[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Evasion[/color] against that same [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color].\n\nWhen fighting an Enemy, aim to have a higher [color=#FFD16D]Accuracy Rating[/color] than their [color=#FFD16D]Evasion Rating[/color]."
msgstr "你的[color=#FFD16D]命中機率[/color]取決於你的[color=#FFD16D]架式命中[/color]與[color=#FFD16D]敵人的閃避[/color]（針對同一[color=#FFD16D]架式[/color]）之比較。\n\n與敵人戰鬥時，應讓你的[color=#FFD16D]命中值[/color]高於其[color=#FFD16D]閃避值[/color]。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Power & Protection"
msgstr "威力與防護"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Damage from attacks is reduced by a percentage depending on [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] and [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n\nYour [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Protection[/color] determines how much of your damage is reduced. Higher [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] helps overcome enemy [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n\n[color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] is primarily obtained from [color=#FFD16D]weapons[/color].\n[color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color] is primarily obtained from other gear.\n\nYou can reduce an Enemy's damage dealt to you by increasing your [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color]."
msgstr "攻擊造成的傷害會依[color=#FFD16D]威力[/color]與[color=#FFD16D]防護[/color]按百分比減少。\n\n你的[color=#FFD16D]威力[/color]與[color=#FFD16D]敵人的防護[/color]相比，決定你的傷害會被減少多少。較高的[color=#FFD16D]威力[/color]有助於突破敵人的[color=#FFD16D]防護[/color]。\n\n[color=#FFD16D]威力[/color]主要來自[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]。\n[color=#FFD16D]防護[/color]主要來自其他裝備。\n\n提高你的[color=#FFD16D]防護[/color]可減少敵人對你造成的傷害。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Magic Elements"
msgstr "魔法元素"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapons[/color] have [color=#FFD16D]Elements[/color] attached to them which determine what type of [color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color] you can use in Combat.\n\nMonsters may also have an [color=#FFD16D]Element[/color], which can either buff or debuff your character.\n\nBeating an Element grants you with [color=green]+15% Max Hit[/color].\nLosing to an Element debuffs you with [color=orange_red]-15% Max Hit[/color].\n\nThis is only applied to you, and never to the Enemy."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]魔法武器[/color]附帶[color=#FFD16D]元素[/color]，決定你在戰鬥中可使用哪種[color=aqua]魔法法術[/color]。\n\n怪物也可能帶有[color=#FFD16D]元素[/color]，可能對你的角色產生增益或減益。\n\n克制元素時獲得[color=green]+15% 最大傷害[/color]。\n被元素克制時受到[color=orange_red]-15% 最大傷害[/color]的減益。\n\n此效果僅套用於你，不會套用於敵人。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Air:\n[ul]Beats Earth\nLoses to Fire[/ul]"
msgstr "風：\n[ul]剋土\n被火剋[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Earth:\n[ul]Beats Water\nLoses to Air[/ul]"
msgstr "土：\n[ul]剋水\n被風剋[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Water:\n[ul]Beats Fire\nLoses to Earth[/ul]"
msgstr "水：\n[ul]剋火\n被土剋[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Fire:\n[ul]Beats Air\nLoses to Water[/ul]"
msgstr "火：\n[ul]剋風\n被水剋[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Neutral has no effect."
msgstr "中立沒有效果。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Using Prayers"
msgstr "使用祈禱"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/color] are toggleable passive effects that can buff your Character. These cost [color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] to remain active."
msgstr "[color=#FFD16D]祈禱[/color]是可切換的被動效果，能強化你的角色。維持啟用需消耗[color=#FFD16D]祈禱點數[/color]。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Obtaining Prayer Points"
msgstr "獲得祈禱點數"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] are obtained by burying [u]Bones[/u] dropped from slain Enemies (via your Bank), or through other methods such as Firemaking."
msgstr "在銀行中埋葬擊殺敵人後掉落的[u]骨頭[/u]，即可獲得[color=#FFD16D]祈禱點數[/color]。生火等其他途徑也能給予祈禱點數。"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Prayer XP"
msgstr "祈禱經驗"

#: Tutorials/combat_tutorial.tscn
msgid "[color=#FFD16D]Prayer XP[/color] is gained while actively using [color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/color]. Your damage dealt and cost of the Prayer determines the XP gained, with higher cost Prayers providing more XP per damage."
msgstr "啟用[color=#FFD16D]祈禱[/color]時可獲得[color=#FFD16D]祈禱經驗[/color]。獲得的經驗取決於你造成的傷害與祈禱的消耗，消耗越高的祈禱每點傷害提供的經驗越多。"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Cook Food"
msgstr "烹飪食物"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Cook various types of Food to restore Health when consumed. Some Food also provides special bonuses when used."
msgstr "烹飪各種食物，食用後可回復生命值。部分食物使用時還會提供特殊加成。"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Cooking Success Chance"
msgstr "烹飪成功率"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Your chance to successfully cook Food depends on your Cooking Proficiency compared to the Food's Difficulty.\n\nCooking Proficiency can be increased by leveling Cooking, equipping Items, or via the Shop or other Skills."
msgstr "成功烹飪食物的機率取決於你的烹飪熟練度與食物難度的比較。\n\n可透過提升烹飪等級、裝備物品，或經由商店及其他技能提高烹飪熟練度。"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Bait"
msgstr "製作魚餌"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use Cooking to create Bait that helps with Fishing and Hunting."
msgstr "使用烹飪製作有助於釣魚與狩獵的魚餌。"

#: Tutorials/cooking_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Skill Synergies"
msgstr "技能協同"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Ranged Armour"
msgstr "製作遠程護甲"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Leather-based armour for use in Ranged Combat."
msgstr "製作用於遠程戰鬥的皮革護甲。"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Materials"
msgstr "製作材料"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft materials and components used in other skills."
msgstr "製作用於其他技能的材料與零件。"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Hunting Traps"
msgstr "製作狩獵陷阱"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Traps used to catch creatures in Hunting."
msgstr "製作用於狩獵中捕捉生物的陷阱。"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Jewellery"
msgstr "製作飾品"

#: Tutorials/crafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Jewellery that provides various bonuses when equipped."
msgstr "製作裝備後可提供各種加成的飾品。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "This is a Passive Skill which progresses while you play the game."
msgstr "這是一項被動技能，會在你遊玩時持續推進。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Grow Crops"
msgstr "種植作物"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Purchase Farming Plots and plant Seeds to grow various types of Crops."
msgstr "購買農耕田地並種下種子，以種植各種作物。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Crop Care"
msgstr "作物照護"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Protect Crops from Pests and Disease, and keep them Watered to maximise their rewards."
msgstr "保護作物免受蟲害與病害，並保持澆水，以獲得最多獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Crop Types"
msgstr "作物類型"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Grow Allotments for Cooking, Herbs for Herblore, Trees for Skill XP, and Orchard Trees for Fruit."
msgstr "種植菜圃作物用於烹飪、藥草用於草藥學、樹木用於獲得技能經驗，以及果樹用於獲得水果。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Composting"
msgstr "堆肥製作"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use Compost Bins to create Compost, which can be applied to Crops to increase their output."
msgstr "使用堆肥桶製作堆肥，施用於作物可提高產量。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Grain Mill"
msgstr "穀物磨坊"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use the Grain Mill to produce Grain for Ranching, and Flour and Sugar for Cooking."
msgstr "使用磨坊生產畜牧用的穀物，以及烹飪用的麵粉與糖。"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Farming Automation"
msgstr "農耕自動化"

#: Tutorials/farming_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Automate Planting, Harvesting, Watering and Composting to manage your Crops automatically.\n\nAutomation consumes Wine to operate."
msgstr "將種植、收成、澆水與施肥自動化，自動管理你的作物。\n\n自動化運作需消耗葡萄酒。"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Burn Logs"
msgstr "燃燒原木"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Burn Logs to gain Firemaking XP and a chance to receive random item rewards."
msgstr "燃燒原木以獲得生火經驗，並有機會獲得隨機物品獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Light Lanterns"
msgstr "點亮燈籠"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use Firemaking to light Lanterns, providing you with Light to take on Dark Combat Areas."
msgstr "使用生火點亮燈籠，為你提供光源以挑戰黑暗戰鬥區域。"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Gain Prayer Points"
msgstr "獲得祈禱點數"

#: Tutorials/firemaking_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Burn special Prayer-related items obtained from Combat to gain Prayer Points (used to train the Prayer Skill)."
msgstr "燃燒從戰鬥中獲得的特殊祈禱相關物品以獲得祈禱點數（用於訓練祈禱技能）。"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Select a location and a fishing spot to begin catching Fish."
msgstr "選擇地點與釣點，開始釣魚。"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Random Catches"
msgstr "隨機漁獲"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Many fishing spots contain multiple types of Fish. Each catch randomly determines which Fish you receive."
msgstr "許多釣點有多種魚類。每次捕獲會隨機決定你獲得哪種魚。"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Junk"
msgstr "垃圾"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "There is a chance to catch Junk instead of Fish."
msgstr "有機率捕到垃圾而非魚。"

#: Tutorials/fishing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Some fishing spots offer special items that you can collect while fishing."
msgstr "部分釣點提供可在釣魚時收集的特殊物品。"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Ranged Equipment"
msgstr "製作遠程裝備"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create various types of Ranged weapons and ammunition for use in Combat.\n\nSome weapons require a certain type of ammunition, while others can be used individually."
msgstr "製作各種遠程武器與彈藥，供戰鬥使用。\n\n部分武器需要特定類型的彈藥，其他則可單獨使用。"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Crafting Steps"
msgstr "製作步驟"

#: Tutorials/fletching_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Each item requires a set number of steps to complete. Ingredients are consumed and rewards are granted upon completion."
msgstr "每件物品需要完成一定數量的步驟。完成時會消耗材料並發放獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/header_tutorial_button.tscn
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "指南"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn Entities/Hunting/hunting_tracking_view.tscn
msgid "Hunt Animals"
msgstr "狩獵動物"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Hunt various animals to collect rewards. Each animal requires a specific type of Trap, created through Crafting."
msgstr "狩獵各種動物以收集獎勵。每種動物都需要特定類型的陷阱，可透過工藝製作。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "The Hunting Process"
msgstr "狩獵流程"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Hunting is automatic and involves three stages: Surveying an area, Tracking an animal, and attempting to Trap it.\n\nIf trapping fails, the animal flees and must be tracked again."
msgstr "狩獵為自動進行，包含三個階段：勘查區域、追蹤動物，以及嘗試誘捕。\n\n若誘捕失敗，動物會逃走，必須重新追蹤。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animal Levels"
msgstr "動物等級"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Each animal has its own Level and XP. Successfully hunting an animal increases its XP, unlocking bonuses as it levels up."
msgstr "每種動物都有自己的等級與經驗。成功狩獵動物會增加其經驗，升級時解鎖加成。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animal Size & Weight"
msgstr "動物體型與重量"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animals come in different Sizes and Weights. Larger and heavier animals provide greater rewards when caught."
msgstr "動物有不同的體型與重量。捕獲體型越大、越重的動物，獎勵越豐厚。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Rare Discoveries"
msgstr "稀有發現"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Discover rare animal species and collect special rewards while Hunting."
msgstr "狩獵時發現稀有動物物種並收集特殊獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "What is Hunting?"
msgstr "什麼是狩獵？"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "Hunting is a Skill that tasks you to hunt a variety of wild Animals & Beasts in order to acquire their rewards.\n\nHunting feeds directly into [b]Beastcrafting[/b] as its primary use, while also rewarding you with various other Items such as [b]Herb Seeds[/b] and [b]Bones[/b]"
msgstr "狩獵是一項讓你獵捕各種野生動物與野獸以取得獎勵的技能。\n\n狩獵的主要用途是直接供應[b]野獸工藝[/b]，同時也會獎勵你各種其他物品，例如[b]藥草種子[/b]與[b]骨頭[/b]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "What do I do?"
msgstr "我該做什麼？"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "Before you can hunt, you must craft a Trap in Crafting.\n\nEach Animal requires a specific Trap, which is listed in Hunting when you select the Animal.\n\nYou can then hunt the Animal, which is an automatic 3-step process, rewarding you with Skill XP and Items upon successfully trapping the Animal."
msgstr "狩獵前，你必須先在工藝中製作陷阱。\n\n每種動物都需要特定的陷阱，選擇該動物時會在狩獵中列出。\n\n接著你就能狩獵該動物，這是一個自動進行的 3 步驟流程，成功捕獲動物後會獎勵技能經驗與物品。"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "The automatic 3-step Hunting process"
msgstr "自動進行的 3 步驟狩獵流程"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "Step 1 - Surveying\n[ul]Search the location to find the Animal’s tracks.[/ul]\n\nStep 2 - Tracking\n[ul]YFollow the tracks to locate the Animal.[/ul]\n\nStep 3 - Trapping\n[ul]Use your crafted Trap and attempt to catch it.\nFailing sends the Animal fleeing, returning you to Tracking.[/ul]"
msgstr "步驟 1 - 勘查\n[ul]搜索地點以找到動物的蹤跡。[/ul]\n\n步驟 2 - 追蹤\n[ul]跟隨蹤跡找到動物。[/ul]\n\n步驟 3 - 誘捕\n[ul]使用你製作的陷阱嘗試捕捉。\n失敗會讓動物逃走，並回到追蹤階段。[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b] is calculated as the average of these 3 substats:"
msgstr "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]為以下 3 項子屬性的平均值："

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "[ul]Keep your Animals fed every hour.\nLose 10% every hour an Animal is not fed.\nReplenish to 100% when fed.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]每小時餵食你的動物。\n動物每小時未被餵食會損失 10%。\n餵食後回復至 100%。[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "[ul]Keep Enclosures repaired as they degrade by 1% every hour.\nThis does not affect Animal's Happiness until it falls below 75%.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]圍欄每小時會損耗 1%，請保持修繕。\n低於 75% 前不會影響動物的幸福度。[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "[ul]Animals have unique needs that can be met to boost Satisfaction.\nManaging this allows Happiness to increase above 100%.[/ul]"
msgstr "[ul]動物有各自獨特的需求，滿足後可提升滿足度。\n妥善管理可讓幸福度超過 100%。[/ul]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "[color=green]Begin the Skill by purchasing your first plot of [b][color=white]Land[/color][/b] and building an [b][color=white]Enclosure[/color][/b].[/color]"
msgstr "[color=green]購買你的第一塊[b][color=white]土地[/color][/b]並建造一座[b][color=white]圍欄[/color][/b]，開始這項技能。[/color]"

#: Tutorials/hunting_tutorial_old.tscn Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
#: Entities/Quests/act_progressed_popup.tscn
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "繼續"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Select a rock to begin mining for Ore, Essence, Gems and other rewards."
msgstr "選擇一塊岩石開始開採礦石、精華、寶石及其他獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Breaking Rocks"
msgstr "碎裂岩石"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Each hit has a chance to break the rock. If the Rock Break Bar reaches 100%, the rock automatically breaks."
msgstr "每次擊中都有機率使岩石碎裂。若岩石碎裂條達到 100%，岩石會自動碎裂。"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Mining Rewards"
msgstr "採礦獎勵"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Breaking a rock grants its rewards."
msgstr "碎裂岩石可獲得其獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Rewards Per Hit"
msgstr "每次命中獎勵"

#: Tutorials/mining_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Some rocks also provide rewards with every hit, even before they break."
msgstr "部分岩石在碎裂前，每次擊中也會提供獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Raise Animals"
msgstr "飼養動物"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Purchase Land, build Enclosures, and buy Animals using Gold Pieces. Each Animal has a limited lifespan before it moves on."
msgstr "使用金幣購買土地、建造圍欄並購買動物。每隻動物都有有限的壽命。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Feed Your Animals"
msgstr "餵養你的動物"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Most Animals require Food to stay healthy, while some can survive without being fed."
msgstr "大多數動物需要食物才能保持健康，但有些不需餵食也能生存。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animal Happiness"
msgstr "動物幸福度"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Maintain your Animals' Comfort and increase their Satisfaction to improve the rewards they produce."
msgstr "維持動物的舒適度並提升其滿意度，以改善牠們產出的獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Enclosure Maintenance"
msgstr "圍欄維護"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Repair Enclosures to keep them in good condition, and give your Animals Pets to meet their needs."
msgstr "修理圍欄以保持良好狀態，並撫摸你的動物以滿足牠們的需求。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Ranching Rewards"
msgstr "畜牧獎勵"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Animals automatically produce XP and item rewards every hour. Proper care increases their output."
msgstr "動物每小時會自動產出經驗與物品獎勵。妥善照顧可提升產量。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "What is Ranching?"
msgstr "什麼是畜牧？"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "Ranching is a [b]Passive[/b] Skill designed to provide important raw resources used around the game in a passive manner.\n\nIt is not designed to be the primary source of these resources, but instead be a source that can produce as you work on other Skills."
msgstr "畜牧是一項[b]被動[/b]技能，旨在以被動方式提供遊戲中各處使用的重要原料。\n\n它並非這些資源的主要來源，而是在你進行其他技能時也能持續產出的來源。"

#: Tutorials/ranching_tutorial_old.tscn
msgid "You are tasked to purchase plots of [b]Land[/b] to build [b]Enclosures[/b] and look after various types of [b]Animals[/b].\n\nEach [b]Animal[/b] has a [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b] stat that needs to be managed, where your primary goal is to keep this at or above 100%.\n\n[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]Skill XP[/b] and resources are generated every 1 hour, multiplied by [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b]."
msgstr "你需要購買[b]土地[/b]來建造[b]圍欄[/b]，並照顧各種[b]動物[/b]。\n\n每隻[b]動物[/b]都有需要管理的 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]屬性，你的主要目標是讓它維持在 100% 以上。\n\n[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]技能經驗[/b]與資源每 1 小時產生一次，並乘以 [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]。"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Runes"
msgstr "製作符文"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Runes required to cast Magic spells in Combat."
msgstr "製作在戰鬥中施放魔法法術所需的符文。"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Magic Equipment"
msgstr "製作魔法裝備"

#: Tutorials/runecrafting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Craft Magic weapons and armour to improve your effectiveness in Combat."
msgstr "製作魔法武器與護甲，以提升你在戰鬥中的效能。"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Smelt Bars"
msgstr "冶煉金屬錠"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Smelt Ores obtained from Mining into Bars used for crafting equipment and other items."
msgstr "將採礦獲得的礦石冶煉成用於製作裝備及其他物品的金屬錠。"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create Weapons & Armour"
msgstr "製作武器與護甲"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use Bars to forge Melee-focused weapons and armour."
msgstr "使用金屬錠鍛造近戰用的武器與護甲。"

#: Tutorials/smithing_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Create components used in Fletching to craft Ranged equipment."
msgstr "製作在製箭中用來製作遠程裝備的零件。"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "This Skill is dangerous and can deal damage to you."
msgstr "此技能具有危險性，可能對你造成傷害。"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Start Thieving"
msgstr "開始偷竊"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Steal from NPCs, Stalls, Locked Chests and Heists to obtain various rewards."
msgstr "從 NPC、攤位、上鎖的寶箱與劫案中偷竊，以獲得各種獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Thieving Success Chance"
msgstr "偷竊成功率"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Your chance to successfully steal depends on your Stealth compared to the target's Perception."
msgstr "成功偷竊的機率取決於你的潛行與目標察覺的比較。"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Failed Attempts & Taking Damage"
msgstr "失敗與受到傷害"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Failing to steal causes you to take damage and become stunned. Dying may result in losing an equipped item.\n\nEquip Food from Cooking to automatically heal when your Health is low."
msgstr "偷竊失敗會讓你受到傷害並陷入暈眩。死亡可能導致失去一件已裝備的物品。\n\n裝備烹飪製作的食物，可在生命值偏低時自動治療。"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Fortune"
msgstr "財運"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Increasing your Fortune boosts the quantity of item rewards received from Thieving."
msgstr "提高財運可增加從偷竊中獲得的物品獎勵數量。"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Use Lockpicks to open Locked Chests, or find their Keys to greatly reduce the Lockpick requirement."
msgstr "使用開鎖器打開上鎖的寶箱，或找到對應的鑰匙以大幅降低開鎖器需求。"

#: Tutorials/thieving_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Complete multi-step Heists to earn rewards at each successful step, with rare rewards available upon completion."
msgstr "完成多步驟的劫案，每成功一個步驟即可獲得獎勵，完成時還有稀有獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Cut Trees"
msgstr "砍伐樹木"

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Select a tree to begin cutting it for Logs and other rewards."
msgstr "選擇一棵樹開始砍伐，以獲得原木與其他獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Tree Health"
msgstr "樹木生命值"

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Each hit reduces the tree's Health. Reduce its Health to 0 to collect its  primary rewards."
msgstr "每次命中都會減少樹木的生命值。將其生命值降至 0 即可獲得其主要獎勵。"

#: Tutorials/woodcutting_tutorial.tscn
msgid "Some trees also provide rewards with every hit, even before their Health reaches zero."
msgstr "有些樹木在每次命中時也會提供獎勵，即使生命值尚未歸零。"

#: Components/ActionUntilX/action_until_x_stop_view.tscn
msgid "Creating Until:"
msgstr "製作直到："

#: Components/ActionUntilX/item_currency_quantity_stop_option_view.tscn
msgid "Item:"
msgstr "物品："

#: Components/ActionUntilX/item_currency_quantity_stop_option_view.tscn
msgid "Quantity:"
msgstr "數量："

#: Components/ActionUntilX/recipe_creations_stop_option_view.tscn
msgid "Count: "
msgstr "數量："

#: Components/ActionUntilX/stop_option_provider_view.tscn
msgid "Stop Condition:"
msgstr "停止條件："

#: Components/ArtisanAction/astral_offerings_description.tscn
msgid "When using Astral Offerings"
msgstr "使用星界祭品時"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/astral_offerings_description.tscn
msgid "Created items have a chance to be destroyed based on the number of steps required."
msgstr "製作出的物品有機率依所需步驟數被摧毀。"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/astral_offerings_description.tscn
msgid "When an item is destroyed, a gift is received instead:"
msgstr "物品被摧毀時，會改為獲得一份禮物："

#: Components/ArtisanAction/level_reward_info.tscn
msgid "Simple Gift of Cedyr"
msgstr "塞迪爾的簡單贈禮"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "When using the Sacrificial Anvil"
msgstr "使用獻祭鐵砧時"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "All outputs are destroyed upon creation."
msgstr "所有產出在製作時都會被銷毀。"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "The sale value of each destroyed item is gained instead."
msgstr "改為獲得每件被銷毀物品的售價。"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "Upon recipe creation, these may also occur:"
msgstr "完成配方時，也可能發生以下情況："

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "One roll per recipe creation:"
msgstr "每次完成配方判定一次："

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "One roll per base recipe step:"
msgstr "每個基礎配方步驟判定一次："

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "Gain a random Collectable item"
msgstr "獲得一件隨機收藏品"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "Gain {0:F1}x experience"
msgstr "獲得 {0:F1} 倍經驗"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "Gain {0:F1}x item sale value"
msgstr "獲得 {0:F1} 倍物品售價"

#: Components/Characters/character_health_progress_bar.tscn
msgid "Auto Eat Threshold"
msgstr "自動進食門檻"

#: Components/Characters/character_health_progress_bar.tscn
#: Components/Characters/CharacterHealthProgressBar.cs.uid
msgid "Enemy's Max Hit"
msgstr "敵人最大傷害"

#: Components/Characters/stance_info_tooltip.tscn
msgid "Trains"
msgstr "訓練"

#: Components/Characters/stance_select_menu.tscn
msgid "Stance"
msgstr "架式"

#: Components/CombatAreas/area_effect_view.tscn
msgid "Area Effects"
msgstr "區域效果"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_areas_menu.tscn
msgid "Select an Area"
msgstr "選擇區域"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_areas_menu.tscn
msgid "No Area currently selected.\nChoose an Area from the left-hand side to get started."
msgstr "目前未選擇區域。\n從左側選擇一個區域以開始。"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_button.tscn
