msgid "Hire a Farmhand I that unlocks automations for all Farming actions with a [b]Farming Level requirement less than [color=orange]30[/color][/b]. Requires Wine as payment for their services."
msgstr "雇用農場幫手 II，為所有[b]農耕等級需求低於 [color=orange]50[/color][/b] 的農耕動作解鎖自動化。需要以葡萄酒支付其服務費用。"

msgid "Grants access to new slayer zones."
msgstr "可進入新的獵殺區域。"

msgid "Yeah, I'm... known to locate some stuff, from time to time."
msgstr "對，我……偶爾能找到一些東西。"

msgid "What would your... contacts, want?"
msgstr "你的……門路，會想要什麼？"

msgid "After a short stay back in Azamire, you and [Companion Name] find it hard to rest. There's still so much to be done. The Ringleader was merely the first step."
msgstr "回到阿扎米爾的這段時間裡，你和[Companion Name]很難靜下心來。還有很多事要做。首領只是開始。"

msgid "The day following your attack on the Ringleader's fort is met with a mixture of joy, relief, grief, and... uncertainty. \nWhile the assault was successful, casualties number in the range of a few dozen, a large blow to the already wavering population of your home.\n\nHowever, with the number of refugees coming and going nowadays, ebbs and flows in the local populace are getting hard to keep track of. While callous, you are thankful that no one you knew well fell - though a few of the original militia recruits you and [Companion Name] trained were among the bodies you brought back on the wagons.\n\nYesterday's events weren't enough to keep you or [Companion Name] down for long, though. The two of you set off back to the fort at first light, searching for tracks of the caravan you saw leave the fort on your first scouting mission. The set of buildings behind their thick wall still smouldered from the night before, reminding you both of the battle."
msgstr "在你們攻擊首領堡壘的第二天，大家的心情很複雜，有喜悅，有輕鬆，有悲傷，還有……迷茫。雖然這次襲擊成功了，但還是有幾十個人受傷或死亡。小鎮的人本來就不多，這些傷亡是很大的鈍擊。\n\n但是，現在難民來來往往，當地人口數量的變化很難追蹤。戰爭很殘酷，但你慶幸的是，你認識的人都還活著。在你和[Companion Name]用馬車運回來的屍體裡，有幾個是民兵隊伍的新兵。\n\n不過，昨天發生的事並沒有讓你或[Companion Name]傷心太久。天剛剛亮，你們倆就出發返回堡壘，尋找那隻車隊。在第一次偵察時，你看到他們離開了堡壘。牆後面的建築還在燃燒，這讓你們想起了昨晚的那場戰鬥。"

msgid "Following the caravan takes you ages. You travel north, out of the Elder Grove and just an hour's walk outside of the town of Hirane until the tracks stop. Several wagons were stopped here and burned, presumably by the hobgolbins bringing them. It seems that several captives were killed, though for what reason, you don't know. From what you're able to gather, the group split into well over thirty different parties, all heading off in different directions. Doubtlessly impossible to follow them all, even without the added difficulty of being much harder to track than the wagons.\n\nYou worry for a moment about Hirane's safety until you realize that the golbins would have to have a small army to raze a town of their size. Being situated on the Heartroad - one of the main throughputs to the capital of Melvor - certainly had its advantages. Being able to trade for finely crafted arms and armor was chief among them, but the Golbin's presence still gave you pause.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] decide to head into town, and the general mood of the place is... tense. Folks who seem to be citizens quickly hurry past haggard, haunted-looking villagers. It's a sight you're well acquainted with, though you're surprised to see it here. You and [Companion Name] are quickly approached by a fussy-looking man with an immaculately cared for mustache and a permanent scowl etched on his face."
msgstr "追蹤那隻車隊花了你很長時間。你向北走，離開長者之林，在距離平根小鎮一小時路程的地方，痕跡沒了。這裡停了幾輛被燒的馬車，想必是押送囚犯的大哥布林做的。似乎還有幾名俘虜被殺了，但你不知道具體原因。根據你掌握的資訊，這支車隊分成了三十多支小隊，向不同的地方走了。要追蹤每一支小隊是不可能的。況且，這些人比馬車還難追蹤，那就更難了。\n\n你有點擔心平根的安全，但轉念一想，要毀掉這麼大的一個城鎮，至少要有一支小軍隊。平根在心路上，而這條路是通往梅爾沃都城的主幹道之一。所以，平根確實有優勢。一個主要優勢是能夠買到精良的武器和護甲。不過，哥布林的存在還是讓你有點擔心。\n\n你和[Companion Name]決定去鎮上。這裡的氣氛……很緊張。鎮民們行色匆匆地經過那些憔悴、驚恐的村民。你對這一幕很熟悉，只是沒想到會在這裡看到。這時，一名男子向你和[Companion Name]走來。他留著精心打理的鬍鬚，看起來緊張不安，總是愁眉苦臉。"

msgid "I simply do not have the time for idle chit-chat. You two are just one group of many flowing into town."
msgstr "我實在沒時間閒聊。除了你們，還有很多人來這兒。"

msgid "Curo purses his lips at that, seemingly a bit lost on what to say after that. He opts for a slight nod and then excuses himself, his chaperones following quickly after.\n\nThe woman you dropped off your goods with politely, but shyly, asks if the two of you could lend just a bit more help since it sounds like you'll be stuck here anyway. You look to [Companion Name], who just shrugs. Might as well. She quickly leads you off to a nearby cooking tent, where a line of hungry refugees waits eagerly. It seems that the current staff are struggling to keep up."
msgstr "庫羅撅了一下嘴，似乎不知道該說些什麼。他點了點頭，然後就走了，幾名隨從緊緊跟著他。\n\n剛才接你們物資的那名女子禮貌又害羞地問你們，能不能再幫一下忙，因為你們似乎暫時不會走。你看著[Companion Name]，他只是聳了聳肩。那就幫吧。她立馬帶你們來到附近一個煮飯的帳篷。那裡排著隊，飢餓的難民在焦急地等待食物。看樣子，現在人手不夠了。"

msgid "After poring over the reports from Hirane's scouts, you're sure of one thing. The hooded figures that attacked Azamire and seem to be kidnapping and transporting townsfolk have headed far to the east. To what end, you couldn't even begin to wager a guess."
msgstr "在仔細閱讀了平根偵察員的報告之後，你確定了一件事。那些攻擊阿扎米爾、綁走鎮民的兜帽人，已經往遙遠的東邊走了。至於他們的目的，你沒辦法推測。"

msgid "You exit Hirane's gate and find yourself deep within the countryside. You travel east along the Heartroad, knowing that if you go far enough, it should be next to impossible to miss Clearwater. From what you were able to gather from folks in Hirane, Clearwater acts as the major waystation between the east and west sides of the Desert Plains. You heard of many small resting points and hamlets between here and there, but few were notable enough to commit to memory.\n\nThe Heartroad is generally well constructed and maintained - even this far from the capital - but as grass turned to arid soil, and then eventually sand, the Heartroad becomes harder to keep track of. Despite what the locals in Hirane said about there being places to rest between there and Clearwater, most of the buildings you pass are abandoned, swallowed by the sands.\n\nThe sun beats down on you overhead in a way you're unfamiliar with except for on Azamire's hottest summer days. There's no reprieve from the heat, just sand stretching out in what seems endless waves of gold."
msgstr "你走出平根的大門，來到一望無際的鄉野。你沿著心路向東走。只要一直走，肯定能到清水鎮。你聽平根的人說，清水鎮是沙漠平原的東側和西側之間的重要中轉點。你聽說沿途有很多小的休息站和村莊，但能記住的沒幾個。\n\n心路離都城很遠，但總體上修建和維護得不錯。一路上，從草地變成乾旱的土地，最後變成沙地，心路上的痕跡越來越難追蹤。平根的當地人說，去清水鎮的路上有休息的地方，但你經過的大多數建築都已經荒廢，被黃沙吞沒了。\n\n頭頂的太陽熱得很，這種熱只有阿扎米爾夏天最熱的那段時間才有。烈日下一片空曠，只有無邊無際的黃金沙之波浪。"

msgid "You wipe the cactus water from your mouth. The two of you tapped into many of the ones nearby and start to stray from the original patch. You find yourselves giggling and swaying to and fro, despite definitely being more hydrated. You're worried that something may be wrong, but how could it be? You feel so good. [Companion Name] nearly collapses against you in a fit of giggles, the sand undulating in mesmerizing patterns underneath you."
msgstr "你擦掉嘴邊的仙人掌汁液。你們倆喝了附近的很多仙人掌，不知不覺就走遠了。水分補充好了，但你們咯咯地笑，身體搖搖晃晃。你擔心有點不對勁，可到底是什麼問題呢？你感覺還不錯。[Companion Name]笑得差點倒在你身上。腳下的沙地起起伏伏，形成迷人的圖案。"

msgid "The cacti that stand in front of you now seem... bigger. And they move. But everything is moving, so that's not particularly strange. What is strange is that one of the cacti swing one of its spiny arms at your head when you try to cut into it with your axe. The needles in the side of your face snap you out of the cactus water's hallucinogenic effects.\n\nEverything around you stops moving, except for the... angry cactus in front of you. And all of the ones behind it. They shift through the sands and reach out with their arms. They're real. You call out to [Companion Name] who seems to be having a similar revelation."
msgstr "眼前的仙人掌似乎……變大了。而且還在動。所有東西都在動，沒什麼特別奇怪的。但奇怪的是，當你準備用斧頭砍一株仙人掌的時候，它揮動長滿刺的手臂，打在你的頭上。你的臉刺痛無比，這時你從仙人掌汁液造成的幻覺中醒了。\n\n你周圍的一切都停了，除了你面前的那株……憤怒的仙人掌。還有它後面的那些。他們在沙裡遊走，伸出它們的手臂。它們都是真的。你呼喚[Companion Name]，她似乎也目擊了。"

msgid "The cacti's spines are rough to contend with, and require a far more protective approach to fighting than you're used to employing, but all is well. The patch of cacti lays slain at your feet, and the... effects of the cactus water seem to have subsided.\n\nYou press on to Clearwater, only taking occasional, small sips of the cactus water you collected when you absolutely need to. You're definitely more giggly than usual and sway lightly on your feet, but the worst of the effects never take hold with your moderate approach.\n\nThe town of Clearwater is a sight for sore, sun-baked eyes. Your feet ache, your skin is sunburnt, and you're absolutely parched. A small crowd of townsfolk gather about, laughing at your misfortune and warning of some of the dangers you may see deeper within in the desert.\n\nWhen you ask about the figures, much of the levity is replaced by fear. A good chunk of the population here seems to have come from the abandoned exterior towns fleeing the... Soulsmiths. It feels weird to finally have a name to the group that destroyed your home. Here, dealing with them has been a constant, and the name holds no gravitas. The townspeople say they've seen the caravans head east, towards the capital, and warn you to stay far away from the eastern Heartroad for now. When you and [Companion Name] tell tales of Azamire and the Ringleader, and your goal of seeing the Soulsmiths brought to justice, it seems like half the town opens their homes to you, keeping you fed and hydrated as you two recover.\n\nAfter some well-deserved rest, the two of you continue east finally out of the dunes and back into grassy fields. You pass into rockier terrain as you approach the Flintcrest Highlands. Large jagged boulders dot the rocky soil, jutting out at odd angles."
msgstr "仙人掌的刺不好對付。要對付它們，你要比平時更加註意防禦。不過好在一切順利。那些仙人掌全都倒在了你腳下，而……仙人掌汁液帶來的「效果」，似乎也已經消退了。\n\n你繼續前往清水鎮。萬不得已時，你偶爾抿一點收集的仙人掌汁液。你比平時更愛笑，身體也有些搖晃。但你喝的不多，那些最糟糕的「效果」沒有出現。\n\n熬過了炎炎烈日，你終於看到了清水鎮。此時你的雙腳痠痛，皮膚曬傷，非常口渴。一群鎮民圍了過來。他們嘲笑你的不幸，提醒你注意沙漠更深處可能存在的一些危險。\n\n當你打聽那些兜帽人時，氣氛從輕鬆變成了恐懼。這裡很多人似乎都是從外面的廢棄城鎮逃來的，而他們閃避的原因……是煉魂師。你終於知道了摧毀家園的那群人叫什麼，這感覺有點奇怪。這裡一直都在對付那些人，所以這個名字聽起來並不沉重。鎮民們說，他們看到那些車隊往東邊，也就是都城的方向走了。他們提醒你暫時遠離東邊的心路。你與[Companion Name]講述阿扎米爾和首領的故事，還說你們的目標是將煉魂師繩之以法。這時，似乎有一半的鎮民為你們敞開家門，給你們吃的喝的，讓你們休息。\n\n休息好了以後，你們倆繼續向東走，終於走出了沙丘，回到了草地。你們越靠近弗林克克雷斯特高地，路上的石頭就越多。地上全是嶙峋的巨石，呈現出各種奇特的角度。"

msgid "With that, [Companion Name] continues to peer over the boulders as the two of you travel along the Heartroad, as if they'd spring to life and tell her where they came from. You've had enough of sentient things that should otherwise not be, so you try to avoid staring too much.\n\nFinally, you arrive at a little inn that seems to have been built into a stone wall and garrison that takes up the expansive entrance of the Broken Pass. The Sleeping Stone is legendary, and for good reason. Not only is it the home of the Slayers Guild for the eastern region of the continent, it attracts world renowned adventurers who wish to venture into the Perilous Peaks to prove themselves to be the best of the best.\n\nThe Broken Pass is the quickest way to the capital, but it's typically travelled by highly armed caravans that can both pay the toll to pass the gate, and can fend off any beasts that travelled down from the mountain proper. When you hear of caravans being rerouted south - around the mountain range - due to a particularly feisty pack of Stonehoppers, you're quick to offer you and [Companion Name]'s services. \n\nThe owner of the Sleeping Stone does you one better, saying that if you take care of them, you'll get free passage through the Broken Pass for life. The deal's too good to pass up."
msgstr "你們倆沿著心路繼續走，[Companion Name]時不時地探頭看看路邊的巨石，彷彿那些巨石會活過來，告訴她來自哪裡。你對這些本來就不該有意識的東西沒興趣，所以儘量不去多看。\n\n最終，你到了一家小客棧。 這家客棧似乎直接建在石牆裡面。旁邊是一處要塞，位置在粉碎關口寬敞的入口。沉睡之石非常有名，而且名副其實。這裡是大陸東部地區「獵殺公會」的總部，吸引了世界各地的著名冒險者。他們都想進入「險惡山脈」，證明自己是頂尖中的頂尖。\n\n粉碎關口是前往都城最快的路，但通常只有裝備精良的車隊才會走。這些車隊付得起通行費，也能夠抵禦山裡的牛羚。聽說有一群特別兇猛的石跳獸，逼得車隊改變方向往南走，繞過大山。你立刻提出要和[Companion Name]一起解決麻煩。\n\n沉睡之石的老闆提出了更誘人的條件：只要你能搞定那群傢伙，以後就可以終身免費透過粉碎關口。這筆買賣太划算了，不能錯過。"

msgid "You tally up the bodies of the tall, awkward beasts. Stonehoppers were a bit of an odd blend of creatures. They were scaly like a lizard and use a long whip-like tail for stability. They have two large wings that aid them in jumping from rock to rock - hence their name - but they were technically flightless. The 'birds' walk on two powerful legs that they use to kick at their prey, which fortunately made it easy to get them tangled up in traps.\n\nWhat surprised you about them was their number. It felt like every time you caught one, you'd see two more jumping overhead."
msgstr "你清理那些牛羚的屍體。它們又高又笨。石跳獸是一種奇特的生物。他們長著蜥蜴般的鱗片，還有一條鞭子似的長尾巴，用來保持平衡。它們有一對大翅膀，讓它們能夠在岩石間跳躍。它們的名字就是這樣來的。但嚴格來說，它們不會飛。這些『鳥』行走時用兩條強壯的腿，捕獵時用腳踢獵物。好在這些特點可以讓它們輕鬆落入陷阱。\n\n令你驚訝的是它們的數量。感覺你抓一隻，頭上又有兩隻略過去。"

msgid "Fine then. Let's make it a bet, then. Whichever of us takes down the least cooks dinner out of them, then."
msgstr "行吧。那我們打個賭。誰打的牛羚最少，誰做晚飯。"

msgid "You and [Companion Name] tally up your kills and... somehow, it's a dead tie. You do a once-over of the den just to make sure you got them all and neither of you could squeak out a last minute victory, but you really did get them all.\n\nYou both throw up your hands and congratulate one another on a job well done and camp out in the Broken Pass, cooking a meal together. Usually you just dig into your travel rations, but this is about as good of a chance as you'll get on the road. With some local herbs and a generous bit of seasoning... yeah, it does taste like chicken. Quite a bit more gamey, and virtually zero fat, but a great meal nonetheless.\n\nYou settle into your sleeping roll and watch the embers of the fire float up into the sky."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]清點各自的戰果……結果打成平手。你們清理了屍體，又把牛羚窩搜了一遍，確認都抓完了。你們都想在最後一秒反超，但實際上，牛羚都抓完了。\n\n你們倆拍拍手，互相祝賀取得的戰果，然後在粉碎關口紮營，一起做飯。你們平時都簡單吃口乾糧，但現在是路上改善伙食的好機會。配上當地的草藥，撒上足量的調料……嘿，吃起來像雞肉。野味比較重，幾乎沒什麼油水，但這頓飯還是不錯的。\n\n你鑽進睡袋，看著火慢慢熄滅，飄到天上。"

msgid "We'll finally be in the capital, soon. I've dreamed about it ever since I was a kid."
msgstr "我們快到都城了。我從小就一直夢想著這一刻。"

msgid "After a bit of shuteye, the rest of the trip is... uneventful in a positive way. You pass by the eastern gate to the Broken Pass and tell them how you've dealt with the Stonehoppers and show them proof, to which the guards are both impressed and thankful, and promise to let those at the Sleeping Stone know.\n\nYou pass by a few villages along the rest of the Heartroad, many of them clearly prospering due to their proximity to the capital. As you pass over the Bridge of Kings, you see the grand gates of Melvor before you, with a long trail of people waiting to be let inside.\n\nThrough talking with the crowd and a few guards who do their best to keep the peace, it sounds like the city has been under a light lockdown to new travellers because of an influx of smuggled goods. Only those bearing visitor passes or proof of citizenship are allowed entry. These visitor passes are sold for... rather exorbitant amounts.\n\nA group of pompous aristocrats wave their passes and bottles of wine about flamboyantly and shuffle along the pathway. They let out strings of taunts and insults as they walk past the line of those looking to be let into the capital. You and [Companion Name] look to one another with wry smiles."
msgstr "睡了一會後，接下來的旅程……平靜順利。你們經過粉碎關口的東門，告訴守護說你們解決了石跳獸，還拿出了證明。他們既驚歎又感激，承諾會通知沉睡之石那邊的人。\n\n沿著心路繼續走，你們經過了幾個村莊。因為靠近都城，許多村莊都很繁華。跨過「國王大橋」，你看到了梅爾沃的大門。門口排著長隊，都是等待進去的人。\n\n你跟那群人還有努力維持秩序的幾名守護聊了一下，聽說因為流入了大量的走私貨，這座城市已經封鎖了，限制外來者進入。只有持訪客通行證或市民身份證明，才能進去。訪客通行證的價格……高得離譜。\n\n一群自大的貴族揮著通行證和酒瓶，十分張揚。他們經過排隊等待進城的人群，嘴裡一直在嘲諷和羞辱。你和[Companion Name]互相看了看，無奈地笑了。"

msgid "You follow the group along for a while until one of the richly dressed men smacks a wide-eyed child on the nose with their pass, then hurries along. The child's mother shouts after them, and the angry line of onlookers finally snaps at the mistreatment. Some of the drunken nobles cower in fear, afraid of the consequences of their own actions, while others egg the crowd on further, clearly enjoying the attention. The guards try to keep the peace, though they are clearly fed up with the 'social elite' as well, judging by their glares.\n\nTaking advantage of the situation, you bump into one of the nobles in the crowd and slip your hand into their coat, withdrawing a sleek sky blue visitor's pass. You keep walking as its original owner shouts after you for daring to touch them, but they're drowned out by the angry mob soon enough. [Companion Name] slides in right beside you, holding one of her own. The two of you open them up, realizing that there's no identifying information that is required, the pass alone is proof enough that you may enter.\n\nJust like that, the gates of the capital won't stop you. You don't even feel a little bad."
msgstr "你跟著人群走了一會兒，這時一名穿著華貴的男子用通行證打了一個孩子的鼻子，那孩子的眼睛瞪得很大。然後，那名男子就走了。孩子的母親在後面大聲喊。看見孩子受欺負，圍觀人群的憤怒徹底爆發。一些醉醺醺的貴族害怕了，擔心自己的行為會造成什麼後果。還有一些貴族煽動情緒，顯然很享受被關注的感覺。守護努力維持秩序，但從他們憤怒的眼睛來看，顯然他們煩透了這些『社會精英』。\n\n趁著混亂，你撞上一名貴族，把手伸進他的外套，掏出了一張天藍色的訪客通行證。這張通行證原來的主人在你後面大喊，罵你摸他，但他的聲音很快就被憤怒的人群淹沒了。你沒有回頭，繼續走。[Companion Name]溜到你旁邊，手裡也拿著通行證。你們倆開啟通行證，目擊上面不需要任何身份資訊。單憑這張通行證，你們就可以進城。就這樣，都城的大門沒能攔住你。你甚至沒覺得不好。"

msgid "By following crumbs of information regarding the group you now know as the Soulsmiths, you've found yourself thrust into the middle of the capital of Melvor with hardly a clue on what to do or where to go next."
msgstr "順著關於那群人（現在你知道他們叫煉魂師）的一些線索，你目擊到了梅爾沃的都城。接下來該做什麼、該去哪兒，你也不知道。"

msgid "You'd heard tales of the capital many times by those who'd travelled the continent and happened to stop by Azamire for trade or rest, but their stories hardly even begin to scratch just how... much was laid out before the two of you. Thousands of people, many speaking languages that you couldn't even begin to place. Buildings that stretch so high into the sky that you have to crane your neck to fully see. Market stalls filled with an endless number of trinkets and clothes, while some on the other side of the random plaza you'd entered emit smells so strange and tantalizing you involuntarily start to drool.\n\nYou try your best to take in everything, excitedly chatting with [Companion Name] as you both try to point out the endless rush of... everything, until you find yourself pushing out of the crowds for the first time. You're thankful for the space, until you feel a strong hand clamp down on your shoulder and yank you backwards. Your hand goes to the weapon at your side until you realize you... walked onto a firing range! An arrow whizzes past your nose as you turn to the person who grabbed you. A tall, tanned man dressed in a gaudy purple cloak and a longbow strapped to his back pulls you out of danger, to [Companion Name] who breathlessly catches up to you."
msgstr "從那些遊歷大陸的人口中，還有那些為了生意或休息經過阿扎米爾的人口中，你很多次聽說關於都城的故事。但他們講的和你們倆親眼看到的相比，簡直連冰山一角都不算。成千上萬的人，很多人說的語言你根本不懂。建築高聳入雲，你要仰起脖子才能完全看清楚。集市攤位上擺滿了數不清的小玩意兒和衣物。你來到廣場的另一側，聞到的氣味奇特又誘人，讓你忍不住流口水。\n\n你努力想要感受眼前的一切，興奮地和[Companion Name]聊天，指著周圍……各種各樣的景象。這時，你第一次擠出了人群。你慶幸終於不擠了，突然一隻強有力的手抓住你的肩，把你往後拽。你伸手去摸腰間的武器，但你目擊自己……進了一個射擊場！當你轉身去看抓你的人，一支箭從你的鼻子旁邊飛過去。抓你的是一名身材高大、皮膚黑黑的男子。他披著一件鮮豔的紫色披風，背上揹著一把長弓。他幫你擺脫危險，把你交給氣喘吁吁趕來的[Companion Name]。"

msgid "New to the capital, I presume?"
msgstr "看來你剛到都城吧？"

msgid "Can't blame you. Melvor is a real beaute, ain't it?"
msgstr "不能怪你。梅爾沃的確是個好地方，不是嗎？"

msgid "Talm winks at the two of you and then holds a finger to his lips, clearly giving no further information than he's already provided. Based on how quickly you and [Companion Name] looked to one another at the mention of Soulsmiths, he knew he had you hooked. Without even asking if you'd be interested, he talks about how arrows fashioned with the feathers of a Sea Griffon always seem to find their mark, and would quite fancy having some of the arrows for himself. Unfortunately, he has no feathers, just the location of one that has been terrorizing a few fishing boats.\n\nYou and [Companion Name] leave the capital as quickly as you came, and after a few hours of travel, find the windy cliffside that the nest was said to be. And sure enough, a large pack of the beasts swoop overhead, clearly upset by your arrival."
msgstr "塔爾姆向你們眨了眨眼，然後豎起一根手指放在唇邊。顯然，他不能再透露更多的資訊了。一提到煉魂師，你和[Companion Name]迅速交換了一個眼神。他知道，你們有興趣了。他甚至沒問你們有沒有興趣，就說用海獅鷲羽毛製作的箭矢總能射中目標。他自己也很想有幾支這樣的箭矢。可惜，他沒有羽毛，只知道有一隻海獅鷲在恐嚇幾艘漁船。\n\n跟來的時候一樣，你和[Companion Name]快速離開都城。幾個小時後，你們找到了巢穴所在的懸崖邊。懸崖邊風很大。果然，一大群牛羚從你們頭上飛過。顯然，你們的到來讓它們很生氣。"

msgid "Feathers gathered, the two of you make the trek back to the capital. The city is just as overwhelming as before, but the clear goal of finding Talm again manages to help you push through the enthralling nature of the new sights and smells with ease. Talm is amongst the competitors, warming up. He's doing a remarkable job even without the feathers, nearly splitting his own arrows far down the range, and you begin to wonder why he feels the need to cheat at all."
msgstr "收集到羽毛後，你們倆回到都城。城裡的景象還是那麼眼花繚亂。但你們有了明確的目標，那就是再次找到塔爾姆。有了這個目標，你們能夠輕鬆應對那些吸引人的新奇景象和氣味。塔爾姆正在進行參賽熱身。即使沒有羽毛，他依然表現得很棒。在遠處的靶子上，他的箭幾乎可以將自己之前射的箭劈成兩半。你不禁在想，他為什麼覺得自己需要作弊呢。"

msgid "Talm's sing-songy taunt elicits a glare from [Companion Name], but after a brief standoff, she sighs and hauls you away, grumpily beginning to cut some arrow shafts. You get the impression she'd rather use that knife elsewhere, but has decided to behave, for now."
msgstr "聽著塔爾姆戲謔地嘲諷你們，[Companion Name]生氣地瞪了他一眼。但糾結了一會兒，她嘆了口氣，把你拉到一邊，暴躁地開始削箭桿。看得出來，她更想把那把刀用在別的地方，但眼下還是決定安分一點。"

msgid "The two of you make your way back to Talm, this time with a bundle of arrows, to which he receives with a small, polite show of clapping. He takes one and inspects it carefully, before bending it so far that it snaps in two. He tuts to himself and shoves the splintered arrow back into your hands."
msgstr "你們倆回到塔爾姆那裡，這次帶了一捆箭。他接過箭，禮貌地輕輕拍了拍手。他提領一支箭仔細檢視，然後用力一掰，箭斷成兩段。他嘖了一聲，把斷了的箭塞回你們手上。"

msgid "Now now, this simply won't do. My bow may also be a bit special. Like I said, I really want to win this. With the force I'll be sending these arrows down range, they don't stand a chance."
msgstr "哎呀，這樣不行啊。我的弓或許也有點特別。我說過，我這次真的想贏。以我射出這些箭的力道，其他人沒有機會贏。"

msgid "Even in a city as bustling as Melvor, Talm is a remarkably easy figure to find. After just a few minutes of asking around the range, you find yourself face to face with the tall, smiling man. Without a word he gestures for you to follow him, so you do, trusting he knows what you're after. You're led deep within the alleys and byways of the capital, some better, some worse. As you round a corner you find yourself at the back entrance of a brightly painted stone building, door already open for you to enter. As the three of you enter, the door quietly shuts behind you without any prompting.\n\nYou're brought before an absolutely stunning woman who greets the three of you with a wordless smile, and gestures for you to sit on cushions laid out in front of her. You do, and the room quickly fills with a twinkling blue fog. You panic for a moment before deciding that they don't seem to mean you harm, and you inhale deeply.\n\nYour vision fades away, then comes back to you as you're flying far overhead a large white building, whose doors seem to suck you in. You fall through the floor of the building and weave through shelf and shelf of books, all the way to a large vault made of a blend of metals and magic you instinctively know as you pass through its walls. Within, you find a gilded tome that seems to glow with power. The moment you touch it, you snap back awake next to [Companion Name]. She seems... upset, seemingly a bit disturbed by whatever she saw."
msgstr "在梅爾沃這座繁華的城市裡，要找到塔爾姆很簡單。四處打聽了一會兒，你就看到了那個身材高大、面帶微笑的男人。他沒說一句話，示意讓你跟著他。你照著做，相信他清楚你的來意。他帶你走進都城巷道的深處，一路上的環境時好時壞。轉過一個角落，你來到一棟顏色鮮豔的石頭建築的後門。門已經開了，正等你們進去。等你們三人進去，身後的門自己就悄悄關上了。\n\n你被帶到一名驚豔的女子面前。她沒說話，笑著和你打招呼，然後示意你坐在她前面的墊子上。你坐下來，房間裡很快就飄滿了閃著微光的藍色霧氣。你有點驚慌，但心想他們似乎沒有惡意，於是便深吸了一口氣。\n\n你的視線慢慢模糊，然後又慢慢清楚。這時，你飛在高高的空中，下面是一棟巨大的白色建築。那棟建築的大門彷彿要把你吸進去。你落下來，穿過那棟建築的地板，在一排排的書架之間穿梭，最後到了一個大寶庫。當你穿過寶庫的牆壁，直覺告訴你這個寶庫是金屬和魔法混合構成的。寶庫內，你目擊了一本閃著力量光芒的鍍金古書。在你觸碰古書的一瞬間，你突然驚醒，身邊是[Companion Name]。她看起來……不太高興，似乎被她看見的景象困住了。"

msgid "What... was that? Did you see the same thing, [Companion Name]?"
msgstr "那……是什麼？你看到了嗎，[Companion Name]？"

msgid "And with that, Talm helps Era up and takes her to a room behind a nearby curtain. It doesn't seem like you're invited. You check on [Companion Name] once again, about the vision she had. She gently, tells you that she'll talk about it later, just that it was a bit scary. \n\nThe two of you wander around the city, a bit less awestruck than when you first arrived, and soon enough, find yourselves on the doorstep of the Ivory Athenaeum. From what you learn, speaking with some of the guests and staff, it'd seem that the titanic structure holds the largest compilation of humanity's knowledge ever created, with a near endless number of books on every subject one could think of.\n\nYou ask about the lower floors, and learn that they are restricted from the general public, needing a direct invitation from the King himself to be let inside, since the books down there contain dangerous information. The process of obtaining an invitation is told to you through a long, well-rehearsed deluge of information. What sticks out to you is the time involved. An average of thirty years for those prestigious enough to be allowed a chance. Too long."
msgstr "說完，塔爾姆扶起艾拉，把她帶進附近一道簾子後面的房間。好像沒讓你們一起去。關於她看見的幻象，你再次詢問[Companion Name]。她低聲說等會兒再細講，只是那幻象有點嚇人。\n\n你們倆在城中閒逛，沒有剛來時那麼驚歎。沒過多久，你們來到象牙藏書院的門前。你們跟這裡的訪客和工作人員交談，聽說這座宏偉的建築裡有人類有史以來最龐大的知識彙編。這裡面的書數不勝數，涵蓋人們所能想象的所有領域。\n\n你詢問底層的情況，得知那裡不對公眾開放。要想進去，需要國王本人的直接邀請，因此那裡的書中有危險的資訊。他們向你介紹獲得邀請的流程。那一長串的介紹就像是反覆排練過的，滔滔不絕。你最關心的是需要的時間。即使是有機會獲得邀請的名門望族，平均也要等三十年。太久了。"

msgid "You want to let out a cheer as the Abyssal Vault comes into view, but you obviously know better than that. You put [Companion Name] up on your shoulders and she slowly but surely presses a wedge of clay into the arcane locking mechanism. The vault is exactly as it appeared in your vision, and you do your best to memorize the magic that courses through it as [Companion Name] deals with the mould. You know from your vision that you'll have to imbue the key with the same magic for it to actually work when you come back and let yourself in.\n\nNow that you've properly mapped out the route to the vault, you're able to get back to the entrance with little trouble. Understandably, the patrolling guards are both few in number and a bit inattentive, it's not like many people would be crazy enough to try this. You and [Companion Name] make it back out of the Ivory Athenaeum, and finally allow yourself to breathe."
msgstr "看見深淵寶庫的時候，你很想歡呼一下，但你當然知道，現在不能歡呼。你把[Companion Name]扛在肩上，她穩穩地將一塊黏土擠進秘鎖裝置。寶庫和你在幻象裡看到的一模一樣。[Companion Name]忙著製作模具，你則盡力記住流轉其中的魔力。你從幻象裡得知，得給鑰匙注入同樣的魔力，等你們回來時，它才能真正開啟這扇門。\n\n現在，通往寶庫的路線已經摸清，回到入口倒沒費多少工夫。巡邏的守護不僅人數少，還有些心不在焉。這也難怪，畢竟沒幾個人會瘋到來幹這種事。你和[Companion Name]終於走出象牙藏書院，這才敢鬆口氣。"

msgid "The two of you quickly search through the displayed items until you find what you're looking for. The black, gilded tome from your vision. Amongst everything else in the vault, you'd almost call it unassuming. \n\nIt hums with some unknown magic, and you give it a ginger touch with your hand. When you don't immediately get vaporized by some unknown power, you lift it from its resting place and crack it open. The first page says... Something in a language you've never seen before. You snap it closed and gently wave it for [Companion Name] to see. She carefully crosses the vault and takes the book, and the two of you head back to the entrance. However, the moment your hand touches the metal of the door to push it back open, it snaps shut. A loud hum fills the room, along with what sounds like an alarm outside of the vault.\n\nAs you look to [Companion Name], a large golem seems to coalesce from the ground, made of the same alloy as the rest of the vault. [Companion Name] readies her weapon, and you follow suit."
msgstr "你們飛快地翻找陳列的物品，終於找到了要找的東西。正是幻象裡那本鑲著金邊的黑色厚書。和寶庫裡的其他東西比起來，它甚至算得上不起眼。\n\n書裡湧動著某種未知的魔力，發出低低的嗡鳴。你小心翼翼地伸手碰了碰。既然沒有當場被什麼神秘力量化成灰，你便把書拿了起來，輕輕翻開。第一頁寫著……一種你從沒見過的文字。你啪地合上書，輕輕晃了晃，示意[Companion Name]看過來。她小心穿過寶庫，接過書，你們一起往入口走去。然而，你的手剛碰到金屬門，想把它推開，門就猛地合上了。響亮的嗡鳴充斥著整個房間，寶庫外似乎也響起了警報。\n\n你轉頭看向[Companion Name]，只見一具巨大的魔像正從地面凝聚成形，身上的合金和寶庫其他地方的材質一模一樣。[Companion Name]握緊武器，你也做好了戰鬥準備。"

msgid "The two of you run like your lives depend on it, because they likely do. Every time you're singed by a magical barrier or narrowly dodge a guardsman's pike, you just think about how many lifetimes you'd likely spend in Melvor's jails. That is, if they didn't just outright execute you. You make sure not to hurt anyone, because murder wouldn't likely get you any better treatment if you were to be captured.\n\nBy some miracle, you manage to make it to the stairwell leading up out of the lower floors. Stunned guardsmen scramble to bring their weapons at the ready - clearly not anticipating any intruders actually making it back to the entrance - and the two of you manage to burst back out into the main floor of the athenaeum.\n\nYou rush outside and into the throngs of people being evacuated outside. Guards point and shout at the two of you as you melt into the crowds but fail to give chase as you quickly slip deeper and deeper into the mass of concerned citizens. The two of you find yourselves at the edge of a canal and jump in, swimming under the water all the way to an exposed sewer grate. You let yourselves inside and strip off your disguises and toss them into the water, both silent as the adrenaline slowly works its way through your bodies. You quietly laugh and lean against the wall of the sewer with a sick squelch you don't even notice. You did it. You got out, somehow."
msgstr "你們拼了命地跑，畢竟這多半真是在逃命。每次被魔法屏障燎一下，或是險險躲過守護的長槍，你都會想到，要是落網，自己大概得在梅爾沃的牢裡蹲上幾輩子。前提是，他們沒有直接把你處死。你儘量不傷到任何人。真被抓住了，再背上一條人命，只會更慘。\n\n簡直是奇蹟，你們竟然跑到了通往上層的樓梯間。守護顯然沒料到入侵者還能活著跑回入口，愣了一下，才手忙腳亂地舉起武器。趁著這工夫，你們衝回了藏書院的主層。\n\n你們衝到外面，混進正在疏散的人群。守護指著你們大喊，可你們轉眼就鑽進了人群深處。四周都是惶惶不安的市民，他們根本追不上來。你們來到一條運河邊，縱身跳下，潛在水裡，一直游到一處露在外面的下水道柵口。鑽進下水道後，你們脫下偽裝，扔進水裡。兩個人都沒說話，方才逃命時的那股亢奮勁還沒過去。你低低地笑了起來，往下水道牆上一靠。黏糊糊的一聲響，你卻渾然不覺。你們做到了。不管怎麼說，總算逃出來了。"

msgid "[Companion Name] flicks the gilded tome open and closed, looking at it from every angle she can, and trying a few different pages. Like you, she hasn't the foggiest clue about what the book says, and the place that would likely know, is still searching high and low for it. You and [Companion Name] have left your little sewer hideaway and sure enough, the disguises you donned before the heist worked. No one comes to put you in shackles and haul you off to some dark dungeon. As far as anyone else is concerned, you're just one of the many thousands of tourists to the capital.\n\nYou head back to Era and Talm's home and find it in flames. Talm worriedly tries to douse the flames with many other passersby, until a capital mage buries the building under a deluge of water. You rush to Talm. Your presence gives him pause, and he gestures for you two to follow him."
msgstr "[Companion Name]把那本鑲金邊的厚書翻來覆去地看，開啟又合上，還換著翻了幾頁。和你一樣，她也完全看不懂。至於那個可能看得懂的地方，現在還在滿城找這本書。你和[Companion Name]離開了下水道里的臨時藏身處。果然，行動前那身偽裝沒白穿。沒人過來給你們戴上鐐銬，拖進什麼暗無天日的地牢。在旁人眼裡，你們不過是都城成千上萬遊客中的兩個。\n\n你們回到艾拉和塔爾姆家，卻目擊那裡……著火了。塔爾姆正和一群路人焦急地撲火，直到一名都城的法師召來傾盆大水，將整棟房子澆了個透。你連忙跑向塔爾姆。看見你，他愣了一下，隨後示意你們跟上。"

msgid "The three of you set off, leaving the burned building behind. Talm leads you through the city with such ease and purpose you get the feeling he's been here a long, long, time. As you travel, the people you see become less friendly, and more dirty. Desperate. The slums were doubtlessly going to be here, like any other large city, but to see them up close was a staunch difference to when you first arrived in the capital a few weeks ago.\n\nRougher looking folks give you a large berth when they lock eyes with Talm. The generally friendly man now walks with murderous intent, his bow now set aside for a longsword and shield that he carries openly. He looks back to you frequently, making sure you're looking out for the shack as diligently as he'd hope for. And sure enough, you see it. The crescent shape by the door - just like in your vision - is so loud to your eyes, you almost don't understand how [Companion Name] and Talm don't see it.\n\nYou point it out, and without a word, Talm approaches the door and sends it off its hinges with a startlingly powerful kick. You eye [Companion Name], who charges in right behind him. Swords clash almost immediately."
msgstr "你們三個動身，把燒燬的房子留在身後。塔爾姆帶著你們穿過城市，熟門熟路，連半點猶豫都沒有。你感覺，他在這裡一定住了很久。越往前走，遇到的人就越不友善，身上也越髒。眼裡滿是絕望。和其他大城市一樣，這裡當然也會有貧民窟。可真走進來，親眼看到這一切，和幾周前剛到都城時的感覺簡直天差地別。\n\n那些看著不好惹的人，一對上塔爾姆的眼睛，便遠遠讓開。這個平日裡和氣的人，此刻渾身都是殺氣。他已經收起弓，明晃晃地拿著長劍和盾牌往前走。他頻頻回頭看你，確認你還在認真尋找那間小屋。果然，你看見了。門旁的月牙和幻象裡一模一樣。它在你眼裡醒目得不得了，你幾乎不明白，[Companion Name]和塔爾姆怎麼會看不見。\n\n你指了指。塔爾姆一聲不吭地走上前，一腳踹開了門，力道大得驚人，連門軸都被踹脫了。你看向[Companion Name]，她已經緊跟著他衝了進去。刀劍碰撞聲幾乎立刻響起。"

msgid "I was around before... this capital. And the one before it. Era too."
msgstr "這座都城還沒建起來的時候……我就在了。上一座也是。艾拉也一樣。"

msgid "You raided one of the most secure locations in the capital for... what's basically a children's history book."
msgstr "你們闖進都城戒備最森嚴的地方之一，拿回來的……基本上就是一本給小孩子看的歷史書。"

msgid "You caught [Companion Name]'s flinch when Talm said that Era's visions are never wrong. But why? What'd she see? You've tried asking, gently, over the last couple of weeks, but you've hardly gotten anything other than it being 'bad'.\n\nTalm utters a command in a language you cannot understand to the thrall, and it shudders for a moment, before walking off at a leisurely pace. The three of you follow close behind until you get to the main gates of the capital. You flinch as you approach the guards and Talm pulls the thrall between you and him. He takes on a drunken sway and starts slurring gibberish as the guard looks your party over. The woman pinches her nose and remarks that you 'smell like death' and waves you off.\n\nYou do your best to wipe off the thrall's blood that leaked through his pilfered robes once you're out of eyeshot, cursing quietly to yourself. The thrall leads you far out of town and out into the countryside. Once you hit the treeline of a nearby forest, Talm curses and releases his command of the thrall, who slumps to the ground. He says he knows where they went.\n\nYou're lead to a large stone tower that blends well into the rocky landscape. It once had a large wooden door that now lays splintered in a dozen large chunks on the ground. Talm exclaims that they attacked his 'real' home, and that the security system was set off."
msgstr "塔爾姆說艾拉的幻象從不會錯時，你注意到[Companion Name]瑟縮了一下。為什麼？她到底看到了什麼？過去幾周，你也試著小心地問過幾次，可除了「很糟糕」，幾乎什麼也沒問出來。\n\n塔爾姆用你聽不懂的語言，對屍僕下了道命令。它抖了一下，隨後不緊不慢地走了出去。你們三個緊跟其後，一直來到都城的大門前。快走到守護面前時，你不由得縮了一下。塔爾姆把屍僕拉到你和他中間。他裝出一副醉醺醺的樣子，搖搖晃晃，嘴裡含糊地胡言亂語，任由守護打量你們。女守護捏著鼻子，嫌你們「一股死人味」，揮手趕你們走了。\n\n離開守護的視線後，你一邊低聲咒罵，一邊盡力擦掉沾到身上的血。那些血從屍僕偷來的袍子裡滲了出來。屍僕帶著你們遠離城鎮，走進鄉野。走到附近一片森林的邊緣時，塔爾姆罵了一聲，解除了對屍僕的控制。它頓時癱倒在地。他說，他知道他們去哪兒了。\n\n他帶著你們來到一座巨大的石塔前。塔身藏在岩石遍佈的地形中，幾乎融為一體。這裡原本有扇巨大的木門，如今卻碎成十幾大塊，散落在地。塔爾姆驚呼，他們襲擊了他「真正的家」，還觸發了防禦機關。"

msgid "[Companion Name] and you look at each other, grimacing a bit as the following silence is punctuated by the sounds of tearing flesh and sickening gurgles. You feel a bit faint listening to Talm work on his... not dead wife. If one can reverse the effects of aging then perhaps mending wounds falls under that domain as well. You see [Companion Name] shoot a glance in their direction then quickly avert her eyes, clutching her mouth after a quiet heave. You think better of it.\n\nYou nearly leap out of your skin when you feel a couple of light taps on your shoulder and come face to face with the incredibly pale visage of Era. Her wounds stitched together, the only remnant of them being the tears in dress from which any number of weapons pierced her. \n\nShe welcomes you to her home and starts to apologize for the mess, before then frowning, realizing your part in its current state. The fact that she was on death's door just moments ago seemingly not bothering her in the slightest. If they're truly as old as Talm claims, you wonder how many times someone could have crossed a similar scene.\n\nEra gestures for [Companion Name] and has Talm bring a chair over, to which she slumps in. She runs her hands over the book with fondness, then gives a few directions for adjusting telescope. She invites the both of you to use it."
msgstr "你和[Companion Name]面面相覷，不由得皺起臉。隨後的寂靜裡，不時傳來血肉撕裂聲，還有令人反胃的咕嚕聲。聽著塔爾姆給他那位……還活著的妻子療傷，你有點頭暈。既然連衰老都能逆轉，那……治好傷口，或許也在這種法術的能力範圍內。你看見[Companion Name]往那邊瞥了一眼，隨即趕緊移開目光，捂著嘴，低低乾嘔了一聲。你決定還是別看了。\n\n肩膀忽然被輕輕拍了兩下，你差點嚇得跳起來。一回頭，正對上艾拉蒼白得嚇人的臉。她的傷口已經癒合，只剩裙子上被各種武器刺破的口子，還能看出她剛才傷得有多重。\n\n她歡迎你們來家裡做客，剛要為屋裡的凌亂道歉，又皺起眉頭，想起來你們也出了一份力。至於幾分鐘前還在鬼門關前轉悠這件事，她似乎一點也沒放在心上。如果他們真像塔爾姆說的那麼長壽，你不禁好奇，這樣的場面，他們究竟經歷過多少次。\n\n艾拉朝[Companion Name]示意，又讓塔爾姆搬來一張椅子，整個人幾乎癱了進去。她愛惜地撫過書頁，又告訴你們該怎麼調整望遠鏡。隨後，她請你們兩個都來看看。"

msgid "The stars stretch out before you, incalculable in number. As you peer up at them through Era's telescope, they twist and turn in so many beautiful arrays and patterns you almost want to weep. As you try to commit them to memory, they dance ever so carefully out of reach again and again. You take breaks when the floor beneath you sways like the gentle rocking of a ship at sea. [Companion Name] takes your place in these bits of downtime. You chat here and there with Era and Talm, who both look at you with a degree of fondness that comes off as... almost warm, though the feeling almost feels misplaced.\n\nThe sight is punctuated by that of Talm's new thralls, the broken bodies of the Soulsmiths being twisted to work on... repairs and cleanup. The sight is as macabre as it is absurd. A pair of thralls mop up after one another in a circle, each trying to clean the trailing blood from their comrade. You shudder at the sight. When one of the thralls tries to remove Talm's sword from the wall and ends up tearing its arm out of its socket. \n\nYou nearly faint. Talm curses softly, and Era simply chuckles. You make note to never get on either of their bad sides. Ever. You know the Soulsmiths are truly wretched and you'd never spill a tear over them, but the level of... flippance that Era and Talm have at seeing their undead bodies lurch about feels unnerving, at least for now.\n\nYou rest and recuperate in their home, taking turns with [Companion Name], peering through the telescope and trying to glean insight from the stars. Once the thralls were disposed of and the traps turned off, the tower really was nice. Though, some of the things you saw may sit with you for a long while."
msgstr "星辰在你眼前鋪展開來，多得數也數不清。透過艾拉的望遠鏡仰望星空，群星流轉，交織出無數美麗的圖案，幾乎讓你想落淚。可每當你想把它們記住，它們便輕巧地舞開，一次又一次，怎麼也抓不住。腳下的地板開始搖晃，彷彿置身海上輕輕搖盪的船隻。這時你便歇一會兒，換[Companion Name]來看。你們時不時和艾拉、塔爾姆聊上幾句。兩人看著你們的眼神帶著幾分喜愛，幾乎稱得上……溫暖，只是這份溫暖總讓你覺得有點不合時宜。\n\n畢竟，旁邊還有塔爾姆新收的屍僕。那些煉魂師殘破的身體被驅使著扭動起來，忙著……修繕和打掃。這場面既瘮人，又荒唐。兩具屍僕繞著圈，一個跟著另一個拖地，都在擦對方一路淌下來的血。看得你直打寒戰。其中一具屍僕想把塔爾姆的劍從牆上拔出來，結果把自己的胳膊從肩頭扯了下來。\n\n你差點暈過去。塔爾姆低低罵了一聲，艾拉只是輕笑。你默默提醒自己，以後絕對別惹這兩個人。絕對。你知道煉魂師壞透了，也絕不會為他們掉一滴眼淚。可看著他們死後的身體踉踉蹌蹌地走來走去，艾拉和塔爾姆卻如此……不當回事，還是讓你心裡發毛。至少現在是這樣。\n\n你們留在他們家休息調養。你和[Companion Name]輪流使用望遠鏡，想從星辰中看出些門道。等屍僕被處理掉，陷阱也都關了，這座塔其實還挺不錯。不過，有些畫面，你恐怕很久都忘不掉。"

msgid "The stars have finally shown you what you needed to see. A lone cold point, deep within the mountain range west of the capital. That is your next target."
msgstr "群星終於為你指明瞭方向。都城西邊的群山深處，有一處孤零零的寒冷所在。那就是你的下一個目的地。"

msgid "Your head feels fuzzy, as each breath - if you even are still breathing anymore - feels shaky and labored. You've grown far more accustomed to Era's telescope, but it still makes you feel as if something within your very being is shifting after long enough. You can practice astrology without it, but as you've learned through numerous conversations, Era's telescope is special. While Talm's summoning domain is Soul, Era's is knowledge and divination. You can't even begin to imagine what kind of creatures she can bring forth. The smoke and telescope are just two tools that allow her to practice.\n\nAnd now you have done so as well. Similarly to how you felt with the Sightsmoke, you feel as if you raise from the tower and pass through its walls. You grasp for the shingled roof, but your hands pass through it without so much as grazing it. You careen up into the sky, far beyond the tower and up amongst the clouds. Your body rights itself, and you feel yourself slingshot towards the Broken Pass, then turn north, to an inlet in the mountains covered with frost and snow. As you shoot towards a stone door carved into the cliffside, you close your eyes... and end up back on the floor of the tower.\n\nYou are covered in ice, and your teeth chatter violently, but you feel so... so warm."
msgstr "你腦子裡昏昏沉沉，每次呼吸都又費力又不穩，如果你現在還在呼吸的話。你已經漸漸習慣使用艾拉的望遠鏡，可看得久了，還是會覺得身體深處有什麼東西在悄悄變化。不用它也能研習占星。不過，聊過這麼多次，你已經知道，艾拉的望遠鏡很不一般。塔爾姆的召喚術專攻靈魂，艾拉則擅長知識和占卜。你實在想象不出，她能召喚出什麼樣的生物。煙霧和望遠鏡，只是她施展這門法術的兩種工具。\n\n如今，你也學著用上了。和吸入視覺之煙時一樣，你感覺自己從塔裡飄了起來，穿過了牆壁。你伸手想抓住鋪著木瓦的屋頂，手卻直接穿了過去，連碰都沒碰到。你猛地衝上天空，將石塔遠遠甩在下方，一頭扎進雲間。身體重新穩住，你感覺自己像被彈弓射了出去，直奔破裂山口，隨後轉向北方，飛向群山中一處覆滿霜雪的凹地。眼看就要撞上崖壁鑿出的石門，你閉上眼睛……再睜眼時，人已經回到了石塔的地板上。\n\n你渾身結滿了冰，牙齒抖得直打架，卻覺得好暖……好暖。"

msgid "The beast staggers back with a cry as your blows connect with its hard flesh. It falls to the ground with a mighty crash, and slumps back against the cavern wall. It releases a breath and begins to... fade away to crystals of ice that melt shortly afterward. Whatever the beast was, it wasn't natural. As you begin to look over the murals etched and painted into the wall, you feel quite sure of that assumption.\n\nThe murals depict the group that once inhabited the cavern. Little blue figures of people living in a beautiful blue forest. Then... the forest burning due to some unknown red assailants riding on similarly colored creatures. After that, there are far fewer blue figures in a blackened forest. The numbers dwindle further and further with each section of wall. Until the blue figures leave the charred forest. The murals show them travelling far... very far. Almost half the cavern wall depicts them travelling from one place to another, in all manner of places. They settle for short periods of time, with each move always predicated by a clash with some new color of figure. Brown, grey, green, red, orange, and even a lighter color blue towards the end. These figures are accompanied by beasts. All drawn simply in nature, but clearly terrifying to those who lived here. You catch yourself wiping your eyes more than once as you spend over an hour trying to follow their story.\n\nFinally, in the last tenth of the wall, it shows the figures... finding what you presume to be this place. They find a book. They create their own creatures. The figures leave the wall and travel across the floor, to spires of ice that jut out from the ground, one nearly touching the ceiling.\n\nYou realize, the center of the room looks... similar to a page of the book you cannot read. You lay it out and [Companion Name] holds her lantern overhead as you trace out places that line up. Two pages of the book, when lined up with the central pillar of ice, resemble the eastern portion of the continent. And within that map, a shining tower lays just off the coast. Comparing it to current maps, it'd be far north of the capital. Your next destination.\n\nYou spare a last glance to the figures on the ground, crowded around the spire of ice. It's the last of their journey, none left their last destination. You can only imagine what the spire represents, but it's a mystery for another time."
msgstr "你的攻擊落在牛羚堅硬的皮肉上。它痛吼一聲，踉蹌著往後退。隨後，它轟然倒地，癱靠在洞壁上。它吐出一口氣，身體開始……散成冰晶，沒多久，那些冰晶也融化了。不管這東西到底是什麼，都不是自然生長出來的。你開始檢視洞壁上雕刻、繪製的壁畫，越看，越覺得自己的猜測沒錯。\n\n壁畫講的是曾經住在這裡的那群人。小小的藍色人影，生活在一片美麗的藍色森林裡。接著……一群來歷不明的紅色人影，騎著同樣顏色的生物襲來，森林燃起了大火。再往後，森林只剩一片焦黑，藍色人影也少了許多。每看過一段壁畫，人影就更少一些。最後，藍色人影離開了燒焦的森林。壁畫裡，他們走了很……遠。幾乎半面洞壁，都在畫他們從一個地方輾轉到另一個地方，什麼樣的地方都有。每到一處，他們只能短暫停留。每次又要離開，都是因為和一種新顏色的人影起了衝突。棕色、灰色、綠色、紅色、橙色，到了後面，甚至還有淺一些的藍色。那些人影身邊，都有牛羚相伴。畫得雖然簡單，卻看得出來，對曾經住在這裡的人來說，那些牛羚都可怕極了。你花了一個多小時，沿著壁畫讀他們的故事。回過神來，才目擊自己已經抹了好幾次眼睛。\n\n終於，在最後那一小段，大約只佔整面壁畫的十分之一，畫裡的人們……找到了一處地方。你猜，就是這裡。他們找到了一本書。他們創造出了自己的生物。那些人影從牆上延伸到地面，一直通向從地裡突起的冰柱，其中一根幾乎頂到了洞頂。\n\n你忽然目擊，洞窟中央的版面配置……很像那本讀不懂的書裡的某一頁。你攤開書，[Companion Name]舉高燈籠，讓你逐一比對相互吻合的地方。書裡的兩頁圖畫，和中央的冰柱對照起來，勾勒出的正是大陸東部。在那幅地圖上，離海岸不遠的地方，立著一座閃閃發光的高塔。拿現在的地圖一比，它應該在都城很遠的北邊。下一個目的地找到了。\n\n你最後看了一眼地面上的人影。他們密密地圍在冰柱四周。旅途到這裡便結束了。再沒有人離開這最後的落腳處。冰柱代表什麼，你也只能猜測。不過，這個謎只能留待以後再解。"

msgid "In their quest to find the shining tower shown to them by the history book stolen from the Ivory Athenaeum, [Player Name] and [Companion Name] find themselves travelling far north of the capital, to a lonely little fishing village tucked into the coast."
msgstr "為了找到從象牙藏書院偷來的歷史書上那座閃亮高塔，[Player Name]和[Companion Name]一路遠赴都城以北，來到海岸邊一個偏僻的小漁村。"

msgid "Bet our findings will get added to that big ivory building in the capital, soon enough. Should go take a look at it yourself someday, real purdy."
msgstr "用不了多久，我們的目擊準能送進都城那棟象牙色的大樓。哪天你也該去看看，漂亮得很。"

msgid "I don't know how you made it down to the capital and bought a proper boat, but I'm glad you did!"
msgstr "我都不知道你什麼時候跑去都城買了條正經船回來，這船真不賴！"

msgid "You bring you sail to the dock and find [Companion Name] floating in the water, treating the boat with what you presume to be waterproofing. You set the sail on the ground and help haul them out of the brine, to which they shake like a dog and get you drenched. You threaten to shove them in, so they wrap their arms around you and threaten to haul you both back in. You shove them off and roll your eyes, to which they give one of the first genuine laughs you've heard from them in a long while.\n\nWhy they decided that smelling like stale water and rotting wood was their happy place, you may never know, but you can't help but smile after seeing them happy. The two of you fit the sail to your skiff and sit on the dock, admiring your handiwork. You each carve your name into its railing, and give it a firm pat. It's ready for its journey. Are you?"
msgstr "你把船帆帶回碼頭，看見[Companion Name]正泡在海水裡，往船身上塗東西，估計是在做防水。你放下船帆，把她從海水裡拉上來。結果，她像狗一樣抖了抖身子，甩了你一身水。你威脅要把她推回去，她便一把抱住你，說要下水就一起下。你推開她，翻了個白眼。她笑出了聲，你已經好久沒聽見她笑得這麼痛快了。\n\n為什麼渾身沾著陳水和爛木頭味，反倒能讓她這麼開心，你大概永遠也想不明白。不過，看見她高興，你也忍不住地笑。你們給小艇裝好船帆，坐在碼頭邊，欣賞自己的成果。兩人各自在船舷刻下名字，又結結實實地拍了拍。它已經準備好啟程了。你們呢？"

msgid "The piles of corpses stop moving, which is as close to dead as you can imagine they'll get. It's not just the bodies, though. The whole tower seems... still. Stale. As if it was frozen in time. \n\nDespite its incredible height, you can only see a single floor, the one you're on. The two of you search high and low, finding... nothing. The place is decorated with stone benches and tables and lit with pale yellow-green lights that make you feel sick, but little else. You sit by the pool in the center of the room, watching the corpse piles slowly turn to ash."
msgstr "屍堆不再動彈。對這些東西來說，這大概就算是死透了。不過，靜下來的不只是它們。整座塔似乎都……沉寂了。透著一股陳腐的氣息。彷彿時間在這裡停住了。\n\n這座塔明明高得驚人，你卻只能看見眼前這一層。你們把四下翻了個遍，結果……什麼也沒找到。這裡擺著些石桌石凳，泛黃的淺綠色光芒照著四周，讓你隱隱作嘔。除此之外，幾乎再沒有別的東西。你在房間中央的水池旁坐下，看著那些屍堆慢慢化為灰燼。"

msgid "Arms of gray skin and bone reach out to grab you from the corridor walls. You and [Companion Name] run through the fetid halls along the only path laid out for you. There's nothing else you can do. Each step becomes heavier and heavier as the bone beneath you turns spongy and slick with blood that pours from the ceiling and walls.\n\nYou lost track of time ages ago, and focus on your breathing. In. Out. In. Out. You reach out to steady [Companion Name]. Flinch back as she cuts a hand away from your throat.\n\nThe tunnel grows more narrow, and all the while, the beast crawls towards you faster and faster. Its breath curls down your back as you sprint through the halls, the feeling reminding you of how the purple vial touching your lips and bringing you to this nightmare felt. You feel the beast's nails bite into your skin. Just a glancing blow, but you know the next time it touches you, it will be fatal.\n\nYou see light up ahead. You jump off the bridge.\n\nAnd then... it ends.\n\nYou reach a large room made of the same stone as the tower that brought you here. Your lungs burn and tears stream down your face. [Companion Name] lands beside you with a thud.\n\nYou look back, and the tunnel you came from isn't there.\n\nMaybe it never was.\n\nYou turn back and see Talm, arm in arm with his wife Era. The two of them look at you with so much hatred that you almost feel like you deserve it, though you haven't the slightest idea on why. Their fingers elongate into claws that scrape against the stone floor, while their bodies twist into malformed ideas of human anatomy."
msgstr "一條條灰皮包骨的手臂從通道兩側伸出，想要抓住你們。你和[Companion Name]沿著眼前唯一的路，在惡臭的通道里狂奔。你們別無選擇。頭頂和牆壁不斷湧出鮮血，腳下的骨頭變得鬆軟溼滑，每邁一步都比上一步更費力。\n\n你早已不知道跑了多久，只顧著調整呼吸。吸氣。呼氣。吸氣。呼氣。你伸手扶穩[Companion Name]。她揮刃斬斷了伸向你喉嚨的一隻手，你驚得猛地往後一縮。\n\n通道越來越窄，身後的牛羚卻越爬越快。你在通道中拼命奔跑，它的吐息已經拂上你的後背。那感覺讓你想起紫色小瓶碰上嘴唇的那一刻，正是那一口藥水，把你帶進了這場噩夢。牛羚的指甲刺進了你的皮膚。只是擦了一下，可你知道，再被它碰到一次，你就沒命了。\n\n前方有光。你縱身跳下橋。\n\n然後……一切都結束了。\n\n你落進一間寬敞的房間，四周的石材與先前那座塔一模一樣。你的肺像燒起來一樣，眼淚止不住地往下淌。[Companion Name]砰的一聲落在你身旁。\n\n你回頭望去，來時的通道已經不見了。\n\n也許它從來就不存在。\n\n轉回頭，你看見塔爾姆和他的妻子艾拉挽著手臂，站在面前。他們望著你，眼裡滿是恨意。那目光幾乎讓你覺得自己罪有應得，可你根本不知道為什麼。他們的手指不斷伸長，化作刮擦石地的利爪，身體也扭曲變形，漸漸沒了人樣。"

