msgid "An old cobbled road takes you and your companion far north, just outside of a town by the name of Tidebreak. The population is said to be rather reclusive, mostly preferring to keep to their own and subsist on what they can fish up. The sea breeze goes from refreshing to... almost sour the further north you get. You get why not many people decided to live up this way, and question the motives of those that do. You push on ahead as the sun begins to set.\n\nThe town itself is... quaint. You feel eyes on you everywhere you go, and kids are pulled inside ahead of your path. You find yourself on the coast, where a lone young man works a length of rope, hardly sparing you a glance. Another man, who almost seems like he could be his brother, looks on and even gives you a smile, which you almost find weirder. You try your chances with the rope worker first."
msgstr "一條古老的鵝卵石路帶著你和同伴一路往北，來到一座名叫破浪鎮的小鎮外。據說這裡的居民相當孤僻，大多只和自己人往來，靠捕上來的漁獲過活。越往北走，海風就從清爽變得……幾乎帶點酸臭。你明白為什麼沒多少人願意住在這一帶，也不禁懷疑那些住在這裡的人有什麼打算。夕陽開始西沉，你繼續往前走。\n\n小鎮本身……頗有古風。不管走到哪裡，你都感覺有人在盯著你，孩子們也在你經過前就被拉進屋裡。你來到海岸邊，一名年輕男子獨自在整理一段繩索，幾乎看都不看你一眼。另一名男子看起來像是他的兄弟，在一旁看著，甚至對你笑了笑，這反而讓你覺得更怪。你決定先找那個整理繩索的人碰碰運氣。"

msgid "This is going to be extremely dangerous."
msgstr "這會非常危險。"

msgid "Phew, that was tough."
msgstr "呼，真是場硬仗。"

