msgid "Recipes, if any, go here. Many items will have alternate recipes."
msgstr "這裡列出配方（如果有的話）。許多物品有多種配方。"

msgid "Uses go here. Unique uses will be marked \"complete\""
msgstr "這裡列出用途。獨特用途會標示為「完成」"

msgid "Sources go here. Unique sources will be marked \"Complete\""
msgstr "這裡列出來源。獨特來源會標示為「完成」"

msgid "Statistics that are tracked will be listed here"
msgstr "追蹤中的統計資料會列在這裡"

msgid "Requirements / Recommendations"
msgstr "需求 / 建議"

msgid "Complete Obstacle Courses"
msgstr "完成障礙路線"

msgid "Train Agility by attempting Obstacle Courses. Each Obstacle has a chance to succeed. Failing an Obstacle restarts the Course."
msgstr "挑戰障礙路線來訓練敏捷。每個障礙都有成功機率，任一障礙失敗就要從頭開始路線。"

msgid "Obstacle Failure"
msgstr "障礙失敗"

msgid "[color=orange_red]Failing an Obstacle deals damage to you[/color]. Equip Food to automatically heal and survive repeated attempts."
msgstr "[color=orange_red]障礙失敗會對你造成傷害[/color]。裝備食物可以自動回復生命，撐過反覆挑戰。"

msgid "Train Techniques"
msgstr "訓練技巧"

msgid "Train different Agility Techniques within their respective Training Categories to improve your ability to overcome Obstacles."
msgstr "在各自的訓練分類中訓練不同的敏捷技巧，提升克服障礙的能力。"

msgid "Obstacle Difficulty"
msgstr "障礙難度"

msgid "Your Technique Level compared to an Obstacle's Difficulty determines your chance of success. Some Obstacles, such as Traps, have a fixed success chance instead."
msgstr "你的技巧等級和障礙難度的差距決定成功機率。部分障礙（例如陷阱）則是固定的成功機率。"

msgid "[color=green]Find special Map items[/color] throughout the game to unlock Unique Trails. Completing these Trails grants access to powerful new content."
msgstr "在遊戲中[color=green]尋找特殊的地圖物品[/color]來解鎖獨特小徑。完成這些小徑就能進入強大的新內容。"

msgid "Earn Agility Marks (Item)"
msgstr "獲得敏捷印記（物品）"

msgid "Completing Agility Courses can reward Marks, which can be spent in the Agility Shop for valuable items."
msgstr "完成敏捷路線可以獲得印記，能在敏捷商店兌換珍貴的物品。"

msgid "Discover Unique Trails"
msgstr "探索獨特小徑"

msgid "Train in Arenas"
msgstr "在競技場訓練"

msgid "Take on Agility Arenas to earn special rewards that can be spent in the Agility Shop."
msgstr "挑戰敏捷競技場來獲得特殊獎勵，可以在敏捷商店使用。"

msgid "Create Potions"
msgstr "製作藥水"

msgid "Use Herbs from Farming and other ingredients to create Potions that provide powerful bonuses to various skills."
msgstr "用農耕種出的草藥和其他材料製作藥水，為各種技能提供強力加成。"

msgid "Potion Potency"
msgstr "藥水效力"

msgid "Each Potion has a Potency. Higher Potencies provide stronger bonuses when consumed."
msgstr "每種藥水都有效力，效力越高，飲用時的加成越強。"

msgid "Potion Classes"
msgstr "藥水類型"

msgid "Potions have two Classes: A and B. Each Class provides different bonuses, allowing you to choose what best suits your needs."
msgstr "藥水分為 A、B 兩種類型，各自提供不同的加成，讓你依需求選擇。"

msgid "Potion Tiers"
msgstr "藥水階級"

msgid "Unlock higher Potion Tiers, such as Super Potions, which combine the bonuses of previous Tiers into one powerful Potion."
msgstr "解鎖更高的藥水階級，例如超級藥水，把前幾個階級的加成合而為一。"

msgid "Comparing to:"
msgstr "比較對象："

msgid "(Cycle Loadous with TAB)"
msgstr "（按 TAB 切換配裝）"

msgid "Study Constellations"
msgstr "研究星座"

msgid "Study Constellations to gain Knowledge. Each Constellation is associated with specific skills."
msgstr "研究星座來獲得知識。每個星座都和特定技能相關。"

msgid "Unlock Major & Minor Nodes"
msgstr "解鎖主要與次要節點"

msgid "Gain enough Knowledge to unlock Major and Minor Nodes, granting permanent bonuses and new unlocks for their associated skills."
msgstr "累積足夠的知識來解鎖主要與次要節點，為相關技能提供永久加成和新的解鎖內容。"

msgid "Observe Rare Events"
msgstr "觀測稀有事件"

msgid "Discover rare events, such as Meteor Showers and Falling Stars, to unlock or access  additional content throughout the game."
msgstr "發現流星雨、星落等稀有事件，以解鎖或進入遊戲中的更多內容。"

msgid "Show Combat Header Button in Legacy Mode"
msgstr "經典模式下顯示戰鬥頂部按鈕"

msgid "Whether to show the Combat Navigation button in the game's header while using Legacy Sidebar"
msgstr "使用經典側邊欄時，是否在遊戲頂部顯示戰鬥導覽按鈕"

msgid "Select NPC Icon"
msgstr "選擇 NPC 圖示"

msgid "Name this NPC"
msgstr "為這個 NPC 命名"

msgid "You cannot change your character name here."
msgstr "你無法在這裡更改角色名稱。"

msgid "Backstory / Naming Help"
msgstr "背景故事 / 命名提示"

msgid "You can edit this at any time."
msgstr "你隨時都可以修改。"

msgid "Customise NPC"
msgstr "自訂 NPC"

msgid "Technique Name"
msgstr "技巧名稱"

msgid "Required"
msgstr "必要"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "建議"

msgid "Reset your Skill Levels to 60?"
msgstr "要把技能等級重設為 60 嗎？"

msgid "During the Demo, Skills were capped at Level 60, but XP could still be earned beyond this limit."
msgstr "試玩版中技能等級上限為 60，但超過上限仍可繼續累積經驗。"

msgid "With Early Access, this extra XP may cause Skills to jump several levels, skipping unlocks and the intended progression."
msgstr "進入搶先體驗版後，這些多出的經驗可能讓技能一口氣跳好幾級，略過解鎖內容和原本設計的進度。"

msgid "We recommend resetting to Level 60 for a more natural progression experience, but this is not required."
msgstr "建議重設為 60 級，進度體驗會比較自然，但這不是必要的。"

msgid "Only Skills with XP above Level 60 will be affected. All other progress will remain unchanged."
msgstr "只有經驗超過 60 級的技能會受影響，其他進度都不會改變。"

msgid "Would you like to reset your Skill XP above Level 60?"
msgstr "要重設超過 60 級的技能經驗嗎？"

msgid "Yes, reset to level 60 (Hold to confirm)"
msgstr "是，重設為 60 級（按住確認）"

msgid "Yes, reset to level 60"
msgstr "是，重設為 60 級"

msgid "No, keep my XP"
msgstr "不，保留我的經驗"

